i/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/wetland.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Reserva de Humedales Azraq &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Reserva de Humedales Azraq &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Reserva de Humedales Azraq es una reserva natural ubicada cerca de la ciudad de Azraq en el desierto oriental de Jordania. Un oasis para las aves migr...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/reserva-de-humedales-azraq/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Yarmouk.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Reserva Forestal Yarmouk &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Reserva Forestal Yarmouk &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature está implementando la Gestión Integrada de Ecosistemas en el proyecto Jordan Rift Valley, que tiene como obje...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/reserva-forestal-yarmouk/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/River-canyon-of-Wadi-Mujib.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Wadi Mujib &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Wadi Mujib &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En 2011, la UNESCO declaró la reserva de la biosfera de Mujib. Se extiende hasta las montañas Kerak y Madaba hacia el Norte y el Sur, llegando...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/wadi-mujib/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Irbid.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Irbid &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Irbid &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Irbid es la segunda ciudad más grande de Jordania. Un breve paseo por el famoso museo Dar As-Saraya revela los antiguos orígenes de Irbid. El museo, ubicado...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/irbid/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Jerash2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Jerash&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Jerash &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Jerash, ubicado a 48 km al Norte de Ammán y enclavado en un valle tranquilo entre las montañas de Galaad, es la grandeza de la Roma imperial como...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/jerash/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/800px-AS-SALT_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;Al-Salt &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Al-Salt &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Salt es una ciudad próspera ubicada en el Noroeste de la capital, Ammán. Construido sobre tres montañas principales (Cadital, Gadaa y Salalem...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/al-salt/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-Umayyad_Palace020.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ummayyad Palace&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Ummayyad Palace&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Umayyad Palace es un gran complejo palaciego del período omeya, ubicado en la colina de la ciudadela de Amman, Jordania. Construido durante la ...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/ummayyad-palace/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Karak.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Karak&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Karak  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Conocido a lo largo de la historia como Qir Heres, Qir Moab y Hareseth, Karak ha sido una posesión preciada de varias civilizaciones. Se encuentra en las antiguas r...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/karak/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 387, 'es', '', 'one col', 'donde-ir-en-jordania');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(393, 'Dove andare in Giordania', 'Dove andare in Giordania', 'Amman - Jordan River e Bethany - Castelli nel deserto - Madaba - Monte Nebo - IL Mar Morto - Ajloun - Little Petra - Petra - La Tomba di Aaronne - Aqaba - Azraq e Riserva di Shawmari - Riserva della Biosfera di Dana - Wadi Rum', 'Dove andare in Giordania', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/Royal Hotel.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;amman&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Amman&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;In questo giorno puoi goderti le innumerevoli risorse che la città ha da offrire, tra una passeggiata nel centro, una visita ai siti archeologici, un tè caldo a Weibdeh o provare il tipico shisha su Rainbow Street...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/amman/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Jordan River/Jordan River1.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Jordan River e Bethany&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Jordan River e Bethany&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il fiume Giordano è un fiume lungo 251 chilometri (156 miglia) in Medio Oriente che sfocia nel Mar di Galilea e nel Mar Morto. La Giordania e le alture del Golan fiancheggiano il ...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/jordan-river-e-bethany/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Oval forum.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Oval Plaza&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Oval Plaza&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La spaziosa piazza misura 90mx80m ed è circondata da un ampio marciapiede e colonnato di colonne ioniche del I secolo d.C. situato a Jerash. Ci sono due alterazioni nel mezzo ...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/oval-plaza/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Desert Castles/Qasr_Kharana_in_Jordan.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Desert castles&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  Castelli nel deserto&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Allungando verso est di Amman, la pianura arida del deserto rotola verso l&#039;Iraq e l&#039;Arabia Saudita. Questo è un luogo in cui sabbia infinita e paesaggi di basalto sterile dimostrano la capacità...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/castelli-nel-deserto/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Madaba/madaba mosque.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Madaba&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Madaba&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Madaba è la capitale del Governatorato di Madaba nella Giordania centrale, con una popolazione di circa 60.000 abitanti. È meglio noto per i suoi mosaici bizantini e omayyadi, in particolare una grande mappa a mosaico dell&#039;era bizantina...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/madaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Mount_nebo/Monte-nebo.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;mount nebo&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Monte Nebo&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Secondo la Bibbia, fu dal Monte Nebo che Mosè contemplò la Terra Promessa dopo che Dio gli proibì di entrare. Inoltre, per i cristiani, è su questa montagna dove si trova la tomba di Mosè. Per i musulmani, sarebbe a Nabi Musa, dall&#039;altra parte...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/mount-nebo/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Deadsea/dead-sea.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Dead Sea&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   IL Mar Morto&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Mar Morto è un lago salato delimitato dalla Giordania ad est e da Israele e dalla Cisgiordania ad ovest. Si trova nella Jordan Rift Valley e il fiume Giordano è l&#039;unica grande fonte...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/il-mar-morto/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/lotsCave-1.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Grotta di Lot&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Grotta di Lot&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A sud del Mar Morto e vicino alla città di Safi c&#039;è un ripido pendio che ospita un monastero, una basilica bizantina del VII secolo d.C. C., un serbatoio e alcuni mosaici insieme alla Lot&#039;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/grotta-di-lot/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Ajlun/ajloun-castle-ajloun-4.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ajlun&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Ajloun&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Viaggiando a nord della Giordania, Ajloun e il suo castello meritano sicuramente una visita. Ajlun, è la capitale del Governatorato di Ajloun, una città collinare nel nord della Giordania, situata a 76 chil...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/ajloun/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Petra/Little Petra22.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Little Petra&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Little Petra&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Little Petra è anche conosciuto in arabo come Siq al-Barid &quot;il canyon freddo&quot;, deriva dal suo orientamento e dalle sue alte mura che impediscono l&#039;ingresso della maggior parte della luce solare disponibile....&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/little-petra/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Petra/khazna4.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Petra&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Petra &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra è stata dichiarata patrimonio dell&#039;umanità dall&#039;UNESCO dal 1985 e una delle nuove 7 meraviglie del mondo che incanta i visitatori provenienti da ogni angolo...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/petra/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Afra Hot Springs Jordan2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Afra Sorgenti Termali&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Afra Sorgenti Termali&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Giordania è la principale destinazione del turismo medico in Medio Oriente e le sorgenti termali di Afra ne sono un chiaro esempio. Situato a 26 k...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/afra-sorgenti-termali/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Amra.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Qasr Amra&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Qasr Amra&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Amra, anche trascritto come Quseir Amra o Qusayr Amra, è il più noto dei castelli del deserto situati oggi nella Giordania orientale. Fu costruito all&#039;inizio dell&#039;VIII...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/qasr-amra/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Petra/df82e914176ce65aacd067c64bd46e1c.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;La Tomba di Aaronne&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   La Tomba di Aaronne&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La tomba di Aaronne è il nome del presunto luogo di sepoltura di Aaronne, fratello di Mosè. Ci sono due descrizioni della sua posizione nel Pentateuco..&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/la-tomba-di-aaronne/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/800px-Montreal_Castle_Visitor_center.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Castello di Montreal&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Castello di Montreal&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Montreal è un castello a croce sul lato est dell&#039;Arabah, arroccato sul lato di una montagna rocciosa e conica, che domina gli alberi da...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/castello-di-montreal/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-Qasr_Haraneh_5.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Qasr Al-Kharanah&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Qasr Al-Kharanah&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Al-Kharanah, è uno dei castiglioni del deserito di altri avvocati nell&#039;Estero della Jordania, un unos di 60 chilometri (37 millesimi)...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/qasr-al-kharanah/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Aqaba/36c158c9dd7eeb67ec829a421cb5ace1.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Aqaba&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Aqaba&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Aqaba è l&#039;unica città costiera della Giordania e la città più grande e popolosa del Golfo di Aqaba. Situata all&#039;estremità meridionale de...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/aqaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Azraq/Azraq.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Azraq e Riserva di Shawmari&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Azraq&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Azraq significa &quot;Il blu&quot; in arabo, è una piccola città nella Garnatura di Zarqa, nel centro-est della Giordania, a 100 chilometri (62 miglia) a...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/azraq/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Dana/DanaReserve.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Riserva della Biosfera di Dana&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Riserva della Biosfera di Dana&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Dana Biosphere Reserve è la più grande riserva naturale della Giordania, situata nella Giordania centro-meridionale. La Rise...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/riserva-della-biosfera-di-dana/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/wadi-rum/wadi-rum-desert-landscape.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;wadi rum&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Wadi Rum&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Quando arrivi a Wadi Rum è facile capire perché sia ​​stato scelto come location per i film ambientati sul pianeta Marte come il famoso film ...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/wadi-rum/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/Roman Amphitheater.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Teatro Romano&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Teatro Romano&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il teatro romano di Amman ha 6.000 posti a sedere e risale al II secolo in epoca romana, quando la città era conosciuta come Filadelfia...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/roman-theatre/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/800px-Ma&#039;in_Hot_Springs2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ma&#039;in Sorgenti Termali &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Ma&#039;in Sorgenti Termali &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le sorgenti calde di Ma&#039;in si trovano 58 km a sud di Amman, nella Gubernatura di Madaba, e 27 km da Madaba. Si trova a 12...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/main-sorgenti-termali/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/Umm_ar-Rasas_12.JPG&quot; alt=&quot;Umm ar-Rasas&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Umm ar-Rasas&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Umm ar-Rasas si trova 30 km a sud-est di Madaba, che è la capitale della Madaba Gubernatura, nella Giordania centrale. Un tempo era accessibile dalle strade di ...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/umm-ar-rasas/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/Mosqueblue.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Moschea del Re Abdullah I&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Moschea del Re Abdullah I&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La moschea del re Abdullah I dalla cupola blu, costruita negli anni &#039;80 dal defunto re Saddam Hussein come monumento a suo nonno, è aperta ai visitatori non mu...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/moschea-del-re-abdullah-i/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-King_Hussein_Mosque_(Amman)_at_night.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Moschea King Hussein Bin Talal&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Moschea King Hussein Bin Talal&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Moschea King Hussein Bin Talal, meglio conosciuta come la moschea del King Hussein, è la più grande moschea della Giordania. Da non confondere con la...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/moschea-king-hussein-bin-talal/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/al-rainbow-st.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Rainbow Street&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Rainbow Street&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rainbow Street, originariamente chiamato Abu Bakr in Siddiq Street, è uno spazio pubblico nella zona storica di Jabal Amman, vicino al centro di....&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/rainbow-street/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/citadel.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Tempio di Ercole &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   T&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Roboto, &#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;empio di Ercole &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Tempio di Ercole è un sito storico nella cittadella di Amman ad Amman, in Giordania. Si ritiene che sia la struttura romana più significativa nella Cittade....&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/tempio-di-ercole/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/thecaveofthesevensleepers.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Grotta dei Dette Dormienti&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Grotta dei Dette Dormienti&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La leggenda dei &quot;sette dormienti&quot; coinvolge sette ragazzi cristiani che furono perseguitati dall&#039;imperatore romano Traiano, poi fuggirono in una grotta e vi dormirono...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/grotta-dei-dette-dormienti/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/Jordan-Amman-citadel-collage.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Cittadella di Amman&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Cittadella di Amman&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Cittadella di Amman è un sito storico nel centro di Amman, in Giordania. Conosciuta in arabo come Jabal al-Qal&#039;a, la collina a forma di L è uno dei sett...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/cittadella-di-amman/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/Ajlun_forestreserve.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Riserva Forestale di Ajloun&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Riserva Forestale di Ajloun&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La riserva forestale di Ajloun è una riserva naturale situata nella Gubernatura di Ajloun, nel nord-ovest della Giordania. Istituita dalla Royal Society for th...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/riserva-forestale-di-ajloun/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/Dibeen_Forest_Reserve.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Dibbeen Riserva Forestale &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Dibbeen Riserva Forestale &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dibbeen Forest Reserve, è una riserva naturale situata nel nord-ovest della Giordania. Si trova appena a sud del sito romano di Jerash e copre un&#039;area di 8,5 ch...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/dibbeen-forest-reserve/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Shawmari Wildlife Reserve2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Riserva Faunistica di Shaumari&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Riserva Faunistica di Shaumari&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Riserva Faunistica di Shaumari è una riserva naturale giordana vicino alla città di Azraq, a circa 100 km (62 miglia) ad est di Amman. È una riserva...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/riserva-faunistica-di-shaumari/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/wetland.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Azraq Wetland Reserve&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Azraq Wetland Reserve&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Azraq Wetland Reserve è una riserva naturale situata vicino alla città di Azraq nel deserto orientale della Giordania. Un&#039;oasi per uccelli migratori, Azraq è stata...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/azraq-wetland-reserve/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Yarmouk.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Riserva Forestale di Yarmouk&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  Riserva Forestale di Yarmouk&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature sta implementando la gestione integrata dell&#039;ecosistema nel progetto Jordan Rift Valley, che mir...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/riserva-forestale-di-yarmouk/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/River-canyon-of-Wadi-Mujib.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Wadi Mujib&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Wadi Mujib&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nel 2011 l&#039;UNESCO ha dichiarato la riserva della biosfera di Mujib. Si estende alle montagne Kerak e Madaba a nord e sud, raggiungendo in alcuni...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/wadi-mujib/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Irbid.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Irbid&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Irbid&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Irbid è la seconda città più grande della Giordania. Una breve passeggiata attraverso il famoso museo Dar As-Saraya rivela le antiche origini di Irbid. ...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/irbid/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Jerash2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Jerah&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Jerah&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Jerash, situato a 48 km a nord di Amman e incastonato in una valle tranquilla tra le montagne di Galaad, è la grandiosità della Roma imperiale come uno...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/jerash/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/800px-AS-SALT_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;Al-Salt&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Al-Salt&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Salt è una fiorente città situata nel nord-ovest della capitale, Amman. Costruito su tre montagne principali (Cadital, Gadaa e Salalem), circondato dalla piazza dell...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/al-salt/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-Umayyad_Palace020.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ummayyad Palace&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Ummayyad Palace&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Umayyad Palace è un grande complesso sontuoso del periodo omayyade, situato sulla collina della cittadella di Amman, in Giordania. Costruito nella ...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/ummayyad-palace/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Karak.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Karak&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Karak&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Conosciuto nel corso della storia come Qir Heres, Qir Moab e Hareseth, Karak è stato un prezioso possedimento di diverse civiltà. Si trova sulle...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/karak/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 387, 'it', '', 'one col', 'dove-andare-in-giordania');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(394, 'Où aller en Jordanie', 'Où aller en Jordanie', 'Amman - Jordan River et Béthanie - Les Chateaux Du Desert - Madaba - Mont Nebo - La Mer Morte - Ajloun - Little Petra - Petra - La Tombe d&#039;Aaron - Aqaba - Azraq et Shawmari Reserve - Réserve de Biosphère de Dana - Wadi Rum', 'Où aller en Jordanie', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/Royal Hotel.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;amman&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Amman&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Ce jour-là, vous pourrez profiter des innombrables ressources que la ville a à offrir, notamment une promenade dans le centre-ville, une visite de sites archéologiques, un thé chaud à Weibdeh ou une dégustation de la chicha typique de Rainbow...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/amman/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Jordan River/Jordan River1.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Jordan River et Béthanie&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  Jordan River et Béthanie&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Jourdain est un fleuve du Moyen-Orient long de 251 kilomètres qui se jette dans la mer de Galilée et la mer Morte. La Jordanie et les hauteurs du Golan bordent le fleuve à l&#039;est, tandis que l...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/jordan-river-et-bethanie/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Oval forum.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Oval Plaza&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  Oval Plaza&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La grande place mesure 90mx80m et est entourée d&#039;un large trottoir et d&#039;une colonnade de colonnes ioniques du Ier siècle après JC situées à Jerash. Il y a deux modifications...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/oval-plaza/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Desert Castles/Qasr_Kharana_in_Jordan.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Desert castles&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; color: #ff8d14; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Les Chateaux Du Desert&lt;/span&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;S&#039;étendant à l&#039;est d&#039;Amman, la plaine aride du désert se poursuit jusqu&#039;en Irak et en Arabie Saoudite. C’est un endroit où des paysages infinis de sable et de basalte stérile témoignent de la capacité de l’homme à s’épanouir...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/les-chateaux-du-desert/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Madaba/madaba mosque.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Madaba&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Madaba&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Madaba est la capitale du gouvernorat de Madaba, au centre de la Jordanie, et compte environ 60 000 habitants. Il est surtout connu pour ses mosaïques byzantines et omeyyades, en particulier pour sa grande carte...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/madaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Mount_nebo/Monte-nebo.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;mount nebo&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Mont Nebo&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Selon la Bible, c&#039;est du mont Nebo que Moïse a contemplé la Terre promise après que Dieu lui ait interdit d&#039;entrer. De plus, pour les chrétiens, c&#039;est sur cette montagne que se trouve le tombeau de Moïse. Pour les musulmans, ce serait à...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/mont-nebo/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Deadsea/dead-sea.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Dead Sea&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  La Mer Morte&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La mer Morte est un lac salé bordé par la Jordanie à l&#039;est, Israël et la Cisjordanie à l&#039;ouest. Il se situe dans la vallée du Jourdain, et le Jourdain est la seule source d’eau majeure se déversa...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/la-mer-morte/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/lotsCave-1.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Grotte de Lot&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  Grotte de Lot&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Au sud de la mer Morte et près de la ville de Safi, se trouve une pente abrupte qui abrite un monastère, une basilique byzantine du 7ème siècle après JC. C., un réservoir et des mosaïque...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/grotte-de-lot/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Ajlun/ajloun-castle-ajloun-4.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ajlun&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Ajloun&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Voyageant au nord de la Jordanie, Ajloun et son château valent vraiment une visite. Ajlun est la capitale du gouvernorat d&#039;Ajloun, une ville vallonnée du nord de la Jordanie, située à 76 kilomètres au nord...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/ajloun/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Petra/Little Petra22.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Little Petra&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Little Petra&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;La petite Petra est également connue en arabe sous le nom de Siq al-Barid, &quot;le canyon froid&quot;, en raison de son orientation et de ses hauts murs qui empêchent la lumière du soleil de pénétrer à fond. Il s’a...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/little-petra/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Petra/khazna4.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Petra&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Petra &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra est inscrite au patrimoine mondial de l’UNESCO depuis 1985 et est l’une des 7 nouvelles merveilles du monde qui enchante les visiteurs du ...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/petra/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Afra Hot Springs Jordan2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Sources Chaudes de Afra&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  Sources Chaudes de Afra&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Jordanie est la principale destination du tourisme médical au Moyen-Orient et les sources chaudes d&#039;Afra en sont un exemple clair. Situées ...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/sources-chaudes-de-afra/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Amra.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Qasr Amra&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  Qasr Amra&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Amra, également transcrit en Quseir Amra ou Qusayr Amra, est le plus connu des châteaux du désert situé dans l&#039;est de la Jordanie. Il a été construi...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/qasr-amra/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Petra/df82e914176ce65aacd067c64bd46e1c.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;La Tombe d&#039;Aaro