dow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Belle Vue1.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Belle Vue Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Belle Vue Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 4-star Belle Vue Hotel boasts luxurious architecture and the proximity to Jordan Craft Center. The venue was opened in 2002...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/belle-vue-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Geneva1.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Geneva Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Geneva Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Geneva Hotel is ideally located at the end of the main road to Queen Alia International Airport at the beautiful spot of west Amman...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/geneva-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/amman-international-hotel.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Amman International Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Amman International Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Every room, hall and facility has been decorated and designed through personal tastes, experience and international requirements...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/amman-international-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Firas.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;Firas Palace &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Firas Palace&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Firas Palace in Amman offers a comfortable accommodation 650 meters from Roman Theater. The venue comprises 80 welcoming...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/firas-palace/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Ocean Hotel.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ocean Hotel &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Ocean Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ocean Hotel provides you with the comfort you need for your business trips, and the most enjoyable stay for you and your clients...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/ocean-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel is located in the city of Amman Alchiemsana area, close to all vital facilities and services concerned with the comfort of the...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/al-thuraya-amman-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Arabela 2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Arabela Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Arabela Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Arabela Amman Hotel is located in Shmeisani Area, the center of Amman and surrounded by great stores, famous restaurants, modern...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/arabela-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Rest hills1.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Rest Hills Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Rest Hills Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rest Hills Hotel is a 3 Star hotel; it is about 7 km from National Library of Jordan. The venue comprises 57 rooms...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/rest-hills-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sandy.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Sandy Palace Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Sandy Palace Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;An excellent choice for travelers visiting Amman, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/sandy-palace-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Toledo.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;Toledo Amman Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Toledo Amman Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toledo Amman Hotel is located in the heart of Amman, on the edge of the old city center and within walking distance to the new downtown...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/toledo-amman-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sama paris.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Sama Paris Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Sama Paris Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sama Paris Hotel is a three stars hotel located in the most beautiful location overlooking the ancient city of Amman...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/sama-paris-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 453, 'en', '', 'one col', 'hotels-in-amman'),
(454, 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This stylish hotel is located in the heart of the downtown district, just steps away from the delights of this ancient yet modern city. Spacious rooms combine with all the facilities you would expect of a Marriott including choice of international dining, piano lounge, bar, and the Oasis Health Club with two pools, gym, sauna and whirlpool. Amman Marriott Hotel is your gateway to modern marvels, historic fascinations and unparalleled comfort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This 5-star hotel offers well-appointed, spacious rooms. It features 2 restaurants, 2 bars, and a health club with 2 pools. It is located in the Shmeissani district in Al Abdali. A 32-inch flat-screen TV and a minibar are in Ammans air-conditioned rooms. Each has a marble bathroom with a hairdryer and separate bath and shower. Some rooms come with a separate seating and dining area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Featuring an open kitchen, Villa Mediterrano serves Mediterranean cuisine. Il Terrazzo offers an authentic Italian cuisine. Gourmet food, fine wine, and cigars are offered at the award-winning Library Lounge &amp;amp; Cigar Bar. Marriott Amman also has a sports bar, a tea lounge and a piano bar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Marriott Amman is a 35-minute drive from Queen Alia International Airport and 10-minute drive from Marka International Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Marriott_5.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.5528764999776!2d35.903607314549575!3d31.97302468122219!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca00dac398a03:0x7457e2ecc4a18517!2sAmman Marriott Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567690147623!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 454, 'en', '', 'one col', 'amman-marriott-hotel'),
(455, 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located on the highest hill of Amman, Four Seasons Hotel Amman boasts luxurious accommodation with panoramic views of the city. It offers indoor and outdoor pools, a gym, a spa and a squash court. At the Spa you can enjoy massages, body treatments, facials or nail treatments for male and female.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All air-conditioned accommodation at Four Seasons Amman is furnished with warm colors and carpeted floors. Each suite and room comes with a private bathroom and a flat-screen TV.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy Levant cuisine at Olea or our unique Friday Brunch; The Foyer Lounge for light meals and international favorites; our new Garden Terrace for continental sandwiches and salads; and Five Grill &amp;amp; Lounger offers refreshments while boasting a view of Amman in the summer.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Four Seasons Concierge desk can give you all the information you need during your stay in Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Four Seasons Amman is a 30-minutes drive from Queen Alia International Airport, and the Dead Sea is 40-minutes away by car.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/four-seasons-hotel-amman.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.973036879678!2d35.87884811454924!3d31.961628181225826!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca05772da5d9d:0x80a84e21ae4f7d59!2sFour Seasons Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567690495298!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 455, 'en', '', 'one col', 'four-seasons-amman-hotel'),
(456, 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This luxurious 5-star hotel in the center of Amman´s business district is very near big shopping malls (Galleria Mall, Baraka Mall) of the capital. It features indoor and outdoor pools, a spa and gym.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A daily breakfast is served at the Spice Garden all day dining restaurant which also serves themed buffet dinners. The Green Lounge offers a selection of coffees and teas from all the continents and live entertainment in the evening.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms are equipped with chic and elegant furnishings. Modern facilities include a satellite TV in every room. Some rooms of Sheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel have a sitting area and a balcony.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Massage treatments and a steam bath are available at Sheraton Amman spa. There is also a modern gym equipped with cardio equipment and free weights. Wi-Fi access is also provided. The Sanctuary Lounge serves refreshing cocktails and various dishes in a buffet style or as individual items. Drinks, snacks and live entertainment can be enjoyed at The Green Lounge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Free private parking is available at Sheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel. Marka International Airport is 9.7 km away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/sheraton-amman-al-nabil-hotel-1-825x510.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.010074912194!2d35.877981514549234!3d31.96062338122619!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1504a948e643cb09:0x185af7c4d5a2737b!2sSheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567691233606!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 456, 'en', '', 'one col', 'sheraton-amman-al-nabil-hotel'),
(457, 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Towering over Amman, Le Royal is home to a luxurious 3-floor shopping mall. Panoramic fitness rooms, a mudroom and a hairdresser are available at the spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All elegant rooms at Le Royal Amman have extra-large panoramic windows with views of the city. Interactive TV and high-speed internet are available and guests are welcomed with a complimentary soft drink.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Luxury indoor and outdoor pools, a hot tub, and sauna provide relaxation, while the aerobics studio is perfect for a good workout.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can choose from 13 international restaurants and bars. Sushi, Italian fare and fine pastries are all available. A Friday brunch with jazz music, exotic cocktails at the Buddah Club and a panoramic smoking lounge are some of the entertainment options.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In the 3rd Circle, Le Royal is about 4.8 km from Marka International Airport, and a shuttle service is available. Free parking is also on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/le royal 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.282320458493!2d35.909222199999995!3d31.953236800000003!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca07c249f6901:0x17e132e18724ba3!2sLe Royal Hotel, Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567691576021!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 457, 'en', '', 'one col', 'le-royal-hotel'),
(458, 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Combining contemporary facilities with local features, InterContinental offers stylish accommodations in Amman´s Diplomatic Area. It features a palm-fringed pool, a palatial indoor pool and a spa with hot tub and massage treatments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Featuring designer furnishings, rooms at InterContinental Jordan are chic and functional. They all include a spacious lounge with sitting area, satellite TV channels and deluxe bathrooms with bathtub.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Homemade cake and pastries in the mornings, snacks during the day and pre-dinner aperitifs are served at the Boulevard Café. The place features large couches and provides a chance to meet the locals in an informal atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 24-hour front desk staff can assist you at any time you may need it. Amman Citadel is one kilometer away and the elegant Al Mukhtar Mall is only a 5 minute drive from the InterContinental Hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/intercontinental.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.2794760983593!2d35.910959314548975!3d31.953313981228465!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca07f4b28ecf5:0xf8a517c99e5113ea!2sInterContinental Amman (Jordan)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567692022132!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 458, 'en', '', 'one col', 'intercontinental-amman-hotel'),
(459, 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Conveniently located in the heart of the business and diplomatic district of Jabal Amman, this 5-star hotel offers luxurious rooms with satellite TV. Health and spa services include indoor and outdoor pools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The air-conditioned rooms at Grand Hyatt Amman feature a modern interior with arabesque touches. All rooms have an iPod docking station, a DVD player, a minibar, and tea and coffee-making facilities. The marble bathrooms include luxury amenities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Restaurant 32º North features a seafood bar, serving fresh oysters, scallops, Alaskan Crab legs, lobsters, and shrimp. L’Incontro, Grand Hyatt Amman’s signature restaurant, provides Italian specialties. Indochine restaurant offers a wide selection of dishes from the Vietnamese cuisine. Guests can enjoy a selection of imported tea, specialty coffees and cocktails at The Lounge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Club Olympos Spa features holistic treatments from professional therapists. Grand Hyatt spa area also has a fitness center, saunas, steam rooms, and whirlpools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Grand Hyatt Amman provides access to the conference center Zara Expo and the Zara Center, including cinemas, food courts, and Amman’s most fashionables shops. Downtown Amman is just a 5-minute drive from the hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Grand_Hyatt.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.186418875123!2d35.90779431454903!3d31.955838981227735!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b7c86523a5947:0x9236d95c77ea6232!2sGrand Hyatt Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567692388278!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 459, 'en', '', 'one col', 'grand-hyatt-amman'),
(460, 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 5-star Le Grand Amman Managed by Accorhotels is located in the heart of Amman as well as features a year-round outdoor pool and free Wi-Fi. The venue comprises 430 non-smoking rooms spread across 9 floors. You can benefit from currency exchange, storage for belongings and a lift.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The accommodation lies within 3.2 km from The Citadel. It’s easily reached within 3.8 km from Roman Theater. The hotel is located within minutes of boutiques and a mall.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The guest rooms are fitted with TV set with satellite channels, ironing facilities and blinds. Each room opens onto the garden. Each room includes a bathroom with a roll in shower, a hairdryer and terry dressing gowns.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The property offers daily buffet breakfast. Enzo restaurant prepares a wide selection of Japanese dishes. Drop in for delicious drinks at the sushi bar onsite. Guests can dine at Al Mukhtar and Benihana 5 minutes walking distance from the venue.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A bus stop is just a short walk away. Bikes and cars for rent are available at this superior accommodation and lawn tennis and cycling can be organized. This hotel also provides a gym, aerobics classes and a fitness centre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Le Grand Amman.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.6516565523425!2d35.90372061454948!3d31.970345681223073!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06deee134e7:0x72780c26aff93ce2!2sLe Grand Amman Managed by ACCOR!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567694803545!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 460, 'en', '', 'one col', 'le-grand-amman-managed-by-accor'),
(461, 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Thousand Nights Hotel is located in Amman, 2.5 km from Diwan al-Sultan Ibrahim Restaurant. The hotel has a terrace and sauna, and guests can enjoy a meal at the restaurant. Free WiFi is featured throughout the property and free private parking is available on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Every room at this hotel is air conditioned and is equipped with a flat-screen TV with satellite channels. Certain rooms feature a seating area to relax in after a busy day. You will find a kettle in the room. Each room has a private bathroom. For your comfort, you will find bath robes and slippers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Hussein National Park is 3.5 km from Thousand Nights Hotel, while US Embassy is 5 km from the property. Abu Jbara restaurant &amp;amp; Habiba restaurant are adjacent to the property. The nearest airport is Queen Alia International Airport, 32 km from the property.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is a 24-hour front desk at the property.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Thousands nights2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.999353826241!2d35.86382491454993!3d31.9880329812173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1c9578c0653:0x39c2045307672c0f!2sThousand Nights Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567695853659!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 461, 'en', '', 'one col', 'thousand-nights-hotel'),
(462, 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Hotel', 'Bristol Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Bristol Hotel is in central Amman, close to the city’s business and commercial district. This 5-star hotel offers comfortable rooms, Wi-Fi for an additional fee and free parking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Breakfast is included in the room rate and can be enjoyed on the sunny terrace overlooking the pool. There are 6 restaurants and bars at the hotel, open throughout the day and serving a great selection of international food including many local specialties.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This Hotel is a great choice for travelers interested in restaurants, family friendly trips and food.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relax in the sun by the Bristol Hotels lovely swimming pool. There is also a fitness center for guests to use.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Bristol_7.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.076794560982!2d35.87413161454919!3d31.958813281226774!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0f8d2a8f185:0xc5a7b9ec3d05caa7!2sBristol Amman Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696335551!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 462, 'en', '', 'one col', 'bristol-amman-hotel'),
(463, 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In the elegant Sweifieh shopping district, this 5-star hotel has 2 pools, a tennis court and a spa with massage facilities. It also features 5 different dining options.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each room at the Crowne Plaza Amman is decorated in warm colors and includes a work desk and a small sitting area equipped with satellite TV. Some rooms have city views.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Halaby Restaurant serves menu for dinner serving Syrian cuisine and V Lounge &amp;amp; Restaurant serves US Angus Steaks. Drinks and cocktails are available at Café Vienna and Jasmine Lounge&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can relax on a lounge chair near the pool, or visit the Crowne Plaza Spa to enjoy a variety of spa massages. The renowned Citadel and the National Archaeological Museum are less than a 20-minute drive from the Ammans Crowne Plaza hotel. Queen Alia International Airport is less than 33.8 km away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Crowne Plaza 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.950606394667!2d35.86800951454927!3d31.962236681225615!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f99a412c929:0x1aec1e47e3d88064!2sCrowne Plaza Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696646436!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 463, 'en', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-amman');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(464, 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The elegant Landmark Amman Hotel &amp;amp; Conference Center is in the heart of the diplomatic and business districts of Amman. It features free Wi-Fi, an outdoor pool, and a spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All the modern and spacious rooms at the Landmark Amman &amp;amp; Conference Center have sitting areas and satellite TV.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Fitness and Wellness health club features a wide range of gym equipment as well as a hot tub and a sauna. Massages treatments include a deep tissue massage and a shiatsu massage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There are 6 restaurants and bars, including Colours All Day Restaurant and Fairouzy , which provide Levant cuisine. Fresh juices are available at the Sugar Cube, and there is an Executive Lounge and Bar. Ghoroub is on the 13th Floor and serves delicious refreshments and cocktails. Tarboush Lounge is the late-night lounge and club which serves a mix of cocktails, mocktails, wines and champagnes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Landmark Amman is a 5-minute drive from the Roman Theatre. Marka International Airport is 8 km away and it takes 10 minutes by car to get to Sofex Exhibition from the property. Free private parking is available.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Land_Mark_7.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.0183095403036!2d35.90201131454923!3d31.96039998122626!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0654b1bc989:0x639bbb9360f2265a!2sLandmark Amman Hotel and Conference Center!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696864876!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 464, 'en', '', 'one col', 'landmark-amman'),
(465, 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in the central business, social and residential destination, Amman’s new downtown, Al Abdali, Amman Rotana offers business travellers and holiday makers alike the serenity and warmth of home as well as the splendour and modern extravagance that can only be offered at Rotana. The hotel is within a 45-minute drive from Queen Alia International Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Rotana is the first tower hotel in Jordan offering 412 lavish rooms and suites, housed across 50 floors at 188 metres high. All rooms boast floor-to-ceiling windows offering remarkable views of the city.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This 5-star hotel is designed in a vibrant modern style providing a combination of deluxe accommodation, diverse culinary experiences, state-of-the-art meeting and event facilities including the Monarch Ballroom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests with recreation in mind can enjoy their workout at Bodylines Fitness &amp;amp; Wellness Club or take a dip at our outdoor swimming pool.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Amman Rotana.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.848090310323!2d35.90098441466836!3d31.96501763224978!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06e3887c383:0x660a49cefe54732e!2sAmman Rotana!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567697480735!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 465, 'en', '', 'one col', 'amman-rotana'),
(466, 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ideally located on the Firth circle and within walking distance of Abdoun, the five star deluxe Fairmont Amman. This Hotel offers contemporary design and unparalleled views of the stunning Amman hills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 317 elegantly appointed guest rooms and suites are remarkably spacious, complete with premium amenities. Each air-conditioned room offers state-of-the art technology including wired and wireless high speed internet access and media connectivity panel. The living area has a 43″ flat screen LED TV and the luxurious marble bathrooms come with a walk-in rain shower and deep soaker tub.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Willow Stream Spa at Fairmont Amman combines an exclusive facility focusing on fitness and movement, with vitality pools, hamam scrub room, Dead Sea pool, inhalation steam rooms as well as healing saunas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Queen Alia International Airport is a 35 minute drive from the airport to the hotel. Free valet &amp;amp; private parking is available on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Fairmont-Amman-Exterior-Shot-Dawn.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.037474893173!2d35.8790314146683!3d31.95988003250614!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca057eb367b41:0x385b54e5b700e10!2sFairmont Amman Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567697810827!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 466, 'en', '', 'one col', 'fairmont-amman'),
(467, 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Grand Millennium Amman hotel located at the gateway to Jordan offers 5-star luxury at an unbeatable location.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;From the heart of Amman&#039;s commercial centre, Grand Millennium Hotel Amman is a 10-minute drive from the Amman Citadel and 25 minutes by car from Queen Alia International Airport. High-end restaurants, shopping centers and entertainment facilities are all within a walking distance, you&#039;ll find shopping centers, art galleries, and entertainment spots all within walking distance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 176 guest rooms provide for a restful stay, and come complete with a range of luxurious amenities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Award-winning offer great cuisine and great views, and Sky Spa &amp;amp; Health Club boast a variety of treatments to help you unwind.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Sky Lounge boasts with uninterrupted views of Amman, which can be used for weddings and other events. Guests can enjoy a relaxing atmosphere at the Havana Cigar Bar or enjoy the exciting ambiance at Crystal Bar. Live the multinational experience with a visit to Food Market restaurant where 3 nations meet into one dining feast, Italian, Arabic and Asian.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/MillenniumHotel1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.7857351878492!2d35.89721721466853!3d31.96670903216547!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f7ce9f455b9:0xf83ea996b94553a0!2sGrand Millennium Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698129242!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 467, 'en', '', 'one col', 'grand-millennium-hotel-amman'),
(468, 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Modern Amman hotel in vibrant commercial district. Stay at Mövenpick Hotel Amman to benefit from a great location, excellent food and wonderful Jordanian hospitality.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The modern 14-floor Amman skyscraper hotel is in the dynamic, commercial hub of Jordan’s capital – close to shopping malls and attractions, 15 minutes to downtown and 35 minutes from Queen Alia International Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Unwind in the health club, swim laps in the pool and work out in the fitness centre. Keep in touch with free Wi-Fi in all 218 rooms and suites. Business travelers and city break sightseers equally enjoy the treat of executive lounge access. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Close to Amman malls and attractions, exquisite and diverse gastronomy across four restaurants, bars and lounges. The Hotel offers outdoor pool, health club and spa. Perfect venues for weddings and 8 state-of-the-art meeting rooms and grand ballroom for 1200 people.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Movenpik.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0731165346724!2d35.86189371466914!3d31.986033331201245!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca18f3ca4e949:0x7549fdec8b8e1369!2sMövenpick Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698379969!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 468, 'en', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-hotel-amman'),
(469, 'W Amman', 'W Amman', 'W Amman', 'W Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in the heart of new modern Amman, Abdali, the past meets the future where local tradition and history of Jordan are instilled with an unmistakably bold design. W Amman uniquely stands tall as a contemporary architectural statement, offering stunning views of bustling city’s seven hills running across the Jordanian capital.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Begin your discovery by entering through an intriguing canyon walk, a breathtaking recreation inspired by the ancient city of Petra, one of the Seven Wonders of the World. The first ever W Hotel in Amman features vibrant spaces where 280 guest rooms and 44 suites offer a sensational swirl of high energy interiors, amplifying technology, vivid design, and floor to ceiling windows that offer vibrant views of the Jordanian capital.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Own the moment &amp;amp; remix your nights at the most original dining &amp;amp; party scene in the city &amp;amp; live it up in at our boldly designed outlets. Savor unexpected authenticity in the all-day dining restaurant, and sample Asian-inspired flavors in the specialty venue. Hang out in the Living Room or join the scene in AURA, the three-floor destination bar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ignite your taste buds within the sleek setting of Enso. Explore pan-Asian signature dishes like sushi, which can be paired with intriguing sake. Escape to Aura and gather with friends over signature cocktails. Soak in the scene and chill out to pulsating music.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/W Hotels.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.8775452043465!2d35.90069181466849!3d31.964218632289686!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06fc9e20179:0xa4a5b50125e1474d!2sW Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698675207!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 469, 'en', '', 'one col', 'w-amman'),
(470, 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Zamzam Towers Hotel was established to serve businessmen, and business traveler, the facilities exists to help make you happy to enjoy your time.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Far a way from the crowd, yet close to business and shopping centers like City Mall, Carfour, Amman mall, and C.Town. The Hotel is distinguished with its quiet environment and it is one of the luxurious hotels with its modern style, best services, including up to date facilities such as Coffee Shop, Beauty Salons, Wedding and Meeting Halls and Stylish Suits.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Zamzam Towers Hotel was deliberately designed to grant more freedom and elegancy, whether you are looking for, accommodation, business or dinning, a relaxing moments; we have it all inside. Modern interior and exterior achievement makes it a unique place for events of any type or size.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Zamzam 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.6630360211702!2d35.850867014550296!3d31.997148881214525!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1c3250bccb5:0xf3c61de69ada3888!2zWmFtemFtIFRvd2VycyBIb3RlbCDYp9io2LHYp9isINiy2YXYstmF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567774485823!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 470, 'en', '', 'one col', 'zamzam-towers-hotel'),
(471, 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This Hotel is located in a commercial, entertainment, and shopping district. Days Inn Hotel Amman has 184 Rooms &amp;amp; Suites. They all contain a self control central heating and cooling system, iron, full-size ironing board, hair dryer, mini fridge, in-room safe box, wireless internet connection throughout the hotel, satellite &amp;amp; LCD television, 24-hour room service, full bathroom amenities, bathrobes, slippers, as well as Coffee/Tea Maker. The majority of rooms have a balcony with amazing views of the city or the pool area. Non-smoking rooms are available upon request.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It offers Energize Fitness Center Our relaxing fitness center, has a fully equipped Gym area with a wide range of Top-of-the line equipment with personal trainers available, special area which gives members and guests the option to join a large variety of fitness classes given by our fitness experts, Heated Indoor-Swimming pool including programs for swimming classes and aqua aerobics, Private Men and Women facilities including Sauna rooms, Jacuzzis, steam rooms, locker rooms, changing rooms, showers, and we shouldn’t forget the special lounge area in which our guests can relax and enjoy healthy food and beverages after a hard work out.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is 25 minutes from Amman Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Days Inn2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.4282828801083!2d35.88483451454971!3d31.976403481221094!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f96f596fb21:0xcb8402592755b704!2sDays Inn Hotel Suites Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775103951!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 471, 'en', '', 'one col', 'days-inn-hotel'),
(472, 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in the heart of Amman, this 4-star Amman West Hotel features European style. Built in 1999, the venue was fully renovated in 2010. There is a 24-hour room service, dry cleaning and valet parking at the accommodation too.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The property&#039;s soundproof rooms feature a mini-refrigerator, a living area and a trouser press. These units offer mountain views. Each room is fitted with an en suite bathroom equipped with a shower, a hairdryer and toiletries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Breakfast is served every morning in the restaurant. The venue features lobby restaurant onsite. Guests can quench their thirst at the wine bar with a favorite drink. Centro Brasserie and Oobe are about a 5-minute walk away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The accommodation offers luggage storage, a safe deposit box and an elevator along with car rentals.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Amman_West_2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.111199828186!2d35.89749671466837!3d31.957879832605936!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca063f7cff84d:0x49f5449e80d42e36!2sAmman West Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775367494!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 472, 'en', '', 'one col', 'amman-west-hotel'),
(473, 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Airport Hotel is a four-star hotel in Jordan; it contains 304 rooms where each room is designed to insure your ultimate comfort whether you are visiting Jordan for business or pleasure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel contains 3 different air-conditioned conference rooms (600 sqm) Arabella, Petra and Jerash; with modern technical equipment which provide the perfect environment for seminars, conferences, business meetings or receptions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In the welcoming restaurants you will enjoy a rich breakfast buffet in the morning. For lunch and dinner they offer a variety of international and national specialties, which are served on the sunny terrace near the pool in summer.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel is located in a distinguished location within the Queen Alia International Airport zone. Only 1km away from the terminals and a mere 15 minutes&#039; drive to the Jordanian capital – Amman (25 km) and 45 km away from the Dead Sea and the Baptism site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Amman Airport Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.853576416551!2d35.963391314662104!3d31.719894544437228!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b543140762d7f:0xc0db1c54c61d55e6!2sAmman Airport Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775660500!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 473, 'en', '', 'one col', 'amman-airport-hotel'),
(474, 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Arena Space Hotel, the most exquisite and prestigious four star hotel. Conveniently and centrally located in the heart of Amman, just 20 Km away from Queen Alia International Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They have got just the right environment to make your stay a comfortable and relaxing experience. The hotel is fully equipped with all the necessary leisure facilities, and when it comes to services you will feel the difference from the moment you check in.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relax with a drink and a light snack at the popular restaurant and enjoy our pleasant atmosphere. They will ensure you great entertainment where mezzah and international cuisine can be enjoyed alongside famous singers and bands.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;You will find all the amenities of a modern hotel along with an exalted contemporary taste promising you a guaranteed luxury.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Arena space.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0765765098026!2d35.87526831466907!3d31.98593953120587!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0315c0f32f7:0x5a76ca316b7cdd47!2sArena Space Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775885286!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 474, 'en', '', 'one col', 'arena-space-hotel'),
(475, 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 4-star Belle Vue Hotel boasts luxurious architecture and the proximity to Jordan Craft Center. The venue was opened in 2002. You can enjoy a welcoming atmosphere, currency exchange, a smoking area and a tour desk provided at the accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Mecca Mall is 2 km away while Zahran Palace is set 1400 meters away. Guests can reach Amman city center in 20 minutes on foot. A church, a citadel and a mosque can be easily reached on foot as well.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The non-smoking rooms have satellite television, climate control and panoramic windows as well as hypo-allergenic pillows, a pillow-top mattress and foam pillows. The property includes a microwave, an electric kettle and kitchenware in the kitchen along with a roll in shower, a hairdryer and terry dressing gowns in the bathroom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A rich buffet breakfast is available daily. You can enjoy delicious Italian dishes in TAJ restaurant. There is the snack bar on site. Serving a wide range of dishes, Grappa Restaurant &amp;amp; Bar and Guang Zhou can be reached within 5 minutes’ walk.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Belle Vue1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.3568927919546!2d35.91394721466811!3d31.951213232938372!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8096930fed:0x2c229700b2b80a45!2sBelle Vue Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776051542!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 475, 'en', '', 'one col', 'belle-vue-hotel'),
(476, 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Geneva Hotel is ideally located at the end of the main road to Queen Alia International Airport at the beautiful spot of west Amman. 25 KM from the airport, 5 KM from downtown and 5 minutes from major shopping centers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Geneva Hotel Amman naturally exudes a warm welcome to all its guests. Fabulous shopping, exquisite dining and upbeat entertainment are just steps away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For a meeting to be successful perfect planning needs to be come together with the right meeting facilities, amenities and service. With eleven impressive venues including a Grand ballroom and a Crystal Ballroom, the hotel is a prestigious venue for meetings and events in Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Too busy to worry about logistics? Relax, and let our Geneva Meetings Director take care of everything.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Geneva1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.911729013891!2d35.85450041466832!3d31.963291332335938!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1091414b6c9:0x5c40c0ff05034649!2sGeneva Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776261648!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 476, 'en', '', 'one col', 'geneva-hotel'),
(477, 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman International Hotel is located next to the University of Jordan; this 4-star hotel offers air-conditioned rooms with a flat-screen TV. It has an outdoor pool and 4 dining outlets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Every room, hall and facility has been decorated and designed through personal tastes, experience and international requirements. Almost all of the furnishings have been designed and hand made locally for the hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;We offer cozy single bedrooms, relaxing double rooms and luxurious suites, alongside a swimming pool and fitness room.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel has three restaurants; The Grand Lounge, The Oasis Terrace, and The Leonard da vinci, serving an international and local menu to suite all guests desires. Our Rouge bar caters to all the sports and entertainment you could ask for.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/amman-international-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.1689519557754!2d35.865565514669704!3d32.01053682997763!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9f79a6b72585:0x9da0ecd483c2ac06!2sAmman International Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776701884!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 477, 'en', '', 'one col', 'amman-international-hotel'),
(478, 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Firas Palace in Amman offers a comfortable accommodation 650 meters from Roman Theater. The venue comprises 80 welcoming rooms. Guests can use 24-hour front desk assistance, laundry facilities and room service at the hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air conditioning, central heating and a sitting area are offered in all rooms at the property. Guests at the venue can enjoy spectacular views. A bath, a shower and a hairdryer are provided.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel is located within a 10-minute walk from the city center. It is just 10 minutes&#039; walk of The Citadel, visitors will enjoy easy access to a citadel and a theatre near the property.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It has an on-site lounge restaurant as well as a lobby bar. Nearby restaurants, such as Romero and Cantaloupe Gastro Pub are easily accessible.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can reach Marka International airport within 15 minutes by car. The venue also features a free car park, a safety deposit box and a lift.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Firas.jpeg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.43824595726!2d35.93081131466807!3d31.9490055330485!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f990d606b11:0xd8b9b245f5748e80!2sFiras Palace!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567781296899!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 478, 'en', '', 'one col', 'firas-palace'),
(479, 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ocean Hotel provides you with the comfort you need for your business trips, and the most enjoyable stay for you and your clients.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This Hotel is located in Um – Uthaina 25 minutes away from Q.A.I.A Airport and 10 minutes away from down town.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel features 48 rooms including 6 junior suites, and 6 Royal suites. Ocean Hotel is three stars approved Four, very luxurious for its atmosphere and service count.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In the lobby where luxury is accompanied with the friendly atmosphere, they make the guest feel that he has never left his home.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The stylish designed reception the guest will find all the services he is looking for. The friendly staff will be more than happy to assist your client and look for his comfort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Ocean Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.763633323426!2d35.872652314668564!3d31.967308532135537!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca053a2ca6803:0xe94de4c658a07ebe!2sOcean Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567781661943!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 479, 'en', '', 'one col', 'ocean-hotel'),
(480, 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel is located in the city of Amman, in the Shmeisani area, close to all vital facilities and services concerned with the comfort of the main guests as it is from the airport approximately 20 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel has single rooms, double rooms, suites, family suites, private suites, private suites Baersan, where the hotel is equipped at the highest levels, was strewn luxuriously kinds of furniture and equipment to provide all levels of comfort and all necessary first visit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel offers free internet and business service, and guests can contact all over the world directly from the rooms, as well as room service and Satellite, refrigerator, safe deposit boxes, laundry service and ironing, shuttle service to and from the airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.3647701803407!2d35.896577214668795!3d31.97812573159583!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca014000921ef:0xc93e8226aef0bbcb!2sAl Thuraya Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567782005138!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 480, 'en', '', 'one col', 'al-thuraya-amman-hotel'),
(481, 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Arabela Amman Hotel is located in Shmeisani Area, the center of Amman and surrounded by great stores, famous restaurants, modern restaurants, modern hospitals, in very active area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It has 36 Super Deluxe Furnished Equipped with A/C, Private Bath Shower, Direct dial Phone, Satelite TV, minibar and internet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This restaurant is established to provide delicious meals of both western and oriental by specialized chef. Kitchen is suitable to do that. Also the restaurant is very quiet place for Bar and alcoholic drinks with high fantasy atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Meeting room equipped with all facilities for your workshops&#039;, restaurant and coffee shop, lobby lounge, room service, Beauty salon, business center and Gym, Gift Shop, High standard of outside catering services and producing is available.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Arabela 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.3468396710605!2d35.89513561466879!3d31.978611931571567!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5fb85d7981af:0x34a5ce977caab726!2sArabela Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567782167907!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 481, 'en', '', 'one col', 'arabela-hotel'),
(482, 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rest Hills Hotel is a 3 Star hotel; it is about 7 km from National Library of Jordan. The venue comprises 57 rooms. At this accommodation you&#039;ll find 24-hour room service, a laundry room and dry cleaning service.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Spacious and air-conditioned, accommodation at Rest Hills Hotel Apartments provides furnished balconies where guests can enjoy breakfast and room service. All apartments include a lounge, a well-equipped kitchen and a dining area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Other facilities offered at the property include currency exchange, a luggage storage and smokers lounge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is also an in house restaurant, serving traditional middle-eastern specialties and some Mediterranean classics. On site vending machines provide refreshments, drinks and snacks 24/7. 20 minutes&#039; drive from Marka International Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Rest hills1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.422854499252!2d35.87460931455142!3d32.03074398120378!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9fa8b4391d5d:0xe2d8af6791fefb2d!2sRest Hills Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783096824!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 482, 'en', '', 'one col', 'rest-hills-hotel'),
(483, 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;An excellent choice for travelers visiting Amman, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that include air conditioning and a mini-bar, bringing comfort and convenience to your visit. Plus, Sandy Palace Hotel offers an international cuisine restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. As well as a Hookah Cafe, to add some oriental relaxing evening to your day.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s easy to stay connected during your stay at Sandy Palace Hotel, we offer our guests a free WiFi.  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel is located in the center of Jabal Al Hussein district, makes Sandy Palace Hotel a great place to stay for those interested in visiting these popular Amman landmarks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sandy.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.722553133814!2d35.91366501454946!3d31.96842278122374!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8b5251b8df:0x5cf75da64adf2d14!2sSandy Palace Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783281004!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 483, 'en', '', 'one col', 'sandy-palace-hotel'),
(484, 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toledo Amman Hotel is located in the heart of Amman, on the edge of the old city center and within walking distance to the new downtown. Toledo Amman Hotel is only few minutes away from major historical and biblical sites, in addition only a two minute walk to the future entertainment center &quot;Al Abdali Boulevard&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toledo Amman Hotel&#039;s 107 guest rooms and suites are provided with all the amenities for your comfort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms are individually climate controlled, with sound insulated windows, satellite channels in several languages, WiFi, mini bar, and direct international telephone services.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms face the famous King Abdullah Mosque and several historical churches.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Toledo.jpeg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.0013333509855!2d35.91539131466848!3d31.960860532457257!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8eb0630c79:0x81b0d6d6950f0a!2sToledo Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783426003!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 484, 'en', '', 'one col', 'toledo-amman-hotel'),
(485, 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sama Paris Hotel is a three stars hotel located in the most beautiful location overlooking the ancient city of Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;With long experiences in hotels management this hotel succeeded in making the services distinguish and giving the customers the most reliable services. A 24 hours rooms services, laundry and shoe cleaning are just a few of the other personal amenities offered, that add extra touch to make your stay even more comfortable.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Mazaj Restaurant location gives it a superior view to all Amman beautiful skylines. The cuisine offers and interesting choice of food and beverages. Served by the courteous, helpful, friendly staff in an atmosphere of elegance and charm. A delicious breakfast buffet is served every morning. Lunch and dinner meals are served a la Carte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;We would like to grab your attention and point out to you the various services and the great site you can see in Jordan during your visit. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sama paris.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.165599509844!2d35.889721814668924!3d31.98352603132624!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f809fa5a23f:0x9cfe6395cb4706c2!2z2YHZhtiv2YIg2LPZhdinINio2KfYsdmK2LM!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783574611!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 485, 'en', '', 'one col', 'sama-paris-hotel');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(486, 'Hôtels à Amman', 'Hôtels à Amman', 'Hôtels à Amman', 'Hôtels à Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Marriott_5.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;amman&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Amman Marriott Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Cet hôtel 5 étoiles propose des chambres bien équipées et spacieuses. Il possède 2 restaurants, 2 bars et un club de bien-être avec 2 piscines...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/amman-marriott-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/four-seasons-hotel-amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Jordan River and Bethany&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Four Seasons Amman Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Four Seasons Hotel Amman, situé sur la plus haute colline d&#039;Amman, propose un hébergement...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;fr/four-seasons-amman-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Lire Plus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/sheraton-amman-al-nabil-hotel-1-825x510.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Desert ca