e Jordania. El local comprende 57...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/rest-hills-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sandy.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Sandy Palace Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Sandy Palace Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Una excelente opción para los viajeros que visitan Ammán, ofreciendo muchas comodidades útiles diseñadas para mejorar...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/sandy-palace-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Toledo.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;Toledo Amman Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Toledo Amman Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Toledo Amman Hotel está ubicado en el corazón de Ammán, en el límite del casco antiguo de la ciudad, a poca distancia del nuevo...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/toledo-amman-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sama paris.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Sama Paris Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Sama Paris Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sama Paris Hotel es un hotel de tres estrellas ubicado en el lugar más hermoso con vista a la antigua ciudad de Amman. Con una larga...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/sama-paris-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 453, 'es', '', 'one col', 'hoteles-en-amman'),
(489, 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este elegante hotel está situado en el corazón del distrito, a pocos pasos de las delicias de esta ciudad antigua pero moderna. Las espaciosas habitaciones se combinan con todas las instalaciones que esperaría de un Marriott, incluida la elección de comidas internacionales, salón de piano, bar y el Oasis Health Club con dos piscinas, gimnasio, sauna e hidromasaje. Ammán Marriott Hotel es su puerta de entrada a las maravillas modernas, las fascinaciones históricas y la comodidad sin igual.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este hotel de 5 estrellas ofrece habitaciones bien equipadas y espaciosas. Cuenta con 2 restaurantes, 2 bares y un club de salud con 2 piscinas. Se encuentra ubicado en el distrito de Shmeissani en Al Abdali. Las habitaciones disponen de aire acondicionado, TV de pantalla plana de 32 pulgadas y mini bar. Cada uno tiene un baño de mármol con secador de pelo y bañera y ducha separadas. Algunas habitaciones cuentan con una zona de estar y comedor independiente.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Villa Mediterrano cuenta con cocina abierta y sirve cocina mediterránea. Il Terrazzo ofrece una auténtica cocina italiana. El galardonado Library Lounge &amp;amp; Cigar Bar ofrece comida gourmet, vinos finos y cigarros. Marriott Ammán también tiene un bar deportivo, un salón de té y un piano bar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Marriott Amman se encuentra a 35 minutos en coche del aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia y a 10 minutos en coche del aeropuerto internacional de Marka.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Marriott_5.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.5528764999776!2d35.903607314549575!3d31.97302468122219!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca00dac398a03:0x7457e2ecc4a18517!2sAmman Marriott Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567690147623!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 454, 'es', '', 'one col', 'amman-marriott-hotel'),
(490, 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet élégant hôtel est situé au cœur du quartier, à quelques pas des merveilles de cette ville ancienne mais moderne. Les chambres spacieuses combinent tous les équipements que vous attendez d&#039;un Marriott, y compris le choix de plats internationaux, un salon de piano, un bar et le club de bien-être Oasis avec deux piscines, une salle de sport, un sauna et un bain à remous. Amman Marriott Hotel est votre passerelle vers les merveilles modernes, les fascinations historiques et le confort inégalé.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel 5 étoiles propose des chambres bien équipées et spacieuses. Il possède 2 restaurants, 2 bars et un club de bien-être avec 2 piscines. Il est situé dans le district de Shmeissani à Al Abdali. Les chambres disposent de la climatisation, d&#039;une télévision à écran plat de 81 cm et d&#039;un minibar. Chacune comprend une salle de bains en marbre avec sèche-cheveux, baignoire et douche séparées. Certaines chambres disposent d&#039;un salon et d&#039;un coin repas séparés.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Villa Mediterrano dispose d&#039;une cuisine ouverte et sert une cuisine méditerranéenne. Il Terrazzo propose une cuisine italienne authentique. Le bar primé Library Lounge &amp;amp; Cigar propose une cuisine gastronomique, des vins raffinés et des cigares. Le Marriott Amman abrite également un bar des sports, un salon de thé et un piano-bar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Marriott Amman se trouve à 35 minutes en voiture de l&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia et à 10 minutes de l&#039;aéroport international de Marka.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Marriott_5.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.5528764999776!2d35.903607314549575!3d31.97302468122219!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca00dac398a03:0x7457e2ecc4a18517!2sAmman Marriott Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567690147623!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 454, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'amman-marriott-hotel'),
(491, 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo elegante hotel è situato nel cuore del quartiere, a pochi passi dalle delizie di questa città antica ma moderna. Le spaziose camere si combinano con tutti i servizi che ci si aspetta da un Marriott, tra cui la scelta di piatti internazionali, piano lounge, bar e l&#039;Oasis Health Club con due piscine, palestra, sauna e idromassaggio. Amman Marriott Hotel è la porta di accesso alle meraviglie moderne, alle affascinazioni storiche e al comfort senza pari.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo hotel a 5 stelle offre camere spaziose e ben attrezzate. Dispone di 2 ristoranti, 2 bar e un centro benessere con 2 piscine. Si trova nel distretto di Shmeissani ad Al Abdali. Le camere sono dotate di aria condizionata, TV a schermo piatto da 32 pollici e minibar. Ognuno ha un bagno in marmo con asciugacapelli e vasca e doccia separate. Alcune camere hanno una zona soggiorno e pranzo separate.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Villa Mediterrano ha una cucina aperta e serve cucina mediterranea. Il Terrazzo offre un&#039;autentica cucina italiana. Il premiato Library Lounge &amp;amp; Cigar Bar offre cibo gourmet, ottimi vini e sigari. Il Marriott Amman ospita anche un bar dello sport, una sala da tè e un piano bar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Marriott Amman dista in auto 35 minuti dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia e 10 minuti dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale Marka.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Marriott_5.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.5528764999776!2d35.903607314549575!3d31.97302468122219!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca00dac398a03:0x7457e2ecc4a18517!2sAmman Marriott Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567690147623!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 454, 'it', '', 'one col', 'amman-marriott-hotel'),
(492, 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', 'Amman Marriott Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This stylish hotel is located in the heart of the downtown district, just steps away from the delights of this ancient yet modern city. Spacious rooms combine with all the facilities you would expect of a Marriott including choice of international dining, piano lounge, bar, and the Oasis Health Club with two pools, gym, sauna and whirlpool. Amman Marriott Hotel is your gateway to modern marvels, historic fascinations and unparalleled comfort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This 5-star hotel offers well-appointed, spacious rooms. It features 2 restaurants, 2 bars, and a health club with 2 pools. It is located in the Shmeissani district in Al Abdali. A 32-inch flat-screen TV and a minibar are in Ammans air-conditioned rooms. Each has a marble bathroom with a hairdryer and separate bath and shower. Some rooms come with a separate seating and dining area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Featuring an open kitchen, Villa Mediterrano serves Mediterranean cuisine. Il Terrazzo offers an authentic Italian cuisine. Gourmet food, fine wine, and cigars are offered at the award-winning Library Lounge &amp;amp; Cigar Bar. Marriott Amman also has a sports bar, a tea lounge and a piano bar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Marriott Amman is a 35-minute drive from Queen Alia International Airport and 10-minute drive from Marka International Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Marriott_5.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.5528764999776!2d35.903607314549575!3d31.97302468122219!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca00dac398a03:0x7457e2ecc4a18517!2sAmman Marriott Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567690147623!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 454, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'amman-marriott-hotel'),
(493, 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Four Seasons Hotel Amman, situado en la colina más alta de Ammán, ofrece alojamiento de lujo con vistas panorámicas a la ciudad. Ofrece piscinas cubiertas y al aire libre, un gimnasio, un spa y una pista de squash. En el Spa podrá disfrutar de masajes, tratamientos corporales, tratamientos faciales o de uñas para hombres y mujeres.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todos los alojamientos con aire acondicionado del Four Seasons Amman están decorados con colores cálidos y suelo de moqueta. Todas las suites y habitaciones cuentan con baño privado y TV de pantalla plana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Disfrute de la cocina levantina en Olea o nuestro exclusivo brunch de los viernes; The Foyer Lounge para comidas ligeras y favoritos internacionales; nuestro nuevo Garden Terrace para sándwiches y ensaladas continentales; y Five Grill &amp;amp; Lounger ofrece refrescos mientras disfruta de una vista de Amman en el verano.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El servicio de concierge de Four Seasons puede brindarle toda la información que necesita durante su estadía en Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Four Seasons Amman se encuentra a 30 minutos en coche del aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia y el Mar Muerto, a 40 minutos en coche.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/four-seasons-hotel-amman.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.973036879678!2d35.87884811454924!3d31.961628181225826!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca05772da5d9d:0x80a84e21ae4f7d59!2sFour Seasons Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567690495298!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 455, 'es', '', 'one col', 'four-seasons-amman-hotel'),
(494, 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Four Seasons Hotel Amman, situé sur la plus haute colline d&#039;Amman, propose un hébergement de luxe avec vue panoramique sur la ville. Il propose des piscines intérieure et extérieure, une salle de sport, un spa et un court de squash. Au spa, vous pourrez profiter de massages, de soins du corps, de soins du visage ou des ongles pour hommes et femmes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tous les hébergements climatisés du Four Seasons Amman sont décorés avec des couleurs chaudes et de la moquette. Toutes les suites et les chambres disposent d&#039;une salle de bains privative et d&#039;une télévision à écran plat.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Profitez de la cuisine levantine à Olea ou de notre brunch exclusif du vendredi; Le salon Foyer pour des repas légers et des plats internationaux; notre nouvelle terrasse de jardin pour les sandwichs et les salades continentaux; et Five Grill &amp;amp; Lounger propose des rafraîchissements tout en profitant d&#039;une vue sur Amman en été.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le service de conciergerie du Four Seasons peut vous fournir toutes les informations dont vous avez besoin pendant votre séjour à Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Four Seasons Amman se trouve à 30 minutes en voiture de l&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia et de la mer Morte, à 40 minutes de route.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/four-seasons-hotel-amman.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.973036879678!2d35.87884811454924!3d31.961628181225826!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca05772da5d9d:0x80a84e21ae4f7d59!2sFour Seasons Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567690495298!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 455, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'four-seasons-amman-hotel'),
(495, 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Four Seasons Hotel Amman, situato sulla collina più alta di Amman, offre sistemazioni di lusso con vista panoramica sulla città. Offre piscine interne ed esterne, una palestra, un centro benessere e un campo da squash. Nella Spa è possibile godere di massaggi, trattamenti per il corpo, trattamenti viso o unghie per uomini e donne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le sistemazioni del Four Seasons Amman sono climatizzate e decorate con colori caldi e pavimenti in moquette. Tutte le suite e le camere sono dotate di bagno privato e TV a schermo piatto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Goditi la cucina levantina di Olea o il nostro esclusivo brunch del venerdì; The Foyer Lounge per pasti leggeri e specialità internazionali; la nostra nuova Garden Terrace per sandwich e insalate continentali; e Five Grill &amp;amp; Lounger offre rinfreschi mentre vi godete una vista di Amman in estate.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il servizio di portineria Four Seasons può fornire tutte le informazioni di cui hai bisogno durante il tuo soggiorno ad Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Four Seasons Amman dista in auto 30 minuti dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia e dal Mar Morto e 40 minuti in auto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/four-seasons-hotel-amman.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.973036879678!2d35.87884811454924!3d31.961628181225826!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca05772da5d9d:0x80a84e21ae4f7d59!2sFour Seasons Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567690495298!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 455, 'it', '', 'one col', 'four-seasons-amman-hotel'),
(496, 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', 'Four Seasons Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located on the highest hill of Amman, Four Seasons Hotel Amman boasts luxurious accommodation with panoramic views of the city. It offers indoor and outdoor pools, a gym, a spa and a squash court. At the Spa you can enjoy massages, body treatments, facials or nail treatments for male and female.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All air-conditioned accommodation at Four Seasons Amman is furnished with warm colors and carpeted floors. Each suite and room comes with a private bathroom and a flat-screen TV.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy Levant cuisine at Olea or our unique Friday Brunch; The Foyer Lounge for light meals and international favorites; our new Garden Terrace for continental sandwiches and salads; and Five Grill &amp;amp; Lounger offers refreshments while boasting a view of Amman in the summer.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Four Seasons Concierge desk can give you all the information you need during your stay in Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Four Seasons Amman is a 30-minutes drive from Queen Alia International Airport, and the Dead Sea is 40-minutes away by car.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/four-seasons-hotel-amman.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.973036879678!2d35.87884811454924!3d31.961628181225826!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca05772da5d9d:0x80a84e21ae4f7d59!2sFour Seasons Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567690495298!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 455, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'four-seasons-amman-hotel'),
(497, 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este lujoso hotel de 5 estrellas se encuentra en el centro del distrito financiero de Ammán, a solo 3,2 km del centro comercial Al Mukhtar Mall Amman. Cuenta con piscinas cubiertas y al aire libre, spa y gimnasio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todos los días se sirve un desayuno en el restaurante Spice Garden, que también sirve cenas buffet temáticas. El Green Lounge ofrece una selección de cafés y tés de todos los continentes y entretenimiento en vivo por la noche.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones están equipadas con muebles elegantes y refinados. Las modernas instalaciones incluyen TV vía satélite en todas las habitaciones. Algunas habitaciones del Sheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel tienen una sala de estar y un balcón.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El spa Sheraton Amman ofrece tratamientos de masaje y baño de vapor. También hay un moderno gimnasio equipado con equipo cardiovascular y pesas libres. También se proporciona acceso a Wi-Fi. El Sanctuary Lounge sirve cócteles refrescantes y varios platos en forma de buffet o como artículos individuales. En The Green Lounge se pueden disfrutar bebidas, aperitivos y entretenimiento en vivo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Sheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel ofrece aparcamiento privado gratuito. El aeropuerto internacional de Marka se encuentra a 9.7 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/sheraton-amman-al-nabil-hotel-1-825x510.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.010074912194!2d35.877981514549234!3d31.96062338122619!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1504a948e643cb09:0x185af7c4d5a2737b!2sSheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567691233606!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 456, 'es', '', 'one col', 'sheraton-amman-al-nabil-hotel');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(498, 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel 5 étoiles de luxe est situé dans le centre du quartier financier d&#039;Amman, à seulement 3 km du centre commercial Al Mukhtar Mall Amman. Il possède des piscines intérieure et extérieure, un spa et une salle de sport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le petit-déjeuner est servi tous les jours au restaurant Spice Garden, qui propose également des dîners buffet à thème. Le Green Lounge propose une sélection de cafés et de thés de tous les continents et propose des spectacles en soirée.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres sont équipées d&#039;un mobilier élégant et raffiné. Les installations modernes incluent la télévision par satellite dans toutes les chambres. Certaines chambres du Sheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel disposent d&#039;un salon et d&#039;un balcon.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le spa du Sheraton Amman propose des massages et un bain à vapeur. Vous trouverez également une salle de sport moderne équipée d&#039;appareils de cardio-training et de poids libres. Une connexion Wi-Fi est également fournie. Le salon Sanctuary sert des cocktails rafraîchissants et divers plats de style buffet ou en tant qu&#039;éléments individuels. Dans le Green Lounge, vous pourrez déguster des boissons, des collations et des spectacles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Sheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel propose un parking privé gratuit. L&#039;aéroport international de Marka est à 9,7 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/sheraton-amman-al-nabil-hotel-1-825x510.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.010074912194!2d35.877981514549234!3d31.96062338122619!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1504a948e643cb09:0x185af7c4d5a2737b!2sSheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567691233606!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 456, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'sheraton-amman-al-nabil-hotel'),
(499, 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo lussuoso hotel a 5 stelle si trova nel centro del quartiere finanziario di Amman, a soli 3 km dal centro commerciale Al Mukhtar Mall Amman. Dispone di piscine interne ed esterne, spa e palestra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La colazione viene servita ogni giorno presso il ristorante Spice Garden, che serve anche cene a buffet a tema. La Green Lounge offre una selezione di caffè e tè da tutti i continenti e spettacoli dal vivo di notte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere sono dotate di mobili eleganti e raffinati. I servizi moderni includono TV satellitare in tutte le camere. Alcune camere dello Sheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel dispongono di soggiorno e balcone.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La spa Sheraton Amman offre massaggi e un bagno di vapore. C&#039;è anche una moderna palestra attrezzata con attrezzature cardio e pesi liberi. È inoltre previsto l&#039;accesso Wi-Fi. Il Sanctuary Lounge serve cocktail rinfrescanti e vari piatti a buffet o come singoli elementi. Nel Green Lounge puoi goderti drink, snack e spettacoli dal vivo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lo Sheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel offre un parcheggio privato gratuito. L&#039;aeroporto internazionale di Marka dista 9,7 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/sheraton-amman-al-nabil-hotel-1-825x510.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.010074912194!2d35.877981514549234!3d31.96062338122619!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1504a948e643cb09:0x185af7c4d5a2737b!2sSheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567691233606!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 456, 'it', '', 'one col', 'sheraton-amman-al-nabil-hotel'),
(500, 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', 'Sheraton Amman Al-Nabil Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This luxurious 5-star hotel in the center of Amman´s business district is only 3.2 km from Al Mukhtar Mall Amman. It features indoor and outdoor pools, a spa and gym.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A daily breakfast is served at the Spice Garden all day dining restaurant which also serves themed buffet dinners. The Green Lounge offers a selection of coffees and teas from all the continents and live entertainment in the evening.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms are equipped with chic and elegant furnishings. Modern facilities include a satellite TV in every room. Some rooms of Sheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel have a sitting area and a balcony.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Massage treatments and a steam bath are available at Sheraton Amman spa. There is also a modern gym equipped with cardio equipment and free weights. Wi-Fi access is also provided. The Sanctuary Lounge serves refreshing cocktails and various dishes in a buffet style or as individual items. Drinks, snacks and live entertainment can be enjoyed at The Green Lounge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Free private parking is available at Sheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel. Marka International Airport is 9.7 km away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/sheraton-amman-al-nabil-hotel-1-825x510.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.010074912194!2d35.877981514549234!3d31.96062338122619!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1504a948e643cb09:0x185af7c4d5a2737b!2sSheraton Amman Al Nabil Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567691233606!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 456, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'sheraton-amman-al-nabil-hotel'),
(501, 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Elevándose sobre Ammán, Le Royal es el hogar de un lujoso centro comercial de 3 pisos. En el spa hay salas panorámicas de fitness, un baño de vapor y una peluquería.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las elegantes habitaciones de Le Royal Amman tienen ventanas panorámicas extragrandes con vistas a la ciudad. TV interactiva e internet de alta velocidad están disponibles y los huéspedes son recibidos con un refresco de cortesía.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las lujosas piscinas cubiertas y al aire libre, la bañera de hidromasaje y la sauna brindan relajación, mientras que el estudio de aeróbicos es perfecto para un buen entrenamiento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los huéspedes pueden elegir entre 13 restaurantes y bares internacionales. Sushi, comida italiana y pasteles finos están disponibles. Un brunch del viernes con música de jazz, cócteles exóticos en el Buddah Club y un salón panorámico para fumadores son algunas de las opciones de entretenimiento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En el tercer círculo, Le Royal está a unos 4,8 km del aeropuerto internacional de Marka y hay un servicio de traslado disponible. Aparcamiento gratuito también en el sitio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/le royal 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.282320458493!2d35.909222199999995!3d31.953236800000003!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca07c249f6901:0x17e132e18724ba3!2sLe Royal Hotel, Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567691576021!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 457, 'es', '', 'one col', 'le-royal-hotel'),
(502, 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Surplombant Amman, Le Royal abrite un luxueux centre commercial de trois étages. Dans le spa, vous trouverez des salles de remise en forme panoramiques, un bain à vapeur et un coiffeur.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres élégantes du Royal Amman possèdent de grandes fenêtres panoramiques donnant sur la ville. Une télévision interactive et une connexion haut débit à Internet sont disponibles et les clients sont accueillis avec une boisson non alcoolisée.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les luxueuses piscines intérieure et extérieure, le bain à remous et le sauna invitent à la détente, tandis que le studio d&#039;aérobic est parfait pour une bonne séance d&#039;entraînement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez choisir parmi 13 restaurants et bars internationaux. Des sushis, des plats italiens et des gâteaux raffinés sont disponibles. Un brunch du vendredi avec de la musique jazz, des cocktails exotiques au Buddah Club et un salon panoramique pour les fumeurs sont quelques-unes des options de divertissement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dans le troisième cercle, Le Royal est à environ 4,8 km de l&#039;aéroport international de Marka et un service de navette est disponible. Parking gratuit également sur place.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/le royal 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.282320458493!2d35.909222199999995!3d31.953236800000003!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca07c249f6901:0x17e132e18724ba3!2sLe Royal Hotel, Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567691576021!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 457, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'le-royal-hotel'),
(503, 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sorge sopra Amman, Le Royal ospita un lussuoso centro commerciale a 3 piani. Nel centro benessere ci sono sale fitness panoramiche, un bagno di vapore e un parrucchiere.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le eleganti camere del Royal Amman dispongono di grandi finestre panoramiche con vista sulla città. Sono disponibili TV interattiva e Internet ad alta velocità e gli ospiti vengono accolti con una bibita analcolica gratuita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le lussuose piscine interne ed esterne, la vasca idromassaggio e la sauna offrono relax, mentre lo studio di aerobica è perfetto per un buon allenamento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gli ospiti possono scegliere tra 13 ristoranti e bar internazionali. Sushi, cibo italiano e torte raffinate sono disponibili. Un brunch del venerdì con musica jazz, cocktail esotici al Buddah Club e una sala panoramica per i fumatori sono alcune delle opzioni di intrattenimento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nella terza cerchia, Le Royal dista circa 4,8 km dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale di Marka ed è disponibile un servizio navetta. Parcheggio gratuito anche in loco.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/le royal 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.282320458493!2d35.909222199999995!3d31.953236800000003!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca07c249f6901:0x17e132e18724ba3!2sLe Royal Hotel, Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567691576021!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 457, 'it', '', 'one col', 'le-royal-hotel'),
(504, 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', 'Le Royal Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Towering over Amman, Le Royal is home to a luxurious 3-floor shopping mall. Panoramic fitness rooms, a mudroom and a hairdresser are available at the spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All elegant rooms at Le Royal Amman have extra-large panoramic windows with views of the city. Interactive TV and high-speed internet are available and guests are welcomed with a complimentary soft drink.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Luxury indoor and outdoor pools, a hot tub, and sauna provide relaxation, while the aerobics studio is perfect for a good workout.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can choose from 13 international restaurants and bars. Sushi, Italian fare and fine pastries are all available. A Friday brunch with jazz music, exotic cocktails at the Buddah Club and a panoramic smoking lounge are some of the entertainment options.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In the 3rd Circle, Le Royal is about 4.8 km from Marka International Airport, and a shuttle service is available. Free parking is also on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/le royal 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.282320458493!2d35.909222199999995!3d31.953236800000003!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca07c249f6901:0x17e132e18724ba3!2sLe Royal Hotel, Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567691576021!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 457, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'le-royal-hotel'),
(505, 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Combinando instalaciones contemporáneas con características locales, InterContinental ofrece alojamiento elegante en el Área Diplomática de Ammán. Cuenta con una piscina rodeada de palmeras, una palaciega piscina cubierta y un spa con bañera de hidromasaje y tratamientos de masaje.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Con muebles de diseño, las habitaciones del InterContinental Jordan son elegantes y funcionales. Todos incluyen un amplio salón con sala de estar, canales de TV vía satélite y baños de lujo con bañera.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En el Boulevard Café se sirven tartas y pasteles caseros por las mañanas, aperitivos durante el día y aperitivos antes de la cena. El lugar cuenta con grandes sofás y ofrece la oportunidad de conocer a los lugareños en un ambiente informal.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El personal de recepción las 24 horas puede ayudarlo en cualquier momento que lo necesite. La ciudadela de Ammán se encuentra a 1 km y el elegante centro comercial Al Mukhtar está a solo 5 minutos en coche del hotel InterContinental.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/intercontinental.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.2794760983593!2d35.910959314548975!3d31.953313981228465!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca07f4b28ecf5:0xf8a517c99e5113ea!2sInterContinental Amman (Jordan)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567692022132!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 458, 'es', '', 'one col', 'intercontinental-amman-hotel'),
(506, 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Combinando servizi moderni con caratteristiche locali, InterContinental offre sistemazioni eleganti nell&#039;area diplomatica di Amman. Dispone di una piscina circondata da palme, una sontuosa piscina coperta e un centro benessere con vasca idromassaggio e massaggi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Con mobili di design, le camere dell&#039;InterContinental Jordan sono eleganti e funzionali. Tutti includono un ampio soggiorno con soggiorno, canali TV satellitari e lussuosi bagni con vasca.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Torte fatte in casa e torte sono servite al Boulevard Café al mattino, snack durante il giorno e snack prima di cena. Il posto ha grandi divani e offre l&#039;opportunità di incontrare la gente del posto in un&#039;atmosfera informale.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il personale della reception 24 ore su 24 può aiutarti in ogni momento. La Cittadella di Amman si trova a 1 km di distanza e l&#039;elegante centro commerciale Al Mukhtar si trova a soli 5 minuti di auto dall&#039;hotel InterContinental.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/intercontinental.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.2794760983593!2d35.910959314548975!3d31.953313981228465!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca07f4b28ecf5:0xf8a517c99e5113ea!2sInterContinental Amman (Jordan)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567692022132!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 458, 'it', '', 'one col', 'intercontinental-amman-hotel'),
(507, 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alliant installations modernes et caractéristiques locales, l&#039;InterContinental propose un hébergement élégant dans le quartier diplomatique d&#039;Amman. Il possède une piscine entourée de palmiers, une superbe piscine couverte et un spa avec bain à remous et massages.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Avec un mobilier design, les chambres de l&#039;InterContinental Jordan sont élégantes et fonctionnelles. Toutes comprennent un salon spacieux avec salon, chaînes de télévision par satellite et salles de bains de luxe avec baignoire.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Des gâteaux et des gâteaux faits maison sont servis au Boulevard Café le matin, des collations pendant la journée et des collations avant le dîner. L&#039;endroit dispose de grands canapés et offre la possibilité de rencontrer les habitants dans une atmosphère informelle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le personnel de la réception ouverte 24h / 24 peut vous aider à tout moment. La citadelle d&#039;Amman est à 1 km et l&#039;élégant centre commercial Al Mukhtar se trouve à seulement 5 minutes de route de l&#039;hôtel InterContinental.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/intercontinental.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.2794760983593!2d35.910959314548975!3d31.953313981228465!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca07f4b28ecf5:0xf8a517c99e5113ea!2sInterContinental Amman (Jordan)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567692022132!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 458, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'intercontinental-amman-hotel'),
(508, 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', 'InterContinental Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Combining contemporary facilities with local features, InterContinental offers stylish accommodations in Amman´s Diplomatic Area. It features a palm-fringed pool, a palatial indoor pool and a spa with hot tub and massage treatments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Featuring designer furnishings, rooms at InterContinental Jordan are chic and functional. They all include a spacious lounge with sitting area, satellite TV channels and deluxe bathrooms with bathtub.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Homemade cake and pastries in the mornings, snacks during the day and pre-dinner aperitifs are served at the Boulevard Café. The place features large couches and provides a chance to meet the locals in an informal atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 24-hour front desk staff can assist you at any time you may need it. Amman Citadel is one kilometer away and the elegant Al Mukhtar Mall is only a 5 minute drive from the InterContinental Hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/intercontinental.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.2794760983593!2d35.910959314548975!3d31.953313981228465!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca07f4b28ecf5:0xf8a517c99e5113ea!2sInterContinental Amman (Jordan)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567692022132!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 458, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'intercontinental-amman-hotel'),
(509, 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Convenientemente ubicado en el corazón del distrito comercial y diplomático de Jabal Amman, este hotel de 5 estrellas ofrece lujosas habitaciones con TV vía satélite. Los servicios de salud y spa incluyen piscinas cubiertas y al aire libre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones con aire acondicionado del Grand Hyatt Amman presentan un interior moderno con toques arábicos. Todas las habitaciones disponen de soporte para iPod, reproductor de DVD, mini bar y set de té y café. Los baños de mármol incluyen comodidades de lujo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El restaurante 32º Norte cuenta con un bar de mariscos que sirve ostras frescas, vieiras, patas de cangrejo de Alaska, langostas y camarones. L’Incontro, el exclusivo restaurante del Grand Hyatt Amman, ofrece especialidades italianas. El restaurante Indochine ofrece una amplia selección de platos de la cocina vietnamita. Los huéspedes pueden disfrutar de una selección de té importado, cafés especiales y cócteles en The Lounge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Club Olympos Spa ofrece tratamientos holísticos de terapeutas profesionales. El área de spa Grand Hyatt también cuenta con un gimnasio, saunas, baños de vapor y jacuzzis.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Grand Hyatt Amman brinda acceso al centro de conferencias Zara Expo y al Zara Center, que incluye cines, patios de comida y las tiendas más modernas de Amman. El centro de Ammán está a solo 5 minutos en coche del hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Grand_Hyatt.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.186418875123!2d35.90779431454903!3d31.955838981227735!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b7c86523a5947:0x9236d95c77ea6232!2sGrand Hyatt Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567692388278!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 459, 'es', '', 'one col', 'grand-hyatt-amman'),
(510, 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Idéalement situé au cœur du quartier commerçant et diplomatique de Jabal Amman, cet hôtel 5 étoiles propose des chambres luxueuses avec télévision par satellite. Les services de santé et de spa incluent des piscines intérieures et extérieures.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres climatisées du Grand Hyatt Amman présentent un intérieur moderne avec des touches arabes. Toutes les chambres disposent d&#039;une station d&#039;accueil pour iPod, d&#039;un lecteur DVD, d&#039;un mini-bar et d&#039;un plateau / bouilloire. Les salles de bains en marbre comprennent des articles de toilette de luxe.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le restaurant 32º Norte abrite un bar de fruits de mer qui sert des huîtres fraîches, des coquilles Saint-Jacques, des cuisses de crabe de l&#039;Alaska, du homard et des crevettes. L’Incontro, le restaurant exclusif du Grand Hyatt Amman, propose des spécialités italiennes. Le restaurant Indochine propose une large sélection de plats vietnamiens. Vous pourrez déguster une sélection de thé importé, de cafés de spécialité et de cocktails dans le salon.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le club de spa Olympos propose des traitements holistiques pour les thérapeutes professionnels. Le spa Grand Hyatt comprend également une salle de sport, des saunas, des hammams et des bains à remous.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Grand Hyatt Amman donne accès au centre de conférence Zara Expo et au centre Zara, qui comprend des cinémas, des aires de restauration et les magasins les plus modernes d’Amman. Le centre d&#039;Amman se trouve à seulement 5 minutes de route de l&#039;hôtel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Grand_Hyatt.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.186418875123!2d35.90779431454903!3d31.955838981227735!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b7c86523a5947:0x9236d95c77ea6232!2sGrand Hyatt Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567692388278!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 459, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'grand-hyatt-amman'),
(511, 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Convenientemente situato nel cuore del quartiere commerciale e diplomatico di Jabal Amman, questo hotel a 5 stelle offre lussuose camere con TV satellitare. I servizi benessere e spa comprendono piscine interne ed esterne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camere del Grand Hyatt Amman sono climatizzate e presentano interni moderni con accenti arabi. Tutte le camere sono dotate di docking station per iPod, lettore DVD, minibar e set per la preparazione di tè e caffè. I bagni in marmo includono accessori di lusso.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il ristorante Norte 32º ha un bar di pesce che serve ostriche fresche, capesante, cosce di granchio dell&#039;Alaska, aragoste e gamberi. L&#039;Incontro, l&#039;esclusivo ristorante del Grand Hyatt Amman, offre specialità italiane. Il ristorante Indochine offre una vasta selezione di piatti vietnamiti. Presso il Lounge potrete gustare una selezione di tè importati, caffè speciali e cocktail.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Olympos Spa Club offre trattamenti olistici per terapisti professionisti. L&#039;area benessere del Grand Hyatt ospita anche una palestra, saune, bagni turchi e vasche idromassaggio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Grand Hyatt Amman offre accesso al centro conferenze Zara Expo e al Zara Center, che comprende cinema, food court e i più moderni negozi Amman. Il centro di Amman è a soli 5 minuti di auto dall&#039;hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Grand_Hyatt.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.186418875123!2d35.90779431454903!3d31.955838981227735!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b7c86523a5947:0x9236d95c77ea6232!2sGrand Hyatt Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567692388278!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 459, 'it', '', 'one col', 'grand-hyatt-amman'),
(512, 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', 'Grand Hyatt Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Conveniently located in the heart of the business and diplomatic district of Jabal Amman, this 5-star hotel offers luxurious rooms with satellite TV. Health and spa services include indoor and outdoor pools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The air-conditioned rooms at Grand Hyatt Amman feature a modern interior with arabesque touches. All rooms have an iPod docking station, a DVD player, a minibar, and tea and coffee-making facilities. The marble bathrooms include luxury amenities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Restaurant 32º North features a seafood bar, serving fresh oysters, scallops, Alaskan Crab legs, lobsters, and shrimp. L’Incontro, Grand Hyatt Amman’s signature restaurant, provides Italian specialties. Indochine restaurant offers a wide selection of dishes from the Vietnamese cuisine. Guests can enjoy a selection of imported tea, specialty coffees and cocktails at The Lounge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Club Olympos Spa features holistic treatments from professional therapists. Grand Hyatt spa area also has a fitness center, saunas, steam rooms, and whirlpools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Grand Hyatt Amman provides access to the conference center Zara Expo and the Zara Center, including cinemas, food courts, and Amman’s most fashionables shops. Downtown Amman is just a 5-minute drive from the hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Grand_Hyatt.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.186418875123!2d35.90779431454903!3d31.955838981227735!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b7c86523a5947:0x9236d95c77ea6232!2sGrand Hyatt Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567692388278!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 459, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'grand-hyatt-amman');
