&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sama paris.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Sama Paris Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Sama Paris Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sama Paris Hotel is a three stars hotel located in the most beautiful location overlooking the ancient city of Amman...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/sama-paris-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 453, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'hotels-in-amman'),
(514, 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 5-star Le Grand Amman Managed by Accorhotels is located in the heart of Amman as well as features a year-round outdoor pool and free Wi-Fi. The venue comprises 430 non-smoking rooms spread across 9 floors. You can benefit from currency exchange, storage for belongings and a lift.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The accommodation lies within 3.2 km from The Citadel. It’s easily reached within 3.8 km from Roman Theater. The hotel is located within minutes of boutiques and a mall.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The guest rooms are fitted with TV set with satellite channels, ironing facilities and blinds. Each room opens onto the garden. Each room includes a bathroom with a roll in shower, a hairdryer and terry dressing gowns.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The property offers daily buffet breakfast. Enzo restaurant prepares a wide selection of Japanese dishes. Drop in for delicious drinks at the sushi bar onsite. Guests can dine at Al Mukhtar and Benihana 5 minutes walking distance from the venue.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A bus stop is just a short walk away. Bikes and cars for rent are available at this superior accommodation and lawn tennis and cycling can be organized. This hotel also provides a gym, aerobics classes and a fitness centre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Le Grand Amman.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.6516565523425!2d35.90372061454948!3d31.970345681223073!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06deee134e7:0x72780c26aff93ce2!2sLe Grand Amman Managed by ACCOR!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567694803545!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 460, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'le-grand-amman-managed-by-accor'),
(515, 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Le Grand Amman Managed by Accorhotels, de 5 estrellas, está situado en el corazón de Ammán y cuenta con una piscina al aire libre durante todo el año y conexión inalámbrica a internet gratuita. El recinto consta de 430 habitaciones para no fumadores repartidas en 9 plantas. Puede beneficiarse del cambio de divisas, el almacenamiento de pertenencias y un ascensor.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El alojamiento está a 3.2 km de The Citadel. Es fácilmente accesible a 3,8 km del teatro romano. El hotel se encuentra a pocos minutos de boutiques y un centro comercial.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones están equipadas con TV con canales vía satélite, utensilios de planchado y persianas. Cada habitación se abre al jardín. Cada habitación incluye un baño con ducha a ras de suelo, secador de pelo y batas de felpa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El establecimiento ofrece un desayuno bufé diario. El restaurante Enzo prepara una amplia selección de platos japoneses. Visite el bar de sushi y deléitese con deliciosas bebidas en el lugar. Los huéspedes pueden comer en Al Mukhtar y Benihana a 5 minutos a pie del lugar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Una parada de autobús está a pocos pasos de distancia. En este alojamiento superior hay bicicletas y coches de alquiler disponibles, y se puede organizar tenis sobre hierba y ciclismo. Este hotel también ofrece un gimnasio, clases de aeróbic y un gimnasio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Le Grand Amman.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.6516565523425!2d35.90372061454948!3d31.970345681223073!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06deee134e7:0x72780c26aff93ce2!2sLe Grand Amman Managed by ACCOR!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567694803545!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 460, 'es', '', 'one col', 'le-grand-amman-managed-by-accor'),
(516, 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Grand Amman Managed by Accorhotels est un établissement 5 étoiles situé au cœur d&#039;Amman. Il dispose d&#039;une piscine extérieure ouverte toute l&#039;année et d&#039;une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite. L&#039;enceinte comprend 430 chambres non-fumeurs réparties sur 9 étages. Vous pouvez bénéficier d&#039;un service de change, de stockage de vos biens et d&#039;un ascenseur.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les hébergements se trouvent à 3,2 km de la citadelle. Il est facilement accessible à 3,8 km du théâtre romain. L&#039;hôtel se trouve à quelques minutes de boutiques et d&#039;un centre commercial.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres sont équipées d&#039;une télévision par satellite, de matériel de repassage et de volets. Chaque pièce ouvre sur le jardin. Chaque chambre comprend une salle de bains avec une douche à l&#039;italienne, un sèche-cheveux et des peignoirs moelleux.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;établissement propose un petit-déjeuner buffet tous les jours. Le restaurant Enzo prépare une large sélection de plats japonais. Visitez le bar à sushi et dégustez de délicieuses boissons sur place. Vous pourrez manger à Al Mukhtar et à Benihana, à 5 minutes à pied de la place.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un arrêt de bus est à quelques pas. Des vélos et des voitures de location sont disponibles dans cet hébergement supérieur. Vous pourrez également faire du tennis sur gazon et du vélo. Cet hôtel propose également une salle de fitness, des cours d&#039;aérobic et une salle de fitness.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Le Grand Amman.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.6516565523425!2d35.90372061454948!3d31.970345681223073!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06deee134e7:0x72780c26aff93ce2!2sLe Grand Amman Managed by ACCOR!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567694803545!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 460, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'le-grand-amman-managed-by-accor'),
(517, 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', 'Le Grand Amman Managed By ACCOR', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il 5 stelle Le Grand Amman Managed by Accorhotels si trova nel cuore di Amman e offre una piscina esterna aperta tutto l&#039;anno e la connessione Wi-Fi gratuita. Il recinto è composto da 430 camere non fumatori dislocate su 9 piani. Puoi beneficiare di cambio valuta, deposito di effetti personali e ascensore.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Cittadella dista 3,2 km. È facilmente accessibile a 3,8 km dal teatro romano. L&#039;hotel si trova a pochi minuti da boutique e un centro commerciale.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camere sono dotate di TV con canali satellitari, set da stiro e persiane. Ogni camera si apre sul giardino. Ogni camera è dotata di bagno con cabina doccia, asciugacapelli e morbidi accappatoi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al mattino vi attende una colazione a buffet. Il ristorante Enzo prepara un&#039;ampia selezione di piatti giapponesi. Visita il sushi bar e goditi deliziosi drink in loco. Potrete mangiare ad Al Mukhtar e Benihana, a 5 minuti a piedi dal luogo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Una fermata dell&#039;autobus è a pochi passi di distanza. Biciclette e auto a noleggio sono disponibili in questa sistemazione di qualità superiore e possono essere organizzati tennis sull&#039;erba e ciclismo. Questo hotel offre anche una palestra, lezioni di aerobica e una palestra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Le Grand Amman.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.6516565523425!2d35.90372061454948!3d31.970345681223073!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06deee134e7:0x72780c26aff93ce2!2sLe Grand Amman Managed by ACCOR!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567694803545!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 460, 'it', '', 'one col', 'le-grand-amman-managed-by-accor'),
(518, 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Thousand Nights Hotel is located in Amman, 2.5 km from Diwan al-Sultan Ibrahim Restaurant. The hotel has a terrace and sauna, and guests can enjoy a meal at the restaurant. Free WiFi is featured throughout the property and free private parking is available on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Every room at this hotel is air conditioned and is equipped with a flat-screen TV with satellite channels. Certain rooms feature a seating area to relax in after a busy day. You will find a kettle in the room. Each room has a private bathroom. For your comfort, you will find bath robes and slippers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Hussein National Park is 3.5 km from Thousand Nights Hotel, while US Embassy is 5 km from the property. Abu Jbara restaurant &amp;amp; Habiba restaurant are adjacent to the property. The nearest airport is Queen Alia International Airport, 32 km from the property.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is a 24-hour front desk at the property.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Thousands nights2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.999353826241!2d35.86382491454993!3d31.9880329812173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1c9578c0653:0x39c2045307672c0f!2sThousand Nights Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567695853659!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 461, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'thousand-nights-hotel'),
(519, 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Thousand Nights Hotel se encuentra en Ammán, a 2,5 km del restaurante Diwan al-Sultan Ibrahim. El hotel tiene una terraza y sauna, y los huéspedes pueden disfrutar de una comida en el restaurante. Hay WiFi gratuita en todo el establecimiento y aparcamiento privado gratuito en el establecimiento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones de este hotel tienen aire acondicionado y están equipadas con TV de pantalla plana con canales vía satélite. Algunas habitaciones cuentan con una zona de estar para relajarse después de un día ajetreado. Encontrará un hervidor de agua en la habitación. Todas las habitaciones incluyen un baño privado. Para su comodidad, encontrará albornoces y zapatillas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Thousand Nights Hotel se encuentra a 3,5 km del parque nacional Al Hussein y a 5 km de la embajada de los Estados Unidos. El restaurante Abu Jbara y el restaurante Habiba se encuentran junto al establecimiento. El aeropuerto más cercano es el de Queen Alia International, a 32 km del alojamiento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El establecimiento dispone de recepción las 24 horas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Thousands nights2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.999353826241!2d35.86382491454993!3d31.9880329812173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1c9578c0653:0x39c2045307672c0f!2sThousand Nights Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567695853659!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 461, 'es', '', 'one col', 'thousand-nights-hotel'),
(520, 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Thousand Nights Hotel est situé à Amman, à 2,5 km du restaurant Diwan al-Sultan Ibrahim. L&#039;hôtel dispose d&#039;une terrasse et d&#039;un sauna. Vous pourrez savourer un repas au restaurant. Une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite est disponible dans tout l&#039;établissement et un parking privé gratuit sur place.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres de cet hôtel sont climatisées et équipées d&#039;une télévision par satellite à écran plat. Certaines chambres disposent d&#039;un coin salon propice à la détente après une journée bien remplie. Vous trouverez une bouilloire dans la chambre. Toutes les chambres comprennent une salle de bains privative. Pour votre confort, vous trouverez des peignoirs et des chaussons.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Thousand Nights Hotel se trouve à 3,5 km du parc national Al Hussein et à 5 km de l&#039;ambassade des États-Unis. Les restaurants Abu Jbara et Habiba sont situés à côté de l&#039;établissement. L&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia, le plus proche, se trouve à 32 km de l&#039;hébergement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;établissement dispose d&#039;une réception ouverte 24h / 24.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Thousands nights2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.999353826241!2d35.86382491454993!3d31.9880329812173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1c9578c0653:0x39c2045307672c0f!2sThousand Nights Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567695853659!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 461, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'thousand-nights-hotel'),
(521, 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', 'Thousand Nights Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Thousand Nights Hotel si trova ad Amman, a 2,5 km dal ristorante Iwanhim Diwan al-Sultan. L&#039;hotel dispone di una terrazza e sauna, e gli ospiti possono gustare un pasto nel ristorante. La connessione Wi-Fi è gratuita in tutta la struttura e un parcheggio privato gratuito in loco.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere di questo hotel sono climatizzate e dotate di TV a schermo piatto con canali satellitari. Alcune camere dispongono di un&#039;area salotto per rilassarsi dopo una giornata intensa. Troverete un bollitore in camera. Tutte le camere sono dotate di bagno privato. Per la vostra comodità, troverete accappatoi e pantofole.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Thousand Nights Hotel dista 3,5 km dal Parco Nazionale Al Hussein e 5 km dall&#039;Ambasciata degli Stati Uniti. Il ristorante Abu Jbara e il ristorante Habiba si trovano accanto alla struttura. L&#039;aeroporto più vicino è Queen Alia International, a 32 km dalla struttura.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La struttura dispone di una reception aperta 24 ore al giorno.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Thousands nights2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.999353826241!2d35.86382491454993!3d31.9880329812173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1c9578c0653:0x39c2045307672c0f!2sThousand Nights Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567695853659!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 461, 'it', '', 'one col', 'thousand-nights-hotel'),
(522, 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Bristol Hotel is in central Amman, close to the city’s business and commercial district. This 5-star hotel offers comfortable rooms, Wi-Fi for an additional fee and free parking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Breakfast is included in the room rate and can be enjoyed on the sunny terrace overlooking the pool. There are 6 restaurants and bars at the hotel, open throughout the day and serving a great selection of international food including many local specialties.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This Hotel is a great choice for travelers interested in restaurants, family friendly trips and food.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relax in the sun by the Bristol Hotels lovely swimming pool. There is also a fitness center for guests to use.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Bristol_7.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.076794560982!2d35.87413161454919!3d31.958813281226774!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0f8d2a8f185:0xc5a7b9ec3d05caa7!2sBristol Amman Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696335551!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 462, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'bristol-amman-hotel');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(523, 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Bristol Hotel está en el centro de Ammán, cerca del distrito comercial y de negocios de la ciudad. Este hotel de 5 estrellas ofrece cómodas habitaciones, conexión inalámbrica a internet por un cargo adicional y aparcamiento gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El desayuno está incluido en el precio de la habitación y se puede disfrutar en la terraza soleada con vistas a la piscina. Hay 6 restaurantes y bares en el hotel, abiertos durante todo el día y que sirven una gran selección de comida internacional que incluye muchas especialidades locales.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este hotel es una excelente opción para los viajeros interesados en restaurantes, viajes familiares y comida.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relájese al sol junto a la encantadora piscina del Bristol Hotel. También hay un gimnasio para uso de los huéspedes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Bristol_7.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.076794560982!2d35.87413161454919!3d31.958813281226774!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0f8d2a8f185:0xc5a7b9ec3d05caa7!2sBristol Amman Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696335551!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 462, 'es', '', 'one col', 'bristol-amman-hotel'),
(524, 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel Bristol est situé dans le centre d&#039;Amman, à proximité du quartier des commerces et des affaires de la ville. Cet hôtel 5 étoiles propose des chambres confortables, une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite moyennant des frais supplémentaires et un parking gratuit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le petit-déjeuner est inclus dans le prix de la chambre et peut être apprécié sur la terrasse ensoleillée surplombant la piscine. Il y a 6 restaurants et bars dans l&#039;hôtel, ouverts toute la journée et servant une grande sélection de plats internationaux comprenant de nombreuses spécialités locales.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel est une excellente option pour les voyageurs intéressés par les restaurants, les voyages en famille et la nourriture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Détendez-vous au soleil au bord de la belle piscine de l&#039;hôtel Bristol. Une salle de sport est à la disposition des clients.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Bristol_7.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.076794560982!2d35.87413161454919!3d31.958813281226774!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0f8d2a8f185:0xc5a7b9ec3d05caa7!2sBristol Amman Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696335551!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 462, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'bristol-amman-hotel'),
(525, 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', 'Bristol Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Bristol Hotel è situato nel centro di Amman, vicino al quartiere commerciale e degli affari della città. Questo hotel a 5 stelle offre camere confortevoli, la connessione Wi-Fi gratuita a un costo aggiuntivo e un parcheggio gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La colazione è inclusa nel prezzo della camera e può essere gustata sulla terrazza soleggiata con vista sulla piscina. Ci sono 6 ristoranti e bar nell&#039;hotel, aperti tutto il giorno e che servono una vasta selezione di piatti internazionali che includono molte specialità locali.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo hotel è un&#039;opzione eccellente per i viaggiatori interessati a ristoranti, viaggi in famiglia e cibo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rilassati al sole nell&#039;incantevole piscina dell&#039;hotel Bristol. C&#039;è anche una palestra per gli ospiti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Bristol_7.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.076794560982!2d35.87413161454919!3d31.958813281226774!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0f8d2a8f185:0xc5a7b9ec3d05caa7!2sBristol Amman Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696335551!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 462, 'it', '', 'one col', 'bristol-amman-hotel'),
(526, 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In the elegant Sweifieh shopping district, this 5-star hotel has 2 pools, a tennis court and a spa with massage facilities. It also features 5 different dining options.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each room at the Crowne Plaza Amman is decorated in warm colors and includes a work desk and a small sitting area equipped with satellite TV. Some rooms have city views.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Halaby Restaurant serves menu for dinner serving Syrian cuisine and V Lounge &amp;amp; Restaurant serves US Angus Steaks. Drinks and cocktails are available at Café Vienna and Jasmine Lounge&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can relax on a lounge chair near the pool, or visit the Crowne Plaza Spa to enjoy a variety of spa massages. The renowned Citadel and the National Archaeological Museum are less than a 20-minute drive from the Ammans Crowne Plaza hotel. Queen Alia International Airport is less than 33.8 km away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Crowne Plaza 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.950606394667!2d35.86800951454927!3d31.962236681225615!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f99a412c929:0x1aec1e47e3d88064!2sCrowne Plaza Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696646436!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 463, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-amman'),
(527, 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En el elegante distrito comercial de Sweifieh, este hotel de 5 estrellas cuenta con 2 piscinas, una cancha de tenis y un spa con servicio de masajes. También cuenta con 5 opciones gastronómicas diferentes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones del Crowne Plaza Amman están decoradas en colores cálidos e incluyen un escritorio y una pequeña sala de estar equipada con TV vía satélite. Algunas habitaciones tienen vistas a la ciudad.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El restaurante Al Halaby sirve un menú para la cena que sirve cocina siria y el V Lounge &amp;amp; Restaurant sirve filetes angus estadounidenses. Bebidas y cócteles están disponibles en Café Vienna y Jasmine Lounge&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los huéspedes pueden relajarse en una tumbona cerca de la piscina o visitar el Crowne Plaza Spa para disfrutar de una variedad de masajes. La famosa Ciudadela y el Museo Arqueológico Nacional están a menos de 20 minutos en coche del hotel Crowne Plaza Amman. El aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia está a menos de 33,8 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Crowne Plaza 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.950606394667!2d35.86800951454927!3d31.962236681225615!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f99a412c929:0x1aec1e47e3d88064!2sCrowne Plaza Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696646436!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 463, 'es', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-amman'),
(528, 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dans l&#039;élégant quartier commerçant de Sweifieh, cet hôtel 5 étoiles dispose de 2 piscines, d&#039;un court de tennis et d&#039;un spa avec services de massage. Il propose également 5 restaurants différents.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres du Crowne Plaza Amman sont décorées dans des couleurs chaudes et comprennent un bureau et un petit salon équipé d&#039;une télévision par satellite. Certaines chambres offrent une vue sur la ville.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le restaurant Al Halaby sert un menu du soir servant une cuisine syrienne et le restaurant V Lounge sert des steaks American Angus. Des boissons et des cocktails sont disponibles au Café Vienna et au Jasmine Lounge&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez vous détendre sur une chaise longue au bord de la piscine ou vous rendre au spa Crowne Plaza pour profiter d’une variété de massages. La célèbre citadelle et le musée archéologique national se trouvent à moins de 20 minutes de route de l&#039;hôtel Crowne Plaza Amman. L&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia est situé à moins de 33,8 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Crowne Plaza 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.950606394667!2d35.86800951454927!3d31.962236681225615!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f99a412c929:0x1aec1e47e3d88064!2sCrowne Plaza Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696646436!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 463, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-amman'),
(529, 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', 'Crowne Plaza Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nell&#039;elegante quartiere dello shopping di Sweifieh, questo hotel a 5 stelle dispone di 2 piscine, un campo da tennis e un centro benessere con massaggi. Ha anche 5 diversi punti di ristoro.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere del Crowne Plaza Amman sono decorate con colori caldi e includono una scrivania e un piccolo soggiorno dotato di TV satellitare. Alcune camere hanno vista sulla città.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il ristorante Al Halaby serve un menu per la cena che serve cucina siriana e il V Lounge &amp;amp; Restaurant serve bistecche American Angus. Bevande e cocktail sono disponibili presso il Café Vienna e il Jasmine Lounge&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Potrete rilassarvi su un lettino vicino alla piscina o visitare il Crowne Plaza Spa per godervi una varietà di massaggi. La famosa Cittadella e il Museo Archeologico Nazionale distano meno di 20 minuti in auto dall&#039;hotel Crowne Plaza Amman. L&#039;Aeroporto Internazionale Queen Alia dista meno di 33,8 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Crowne Plaza 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.950606394667!2d35.86800951454927!3d31.962236681225615!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f99a412c929:0x1aec1e47e3d88064!2sCrowne Plaza Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696646436!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 463, 'it', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-amman'),
(530, 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The elegant Landmark Amman Hotel &amp;amp; Conference Center is in the heart of the diplomatic and business districts of Amman. It features free Wi-Fi, an outdoor pool, and a spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All the modern and spacious rooms at the Landmark Amman &amp;amp; Conference Center have sitting areas and satellite TV.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Fitness and Wellness health club features a wide range of gym equipment as well as a hot tub and a sauna. Massages treatments include a deep tissue massage and a shiatsu massage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There are 6 restaurants and bars, including Colours All Day Restaurant and Fairouzy , which provide Levant cuisine. Fresh juices are available at the Sugar Cube, and there is an Executive Lounge and Bar. Ghoroub is on the 13th Floor and serves delicious refreshments and cocktails. Tarboush Lounge is the late-night lounge and club which serves a mix of cocktails, mocktails, wines and champagnes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Landmark Amman is a 5-minute drive from the Roman Theatre. Marka International Airport is 8 km away and it takes 10 minutes by car to get to Sofex Exhibition from the property. Free private parking is available.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Land_Mark_7.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.0183095403036!2d35.90201131454923!3d31.96039998122626!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0654b1bc989:0x639bbb9360f2265a!2sLandmark Amman Hotel and Conference Center!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696864876!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 464, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'landmark-amman'),
(531, 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El elegante Landmark Amman Hotel &amp;amp; Conference Center se encuentra en el corazón de los distritos diplomáticos y de negocios de Amman. Cuenta con conexión Wi-Fi gratuita, piscina al aire libre y spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones modernas y espaciosas del Landmark Amman &amp;amp; Conference Center tienen salas de estar y televisión vía satélite.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El gimnasio Fitness &amp;amp; Wellness cuenta con una amplia gama de equipos de gimnasia, así como con bañera de hidromasaje y sauna. Los tratamientos de masajes incluyen un masaje de tejido profundo y un masaje shiatsu.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hay 6 restaurantes y bares, que incluyen el restaurante Colors All Day y Fairouzy, que ofrecen cocina levantina. Hay frescos jugos disponibles en el Sugar Cube, y hay un bar y salón ejecutivo. Ghoroub está en el piso 13 y sirve deliciosos refrescos y cócteles. Tarboush Lounge es el lounge y club nocturno que sirve una mezcla de cócteles, cócteles sin alcohol, vinos y champanes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Landmark Amman se encuentra a 5 minutos en coche del teatro romano. El aeropuerto internacional de Marka está a 8 km y el establecimiento se encuentra a 10 minutos en coche de Sofex Exhibition. Hay aparcamiento privado gratuito disponible.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Land_Mark_7.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.0183095403036!2d35.90201131454923!3d31.96039998122626!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0654b1bc989:0x639bbb9360f2265a!2sLandmark Amman Hotel and Conference Center!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696864876!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 464, 'es', '', 'one col', 'landmark-amman'),
(532, 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;élégant Landmark Amman Hotel &amp;amp; Conference Centre est situé au cœur des quartiers diplomatique et des affaires d&#039;Amman. Il dispose d&#039;une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite, d&#039;une piscine extérieure et d&#039;un spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres modernes et spacieuses du Landmark Amman &amp;amp; Conference Centre disposent d&#039;un salon et de la télévision par satellite.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La salle de sport Fitness &amp;amp; Wellness propose une large gamme d&#039;équipements, ainsi qu&#039;un bain à remous et un sauna. Les massages proposés incluent un massage des tissus profonds et un massage shiatsu.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous trouverez 6 restaurants et bars, parmi lesquels le restaurant Colors All Day et le restaurant Fairouzy, qui proposent une cuisine du Levant. Des jus de fruits frais sont disponibles au Sugar Cube. Vous trouverez également un bar et un salon exécutif. Ghoroub se trouve au 13ème étage et sert de délicieuses boissons sans alcool et cocktails. Tarboush Lounge est le salon et la discothèque qui sert un mélange de cocktails, cocktails sans alcool, vins et champagnes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Landmark Amman se trouve à 5 minutes en voiture du théâtre romain. L&#039;aéroport international de Marka est à 8 km et l&#039;établissement se trouve à 10 minutes en voiture du parc des expositions Sofex. Un parking privé gratuit est disponible.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Land_Mark_7.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.0183095403036!2d35.90201131454923!3d31.96039998122626!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0654b1bc989:0x639bbb9360f2265a!2sLandmark Amman Hotel and Conference Center!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696864876!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 464, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'landmark-amman'),
(533, 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', 'Landmark Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;elegante Landmark Amman Hotel &amp;amp; Conference Center si trova nel cuore dei quartieri diplomatici e degli affari di Amman. Offre la connessione Wi-Fi gratuita, una piscina all&#039;aperto e un centro benessere.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere moderne e spaziose del Landmark Amman &amp;amp; Conference Center dispongono di salotti e televisione satellitare.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La palestra Fitness &amp;amp; Wellness offre una vasta gamma di attrezzature da palestra, una vasca idromassaggio e una sauna. I massaggi comprendono un massaggio profondo dei tessuti e un massaggio shiatsu.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ci sono 6 ristoranti e bar, tra cui il Colors All Day e il ristorante Fairouzy, che offrono cucina levantina. Lo Sugar Cube offre succhi di frutta freschi e un bar e una sala executive. Ghoroub è al 13 ° piano e serve deliziosi drink e cocktail. Tarboush Lounge è la lounge e la discoteca che serve un mix di cocktail, cocktail analcolici, vini e champagne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il punto di riferimento Amman si trova a 5 minuti di auto dal teatro romano. L&#039;Aeroporto Internazionale Marka si trova a 8 km di distanza e la struttura dista 10 minuti di auto dalla mostra Sofex. È disponibile un parcheggio privato gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Land_Mark_7.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.0183095403036!2d35.90201131454923!3d31.96039998122626!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0654b1bc989:0x639bbb9360f2265a!2sLandmark Amman Hotel and Conference Center!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567696864876!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 464, 'it', '', 'one col', 'landmark-amman'),
(534, 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in the central business, social and residential destination, Amman’s new downtown, Al Abdali, Amman Rotana offers business travellers and holiday makers alike the serenity and warmth of home as well as the splendour and modern extravagance that can only be offered at Rotana. The hotel is within a 45-minute drive from Queen Alia International Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Rotana is the first tower hotel in Jordan offering 412 lavish rooms and suites, housed across 50 floors at 188 metres high. All rooms boast floor-to-ceiling windows offering remarkable views of the city.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This 5-star hotel is designed in a vibrant modern style providing a combination of deluxe accommodation, diverse culinary experiences, state-of-the-art meeting and event facilities including the Monarch Ballroom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests with recreation in mind can enjoy their workout at Bodylines Fitness &amp;amp; Wellness Club or take a dip at our outdoor swimming pool.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Amman Rotana.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.848090310323!2d35.90098441466836!3d31.96501763224978!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06e3887c383:0x660a49cefe54732e!2sAmman Rotana!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567697480735!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 465, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'amman-rotana'),
(535, 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ubicado en el centro de negocios, destino social y residencial, el nuevo centro de Amman, Al Abdali, Amman Rotana ofrece a los viajeros de negocios y a los veraneantes la serenidad y la calidez del hogar, así como el esplendor y la extravagancia moderna que solo se pueden ofrecer en Rotana. El hotel se encuentra a 45 minutos en coche del aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Rotana es el primer hotel de la torre en Jordania que ofrece 412 lujosas habitaciones y suites, distribuidas en 50 pisos a 188 metros de altura. Todas las habitaciones cuentan con ventanas de piso a techo que ofrecen impresionantes vistas de la ciudad.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este hotel de 5 estrellas está diseñado en un estilo moderno y vibrante que ofrece una combinación de alojamiento de lujo, diversas experiencias culinarias, modernas instalaciones para reuniones y eventos, incluido el Monarch Ballroom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los huéspedes con recreación en mente pueden disfrutar de su entrenamiento en Bodylines Fitness &amp;amp; Wellness Club o darse un chapuzón en nuestra piscina al aire libre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Amman Rotana.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.848090310323!2d35.90098441466836!3d31.96501763224978!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06e3887c383:0x660a49cefe54732e!2sAmman Rotana!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567697480735!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 465, 'es', '', 'one col', 'amman-rotana'),
(536, 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situé dans le centre d&#039;affaires, destination sociale et résidentielle, le nouveau centre d&#039;Amman, Al Abdali, Amman Rotana offre aux voyageurs d&#039;affaires et aux vacanciers la sérénité et la chaleur de la maison, ainsi que la splendeur et l&#039;extravagance moderne Ils peuvent être offerts à Rotana. L&#039;hôtel se trouve à 45 minutes de route de l&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Rotana est le premier hôtel de tour en Jordanie proposant 412 chambres et suites luxueuses, réparties sur 50 étages et culminant à 188 mètres. Toutes les chambres disposent de baies vitrées offrant une vue imprenable sur la ville.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel 5 étoiles est conçu dans un style moderne et vivant. Il propose à la fois un hébergement de luxe, diverses expériences culinaires, des installations de réunion modernes et des salles de réception, y compris la salle de bal Monarch.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les clients souhaitant se détendre peuvent profiter de leur formation au club de bien-être et de bien-être Bodylines ou faire un plongeon dans notre piscine extérieure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Amman Rotana.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.848090310323!2d35.90098441466836!3d31.96501763224978!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06e3887c383:0x660a49cefe54732e!2sAmman Rotana!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567697480735!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 465, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'amman-rotana'),
(537, 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', 'Amman Rotana', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situato nel centro degli affari, destinazione sociale e residenziale, il nuovo centro di Amman, Al Abdali, Amman Rotana offre ai viaggiatori d&#039;affari e ai vacanzieri la serenità e il calore della casa, nonché lo splendore e la stravaganza moderna che solo Possono essere offerti a Rotana. L&#039;hotel si trova a 45 minuti di auto dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Rotana è il primo hotel a torre in Giordania che offre 412 lussuose camere e suite, disposte su 50 piani a 188 metri di altezza. Tutte le camere sono dotate di vetrate a tutta altezza che offrono viste mozzafiato sulla città.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo hotel a 5 stelle è stato progettato in uno stile moderno e vivace che offre una combinazione di alloggi di lusso, varie esperienze culinarie, moderne sale riunioni ed eventi, tra cui la sala da ballo Monarch.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gli ospiti con in mente attività ricreative possono allenarsi al Bodylines Fitness &amp;amp; Wellness Club o fare un tuffo nella nostra piscina all&#039;aperto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Amman Rotana.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.848090310323!2d35.90098441466836!3d31.96501763224978!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06e3887c383:0x660a49cefe54732e!2sAmman Rotana!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567697480735!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 465, 'it', '', 'one col', 'amman-rotana'),
(538, 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ideally located on the Firth circle and within walking distance of Abdoun, the five star deluxe Fairmont Amman. This Hotel offers contemporary design and unparalleled views of the stunning Amman hills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 317 elegantly appointed guest rooms and suites are remarkably spacious, complete with premium amenities. Each air-conditioned room offers state-of-the art technology including wired and wireless high speed internet access and media connectivity panel. The living area has a 43″ flat screen LED TV and the luxurious marble bathrooms come with a walk-in rain shower and deep soaker tub.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Willow Stream Spa at Fairmont Amman combines an exclusive facility focusing on fitness and movement, with vitality pools, hamam scrub room, Dead Sea pool, inhalation steam rooms as well as healing saunas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Queen Alia International Airport is a 35 minute drive from the airport to the hotel. Free valet &amp;amp; private parking is available on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Fairmont-Amman-Exterior-Shot-Dawn.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.037474893173!2d35.8790314146683!3d31.95988003250614!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca057eb367b41:0x385b54e5b700e10!2sFairmont Amman Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567697810827!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 466, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'fairmont-amman'),
(539, 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Idealmente ubicado en el círculo Firth, a poca distancia de Abdoun, el lujoso Fairmont Amman de cinco estrellas. Este hotel ofrece un diseño contemporáneo y vistas incomparables de las impresionantes colinas de Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las 317 habitaciones y suites elegantemente decoradas son notablemente espaciosas y cuentan con comodidades de primera calidad. Cada habitación con aire acondicionado ofrece tecnología de punta que incluye acceso a Internet de alta velocidad por cable e inalámbrico y panel de conectividad de medios. La sala de estar tiene un televisor LED de pantalla plana de 43 ″ y los lujosos baños de mármol cuentan con una ducha de efecto lluvia a ras de suelo y una bañera profunda.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Willow Stream Spa en Fairmont Amman combina una instalación exclusiva que se enfoca en el estado físico y el movimiento, con piscinas de vitalidad, sala de depurado Hamam, piscina del Mar Muerto, salas de vapor de inhalación y saunas curativas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia está a 35 minutos en coche del aeropuerto al hotel. Se ofrece servicio de aparcacoches y aparcamiento privado gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Fairmont-Amman-Exterior-Shot-Dawn.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.037474893173!2d35.8790314146683!3d31.95988003250614!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca057eb367b41:0x385b54e5b700e10!2sFairmont Amman Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567697810827!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 466, 'es', '', 'one col', 'fairmont-amman'),
(540, 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Idéalement situé dans le cercle Firth, à une courte distance d&#039;Abdoun, le luxueux hôtel cinq étoiles Fairmont Amman. Cet hôtel présente un design contemporain et offre une vue imprenable sur les impressionnantes collines d&#039;Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les 317 chambres et suites élégamment décorées sont remarquablement spacieuses et dotées d&#039;équipements de qualité supérieure. Chaque chambre climatisée est dotée d&#039;une technologie de pointe comprenant un accès Internet haut débit avec et sans fil et un panneau de connectivité multimédia. Le salon dispose d&#039;une télévision à écran plat LED 43 pouces et les luxueuses salles de bains en marbre disposent d&#039;une douche à effet pluie et d&#039;une baignoire profonde.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Willow Stream Spa du Fairmont Amman associe une installation exclusive axée sur la condition physique et les mouvements, avec des bassins vitalité, une salle de lavage Hamam, une piscine de la mer Morte, des hammams à inhalation et des saunas de guérison.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia se trouve à 35 minutes en voiture de l&#039;aéroport. Un service de voiturier et un parking privé gratuit sont disponibles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Fairmont-Amman-Exterior-Shot-Dawn.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.037474893173!2d35.8790314146683!3d31.95988003250614!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca057eb367b41:0x385b54e5b700e10!2sFairmont Amman Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567697810827!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 466, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'fairmont-amman'),
(541, 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', 'Fairmont Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Idealmente situato nel circolo Firth, a breve distanza da Abdoun, il lussuoso Fairmont Amman a cinque stelle. Questo hotel offre un design contemporaneo e viste impareggiabili sulle imponenti colline di Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le 317 camere e suite elegantemente arredate sono molto spaziose e dispongono di servizi di alta qualità. Ogni camera con aria condizionata offre una tecnologia all&#039;avanguardia che include accesso a Internet cablato e wireless ad alta velocità e pannello di connettività multimediale. Il soggiorno ha una TV LED a schermo piatto da 43 pollici e i lussuosi bagni in marmo dispongono di cabina doccia con getto a pioggia e vasca da bagno a immersione totale.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Willow Stream Spa di Fairmont Amman combina un&#039;esclusiva struttura che si concentra su fitness e movimento, con piscine vitality, sala lavaggio Hamam, piscina sul Mar Morto, bagni turchi per inalazione e saune curative.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Aeroporto Internazionale Queen Alia è a 35 minuti in auto dall&#039;aeroporto all&#039;hotel. Il parcheggio custodito e il parcheggio privato gratuito sono disponibili.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Fairmont-Amman-Exterior-Shot-Dawn.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.037474893173!2d35.8790314146683!3d31.95988003250614!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca057eb367b41:0x385b54e5b700e10!2sFairmont Amman Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567697810827!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 466, 'it', '', 'one col', 'fairmont-amman'),
(542, 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Grand Millennium Amman hotel located at the gateway to Jordan offers 5-star luxury at an unbeatable location.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;From the heart of Amman&#039;s commercial centre, Grand Millennium Hotel Amman is a 10-minute drive from the Amman Citadel and 25 minutes by car from Queen Alia International Airport. High-end restaurants, shopping centers and entertainment facilities are all within a walking distance, you&#039;ll find shopping centers, art galleries, and entertainment spots all within walking distance. Our 176 guest rooms provide for a restful stay, and come complete with a range of luxurious amenities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Award-winning offer great cuisine and great views, and Sky Spa &amp;amp; Health Club boast a variety of treatments to help you unwind.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Sky Lounge boasts with uninterrupted views of Amman, which can be used for weddings and other events. Guests can enjoy a relaxing atmosphere at the Havana Cigar Bar or enjoy the exciting ambiance at Crystal Bar. Live the multinational experience with a visit to Food Market restaurant where 3 nations meet into one dining feast, Italian, Arabic and Asian.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/MillenniumHotel1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.7857351878492!2d35.89721721466853!3d31.96670903216547!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f7ce9f455b9:0xf83ea996b94553a0!2sGrand Millennium Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698129242!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 467, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'grand-millennium-hotel-amman'),
(543, 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Desde el corazón del centro comercial de Ammán, el Grand Millennium Hotel Amman se encuentra a 10 minutos en coche de la Ciudadela de Ammán y a 25 minutos en coche del aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia. Restaurantes de alta gama, centros comerciales e instalaciones de entretenimiento se encuentran a poca distancia, encontrará centros comerciales, galerías de arte y lugares de entretenimiento a poca distancia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las 176 habitaciones ofrecen una estadía tranquila y se completan con una gama de lujosas comodidades.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El galardonado ofrece una excelente cocina y excelentes vistas, y Sky Spa &amp;amp; Health Club cuenta con una variedad de tratamientos para ayudarlo a relajarse.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Sky Lounge cuenta con vistas ininterrumpidas de Amman, que se pueden utilizar para bodas y otros eventos. Los huéspedes pueden disfrutar de un ambiente relajante en el Havana Cigar Bar o disfrutar del ambiente emocionante en Crystal Bar. Vive la experiencia multinacional con una visita al restaurante Food Market, donde 3 naciones se reúnen en una fiesta gastronómica, italiana, árabe y asiática.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/MillenniumHotel1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.7857351878492!2d35.89721721466853!3d31.96670903216547!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f7ce9f455b9:0xf83ea996b94553a0!2sGrand Millennium Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698129242!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 467, 'es', '', 'one col', 'grand-millennium-hotel-amman'),
(544, 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situé en plein cœur du centre commercial d&#039;Amman, le Grand Millennium Hotel Amman se trouve à 10 minutes en voiture de la citadelle d&#039;Amman et à 25 minutes de route de l&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia. Les restaurants haut de gamme, les centres commerciaux et les lieux de divertissement sont accessibles à pied. Vous trouverez des centres commerciaux, des galeries d&#039;art et des lieux de divertissement à quelques minutes à pied.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les 176 chambres offrent un séjour calme et sont complétées par une gamme d&#039;équipements luxueux.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le restaurant primé propose une excellente cuisine et de superbes vues. Le Sky Spa &amp;amp; Health Club propose une variété de soins pour vous aider à vous détendre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Sky Lounge offre une vue imprenable sur Amman et peut être utilisé pour les mariages et autres événements. Vous pourrez profiter d&#039;une atmosphère relaxante au bar Havana Cigar ou au bar Crystal. Vivez l&#039;expérience multinationale en visitant le restaurant Food Market, où les trois nations se réunissent lors d&#039;une fête gastronomique, italienne, arabe et asiatique.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/MillenniumHotel1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.7857351878492!2d35.89721721466853!3d31.96670903216547!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f7ce9f455b9:0xf83ea996b94553a0!2sGrand Millennium Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698129242!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 467, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'grand-millennium-hotel-amman');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(545, 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', 'Grand Millennium Hotel Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dal cuore del centro commerciale di Amman, il Grand Millennium Hotel Amman dista in auto 10 minuti dalla cittadella di Amman e 25 minuti dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia. Ristoranti di fascia alta, centri commerciali e strutture per l&#039;intrattenimento sono raggiungibili a piedi, mentre centri commerciali, gallerie d&#039;arte e luoghi di intrattenimento sono raggiungibili a piedi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le 176 camere offrono un soggiorno tranquillo e sono completate da una vasta gamma di servizi di lusso.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il pluripremiato offre una cucina eccellente e splendide viste, e Sky Spa &amp;amp; Health Club offre una varietà di trattamenti per aiutarvi a rilassarvi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Sky Lounge offre una vista ininterrotta di Amman, che può essere utilizzata per matrimoni e altri eventi. Gli ospiti possono godere di un&#039;atmosfera rilassante presso l&#039;Havana Cigar Bar o godersi l&#039;eccitante atmosfera del Crystal Bar. Vivi l&#039;esperienza multinazionale con una visita al ristorante Food Market, dove 3 nazioni si riuniscono in una festa gastronomica, italiana, araba e asiatica.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/MillenniumHotel1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.7857351878492!2d35.89721721466853!3d31.96670903216547!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f7ce9f455b9:0xf83ea996b94553a0!2sGrand Millennium Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698129242!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 467, 'it', '', 'one col', 'grand-millennium-hotel-amman'),
(546, 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Modern Amman hotel in vibrant commercial district. Stay at Mövenpick Hotel Amman to benefit from a great location, excellent food and wonderful Jordanian hospitality.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The modern 14-floor Amman skyscraper hotel is in the dynamic, commercial hub of Jordan’s capital – close to shopping malls and attractions, 15 minutes to downtown and 35 minutes from Queen Alia International Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Unwind in the health club, swim laps in the pool and work out in the fitness centre. Keep in touch with free Wi-Fi in all 218 rooms and suites. Business travelers and city break sightseers equally enjoy the treat of executive lounge access.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Close to Amman malls and attractions, exquisite and diverse gastronomy across four restaurants, bars and lounges. The Hotel offers outdoor pool, health club and spa. Perfect venues for weddings and 8 state-of-the-art meeting rooms and grand ballroom for 1200 people.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Movenpik.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0731165346724!2d35.86189371466914!3d31.986033331201245!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca18f3ca4e949:0x7549fdec8b8e1369!2sMövenpick Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698379969!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 468, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-hotel-amman'),
(547, 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Moderno hotel de Amman en un vibrante distrito comercial. Alójese en el Mövenpick Hotel Amman para beneficiarse de una excelente ubicación, excelente comida y maravillosa hospitalidad jordana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El moderno hotel de rascacielos Amman, de 14 pisos, se encuentra en el dinámico centro comercial de la capital de Jordania, cerca de centros comerciales y atracciones, a 15 minutos del centro de la ciudad y a 35 minutos del aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relájate en el gimnasio, nada en la piscina y ejercítate en el gimnasio. Manténgase en contacto con Wi-Fi gratis en las 218 habitaciones y suites. Los viajeros de negocios y los turistas que visitan la ciudad disfrutan del placer del acceso al salón ejecutivo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cerca de los centros comerciales y atracciones de Amman, gastronomía exquisita y diversa en cuatro restaurantes, bares y salones. El hotel ofrece piscina al aire libre, gimnasio y spa. Lugares perfectos para bodas y 8 salas de reuniones de última generación y un gran salón de baile para 1200 personas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Movenpik.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0731165346724!2d35.86189371466914!3d31.986033331201245!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca18f3ca4e949:0x7549fdec8b8e1369!2sMövenpick Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698379969!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 468, 'es', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-hotel-amman'),
(548, 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hôtel moderne situé à Amman, dans un quartier commerçant animé. Séjournez à l&#039;hôtel Mövenpick Amman pour profiter d&#039;un excellent emplacement, d&#039;une excellente cuisine et de la merveilleuse hospitalité jordanienne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel moderne gratte-ciel d&#039;Amman de 14 étages est situé dans le centre commercial dynamique de la capitale jordanienne, à proximité des centres commerciaux et des attractions, à 15 minutes du centre-ville et à 35 minutes de l&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Détendez-vous dans la salle de sport, nagez dans la piscine et entraînez-vous dans la salle de sport. Restez en contact avec le Wi-Fi gratuit dans les 218 chambres et suites. Les voyageurs d&#039;affaires et les touristes visitant la ville profitent du plaisir d&#039;accéder au salon exécutif.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Près des centres commerciaux et des attractions d&#039;Amman, cuisine exquise et variée dans quatre restaurants, bars et salons. L&#039;hôtel propose une piscine extérieure, une salle de sport et un spa. Salles de réunion parfaites pour les mariages, 8 salles de réunion ultramodernes et une grande salle de bal pouvant accueillir 1 200 personnes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Movenpik.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0731165346724!2d35.86189371466914!3d31.986033331201245!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca18f3ca4e949:0x7549fdec8b8e1369!2sMövenpick Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698379969!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 468, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-hotel-amman'),
(549, 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', 'Mövenpick Hotel Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hotel moderno di Amman in un vivace quartiere dello shopping. Soggiornate al Mövenpick Hotel Amman per beneficiare di una posizione eccellente, cibo eccellente e meravigliosa ospitalità giordana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il moderno hotel grattacielo di 14 piani Amman si trova nel dinamico centro commerciale della capitale della Giordania, vicino ai centri commerciali e alle attrazioni, a 15 minuti dal centro città e 35 minuti dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rilassarsi in palestra, nuotare in piscina e allenarsi in palestra. Resta in contatto con la connessione Wi-Fi gratuita nelle 218 camere e suite. I viaggiatori d&#039;affari e i turisti che visitano la città apprezzano il piacere di accedere alla sala executive.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vicino ai centri commerciali e alle attrazioni di Amman, cucina squisita e diversificata in quattro ristoranti, bar e lounge. L&#039;hotel offre una piscina all&#039;aperto, una palestra e un centro benessere. Location perfette per matrimoni e 8 sale riunioni all&#039;avanguardia e una grande sala da ballo per 1200 persone.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/Movenpik.png&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0731165346724!2d35.86189371466914!3d31.986033331201245!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca18f3ca4e949:0x7549fdec8b8e1369!2sMövenpick Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698379969!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 468, 'it', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-hotel-amman'),
(550, 'W Amman', 'W Amman', 'W Amman', 'W Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in the heart of new modern Amman, Abdali, the past meets the future where local tradition and history of Jordan are instilled with an unmistakably bold design. W Amman uniquely stands tall as a contemporary architectural statement, offering stunning views of bustling city’s seven hills running across the Jordanian capital.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Begin your discovery by entering through an intriguing canyon walk, a breathtaking recreation inspired by the ancient city of Petra, one of the Seven Wonders of the World. The first ever W Hotel in Amman features vibrant spaces where 280 guest rooms and 44 suites offer a sensational swirl of high energy interiors, amplifying technology, vivid design, and floor to ceiling windows that offer vibrant views of the Jordanian capital.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Own the moment &amp;amp; remix your nights at the most original dining &amp;amp; party scene in the city &amp;amp; live it up in at our boldly designed outlets. Savor unexpected authenticity in the all-day dining restaurant, and sample Asian-inspired flavors in the specialty venue. Hang out in the Living Room or join the scene in AURA, the three-floor destination bar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ignite your taste buds within the sleek setting of Enso. Explore pan-Asian signature dishes like sushi, which can be paired with intriguing sake. Escape to Aura and gather with friends over signature cocktails. Soak in the scene and chill out to pulsating music.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/W Hotels.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.8775452043465!2d35.90069181466849!3d31.964218632289686!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06fc9e20179:0xa4a5b50125e1474d!2sW Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698675207!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 469, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'w-amman'),
(551, 'W Amman', 'W Amman', 'W Amman', 'W Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ubicado en el corazón del nuevo y moderno Amman, Abdali, el pasado se encuentra con el futuro donde la tradición local y la historia de Jordania se inculcan con un diseño inconfundiblemente audaz. W Amman se destaca como una declaración arquitectónica contemporánea, ofreciendo impresionantes vistas de las siete colinas de la bulliciosa ciudad que atraviesan la capital jordana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Comience su descubrimiento ingresando a través de una intrigante caminata por el cañón, una recreación impresionante inspirada en la antigua ciudad de Petra, una de las Siete Maravillas del Mundo. El primer W Hotel en Amman cuenta con espacios vibrantes donde 280 habitaciones y 44 suites ofrecen un remolino sensacional de interiores de alta energía, tecnología de amplificación, diseño vívido y ventanas de piso a techo que ofrecen vistas vibrantes de la capital jordana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sé dueño del momento y remezcla tus noches en la escena gastronómica y de fiesta más original de la ciudad y vívela en nuestros outlets con un diseño atrevido. Saboree una autenticidad inesperada en el restaurante abierto todo el día y pruebe sabores de inspiración asiática en el lugar de especialidad. Pasa el rato en la sala de estar o únete a la escena en AURA, el bar de tres pisos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Encienda sus papilas gustativas en el entorno elegante de Enso. Explore los platos típicos pan asiáticos como el sushi, que se pueden combinar con sake intrigante. Escápese a Aura y reúnase con amigos con cócteles exclusivos. Sumérgete en la escena y relájate con la música pulsante.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/W Hotels.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.8775452043465!2d35.90069181466849!3d31.964218632289686!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06fc9e20179:0xa4a5b50125e1474d!2sW Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698675207!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 469, 'es', '', 'one col', 'w-amman'),
(552, 'W Amman', 'W Amman', 'W Amman', 'W Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situé au cœur du nouvel et moderne Amman, Abdali, le passé se confond avec le futur, où tradition et histoire de la Jordanie sont imprégnées d&#039;un design résolument audacieux. Le W Amman se distingue en tant que déclaration architecturale contemporaine, offrant une vue imprenable sur les sept collines de la ville animée qui traverse la capitale jordanienne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Commencez votre découverte par une randonnée intriguante à travers le canyon, une récréation impressionnante inspirée par la ville antique de Pétra, l’une des sept merveilles du monde. Le premier hôtel W à Amman dispose d&#039;espaces animés où 280 chambres et 44 suites offrent un tourbillon sensationnel d&#039;intérieurs énergiques, de technologie d&#039;amplification, de design vivant et de baies vitrées offrant une vue imprenable sur la capitale jordanienne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Saisissez le moment et remixez vos nuits dans la scène gastronomique et festive la plus originale de la ville et vivez-le dans nos points de vente au design audacieux. Savourez une authenticité inattendue au restaurant ouvert toute la journée et essayez des saveurs d&#039;inspiration asiatique au lieu de spécialité. Détendez-vous dans le salon ou rejoignez la scène à AURA, le bar à trois étages.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Allumez vos papilles dans l&#039;environnement élégant d&#039;Enso. Explorez des plats de pain asiatiques typiques tels que les sushis, qui peuvent être combinés avec un saké intrigant. Escape to Aura et rencontrer des amis avec des cocktails exclusifs. Plongez dans la scène et détendez-vous avec la musique palpitante.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/W Hotels.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.8775452043465!2d35.90069181466849!3d31.964218632289686!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06fc9e20179:0xa4a5b50125e1474d!2sW Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698675207!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 469, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'w-amman'),
(553, 'W Amman', 'W Amman', 'W Amman', 'W Amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situato nel cuore del nuovo e moderno Amman, Abdali, il passato incontra il futuro in cui la tradizione locale e la storia della Giordania sono instillate con un design inconfondibilmente audace. W Amman si distingue come una dichiarazione architettonica contemporanea, offrendo una vista mozzafiato sulle sette colline della vivace città che attraversa la capitale giordana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Inizia la tua scoperta entrando attraverso un&#039;escursione intrigante attraverso il canyon, un&#039;impressionante ricreazione ispirata all&#039;antica città di Petra, una delle sette meraviglie del mondo. Il primo W Hotel ad Amman ha spazi vibranti in cui 280 camere e 44 suite offrono un vortice sensazionale di interni ad alta energia, tecnologia di amplificazione, design vivido e finestre dal pavimento al soffitto che offrono una vista vibrante della capitale giordana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Assapora il momento e remixa le tue serate nella scena gastronomica e di festa più originale della città e vivila nei nostri outlet con un design audace. Assapora un&#039;autentica inaspettata nel ristorante aperto tutto il giorno e prova i sapori di ispirazione asiatica nel locale specializzato. Passa il tempo in salotto o unisciti alla scena di AURA, il bar a tre piani.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Illumina le tue papille gustative negli eleganti ambienti di Enso. Esplora piatti tipici del pane asiatico come il sushi, che può essere combinato con un sake intrigante. Fuggi in Aura e incontra gli amici con cocktail esclusivi. Immergiti nella scena e rilassati con la musica pulsante.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/W Hotels.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.8775452043465!2d35.90069181466849!3d31.964218632289686!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06fc9e20179:0xa4a5b50125e1474d!2sW Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567698675207!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 469, 'it', '', 'one col', 'w-amman'),
(554, 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Zamzam Towers Hotel was established to serve businessmen, and business traveler, the facilities exists to help make you happy to enjoy your time.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Far a way from the crowd, yet close to business and shopping centers like City Mall, Carfour, Amman mall, and C.Town. The Hotel is distinguished with its quiet environment and it is one of the luxurious hotels with its modern style, best services, including up to date facilities such as Coffee Shop, Beauty Salons, Wedding and Meeting Halls and Stylish Suits.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Zamzam Towers Hotel was deliberately designed to grant more freedom and elegancy, whether you are looking for, accommodation, business or dinning, a relaxing moments; we have it all inside. Modern interior and exterior achievement makes it a unique place for events of any type or size.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Zamzam 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.6630360211702!2d35.850867014550296!3d31.997148881214525!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1c3250bccb5:0xf3c61de69ada3888!2zWmFtemFtIFRvd2VycyBIb3RlbCDYp9io2LHYp9isINiy2YXYstmF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567774485823!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 470, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'zamzam-towers-hotel'),
(555, 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Zamzam Towers Hotel fue establecido para servir a hombres y mujeres de negocios y viajeros de negocios, las instalaciones existen para ayudarlo a disfrutar de su tiempo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lejos de la multitud, pero cerca de centros comerciales y de negocios como City Mall, Carfour, Amman Mall y C.Town. El hotel se distingue por su ambiente tranquilo y es uno de los hoteles de lujo con su estilo moderno, los mejores servicios, que incluyen instalaciones modernas como cafetería, salones de belleza, salones de bodas y reuniones y trajes elegantes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Zamzam Towers Hotel fue diseñado deliberadamente para otorgar más libertad y elegancia, ya sea que esté buscando, alojamiento, negocios o cenas, momentos relajantes; Lo tenemos todo adentro. El moderno logro interior y exterior lo convierte en un lugar único para eventos de cualquier tipo o tamaño.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Zamzam 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.6630360211702!2d35.850867014550296!3d31.997148881214525!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1c3250bccb5:0xf3c61de69ada3888!2zWmFtemFtIFRvd2VycyBIb3RlbCDYp9io2LHYp9isINiy2YXYstmF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567774485823!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 470, 'es', '', 'one col', 'zamzam-towers-hotel'),
(556, 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel Zamzam Towers a été créé pour servir les hommes et les femmes d&#039;affaires et les voyageurs d&#039;affaires. Les installations existent pour vous aider à profiter de votre temps.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Loin de la foule, mais à proximité des centres commerciaux et des centres d’affaires comme City Mall, Carfour, Amman Mall et C.Town. L&#039;hôtel se distingue par son atmosphère paisible et fait partie des hôtels de luxe avec son style moderne et les meilleurs services, qui comprennent des équipements modernes tels qu&#039;une cafétéria, des salons de beauté, des salles de mariage et de réunion et des tenues élégantes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Zamzam Towers Hotel a été délibérément conçu pour offrir plus de liberté et d’élégance, que vous recherchiez un logement, des affaires ou un dîner, des moments de détente. Nous avons tout à l&#039;intérieur. Les réalisations intérieures et extérieures modernes en font un lieu unique pour des événements de tous types et de toutes tailles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Zamzam 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.6630360211702!2d35.850867014550296!3d31.997148881214525!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1c3250bccb5:0xf3c61de69ada3888!2zWmFtemFtIFRvd2VycyBIb3RlbCDYp9io2LHYp9isINiy2YXYstmF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567774485823!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 470, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'zamzam-towers-hotel'),
(557, 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', 'Zamzam Towers Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Zamzam Towers Hotel è stato istituito per servire uomini e donne d&#039;affari e viaggiatori d&#039;affari, le strutture esistono per aiutarti a goderti il tuo tempo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lontano dalla folla, ma vicino a centri commerciali e commerciali come City Mall, Carfour, Amman Mall e C.Town. L&#039;hotel si distingue per la sua atmosfera tranquilla ed è uno degli hotel di lusso con il suo stile moderno, i migliori servizi, che includono servizi moderni come caffetteria, saloni di bellezza, sale per matrimoni e riunioni ed eleganti abiti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lo Zamzam Towers Hotel è stato progettato appositamente per garantire maggiore libertà ed eleganza, sia che stiate cercando un alloggio, affari o cena, momenti di relax; Abbiamo tutto dentro. La moderna realizzazione interna ed esterna lo rende un luogo unico per eventi di qualsiasi tipo o dimensione.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Zamzam 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.6630360211702!2d35.850867014550296!3d31.997148881214525!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1c3250bccb5:0xf3c61de69ada3888!2zWmFtemFtIFRvd2VycyBIb3RlbCDYp9io2LHYp9isINiy2YXYstmF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567774485823!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 470, 'it', '', 'one col', 'zamzam-towers-hotel'),
(558, 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This Hotel is located in a commercial, entertainment, and shopping district. Days Inn Hotel Amman has 184 Rooms &amp;amp; Suites. They all contain a self control central heating and cooling system, iron, full-size ironing board, hair dryer, mini fridge, in-room safe box, wireless internet connection throughout the hotel, satellite &amp;amp; LCD television, 24-hour room service, full bathroom amenities, bathrobes, slippers, as well as Coffee/Tea Maker. The majority of rooms have a balcony with amazing views of the city or the pool area. Non-smoking rooms are available upon request.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It offers Energize Fitness Center Our relaxing fitness center, has a fully equipped Gym area with a wide range of Top-of-the line equipment with personal trainers available, special area which gives members and guests the option to join a large variety of fitness classes given by our fitness experts, Heated Indoor-Swimming pool including programs for swimming classes and aqua aerobics, Private Men and Women facilities including Sauna rooms, Jacuzzis, steam rooms, locker rooms, changing rooms, showers, and we shouldn’t forget the special lounge area in which our guests can relax and enjoy healthy food and beverages after a hard work out.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is 25 minutes from Amman Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Days Inn2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.4282828801083!2d35.88483451454971!3d31.976403481221094!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f96f596fb21:0xcb8402592755b704!2sDays Inn Hotel Suites Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775103951!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 471, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'days-inn-hotel'),
(559, 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este hotel está ubicado en un distrito comercial, de entretenimiento y de compras. Days Inn Hotel Amman cuenta con 184 habitaciones y suites. Todos contienen un sistema de calefacción y refrigeración central de autocontrol, plancha, tabla de planchar grande, secador de pelo, mini nevera, caja de seguridad en la habitación, conexión inalámbrica a Internet en todo el hotel, televisión satelital y LCD, servicio a la habitación las 24 horas, amenidades de baño completo, batas de baño, pantuflas y cafetera / tetera. La mayoría de las habitaciones tienen un balcón con impresionantes vistas de la ciudad o el área de la piscina. Hay habitaciones para no fumadores disponibles bajo petición.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ofrece Energize Fitness Center. Nuestro relajante gimnasio cuenta con un área de gimnasio totalmente equipada con una amplia gama de equipos de primera línea con entrenadores personales disponibles, área especial que brinda a los miembros e invitados la opción de unirse a una gran variedad de clases de ejercicios, impartido por nuestros expertos en acondicionamiento físico, piscina cubierta climatizada que incluye programas para clases de natación y aeróbic acuático, instalaciones privadas para hombres y mujeres que incluyen salas de sauna, jacuzzis, baños de vapor, vestuarios, vestuarios, duchas, y no debemos olvidar el especial sala de estar en la que nuestros huéspedes pueden relajarse y disfrutar de alimentos y bebidas saludables después de un duro ejercicio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Está a 25 minutos del aeropuerto de Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Days Inn2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.4282828801083!2d35.88483451454971!3d31.976403481221094!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f96f596fb21:0xcb8402592755b704!2sDays Inn Hotel Suites Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775103951!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 471, 'es', '', 'one col', 'days-inn-hotel'),
(560, 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel est situé dans un quartier commerçant, de loisirs et de divertissement. Le Days Inn Hotel Amman dispose de 184 chambres et suites. Toutes comprennent un système de chauffage et de climatisation central avec contrôle automatique, fer à repasser, grande table à repasser, sèche-cheveux, mini-réfrigérateur, coffre-fort dans la chambre, connexion Internet sans fil dans tout l&#039;hôtel, télévision par satellite et à écran LCD, service de chambre Chambre ouverte 24h / 24, produits de toilette complets, peignoirs, pantoufles et cafetière / théière. La plupart des chambres ont un balcon avec une vue imprenable sur la ville ou la piscine. Des chambres non-fumeurs sont disponibles sur demande.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Offres centre de remise en forme Energize. Notre salle de sport relaxante comprend une salle de sport entièrement équipée avec une large gamme d’équipements de première ligne avec entraîneurs personnels disponibles, une zone spéciale qui offre aux membres et aux invités la possibilité de participer à une grande variété de cours d’exercice, enseignés par notre Experts en fitness, piscine intérieure chauffée comprenant des programmes de natation et des cours d’aérobic aquatique, des installations privées pour hommes et femmes comprenant des saunas, des bains à remous, des hammams, des vestiaires, des vestiaires, des douches, sans oublier la salle spéciale d’être là où nos clients peuvent se détendre et savourer une nourriture et des boissons saines après un dur entraînement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il est à 25 minutes de l&#039;aéroport d&#039;Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Days Inn2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.4282828801083!2d35.88483451454971!3d31.976403481221094!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f96f596fb21:0xcb8402592755b704!2sDays Inn Hotel Suites Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775103951!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 471, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'days-inn-hotel'),
(561, 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', 'Days Inn Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo hotel si trova in una zona commerciale, di intrattenimento e commerciale. Days Inn Hotel Amman dispone di 184 camere e suite. Tutte contengono un sistema di riscaldamento e raffreddamento autonomo, ferro da stiro, grande asse da stiro, asciugacapelli, mini frigorifero, cassaforte in camera, connessione internet wireless in tutto l&#039;hotel, TV satellitare e LCD, servizio in camera Camera 24 ore su 24, prodotti da bagno completi, accappatoi, pantofole e set per la preparazione di tè e caffè. La maggior parte delle camere ha un balcone con vista mozzafiato sulla città o sulla piscina. Le camere per non fumatori sono disponibili su richiesta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Offerte Energize Fitness Center. La nostra palestra rilassante dispone di un&#039;area palestra completamente attrezzata con una vasta gamma di attrezzature di prima linea con personal trainer disponibili, un&#039;area speciale che offre ai membri e agli ospiti la possibilità di partecipare a una vasta gamma di lezioni di ginnastica, insegnate dal nostro Esperti di fitness, piscina interna riscaldata che include programmi di nuoto e lezioni di aerobica in acqua, servizi privati ​​per uomini e donne che includono sauna, vasche idromassaggio, bagni turchi, spogliatoi, spogliatoi, docce e non dobbiamo dimenticare la stanza speciale di essere dove i nostri ospiti possono rilassarsi e godersi cibi e bevande salutari dopo un duro allenamento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si trova a 25 minuti dall&#039;aeroporto di Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Days Inn2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.4282828801083!2d35.88483451454971!3d31.976403481221094!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f96f596fb21:0xcb8402592755b704!2sDays Inn Hotel Suites Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775103951!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 471, 'it', '', 'one col', 'days-inn-hotel'),
(562, 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in the heart of Amman, this 4-star Amman West Hotel features European style. Built in 1999, the venue was fully renovated in 2010. There is a 24-hour room service, dry cleaning and valet parking at the accommodation too.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The property&#039;s soundproof rooms feature a mini-refrigerator, a living area and a trouser press. These units offer mountain views. Each room is fitted with an en suite bathroom equipped with a shower, a hairdryer and toiletries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Breakfast is served every morning in the restaurant. The venue features lobby restaurant onsite. Guests can quench their thirst at the wine bar with a favorite drink. Centro Brasserie and Oobe are about a 5-minute walk away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The accommodation offers luggage storage, a safe deposit box and an elevator along with car rentals.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Amman_West_2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.111199828186!2d35.89749671466837!3d31.957879832605936!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca063f7cff84d:0x49f5449e80d42e36!2sAmman West Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775367494!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 472, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'amman-west-hotel'),
(563, 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ubicado en el corazón de Amman, este hotel de 4 estrellas Amman West presenta un estilo europeo. Construido en 1999, el lugar fue completamente renovado en 2010. También hay servicio de habitaciones las 24 horas, limpieza en seco y servicio de aparcacoches en el alojamiento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones insonorizadas del establecimiento cuentan con mini-refrigerador, sala de estar y plancha pantalones. Estas unidades ofrecen vistas a la montaña. Cada habitación está equipada con un cuarto de baño privado con ducha, secador de pelo y artículos de tocador.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El desayuno se sirve todas las mañanas en el restaurante. El lugar cuenta con restaurante en el vestíbulo del hotel. Los huéspedes pueden saciar su sed en el bar de vinos con su bebida favorita. El centro Brasserie y Oobe están a unos 5 minutos a pie.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El alojamiento ofrece depósito de equipaje, caja fuerte y ascensor junto con alquiler de coches.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Amman_West_2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.111199828186!2d35.89749671466837!3d31.957879832605936!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca063f7cff84d:0x49f5449e80d42e36!2sAmman West Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775367494!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 472, 'es', '', 'one col', 'amman-west-hotel'),
(564, 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situé au cœur d&#039;Amman, cet hôtel 4 étoiles Amman West présente un style européen. Construit en 1999, le lieu a été entièrement rénové en 2010. Il propose également un service de chambre 24h / 24, un service de nettoyage à sec et un service de voiturier sur place.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres insonorisées de l&#039;établissement disposent d&#039;un mini-réfrigérateur, d&#039;un salon et d&#039;une presse à pantalons. Ces unités offrent une vue sur la montagne. Chaque chambre est équipée d&#039;une salle de bains privative avec douche, sèche-cheveux et articles de toilette.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le petit-déjeuner est servi tous les matins au restaurant. L&#039;endroit a un restaurant dans le hall de l&#039;hôtel. Les clients peuvent se désaltérer au bar à vin avec leur boisson préférée. Downtown Brasserie et Oobe sont à environ 5 minutes à pied.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le logement offre une consigne à bagages, coffre-fort et ascenseur ainsi que la location de voiture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Amman_West_2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.111199828186!2d35.89749671466837!3d31.957879832605936!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca063f7cff84d:0x49f5449e80d42e36!2sAmman West Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775367494!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 472, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'amman-west-hotel'),
(565, 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', 'Amman West Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situato nel cuore di Amman, questo hotel a 4 stelle Amman West vanta uno stile europeo. Costruito nel 1999, il luogo è stato completamente rinnovato nel 2010. Presso l&#039;alloggio è disponibile anche il servizio in camera 24 ore su 24, il lavaggio a secco e il parcheggio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camere insonorizzate della struttura dispongono di mini-frigo, salotti e pressa per pantaloni. Queste unità offrono viste sulle montagne. Ogni camera è dotata di bagno privato con doccia, asciugacapelli e articoli da toeletta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La colazione viene servita ogni mattina nel ristorante. Il posto ha un ristorante nella hall dell&#039;hotel. Gli ospiti possono spegnere la loro sete al wine bar con il loro drink preferito. Downtown Brasserie e Oobe distano circa 5 minuti a piedi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La struttura offre un deposito bagagli, una cassaforte e un ascensore, oltre al noleggio auto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Amman_West_2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.111199828186!2d35.89749671466837!3d31.957879832605936!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca063f7cff84d:0x49f5449e80d42e36!2sAmman West Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775367494!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 472, 'it', '', 'one col', 'amman-west-hotel');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(566, 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Airport Hotel is a four-star hotel in Jordan; it contains 304 rooms where each room is designed to insure your ultimate comfort whether you are visiting Jordan for business or pleasure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel contains 3 different air-conditioned conference rooms (600 sqm) Arabella, Petra and Jerash; with modern technical equipment which provide the perfect environment for seminars, conferences, business meetings or receptions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In the welcoming restaurants you will enjoy a rich breakfast buffet in the morning. For lunch and dinner they offer a variety of international and national specialties, which are served on the sunny terrace near the pool in summer.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel is located in a distinguished location within the Queen Alia International Airport zone. Only 1km away from the terminals and a mere 15 minutes&#039; drive to the Jordanian capital – Amman (25 km) and 45 km away from the Dead Sea and the Baptism site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Amman Airport Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.853576416551!2d35.963391314662104!3d31.719894544437228!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b543140762d7f:0xc0db1c54c61d55e6!2sAmman Airport Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775660500!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 473, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'amman-airport-hotel'),
(567, 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Airport Hotel es un hotel de cuatro estrellas en Jordania; contiene 304 habitaciones donde cada habitación está diseñada para garantizar su máxima comodidad, ya sea que visite Jordan por negocios o placer.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel contiene 3 salas de conferencias con aire acondicionado (600 m²) Arabella, Petra y Jerash; con modernos equipos técnicos que brindan el ambiente perfecto para seminarios, conferencias, reuniones de negocios o recepciones.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En los acogedores restaurantes podrá disfrutar de un rico desayuno bufé por la mañana. Para el almuerzo y la cena, ofrecen una variedad de especialidades internacionales y nacionales, que se sirven en la terraza soleada cerca de la piscina en verano.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel está ubicado en un lugar distinguido dentro de la zona del Aeropuerto Internacional Queen Alia. A solo 1 km de las terminales y a solo 15 minutos en coche de la capital jordana, Amman (25 km) y a 45 km del Mar Muerto y el sitio del Bautismo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Amman Airport Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.853576416551!2d35.963391314662104!3d31.719894544437228!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b543140762d7f:0xc0db1c54c61d55e6!2sAmman Airport Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775660500!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 473, 'es', '', 'one col', 'amman-airport-hotel'),
(568, 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Airport Hotel est un hôtel quatre étoiles en Jordanie; Il contient 304 chambres où chaque chambre est conçue pour assurer un maximum de confort, que vous soyez en Jordanie pour le travail ou le plaisir.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel dispose de 3 salles de conférence climatisées (600 m²): Arabella, Petra et Jerash; avec des équipements techniques modernes offrant un environnement idéal pour des séminaires, des conférences, des réunions de travail ou des réceptions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dans les restaurants confortables, vous pourrez savourer un copieux petit-déjeuner buffet le matin. Pour le déjeuner et le dîner, ils offrent une variété de spécialités internationales et nationales, qui sont servies sur la terrasse ensoleillée près de la piscine en été.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel est situé dans un endroit distingué dans le secteur de l&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia. À seulement 1 km des terminaux et à seulement 15 minutes en voiture de la capitale jordanienne, Amman (25 km) et à 45 km de la mer Morte et du site du baptême.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Amman Airport Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.853576416551!2d35.963391314662104!3d31.719894544437228!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b543140762d7f:0xc0db1c54c61d55e6!2sAmman Airport Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775660500!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 473, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'amman-airport-hotel'),
(569, 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', 'Amman Airport Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Airport Hotel è un hotel a quattro stelle in Giordania; Contiene 304 camere in cui ogni camera è progettata per garantire il massimo comfort, sia in visita in Giordania per affari che per piacere.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel dispone di 3 sale conferenze con aria condizionata (600 m²) Arabella, Petra e Jerash; con moderne attrezzature tecniche che forniscono l&#039;ambiente perfetto per seminari, conferenze, riunioni di lavoro o ricevimenti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Negli accoglienti ristoranti potrete gustare una ricca colazione a buffet al mattino. A pranzo e cena, offrono una varietà di specialità internazionali e nazionali, che vengono servite sulla terrazza soleggiata vicino alla piscina in estate.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel è situato in un luogo distinto all&#039;interno dell&#039;area dell&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia. A solo 1 km dai terminal e solo 15 minuti in auto dalla capitale giordana, Amman (25 km) e 45 km dal Mar Morto e dal sito del Battesimo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Amman Airport Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.853576416551!2d35.963391314662104!3d31.719894544437228!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b543140762d7f:0xc0db1c54c61d55e6!2sAmman Airport Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775660500!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 473, 'it', '', 'one col', 'amman-airport-hotel'),
(570, 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Arena Space Hotel, the most exquisite and prestigious four star hotel. Conveniently and centrally located in the heart of Amman, just 20 Km away from Queen Alia International Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They have got just the right environment to make your stay a comfortable and relaxing experience. The hotel is fully equipped with all the necessary leisure facilities, and when it comes to services you will feel the difference from the moment you check in.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relax with a drink and a light snack at the popular restaurant and enjoy our pleasant atmosphere. They will ensure you great entertainment where mezzah and international cuisine can be enjoyed alongside famous singers and bands.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;You will find all the amenities of a modern hotel along with an exalted contemporary taste promising you a guaranteed luxury.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Arena space.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0765765098026!2d35.87526831466907!3d31.98593953120587!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0315c0f32f7:0x5a76ca316b7cdd47!2sArena Space Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775885286!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 474, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'arena-space-hotel'),
(571, 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bienvenido a Arena Space Hotel, el hotel de cuatro estrellas más exquisito y prestigioso. Convenientemente ubicado en el corazón de Ammán, a solo 20 km del aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tienen el entorno adecuado para que su estadía sea una experiencia cómoda y relajante. El hotel está totalmente equipado con todas las instalaciones de ocio necesarias, y cuando se trata de servicios, sentirá la diferencia desde el momento en que se registra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relájese con una bebida y un aperitivo en el popular restaurante y disfrute del agradable ambiente. Le aseguraremos un gran entretenimiento donde se puede disfrutar de mezzah y cocina internacional junto a cantantes y bandas famosas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Encontrará todas las comodidades de un hotel moderno junto con un gusto contemporáneo exaltado que le promete un lujo garantizado.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Arena space.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0765765098026!2d35.87526831466907!3d31.98593953120587!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0315c0f32f7:0x5a76ca316b7cdd47!2sArena Space Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775885286!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 474, 'es', '', 'one col', 'arena-space-hotel'),
(572, 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bienvenue à l’Arena Space Hotel, l’hôtel quatre étoiles le plus exquis et le plus prestigieux. Idéalement situé au cœur d&#039;Amman, à seulement 20 km de l&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ils ont le bon environnement pour rendre votre séjour une expérience confortable et relaxante. L’hôtel est entièrement équipé de tous les équipements de loisirs nécessaires. En ce qui concerne les services, vous sentirez la différence dès votre inscription.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Détendez-vous avec un verre et une collation dans le restaurant populaire et profitez de l&#039;atmosphère agréable. Nous vous assurerons un excellent divertissement où vous pourrez déguster une cuisine mezza et internationale avec des chanteurs et des groupes célèbres.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous trouverez tout le confort d&#039;un hôtel moderne avec un goût contemporain exalté qui vous promet un luxe garanti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Arena space.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0765765098026!2d35.87526831466907!3d31.98593953120587!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0315c0f32f7:0x5a76ca316b7cdd47!2sArena Space Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775885286!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 474, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'arena-space-hotel'),
(573, 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', 'Arena Space Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Benvenuti all&#039;Arena Space Hotel, il più raffinato e prestigioso hotel a quattro stelle. Convenientemente situato nel cuore di Amman, a soli 20 km dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hanno l&#039;ambiente giusto per rendere il tuo soggiorno un&#039;esperienza confortevole e rilassante. L&#039;hotel è completamente attrezzato con tutte le strutture ricreative necessarie e, quando si tratta di servizi, sentirai la differenza dal momento della registrazione.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rilassati con un drink e uno spuntino nel famoso ristorante e goditi l&#039;atmosfera piacevole. Ti assicureremo un ottimo intrattenimento dove potrai gustare mezzah e cucina internazionale con cantanti e band famose.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Troverai tutti i comfort di un hotel moderno insieme a un gusto contemporaneo esaltato che ti promette lusso garantito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Arena space.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0765765098026!2d35.87526831466907!3d31.98593953120587!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0315c0f32f7:0x5a76ca316b7cdd47!2sArena Space Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567775885286!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 474, 'it', '', 'one col', 'arena-space-hotel'),
(574, 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 4-star Belle Vue Hotel boasts luxurious architecture and the proximity to Jordan Craft Center. The venue was opened in 2002. You can enjoy a welcoming atmosphere, currency exchange, a smoking area and a tour desk provided at the accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Mecca Mall is 2 km away while Zahran Palace is set 1400 meters away. Guests can reach Amman city center in 20 minutes on foot. A church, a citadel and a mosque can be easily reached on foot as well.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The non-smoking rooms have satellite television, climate control and panoramic windows as well as hypo-allergenic pillows, a pillow-top mattress and foam pillows. They offer sea views. The property includes a microwave, an electric kettle and kitchenware in the kitchen along with a roll in shower, a hairdryer and terry dressing gowns in the bathroom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A rich buffet breakfast is available daily. You can enjoy delicious Italian dishes in TAJ restaurant. There is the snack bar on site. Serving a wide range of dishes, Grappa Restaurant &amp;amp; Bar and Guang Zhou can be reached within 5 minutes’ walk.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Belle Vue1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.3568927919546!2d35.91394721466811!3d31.951213232938372!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8096930fed:0x2c229700b2b80a45!2sBelle Vue Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776051542!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 475, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'belle-vue-hotel'),
(575, 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Belle Vue Hotel de 4 estrellas ofrece una arquitectura lujosa y está cerca del Jordan Craft Center. El lugar fue inaugurado en 2002. Se puede disfrutar de un ambiente acogedor, cambio de divisas, una zona para fumadores y un mostrador de información turística en el alojamiento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El centro comercial Mecca se encuentra a 2 km y el palacio Zahran, a 1400 metros. Los huéspedes pueden llegar al centro de la ciudad de Ammán en 20 minutos a pie. También se puede llegar fácilmente a pie a la Iglesia, a la Ciudadela y una Mezquita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones para no fumadores cuentan con televisión por satélite, climatizador y ventanas panorámicas, así como almohadas hipoalergénicas, un colchón con cubierta tipo almohada y almohadas de espuma. Ofrecen vistas al mar. El establecimiento cuenta con microondas, hervidor eléctrico y utensilios de cocina en la cocina, además de una ducha adaptada, un secador de pelo y batas de felpa en el baño.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todos los días se sirve un rico desayuno bufé. Puedes disfrutar de deliciosos platos italianos en el restaurante TAJ. Hay un snack bar en el lugar. Sirviendo una amplia variedad de platos, Grappa Restaurant &amp;amp; Bar y Guang Zhou se encuentran a 5 minutos a pie.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Belle Vue1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.3568927919546!2d35.91394721466811!3d31.951213232938372!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8096930fed:0x2c229700b2b80a45!2sBelle Vue Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776051542!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 475, 'es', '', 'one col', 'belle-vue-hotel'),
(576, 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Belle Vue Hotel est un établissement 4 étoiles à l&#039;architecture luxueuse situé à proximité du centre artisanal Jordan. Le lieu a été ouvert en 2002. Vous pourrez profiter d&#039;une atmosphère chaleureuse, d&#039;un bureau de change, d&#039;un espace fumeur et d&#039;un bureau d&#039;excursions dans l&#039;hébergement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le centre commercial La Mecque se trouve à 2 km et le palais Zahran à 1400 mètres. Vous pourrez rejoindre le centre-ville d&#039;Amman en 20 minutes à pied. L&#039;église, la citadelle et une mosquée sont également facilement accessibles à pied.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres non-fumeurs disposent de la télévision par satellite, de la climatisation et de fenêtres panoramiques, ainsi que d&#039;oreillers hypoallergéniques, d&#039;un matelas à oreiller et d&#039;oreillers en mousse. Ils offrent une vue sur la mer. La propriété dispose d&#039;un four micro-ondes, d&#039;une bouilloire électrique et d&#039;ustensiles de cuisine dans la cuisine, ainsi que d&#039;une douche adaptée, d&#039;un sèche-cheveux et de peignoirs moelleux dans la salle de bains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un copieux petit-déjeuner buffet est servi tous les jours. Vous pourrez déguster de délicieux plats italiens au restaurant TAJ. Il y a un snack-bar à la place. Servant une grande variété de plats, Grappa Restaurant &amp;amp; Bar et Guang Zhou sont à 5 minutes à pied.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Belle Vue1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.3568927919546!2d35.91394721466811!3d31.951213232938372!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8096930fed:0x2c229700b2b80a45!2sBelle Vue Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776051542!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 475, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'belle-vue-hotel'),
(577, 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', 'Belle Vue Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Belle Vue Hotel a 4 stelle vanta un&#039;architettura lussuosa e si trova vicino al Jordan Craft Center. Il luogo è stato aperto nel 2002. Presso l&#039;alloggio è possibile godere di un&#039;atmosfera accogliente, cambio valuta, un&#039;area fumatori e un banco escursioni.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il centro commerciale La Mecca si trova a 2 km di distanza e il Palazzo Zahran a 1400 metri. Gli ospiti possono raggiungere il centro di Amman in 20 minuti a piedi. La chiesa, la cittadella e una moschea sono facilmente raggiungibili a piedi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camere per non fumatori sono dotate di TV satellitare, climatizzazione e finestre panoramiche, nonché cuscini ipoallergenici, materasso a doppio strato e cuscini in espanso. Offrono viste sul mare. La proprietà dispone di una microonde, un bollitore elettrico e utensili da cucina in cucina, nonché una doccia adattabile, un asciugacapelli e morbidi accappatoi in bagno.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ogni giorno viene servita una ricca colazione a buffet. Puoi gustare deliziosi piatti italiani nel ristorante TAJ. C&#039;è uno snack bar nel posto. Grappa Restaurant &amp;amp; Bar e Guang Zhou sono a 5 minuti a piedi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Belle Vue1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.3568927919546!2d35.91394721466811!3d31.951213232938372!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8096930fed:0x2c229700b2b80a45!2sBelle Vue Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776051542!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 475, 'it', '', 'one col', 'belle-vue-hotel'),
(578, 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Geneva Hotel is ideally located at the end of the main road to Queen Alia International Airport at the beautiful spot of west Amman. 25 KM from the airport, 5 KM from downtown and 5 minutes from major shopping centers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Geneva Hotel Amman naturally exudes a warm welcome to all its guests. Fabulous shopping, exquisite dining and upbeat entertainment are just steps away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For a meeting to be successful perfect planning needs to be come together with the right meeting facilities, amenities and service. With eleven impressive venues including a Grand ballroom and a Crystal Ballroom, the hotel is a prestigious venue for meetings and events in Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Too busy to worry about logistics? Relax, and let our Geneva Meetings Director take care of everything.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Geneva1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.911729013891!2d35.85450041466832!3d31.963291332335938!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1091414b6c9:0x5c40c0ff05034649!2sGeneva Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776261648!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 476, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'geneva-hotel'),
(579, 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Geneva Hotel está idealmente ubicado al final de la carretera principal hacia el aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia, en el hermoso lugar del Oeste de Ammán. A 25 km del aeropuerto, a 5 km del centro y a 5 minutos de los principales centros comerciales.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Geneva Hotel Amman naturalmente da una cálida bienvenida a todos sus huéspedes. Las fabulosas tiendas, los exquisitos restaurantes y el animado entretenimiento están a solo unos pasos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para que una reunión sea exitosa, la planificación perfecta debe venir con las instalaciones, servicios y servicios adecuados para reuniones. Con once lugares impresionantes que incluyen un gran salón de baile y un salón Crystal Ballroom, el hotel es un lugar prestigioso para reuniones y eventos en Geneva Hotel Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;¿Demasiado ocupado para preocuparse por la logística? Relájese y deje que nuestro Director de Reuniones de Geneva Hotel se encargue de todo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Geneva1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.911729013891!2d35.85450041466832!3d31.963291332335938!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1091414b6c9:0x5c40c0ff05034649!2sGeneva Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776261648!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 476, 'es', '', 'one col', 'geneva-hotel'),
(580, 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel Geneva est idéalement situé au bout de la route principale menant à l&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia, dans le magnifique quartier d&#039;Amman occidental. À 25 km de l&#039;aéroport, à 5 km du centre et à 5 minutes des principaux centres commerciaux.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Geneva Hotel Amman accueille naturellement tous ses clients. Des boutiques fabuleuses, des restaurants exquis et des animations animées se trouvent à quelques pas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour qu&#039;une réunion soit réussie, une planification parfaite doit venir avec les installations, services et services adéquats pour les réunions. Avec onze sites impressionnants comprenant une grande salle de bal et une salle de bal Crystal, cet hôtel est un lieu prestigieux pour des réunions et des événements à l&#039;hôtel Geneva Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Trop occupé pour vous soucier de logistique? Détendez-vous et laissez notre directeur des réunions du Geneva Hotel s&#039;occuper de tout.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Geneva1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.911729013891!2d35.85450041466832!3d31.963291332335938!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1091414b6c9:0x5c40c0ff05034649!2sGeneva Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776261648!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 476, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'geneva-hotel'),
(581, 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', 'Geneva Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Geneva Hotel è situato alla fine della strada principale per l&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia, nella splendida posizione di West Amman. 25 km dall&#039;aeroporto, 5 km dal centro e 5 minuti dai principali centri commerciali.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Geneva Hotel Amman accoglie naturalmente tutti i suoi ospiti. Negozi favolosi, ristoranti squisiti e animazioni vivaci sono a pochi passi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Perché una riunione abbia successo, una pianificazione perfetta deve arrivare con le giuste strutture, servizi e servizi per le riunioni. Con undici luoghi impressionanti che includono una grande sala da ballo e una sala da ballo in cristallo, l&#039;hotel è un luogo prestigioso per meeting ed eventi presso Geneva Hotel&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Troppo impegnato a preoccuparti della logistica? Rilassati e lascia che il nostro direttore delle riunioni Geneva Hotel si occupi di tutto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/Geneva1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.911729013891!2d35.85450041466832!3d31.963291332335938!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca1091414b6c9:0x5c40c0ff05034649!2sGeneva Hotel Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776261648!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 476, 'it', '', 'one col', 'geneva-hotel'),
(582, 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman International Hotel is located next to the University of Jordan; this 4-star hotel offers air-conditioned rooms with a flat-screen TV. It has an outdoor pool and 4 dining outlets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Every room, hall and facility has been decorated and designed through personal tastes, experience and international requirements. Almost all of the furnishings have been designed and hand made locally for the hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;We offer cozy single bedrooms, relaxing double rooms and luxurious suites, alongside a swimming pool and fitness room.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel has three restaurants; The Grand Lounge, The Oasis Terrace, and The Leonard da vinci, serving an international and local menu to suite all guests desires. Our Rouge bar caters to all the sports and entertainment you could ask for.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/amman-international-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.1689519557754!2d35.865565514669704!3d32.01053682997763!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9f79a6b72585:0x9da0ecd483c2ac06!2sAmman International Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776701884!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 477, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'amman-international-hotel'),
(583, 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman International Hotel está ubicado al lado de la Universidad de Jordania; Este hotel de 4 estrellas ofrece habitaciones con aire acondicionado y TV de pantalla plana. Cuenta con una piscina al aire libre y 4 restaurantes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cada habitación, salón e instalación ha sido decorada y diseñada a través de gustos personales, experiencia y requisitos internacionales. Casi todos los muebles han sido diseñados y hechos a mano localmente para el hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ofrecemos acogedoras habitaciones individuales, relajantes habitaciones dobles y lujosas suites, junto con una piscina y un gimnasio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel tiene tres restaurantes; The Grand Lounge, The Oasis Terrace y The Leonard da Vinci, que sirven un menú internacional y local para satisfacer todos los deseos de los huéspedes. Nuestro bar Rouge atiende a todos los deportes y entretenimientos que pueda pedir.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/amman-international-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.1689519557754!2d35.865565514669704!3d32.01053682997763!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9f79a6b72585:0x9da0ecd483c2ac06!2sAmman International Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776701884!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 477, 'es', '', 'one col', 'amman-international-hotel'),
(584, 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman International Hotel est situé à côté de l&#039;université de Jordanie; Cet hôtel 4 étoiles propose des chambres climatisées avec une télévision à écran plat. Il possède une piscine extérieure et 4 restaurants.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Chaque pièce, salon et installation a été décoré et conçu selon des goûts personnels, une expérience et des exigences internationales. Presque tous les meubles ont été conçus et fabriqués à la main pour l&#039;hôtel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nous proposons des chambres simples confortables, des chambres doubles relaxantes et des suites luxueuses, ainsi qu&#039;une piscine et une salle de sport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel a trois restaurants; Le Grand Lounge, The Oasis Terrace et The Leonard da Vinci servent un menu international et local pour satisfaire tous les désirs. Notre bar Rouge sert tous les sports et les divertissements que vous pouvez demander.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/amman-international-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.1689519557754!2d35.865565514669704!3d32.01053682997763!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9f79a6b72585:0x9da0ecd483c2ac06!2sAmman International Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776701884!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 477, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'amman-international-hotel'),
(585, 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', 'Amman International Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman International Hotel si trova vicino all&#039;Università della Giordania; Questo hotel a 4 stelle offre camere climatizzate con TV a schermo piatto. Dispone di una piscina all&#039;aperto e 4 ristoranti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ogni stanza, soggiorno e installazione è stata decorata e progettata attraverso gusti personali, esperienza e requisiti internazionali. Quasi tutti i mobili sono stati progettati e realizzati a mano a livello locale per l&#039;hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Offriamo accoglienti camere singole, rilassanti camere doppie e lussuose suite, insieme a piscina e palestra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel ha tre ristoranti; Il Grand Lounge, The Oasis Terrace e The Leonard da Vinci, che serve un menu internazionale e locale per soddisfare tutti i desideri degli ospiti. Il nostro bar Rouge serve tutti gli sport e l&#039;intrattenimento che puoi chiedere.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/4 Star/amman-international-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.1689519557754!2d35.865565514669704!3d32.01053682997763!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9f79a6b72585:0x9da0ecd483c2ac06!2sAmman International Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567776701884!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 477, 'it', '', 'one col', 'amman-international-hotel'),
(586, 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Firas Palace in Amman offers a comfortable accommodation 650 meters from Roman Theater. The venue comprises 80 welcoming rooms. Guests can use 24-hour front desk assistance, laundry facilities and room service at the hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air conditioning, central heating and a sitting area are offered in all rooms at the property. Guests at the venue can enjoy spectacular views. A bath, a shower and a hairdryer are provided.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel is located within a 10-minute walk from the city center. It is just 10 minutes&#039; walk of The Citadel, visitors will enjoy easy access to a citadel and a theatre near the property.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It has an on-site lounge restaurant as well as a lobby bar. Nearby restaurants, such as Romero and Cantaloupe Gastro Pub are easily accessible.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can reach Marka International airport within 15 minutes by car. The venue also features a free car park, a safety deposit box and a lift.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Firas.jpeg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.43824595726!2d35.93081131466807!3d31.9490055330485!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f990d606b11:0xd8b9b245f5748e80!2sFiras Palace!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567781296899!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 478, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'firas-palace'),
(587, 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Firas Palace de Ammán ofrece un alojamiento confortable a 650 metros del teatro romano. El lugar comprende 80 acogedoras habitaciones. Los huéspedes pueden utilizar la recepción las 24 horas, lavandería y servicio de habitaciones en el hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones cuentan con aire acondicionado, calefacción central y una sala de estar. Los huéspedes del lugar pueden disfrutar de vistas espectaculares. Se proporcionan una bañera, una ducha y un secador de pelo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel se encuentra a 10 minutos a pie del centro de la ciudad. Está a solo 10 minutos a pie de la Ciudadela, los visitantes disfrutarán de un fácil acceso a una ciudadela y un teatro cerca de la propiedad.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cuenta con un salón restaurante y un bar en el vestíbulo. Los restaurantes cercanos, como Romero y Cantaloupe Gastro Pub, son fácilmente accesibles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los huéspedes pueden llegar al aeropuerto Marka International en 15 minutos en coche. El establecimiento también cuenta con aparcamiento gratuito, caja fuerte y ascensor.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Firas.jpeg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.43824595726!2d35.93081131466807!3d31.9490055330485!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f990d606b11:0xd8b9b245f5748e80!2sFiras Palace!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567781296899!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 478, 'es', '', 'one col', 'firas-palace'),
(588, 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Firas Palace à Amman propose un hébergement confortable à 650 mètres du théâtre romain. Le lieu comprend 80 chambres confortables. Vous pourrez utiliser la réception ouverte 24h / 24, la blanchisserie et le service d&#039;étage de l&#039;hôtel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres disposent de la climatisation, du chauffage central et d&#039;un salon. Les clients de l&#039;endroit peuvent profiter de vues spectaculaires. Une baignoire, une douche et un sèche-cheveux sont fournis.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel se trouve à 10 minutes à pied du centre-ville. À seulement 10 minutes à pied de la citadelle, les visiteurs pourront facilement accéder à une citadelle et à un théâtre à proximité de la propriété.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il dispose d&#039;un restaurant et d&#039;un bar dans le hall. Les restaurants à proximité, tels que le Romero et le Cantaloupe Gastro Pub, sont facilement accessibles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les hôtes de la propriété peuvent rejoindre l&#039;aéroport international de Marka en 15 minutes de voiture. L&#039;établissement dispose également d&#039;un parking gratuit, d&#039;un coffre-fort et d&#039;un ascenseur.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Firas.jpeg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.43824595726!2d35.93081131466807!3d31.9490055330485!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f990d606b11:0xd8b9b245f5748e80!2sFiras Palace!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567781296899!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 478, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'firas-palace');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(589, 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', 'Firas Palace', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Firas Palace di Amman offre sistemazioni confortevoli a 650 metri dal teatro romano. Il posto comprende 80 camere accoglienti. Gli ospiti possono usufruire di reception 24 ore, lavanderia e servizio in camera presso l&#039;hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere sono dotate di aria condizionata, riscaldamento centralizzato e soggiorno. Gli ospiti del luogo possono godere di viste spettacolari. Sono disponibili una vasca da bagno, una doccia e un asciugacapelli.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel si trova a 10 minuti a piedi dal centro città. Si trova a soli 10 minuti a piedi dalla Cittadella, i visitatori potranno godere di un facile accesso a una cittadella e un teatro vicino alla proprietà.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dispone di una sala ristorante e un bar nella hall. I ristoranti vicini, come Romero e Cantaloupe Gastro Pub, sono facilmente accessibili.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;aeroporto Marka International è a 15 min. D&#039;auto dall&#039;hotel. La struttura dispone inoltre di parcheggio gratuito, cassetta di sicurezza e ascensore.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Firas.jpeg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.43824595726!2d35.93081131466807!3d31.9490055330485!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f990d606b11:0xd8b9b245f5748e80!2sFiras Palace!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567781296899!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 478, 'it', '', 'one col', 'firas-palace'),
(590, 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ocean Hotel provides you with the comfort you need for your business trips, and the most enjoyable stay for you and your clients.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This Hotel is located in Um – Uthaina 25 minutes away from Q.A.I.A Airport and 10 minutes away from down town.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel features 48 rooms including 6 junior suites, and 6 Royal suites. Ocean Hotel is three stars approved Four, very luxurious for its atmosphere and service count.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In the lobby where luxury is accompanied with the friendly atmosphere, they make the guest feel that he has never left his home.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The stylish designed reception the guest will find all the services he is looking for. The friendly staff will be more than happy to assist your client and look for his comfort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Ocean Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.763633323426!2d35.872652314668564!3d31.967308532135537!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca053a2ca6803:0xe94de4c658a07ebe!2sOcean Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567781661943!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 479, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'ocean-hotel'),
(591, 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ocean Hotel le brinda la comodidad que necesita para sus viajes de negocios y la estadía más placentera para usted y sus clientes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este hotel está situado en Um - Uthaina a 25 minutos del aeropuerto Q.A.I.A y a 10 minutos del centro de la ciudad.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel dispone de 48 habitaciones, incluidas 6 junior suites y 6 suites Royal. Ocean Hotel cuenta con tres estrellas aprobadas Cuatro, muy lujoso por su atmósfera y servicio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En el vestíbulo, donde el lujo se acompaña del ambiente agradable, hacen que el huésped sienta que nunca ha salido de su casa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La elegante recepción de diseño del huésped encontrará todos los servicios que está buscando. El amable personal estará más que feliz de ayudar a su cliente y buscar su comodidad.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Ocean Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.763633323426!2d35.872652314668564!3d31.967308532135537!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca053a2ca6803:0xe94de4c658a07ebe!2sOcean Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567781661943!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 479, 'es', '', 'one col', 'ocean-hotel'),
(592, 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ocean Hotel vous offre le confort dont vous avez besoin pour vos voyages d&#039;affaires et le séjour le plus agréable pour vous et vos clients.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel est situé à Um-Uthaina, à 25 minutes de l&#039;aéroport Q.A.I.A et à 10 minutes du centre-ville.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel dispose de 48 chambres, dont 6 suites junior et 6 suites royales. Ocean Hotel dispose de trois hôtels quatre étoiles approuvés, très luxueux pour son atmosphère et son service.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dans le hall, où le luxe s’accompagne d’une atmosphère agréable, ils donnent à l’invité le sentiment qu’il n’a jamais quitté sa maison.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La réception élégante et design trouvera tous les services que vous recherchez. Le personnel amical sera plus qu&#039;heureux d&#039;aider votre client et de rechercher votre confort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Ocean Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.763633323426!2d35.872652314668564!3d31.967308532135537!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca053a2ca6803:0xe94de4c658a07ebe!2sOcean Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567781661943!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 479, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'ocean-hotel'),
(593, 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', 'Ocean Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ocean Hotel ti offre il comfort di cui hai bisogno per i tuoi viaggi di lavoro e il soggiorno più piacevole per te e i tuoi clienti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo hotel si trova a Um - Uthaina, a 25 minuti dall&#039;aeroporto Q.A.I.A e 10 minuti dal centro città.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel dispone di 48 camere, di cui 6 junior suite e 6 suite reali. Ocean Hotel ha tre stelle approvate, molto lussuose per l&#039;atmosfera e il servizio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nella hall, dove il lusso è accompagnato dalla piacevole atmosfera, fanno sentire l&#039;ospite che non ha mai lasciato la sua casa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;elegante reception di design troverà tutti i servizi che stai cercando. Il personale cordiale sarà più che felice di aiutare il cliente e cercare il massimo del comfort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Ocean Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.763633323426!2d35.872652314668564!3d31.967308532135537!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca053a2ca6803:0xe94de4c658a07ebe!2sOcean Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567781661943!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 479, 'it', '', 'one col', 'ocean-hotel'),
(594, 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel is located in the city of Amman Shmeisani area, close to all vital facilities and services concerned with the comfort of the main guests as it is from the airport approximately 20 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel has single rooms, double rooms, suites, family suites, private suites, private suites Baersan, where the hotel is equipped at the highest levels, was strewn luxuriously kinds of furniture and equipment to provide all levels of comfort and all necessary first visit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel offers free internet and business service, and guests can contact all over the world directly from the rooms, as well as room service and Satellite, refrigerator, safe deposit boxes, laundry service and ironing, shuttle service to and from the airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.3647701803407!2d35.896577214668795!3d31.97812573159583!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca014000921ef:0xc93e8226aef0bbcb!2sAl Thuraya Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567782005138!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 480, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'al-thuraya-amman-hotel'),
(595, 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel está ubicado en el área de la ciudad de Amman Shmeisani, cerca de todas las instalaciones y servicios vitales relacionados con la comodidad de los huéspedes principales, ya que está desde el aeropuerto aproximadamente 20 minutos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel cuenta con habitaciones individuales, habitaciones dobles, suites, suites familiares, suites privadas, suites privadas Baersan, donde el hotel está equipado en los niveles más altos, fueron esparcidos lujosamente tipos de muebles y equipos para proporcionar todos los niveles de confort y toda la primera visita necesaria.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel ofrece internet gratuito y servicio de negocios, y los huéspedes pueden contactar a todo el mundo directamente desde las habitaciones, así como el servicio a la habitación, refrigerador, satélite, las cajas de seguridad, el servicio de lavandería y planchado, el servicio de transporte desde y hacia el aeropuerto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.3647701803407!2d35.896577214668795!3d31.97812573159583!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca014000921ef:0xc93e8226aef0bbcb!2sAl Thuraya Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567782005138!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 480, 'es', '', 'one col', 'al-thuraya-amman-hotel'),
(596, 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel Al-Thuraya Amman est situé dans le quartier de la ville d&#039;Amman Shmeisani, à proximité de tous les équipements et services essentiels liés au confort des clients principaux, puisqu&#039;il se trouve à environ 20 minutes de l&#039;aéroport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel propose des chambres simples, des chambres doubles, des suites, des suites familiales, des suites privées, des suites privées, Baersan, où l&#039;hôtel est équipé aux niveaux les plus élevés, où les types de mobilier et les équipements ont été dispersés pour fournir tous les niveaux de confort La première visite nécessaire.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel propose une connexion Internet gratuite et un service d&#039;affaires. Vous pourrez contacter tout le monde directement depuis les chambres. Un service d&#039;étage, un réfrigérateur, la télévision par satellite, des coffres-forts, un service de blanchisserie et de repassage sont également proposés. de transport vers et depuis l&#039;aéroport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.3647701803407!2d35.896577214668795!3d31.97812573159583!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca014000921ef:0xc93e8226aef0bbcb!2sAl Thuraya Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567782005138!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 480, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'al-thuraya-amman-hotel'),
(597, 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', 'Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel è situato nella zona della città di Amman Shmeisani, vicino a tutte le strutture e servizi vitali legati al comfort degli ospiti principali, poiché è dall&#039;aeroporto circa 20 minuti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel dispone di camere singole, doppie, suite, suite familiari, suite private, suite private Baersan, dove l&#039;hotel è attrezzato ai massimi livelli, i tipi di mobili e attrezzature sono stati sparsi per fornire tutti i livelli di comfort e tutti È necessaria la prima visita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel offre la connessione internet gratuita e un servizio business e gli ospiti possono contattare tutti direttamente dalle camere, nonché servizio in camera, frigorifero, satellite, cassette di sicurezza, servizio lavanderia e stireria, servizio di trasporto da e per l&#039;aeroporto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Al-Thuraya Amman Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.3647701803407!2d35.896577214668795!3d31.97812573159583!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca014000921ef:0xc93e8226aef0bbcb!2sAl Thuraya Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567782005138!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 480, 'it', '', 'one col', 'al-thuraya-amman-hotel'),
(598, 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Arabela Amman Hotel is located in Shmeisani Area, the center of Amman and surrounded by great stores, famous restaurants, modern restaurants, modern hospitals, in very active area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It has 36 Super Deluxe Furnished Equipped with A/C, Private Bath Shower, Direct dial Phone, Satelite TV, minibar and internet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This restaurant is established to provide delicious meals of both western and oriental by specialized chef. Kitchen is suitable to do that. Also the restaurant is very quiet place for Bar and alcoholic drinks with high fantasy atmosphere.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Meeting room equipped with all facilities for your workshops&#039;, restaurant and coffee shop, lobby lounge, room service, Beauty salon, business center and Gym, Gift Shop, High standard of outside catering services and producing is available.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Arabela 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.3468396710605!2d35.89513561466879!3d31.978611931571567!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5fb85d7981af:0x34a5ce977caab726!2sArabela Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567782167907!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 481, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'arabela-hotel'),
(599, 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Arabela Amman Hotel está ubicado en el área de Shmeisani, el centro de Ammán y está rodeado de excelentes tiendas, restaurantes famosos, restaurantes modernos, hospitales modernos, en un área muy activa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cuenta con 36 Super Deluxe Amueblado Equipado con A / C, baño privado con ducha, teléfono de línea directa, TV vía satélite, minibar e internet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este restaurante está establecido para ofrecer deliciosas comidas tanto occidentales como orientales por chef especializados. La cocina esta adecuada para hacer eso. Además, el restaurante es un lugar muy tranquilo para bar y bebidas alcohólicas con un ambiente de alta fantasía.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sala de reuniones equipada con todas las instalaciones para sus talleres, restaurante y cafetería, salón en el vestíbulo, servicio a la habitación, salón de belleza, centro de negocios y gimnasio, tienda de regalos, servicio de catering externo de alto nivel y producción disponible.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Arabela 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.3468396710605!2d35.89513561466879!3d31.978611931571567!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5fb85d7981af:0x34a5ce977caab726!2sArabela Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567782167907!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 481, 'es', '', 'one col', 'arabela-hotel'),
(600, 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Arabela Amman Hotel est situé dans le quartier de Shmeisani, au centre d&#039;Amman. Il est entouré d&#039;excellents magasins, de restaurants réputés, de restaurants modernes, d&#039;hôpitaux modernes, dans un quartier très actif.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il dispose de 36 chambres Super Deluxe meublées équipées de la climatisation, d&#039;une salle de bain privée avec douche, d&#039;un téléphone avec ligne directe, de la télévision par satellite, d&#039;un minibar et d&#039;Internet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ce restaurant proposera de délicieux plats occidentaux et orientaux préparés par un chef spécialisé. La cuisine est faite pour ça. De plus, le restaurant est un endroit très calme pour les bars et les boissons alcoolisées avec une atmosphère fantastique.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Salle de réunion équipée de toutes les installations pour vos ateliers, restaurant et cafétéria, salon du hall, service en chambre, salon de beauté, centre d&#039;affaires et salle de sport, boutique de cadeaux, service de restauration externe de haut niveau et production disponible.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Arabela 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.3468396710605!2d35.89513561466879!3d31.978611931571567!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5fb85d7981af:0x34a5ce977caab726!2sArabela Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567782167907!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 481, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'arabela-hotel'),
(601, 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', 'Arabela Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Arabela Amman Hotel è situato nella zona di Shmeisani, il centro di Amman ed è circondato da negozi eccellenti, ristoranti famosi, ristoranti moderni, ospedali moderni, in una zona molto attiva.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dispone di 36 Super Deluxe arredati e dotati di aria condizionata, bagno privato con doccia, telefono diretto, TV satellitare, minibar e internet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo ristorante propone deliziosi piatti occidentali e orientali di chef specializzati. La cucina è adatta per farlo. Inoltre, il ristorante è un posto molto tranquillo per bar e bevande alcoliche con un&#039;atmosfera di alta fantasia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sala riunioni dotata di tutti i servizi per le vostre officine, ristorante e caffetteria, salone nella hall, servizio in camera, salone di bellezza, centro business e palestra, negozio di articoli da regalo, servizio di catering esterno di alto livello e produzione disponibile.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Arabela 2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.3468396710605!2d35.89513561466879!3d31.978611931571567!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5fb85d7981af:0x34a5ce977caab726!2sArabela Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567782167907!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 481, 'it', '', 'one col', 'arabela-hotel'),
(602, 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rest Hills Hotel is a 3 Star hotel; it is about 7 km from National Library of Jordan. The venue comprises 57 rooms. At this accommodation you&#039;ll find 24-hour room service, a laundry room and dry cleaning service.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Spacious and air-conditioned, accommodation at Rest Hills Hotel Apartments provides furnished balconies where guests can enjoy breakfast and room service. All apartments include a lounge, a well-equipped kitchen and a dining area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Other facilities offered at the property include currency exchange, a luggage storage and smokers lounge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is also an in house restaurant, serving traditional middle-eastern specialties and some Mediterranean classics. On site vending machines provide refreshments, drinks and snacks 24/7. 20 minutes&#039; drive from Marka International Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Rest hills1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.422854499252!2d35.87460931455142!3d32.03074398120378!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9fa8b4391d5d:0xe2d8af6791fefb2d!2sRest Hills Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783096824!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 482, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'rest-hills-hotel'),
(603, 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rest Hills Hotel es un hotel de 3 estrellas; Está a unos 7 km de la Biblioteca Nacional de Jordania. El local comprende 57 habitaciones. En este alojamiento encontrarás servicio de habitaciones las 24 horas, lavandería y servicio de tintorería.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los alojamientos del Rest Hills Hotel Apartments son amplios y cuentan con aire acondicionado y balcones amueblados donde los huéspedes pueden disfrutar del desayuno y del servicio de habitaciones. Todos los apartamentos incluyen un salón, una cocina bien equipada y una zona de comedor.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El establecimiento ofrece cambio de divisas, consigna de equipaje y salón para fumadores.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;También hay un restaurante que sirve especialidades tradicionales de Oriente Medio y algunos clásicos mediterráneos. Las máquinas expendedoras del hotel ofrecen refrescos, bebidas y aperitivos las 24 horas, los 7 días de la semana. A 20 minutos en coche del aeropuerto internacional de Marka.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Rest hills1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.422854499252!2d35.87460931455142!3d32.03074398120378!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9fa8b4391d5d:0xe2d8af6791fefb2d!2sRest Hills Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783096824!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 482, 'es', '', 'one col', 'rest-hills-hotel'),
(604, 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rest Hills Hotel est un hôtel 3 étoile; Il est à environ 7 km de la bibliothèque nationale de Jordanie. Le lieu comprend 57 chambres. Dans cet hébergement, vous trouverez un service de chambre 24h / 24, un service de blanchisserie et de nettoyage à sec.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les hébergements du Rest Hills Hotel Apartments sont spacieux et disposent de la climatisation et d&#039;un balcon meublé où vous pourrez prendre votre petit-déjeuner et vous servir d&#039;un service d&#039;étage. Tous les appartements comprennent un salon, une cuisine bien équipée et un coin repas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;établissement propose un bureau de change, une bagagerie et un fumoir.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous trouverez également un restaurant servant des spécialités traditionnelles du Moyen-Orient et certains classiques méditerranéens. Les distributeurs automatiques de l&#039;hôtel proposent des boissons sans alcool, des boissons et des collations 24h / 24 et 7j / 7. 20 minutes en voiture de l&#039;aéroport international de Marka.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Rest hills1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.422854499252!2d35.87460931455142!3d32.03074398120378!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9fa8b4391d5d:0xe2d8af6791fefb2d!2sRest Hills Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783096824!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 482, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'rest-hills-hotel'),
(605, 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', 'Rest Hills Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rest Hills Hotel è un albergo a 3 stelle; Si trova a circa 7 km dalla Biblioteca Nazionale di Giordania. Il posto comprende 57 camere. In questo alloggio troverete servizio in camera 24 ore su 24, servizio di lavanderia e pulitura a secco.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le sistemazioni del Rest Hills Hotel Apartments sono spaziose e dotate di aria condizionata e balconi arredati dove gli ospiti possono gustare la colazione e il servizio in camera. Tutti gli appartamenti includono un soggiorno, una cucina ben attrezzata e una zona pranzo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La struttura offre cambio valuta, deposito bagagli e una sala fumatori.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;C&#039;è anche un ristorante che serve specialità tradizionali del Medio Oriente e alcuni classici mediterranei. I distributori automatici dell&#039;hotel offrono bevande analcoliche, bevande e snack 24 ore al giorno, 7 giorni alla settimana. 20 minuti in auto dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale di Marka.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Rest hills1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.422854499252!2d35.87460931455142!3d32.03074398120378!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9fa8b4391d5d:0xe2d8af6791fefb2d!2sRest Hills Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783096824!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 482, 'it', '', 'one col', 'rest-hills-hotel'),
(606, 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;An excellent choice for travelers visiting Amman, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that include air conditioning and a mini-bar, bringing comfort and convenience to your visit. Plus, Sandy Palace Hotel offers an international cuisine restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. As well as a Hookah Cafe, to add some oriental relaxing evening to your day.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s easy to stay connected during your stay at Sandy Palace Hotel, we offer our guests a free WiFi.  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel is located in the center of Jabal Al Hussein district, makes Sandy Palace Hotel a great place to stay for those interested in visiting these popular Amman landmarks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sandy.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.722553133814!2d35.91366501454946!3d31.96842278122374!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8b5251b8df:0x5cf75da64adf2d14!2sSandy Palace Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783281004!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 483, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'sandy-palace-hotel'),
(607, 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Una excelente opción para los viajeros que visitan Ammán, ofreciendo muchas comodidades útiles diseñadas para mejorar su estadía.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Disfrutará de habitaciones relajantes que incluyen aire acondicionado y un mini-bar, brindando comodidad y conveniencia a su visita. Además, Sandy Palace Hotel ofrece un restaurante de cocina internacional, que brinda un respiro agradable de su ajetreado día. Además de un Hookah Cafe, para agregar una tarde oriental relajante a su día.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Es fácil mantenerse conectado durante su estadía en Sandy Palace Hotel, ofrecemos a nuestros huéspedes una conexión WiFi gratuita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel está ubicado en el centro del distrito de Jabal Al Hussein, lo que hace del Sandy Palace Hotel un excelente lugar para alojarse para aquellos interesados en visitar estos lugares de provecho de Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sandy.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.722553133814!2d35.91366501454946!3d31.96842278122374!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8b5251b8df:0x5cf75da64adf2d14!2sSandy Palace Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783281004!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 483, 'es', '', 'one col', 'sandy-palace-hotel'),
(608, 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Une excellente option pour les voyageurs visitant Amman, offrant de nombreux équipements utiles conçus pour améliorer leur séjour.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous apprécierez les chambres de détente équipées de la climatisation et d&#039;un mini-bar, offrant confort et commodité pour votre visite. De plus, le Sandy Palace Hotel propose un restaurant servant une cuisine internationale, ce qui vous permettra de vous détendre après une journée bien remplie. En plus d’un café narguilé, ajoutez un après-midi oriental relaxant à votre journée.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il est facile de rester connecté pendant votre séjour à l&#039;hôtel Sandy Palace, nous offrons à nos clients une connexion WiFi gratuite.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel est situé dans le centre du quartier de Jabal Al Hussein, ce qui fait du Sandy Palace Hotel un lieu de séjour idéal pour ceux qui souhaitent visiter Amman et profiter de ces lieux.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sandy.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.722553133814!2d35.91366501454946!3d31.96842278122374!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8b5251b8df:0x5cf75da64adf2d14!2sSandy Palace Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783281004!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 483, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'sandy-palace-hotel'),
(609, 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', 'Sandy Palace Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un&#039;opzione eccellente per i viaggiatori che visitano Amman, offre molti servizi utili progettati per migliorare il loro soggiorno.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Godrai di camere rilassanti che includono aria condizionata e minibar, offrendo comfort e praticità alla tua visita. Inoltre, Sandy Palace Hotel offre un ristorante con cucina internazionale, che offre una piacevole pausa dalla giornata impegnativa. Oltre a un Hookah Cafe, per aggiungere un rilassante pomeriggio orientale alla tua giornata.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;È facile rimanere in contatto durante il tuo soggiorno al Sandy Palace Hotel, offriamo ai nostri ospiti una connessione WiFi gratuita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel è situato nel centro del quartiere Jabal Al Hussein, il che rende il Sandy Palace Hotel un luogo di soggiorno eccellente per coloro che sono interessati a visitare questi luoghi per beneficiare di Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sandy.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.722553133814!2d35.91366501454946!3d31.96842278122374!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8b5251b8df:0x5cf75da64adf2d14!2sSandy Palace Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783281004!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 483, 'it', '', 'one col', 'sandy-palace-hotel'),
(610, 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toledo Amman Hotel is located in the heart of Amman, on the edge of the old city center and within walking distance to the new downtown. Toledo Amman Hotel is only few minutes away from major historical and biblical sites, in addition only a two minute walk to the future entertainment center &quot;Al Abdali Boulevard&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toledo Amman Hotel&#039;s 107 guest rooms and suites are provided with all the amenities for your comfort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms are individually climate controlled, with sound insulated windows, satellite channels in several languages, WiFi, mini bar, and direct international telephone services.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms face the famous King Abdullah Mosque and several historical churches.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Toledo.jpeg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.0013333509855!2d35.91539131466848!3d31.960860532457257!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8eb0630c79:0x81b0d6d6950f0a!2sToledo Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783426003!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 484, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'toledo-amman-hotel'),
(611, 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Toledo Amman Hotel está ubicado en el corazón de Ammán, en el límite del casco antiguo de la ciudad, a poca distancia del nuevo centro. El hotel Toledo Amman está a solo unos minutos de los principales sitios históricos y bíblicos, además de solo dos minutos a pie del futuro centro de entretenimiento &quot;Al Abdali Boulevard&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las 107 habitaciones y suites del Toledo Amman Hotel cuentan con todas las comodidades para su comodidad.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones tienen climatización individual, ventanas con aislamiento acústico, canales por satélite en varios idiomas, Wi-Fi, mini-bar y servicios telefónicos internacionales directos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones dan a la famosa Mezquita del Rey Abdullah y a varias iglesias históricas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Toledo.jpeg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.0013333509855!2d35.91539131466848!3d31.960860532457257!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8eb0630c79:0x81b0d6d6950f0a!2sToledo Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783426003!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 484, 'es', '', 'one col', 'toledo-amman-hotel'),
(612, 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Toledo Amman Hotel est situé au cœur d&#039;Amman, à la périphérie de la vieille ville, à une courte distance du nouveau centre. L&#039;hôtel Toledo Amman est à quelques minutes des principaux sites historiques et bibliques, ainsi qu&#039;à deux minutes à pied du futur centre de divertissement &quot;Al Abdali Boulevard&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les 107 chambres et suites de l&#039;hôtel Toledo Amman disposent de tout le confort nécessaire à votre confort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres disposent de la climatisation individuelle, de fenêtres insonorisées, de chaînes satellite en plusieurs langues, d&#039;une connexion Wi-Fi, d&#039;un mini-bar et d&#039;une ligne téléphonique internationale directe.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres donnent sur la célèbre mosquée King Abdullah et plusieurs églises historiques.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Toledo.jpeg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.0013333509855!2d35.91539131466848!3d31.960860532457257!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8eb0630c79:0x81b0d6d6950f0a!2sToledo Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783426003!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 484, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'toledo-amman-hotel');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(613, 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', 'Toledo Amman Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Toledo Amman Hotel è situato nel cuore di Amman, ai margini del centro storico, a breve distanza dal nuovo centro. L&#039;hotel Toledo Amman si trova a pochi minuti dai principali siti storici e biblici, nonché a soli due minuti a piedi dal futuro centro di intrattenimento &quot;Al Abdali Boulevard&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le 107 camere e suite dell&#039;hotel Toledo Amman dispongono di tutti i comfort per il vostro comfort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere sono dotate di aria condizionata individuale, finestre insonorizzate, canali satellitari in diverse lingue, Wi-Fi, minibar e servizi telefonici internazionali diretti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere si affacciano sulla famosa Moschea del Re Abdullah e su numerose chiese storiche.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Toledo.jpeg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.0013333509855!2d35.91539131466848!3d31.960860532457257!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f8eb0630c79:0x81b0d6d6950f0a!2sToledo Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783426003!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 484, 'it', '', 'one col', 'toledo-amman-hotel'),
(614, 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sama Paris Hotel is a three stars hotel located in the most beautiful location overlooking the ancient city of Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;With long experiences in hotels management this hotel succeeded in making the services distinguish and giving the customers the most reliable services. A 24 hours rooms services, laundry and shoe cleaning are just a few of the other personal amenities offered, that add extra touch to make your stay even more comfortable.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Mazaj Restaurant location gives it a superior view to all Amman beautiful skylines. The cuisine offers and interesting choice of food and beverages. Served by the courteous, helpful, friendly staff in an atmosphere of elegance and charm. A delicious breakfast buffet is served every morning. Lunch and dinner meals are served a la Carte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;We would like to grab your attention and point out to you the various services and the great site you can see in Jordan during your visit. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sama paris.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.165599509844!2d35.889721814668924!3d31.98352603132624!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f809fa5a23f:0x9cfe6395cb4706c2!2z2YHZhtiv2YIg2LPZhdinINio2KfYsdmK2LM!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783574611!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 485, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'sama-paris-hotel'),
(615, 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sama Paris Hotel es un hotel de tres estrellas ubicado en el lugar más hermoso con vista a la antigua ciudad de Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Con una larga experiencia en la gestión hotelera, este hotel logró distinguir los servicios y brindar a los clientes los servicios más confiables. Los servicios de habitaciones las 24 horas, lavandería y limpieza de zapatos son solo algunas de las otras comodidades personales que se ofrecen, que agregan un toque adicional para que su estadía sea aún más cómoda.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La ubicación del restaurante Mazaj le da una vista superior a todos los hermosos horizontes de Amman. La cocina ofrece una interesante selección de alimentos y bebidas. Servido por el personal cortés, servicial y amable en un ambiente de elegancia y encanto. Todas las mañanas se sirve un delicioso desayuno bufé. El almuerzo y la cena se sirven a la carta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nos gustaría llamar su atención y señalarle los diversos servicios y el gran sitio que puede ver en Jordania durante su visita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sama paris.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.165599509844!2d35.889721814668924!3d31.98352603132624!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f809fa5a23f:0x9cfe6395cb4706c2!2z2YHZhtiv2YIg2LPZhdinINio2KfYsdmK2LM!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783574611!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 485, 'es', '', 'one col', 'sama-paris-hotel'),
(616, 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sama Paris Hotel est un hôtel trois étoiles situé dans le plus bel endroit surplombant la ville antique d&#039;Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Avec une longue expérience dans la gestion hôtelière, cet hôtel a réussi à distinguer les services et à fournir aux clients les services les plus fiables. Le service de chambre 24h / 24, la blanchisserie et le nettoyage des chaussures ne sont que quelques-uns des équipements personnels proposés, qui ajoutent une touche supplémentaire pour rendre votre séjour encore plus confortable.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;emplacement du restaurant Mazaj donne une vue supérieure sur tous les beaux horizons d&#039;Amman. La cuisine offre une sélection intéressante de nourriture et de boissons. Servi par un personnel courtois, serviable et sympathique dans une atmosphère d&#039;élégance et de charme. Un délicieux petit-déjeuner buffet est servi chaque matin. Le déjeuner et le dîner sont servis à la carte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nous aimerions attirer votre attention et signaler les différents services et le super site que vous pouvez voir en Jordanie lors de votre visite.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sama paris.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.165599509844!2d35.889721814668924!3d31.98352603132624!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f809fa5a23f:0x9cfe6395cb4706c2!2z2YHZhtiv2YIg2LPZhdinINio2KfYsdmK2LM!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1567783574611!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 485, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'sama-paris-hotel'),
(617, 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', 'Sama Paris Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sama Paris Hotel è un hotel a tre stelle situato nel posto più bello che domina l&#039;antica città di Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Con una lunga esperienza nella gestione alberghiera, questo hotel è riuscito a distinguere i servizi e fornire ai clienti i servizi più affidabili. Il servizio in camera 24 ore su 24, la lavanderia e la pulizia delle scarpe sono solo alcuni degli altri servizi personali offerti, che aggiungono un tocco in più per rendere il vostro soggiorno ancora più confortevole.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La posizione del ristorante Mazaj offre una vista superiore a tutti i meravigliosi orizzonti di Amman. La cucina offre un&#039;interessante selezione di cibi e bevande. Servito da personale cortese, disponibile e cordiale in un&#039;atmosfera di eleganza e fascino. Una deliziosa colazione a buffet viene servita ogni mattina. Pranzo e cena sono serviti à la carte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vorremmo attirare la vostra attenzione e sottolineare i vari servizi e il fantastico sito che potete vedere in Giordania durante la vostra visita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels In Amman/3 Star/Sama paris.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.165599509844!2d35.889721814668924!3d31.98352603132624!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f809fa5a23f:0x9cfe6395cb4706c2!2z2YHZhtiv2YIg2LPZhdinINio2KfYsdmK2LM!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!