(621, 'Hoteles en el Mar Muerto', 'Hoteles en el Mar Muerto', 'Hoteles en el Mar Muerto', 'Hoteles en el Mar Muerto', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/MovenpickDead_Sea 3.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; SPA Dead Sea&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Dead Sea&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;El lujoso Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Dead Sea se encuentra en un pueblo tradicional ubicado entre exuberantes jardines. El complejo se encuentra en...&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-dead-sea/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/crowne-plaza 2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp;amp; Spa&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un complejo turístico del Mar Muerto en Jordania con una playa de arena blanca y servicios de spa exclusivos...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/crowne-plaza-jordan-dead-sea-resort-amp-spa/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quo