ot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Holiday Inn Resort Dead Sea, hotel spa y resort para una estancia familiar en Jordania. Sumérjase en la magia antigua del Mar...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/holiday-inn-resort-dead-sea/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Ma-in3.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ma&#039;in Hot Springs&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Ma&#039;in Hot Springs&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este complejo de estilo oasis ofrece una piscina al aire libre y un spa situado directamente debajo de una cascada de aguas...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/main-hot-springs-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/4 Star/grand-east-slide1.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Grand East Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Grand East Hotel &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Grand East Hotel ofrece 198 lujosas y espaciosas habitaciones y suites de diferentes categorías de en el edificio principal...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/grand-east-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/4 Star/hotel-exterior-at-ramada-resort-dead-sea.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ramada Resort Dead Sea&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Ramada Resort Dead Sea&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bordeando las costas orientales de Jordania, el Ramada Resort by Wyndham Dead Sea se encuentra entre poderosos...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/ramada-resort-dead-sea/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/4 Star/russian.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Russian Pilgrim Residence&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Russian Pilgrim Residence&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En Russian Pilgrim&#039;s Residence, los huéspedes pueden dar unas vueltas en el Mar Muerto, que se encuentra a 5 minutos...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/russian-pilgrim-residence/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/4 Star/Dead Sea Spa Hotel.jpg&quot; alt=&quot; Dead Sea Spa Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Dead Sea Spa Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dead Sea Spa Hotel está ubicado a orillas del Mar Muerto, a 420 metros bajo el nivel del mar en lo que se conoce como el punto...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/dead-sea-spa-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 618, 'es', '', 'one col', 'hoteles-en-el-mar-muerto'),
(622, 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The luxury Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Dead Sea is found in a traditional village setting nestled amongst lush gardens. The resort is set on the northern shores of the Dead Sea, at the lowest point on earth. With your well-being and balance in mind, this resort is an oasis of tranquility.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relax in the award-winning Arabian Dead Sea Zara Spa with breathtaking views of the healing waters. Offering world-class facilities on 6,000 square meters, you can be sure to experience ultimate spa luxury. A unique revitalizing and therapeutic experience awaits you.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Best known for: Genuine Arabic village resort, 6,000 sqm (1.5 acres) Zara Spa, 8 hectares (20 acres) of lush gardens, renowned for meetings/conferences, 9 in and outdoor restaurants/bars.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you are travelling with your family, you can be sure your little ones will be well taken care of. The Mövenpick Family program makes every family travel easier.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/MovenpickDead_Sea 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d6787.901686249695!2d35.586212466656484!3d31.71723775789412!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a14beb4c019:0x73fae9b9d43adb13!2sMovenpick Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568202442979!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 622, 'en', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-dead-sea'),
(623, 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The luxury Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Dead Sea is found in a traditional village setting nestled amongst lush gardens. The resort is set on the northern shores of the Dead Sea, at the lowest point on earth. With your well-being and balance in mind, this resort is an oasis of tranquility.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relax in the award-winning Arabian Dead Sea Zara Spa with breathtaking views of the healing waters. Offering world-class facilities on 6,000 square meters, you can be sure to experience ultimate spa luxury. A unique revitalizing and therapeutic experience awaits you.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Best known for: Genuine Arabic village resort, 6,000 sqm (1.5 acres) Zara Spa, 8 hectares (20 acres) of lush gardens, renowned for meetings/conferences, 9 in and outdoor restaurants/bars.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you are travelling with your family, you can be sure your little ones will be well taken care of. The Mövenpick Family program makes every family travel easier.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/MovenpickDead_Sea 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d6787.901686249695!2d35.586212466656484!3d31.71723775789412!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a14beb4c019:0x73fae9b9d43adb13!2sMovenpick Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568202442979!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 622, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-dead-sea'),
(624, 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El lujoso Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Dead Sea se encuentra en un pueblo tradicional ubicado entre exuberantes jardines. El complejo se encuentra en las costas del Norte del Mar Muerto, en el punto más bajo de la tierra. Con su bienestar y equilibrio en mente, este complejo es un oasis de tranquilidad.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relájate en el galardonado Arabian Dead Sea Zara Spa con impresionantes vistas de las aguas curativas. Ofreciendo instalaciones de clase mundial en 6,000 metros cuadrados, puede estar seguro de experimentar lo último en spa de lujo. Una experiencia terapéutica y revitalizante única te espera.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Mejor conocido por: genuino resort de pueblo árabe, Zara Spa de 6,000 metros cuadrados (1,5 acres), 8 hectáreas (20 acres) de exuberantes jardines, famoso por reuniones / conferencias, restaurantes y bares de 9 en y al aire libre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si viaja con su familia, puede estar seguro de que sus pequeños estarán bien atendidos. El programa Mövenpick Family hace que cada viaje familiar sea más fácil.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/MovenpickDead_Sea 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d6787.901686249695!2d35.586212466656484!3d31.71723775789412!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a14beb4c019:0x73fae9b9d43adb13!2sMovenpick Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568202442979!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 622, 'es', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-dead-sea'),
(625, 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le luxueux Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Dead Sea est situé dans un village traditionnel niché dans des jardins luxuriants. Le complexe est situé sur les rives nord de la mer Morte, au point le plus bas de la planète. Avec son bien-être et son équilibre, ce complexe est une oasis de tranquillité.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Détendez-vous dans le spa primé Arabian Dead Sea Zara avec une vue imprenable sur les eaux apaisantes. Offrant des installations de classe mondiale sur 6 000 mètres carrés, vous pouvez être sûr de vivre le nec plus ultra des spas de luxe. Une expérience thérapeutique et revitalisante unique vous attend.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Principalement connu pour: véritable village de villégiature arabe, Zara Spa de 6 000 mètres carrés, 8 hectares de jardins luxuriants, réputés pour leurs réunions / conférences, restaurants et 9 bars à l&#039;intérieur et à l&#039;extérieur.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si vous voyagez avec votre famille, vous pouvez être sûr que vos enfants seront bien pris en charge. Le programme Mövenpick Family facilite chaque voyage en famille.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/MovenpickDead_Sea 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d6787.901686249695!2d35.586212466656484!3d31.71723775789412!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a14beb4c019:0x73fae9b9d43adb13!2sMovenpick Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568202442979!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 622, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-dead-sea'),
(626, 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; SPA Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il lussuoso Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Dead Sea si trova in un villaggio tradizionale immerso in rigogliosi giardini. Il complesso è situato sulle rive settentrionali del Mar Morto, nel punto più basso della terra. Con il suo benessere e l&#039;equilibrio in mente, questo complesso è un&#039;oasi di tranquillità.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rilassati nella premiata Arabian Dead Sea Zara Spa con vista mozzafiato sulle acque curative. Offrendo servizi di prima classe a 6.000 metri quadrati, puoi essere certo di sperimentare il massimo in termini di spa di lusso. Un&#039;esperienza terapeutica e rivitalizzante unica ti aspetta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Meglio conosciuto per: autentico villaggio arabo, Zara Spa di 6.000 metri quadrati (1,5 acri), 8 ettari (20 acri) di rigogliosi giardini, famoso per riunioni / conferenze, ristoranti e 9 bar dentro e fuori.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se viaggi con la tua famiglia, puoi essere sicuro che i tuoi piccoli saranno ben curati. Il programma Famiglia Mövenpick semplifica ogni viaggio in famiglia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/MovenpickDead_Sea 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d6787.901686249695!2d35.586212466656484!3d31.71723775789412!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a14beb4c019:0x73fae9b9d43adb13!2sMovenpick Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568202442979!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 622, 'it', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-dead-sea'),
(627, 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A Dead Sea Resort in Jordan with a White-Sandy Beach and Spa Upscale amenities and stunning Dead Sea views at the Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp;amp; Spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;An hour west Queen Alia International Airport, this 5-star beach resort is ideal for a weekend retreat or a family vacation in Jordan. Prepare to feel pampered, whether floating in the buoyant waters off the longest private Dead Sea beach or enjoying a treatment in the renowned D&#039;Sante SpaAfter refreshing with a cold drink from the free mini-bar, you can soak up the sun by the Lake, a 5,500sqm pool fringed by tall palms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cool down with a cocktail at Aqua Pool Bar, and then swim to the edge of the adults-only infinity pool for sweeping views of the Dead Sea.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Children have their own pool to splash in, and the Kids Club to keep them entertained. After sunset, poolside El Grito opens for classic Latin American food and live entertainment. An impressive venue for meetings and events in Jordan, hotel conference facilities are state-of-the-art with personalized attention by multilingual staff.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Crown, the elegant ballroom, has inspiring sea views, as does the Promenade, which curves gracefully along the beachfront. Let the chefs treat you to Lebanese specialties in sophisticated Burj Al Hamam and an international buffet in all-day Ambrosia Restaurant.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/crowne-plaza 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.3054571959556!2d35.58220631454126!3d31.707549981308052!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x2f40c0dcca2ffc9a!2sCrowne Plaza Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568203697227!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 627, 'en', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-jordan-dead-sea-resort-amp-spa'),
(628, 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A Dead Sea Resort in Jordan with a White-Sandy Beach and Spa Upscale amenities and stunning Dead Sea views at the Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp;amp; Spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;An hour west Queen Alia International Airport, this 5-star beach resort is ideal for a weekend retreat or a family vacation in Jordan. Prepare to feel pampered, whether floating in the buoyant waters off the longest private Dead Sea beach or enjoying a treatment in the renowned D&#039;Sante SpaAfter refreshing with a cold drink from the free mini-bar, you can soak up the sun by the Lake, a 5,500sqm pool fringed by tall palms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cool down with a cocktail at Aqua Pool Bar, and then swim to the edge of the adults-only infinity pool for sweeping views of the Dead Sea.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Children have their own pool to splash in, and the Kids Club to keep them entertained. After sunset, poolside El Grito opens for classic Latin American food and live entertainment. An impressive venue for meetings and events in Jordan, hotel conference facilities are state-of-the-art with personalized attention by multilingual staff.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Crown, the elegant ballroom, has inspiring sea views, as does the Promenade, which curves gracefully along the beachfront. Let the chefs treat you to Lebanese specialties in sophisticated Burj Al Hamam and an international buffet in all-day Ambrosia Restaurant.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/crowne-plaza 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.3054571959556!2d35.58220631454126!3d31.707549981308052!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x2f40c0dcca2ffc9a!2sCrowne Plaza Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568203697227!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 627, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-jordan-dead-sea-resort-amp-spa'),
(629, 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un complejo turístico del Mar Muerto en Jordania con una playa de arena blanca y servicios de spa exclusivos e impresionantes vistas al mar Muerto en el Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp;amp; Spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A una hora al Oeste del Aeropuerto Internacional Queen Alia, este complejo de playa de 5 estrellas es ideal para un retiro de fin de semana o unas vacaciones familiares en Jordania. Prepárese para sentirse mimado, ya sea flotando en las aguas de la playa privada más larga del Mar Muerto o disfrutando de un tratamiento en el famoso D&#039;Sante Spa Después de refrescarse con una bebida fría del mini-bar gratuito, puede tomar el sol junto al lago, una piscina de 5.500 metros cuadrados rodeada de altas palmeras.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Refrésquese con un cóctel en el Aqua Pool Bar y luego nade hasta el borde de la piscina infinita solo para adultos para disfrutar de vistas panorámicas del Mar Muerto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los niños tienen su propia piscina para chapotear y el Kids Club para mantenerlos entretenidos. Después del atardecer, El Grito junto a la piscina se abre para disfrutar de comida clásica latinoamericana y entretenimiento en vivo. Un lugar impresionante para reuniones y eventos en Jordania, las instalaciones para conferencias del hotel son modernas con atención personalizada por personal multilingüe.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Crown, el elegante salón de baile, tiene vistas inspiradoras al mar, al igual que el Promenade, que se curva con gracia a lo largo de la playa. Deje que los chefs lo traten con especialidades libanesas en el sofisticado Burj Al Hamam y un buffet internacional en el restaurante Ambrosia durante todo el día.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/crowne-plaza 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.3054571959556!2d35.58220631454126!3d31.707549981308052!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x2f40c0dcca2ffc9a!2sCrowne Plaza Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568203697227!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 627, 'es', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-jordan-dead-sea-resort-amp-spa'),
(630, 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un complexe de la mer Morte en Jordanie avec une plage de sable blanc et des services de spa exclusifs et une vue imprenable sur la mer Morte au Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp;amp; Spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;À une heure à l&#039;ouest de l&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia, ce complexe balnéaire 5 étoiles est idéal pour un week-end ou des vacances en famille en Jordanie. Préparez-vous à vous faire dorloter, que vous naviguiez dans les eaux de la plus longue plage privée de la mer Morte ou profitiez d&#039;un soin au célèbre spa D&#039;Sante. Après une boisson fraîche dans le mini-bar gratuit, vous pourrez bronzer ensemble. Pour le lac, une piscine de 5 500 mètres carrés entourée de grands palmiers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rafraîchissez-vous avec un cocktail au bar Aqua Pool, puis nagez jusqu&#039;au bord de la piscine à débordement réservée aux adultes et profitez d&#039;une vue panoramique sur la mer Morte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les enfants ont leur propre pataugeoire et le Kids Club pour se divertir. Après le coucher du soleil, El Grito de la piscine s&#039;ouvre pour déguster des plats classiques d&#039;Amérique latine et des spectacles. Un lieu impressionnant pour les réunions et les événements en Jordanie, les salles de conférence de l&#039;hôtel sont modernes avec une attention personnalisée par un personnel multilingue.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Crown, l&#039;élégante salle de bal, offre une vue imprenable sur la mer, tout comme la Promenade, qui serpente gracieusement le long de la plage. Laissez les chefs vous régaler de spécialités libanaises au raffiné Burj Al Hamam et d&#039;un buffet international au restaurant Ambrosia tout au long de la journée.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/crowne-plaza 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.3054571959556!2d35.58220631454126!3d31.707549981308052!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x2f40c0dcca2ffc9a!2sCrowne Plaza Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568203697227!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 627, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-jordan-dead-sea-resort-amp-spa'),
(631, 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un resort sul Mar Morto in Giordania con una spiaggia di sabbia bianca e servizi spa esclusivi e viste mozzafiato sul Mar Morto al Crowne Plaza Jordan Dead Sea Resort &amp;amp; Spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un&#039;ora a ovest dell&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia, questo resort a 5 stelle sulla spiaggia è ideale per un weekend o una vacanza in famiglia in Giordania. Preparati a sentirti coccolato, sia che galleggi nelle acque della più lunga spiaggia privata del Mar Morto o goditi un trattamento presso la famosa Spa D&#039;Sante Dopo esserti rinfrescato con una bibita fresca dal mini-bar gratuito, puoi prendere il sole insieme Al lago, una piscina di 5.500 metri quadrati circondata da alte palme.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rinfrescati con un cocktail all&#039;Aqua Pool Bar e nuota fino al bordo della piscina a sfioro per soli adulti per goderti una vista panoramica sul Mar Morto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;I bambini hanno la loro piscina per bambini e il Kids Club per farli divertire. Dopo il tramonto, El Grito a bordo piscina si apre per gustare la classica cucina latino americana e spettacoli dal vivo. Luogo impressionante per riunioni ed eventi in Giordania, le strutture per conferenze dell&#039;hotel sono moderne con attenzione personalizzata da parte del personale multilingue.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Crown, l&#039;elegante sala da ballo, ha una vista stimolante sul mare, così come la Promenade, che curva con grazia lungo la spiaggia. Lascia che gli chef ti trattino con specialità libanesi nel sofisticato Burj Al Hamam e un buffet internazionale al ristorante Ambrosia per tutto il giorno.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/crowne-plaza 3.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.3054571959556!2d35.58220631454126!3d31.707549981308052!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x2f40c0dcca2ffc9a!2sCrowne Plaza Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568203697227!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 627, 'it', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-jordan-dead-sea-resort-amp-spa'),
(632, 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Stay at the Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp;amp; Spa for an upscale experience in a unique location. Located at the lowest point on earth, over 1,312 feet below sea level, they are set in the heart of the Jordan Valley, with direct access to the beach. Spend the day lounging on the sundeck of our floating pontoon on the beautiful waters of the Dead Sea for a blissful escape. Try the new Sarab pool, with 330 sq. m. of breathtaking infinity views over the Dead Sea.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Best known for: 2 infinity pools, and supervised Kids&#039; Club with pool and activities, direct beach access, floating pontoon, sun deck and mud baths, 7 restaurants and bars with all-day dining, specialty restaurants, and swim-up bar, 24-hour fitness center, treatment rooms for aromatherapy massages, 2 boardrooms and event space in adjacent King Hussein Bin Talal Convention Center and panoramic resort at the lowest point on Earth, near major tourist attractions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Imagine hosting your next event by the beautiful infinity pool with the breathtaking backdrop of the Dead Sea. They also offer two grand boardrooms and 133,000 sq. ft. of flexible function space in the adjacent King Hussein Bin Talal Convention Centre managed by Hilton.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Hilton.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d435266.0062337131!2d35.210091116816514!3d31.537459641166173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a42245ddd89:0x26f6ee5d3ad475ea!2sKing Hussein Bin Talal Convention Centre Managed by Hilton!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568205786163!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 632, 'en', '', 'one col', 'hilton-dead-sea-resort-amp-spa'),
(633, 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Stay at the Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp;amp; Spa for an upscale experience in a unique location. Located at the lowest point on earth, over 1,312 feet below sea level, they are set in the heart of the Jordan Valley, with direct access to the beach. Spend the day lounging on the sundeck of our floating pontoon on the beautiful waters of the Dead Sea for a blissful escape. Try the new Sarab pool, with 330 sq. m. of breathtaking infinity views over the Dead Sea.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Best known for: 2 infinity pools, and supervised Kids&#039; Club with pool and activities, direct beach access, floating pontoon, sun deck and mud baths, 7 restaurants and bars with all-day dining, specialty restaurants, and swim-up bar, 24-hour fitness center, treatment rooms for aromatherapy massages, 2 boardrooms and event space in adjacent King Hussein Bin Talal Convention Center and panoramic resort at the lowest point on Earth, near major tourist attractions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Imagine hosting your next event by the beautiful infinity pool with the breathtaking backdrop of the Dead Sea. They also offer two grand boardrooms and 133,000 sq. ft. of flexible function space in the adjacent King Hussein Bin Talal Convention Centre managed by Hilton.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Hilton.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d435266.0062337131!2d35.210091116816514!3d31.537459641166173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a42245ddd89:0x26f6ee5d3ad475ea!2sKing Hussein Bin Talal Convention Centre Managed by Hilton!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568205786163!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 632, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'hilton-dead-sea-resort-amp-spa'),
(634, 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hospédese en el Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp;amp; Spa para una experiencia exclusiva en una ubicación única. Ubicados en el punto más bajo de la tierra, a más de 1.312 pies bajo el nivel del mar, se encuentran en el corazón del Valle del Jordán, con acceso directo a la playa. Pase el día descansando en la terraza de nuestro pontón flotante en las hermosas aguas del Mar Muerto para una escapada maravillosa. Pruebe la nueva piscina Sarab, con 330 metros cuadrados, con impresionantes vistas infinitas sobre el Mar Muerto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Mejor conocido por: 2 piscinas infinitas y un club infantil supervisado con piscina y actividades, acceso directo a la playa, pontón flotante, terraza y baños de barro, 7 restaurantes y bares con comidas durante todo el día, restaurantes especializados y bar en la piscina, Gimnasio abierto las 24 horas, salas de tratamiento para masajes de aromaterapia, 2 salas de juntas y espacio para eventos en el adyacente Centro de Convenciones King Hussein Bin Talal y resort panorámico en el punto más bajo de la Tierra, cerca de las principales atracciones turísticas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Imagine organizar su próximo evento junto a la hermosa piscina infinita con el impresionante telón de fondo del Mar Muerto. También ofrecen dos grandes salas de juntas y 133,000 pies cuadrados de espacio flexible para funciones en el adyacente Centro de Convenciones King Hussein Bin Talal, administrado por Hilton.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Hilton.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d435266.0062337131!2d35.210091116816514!3d31.537459641166173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a42245ddd89:0x26f6ee5d3ad475ea!2sKing Hussein Bin Talal Convention Centre Managed by Hilton!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568205786163!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 632, 'es', '', 'one col', 'hilton-dead-sea-resort-amp-spa'),
(635, 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Séjournez à l&#039;hôtel Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp;amp; Spa pour une expérience exclusive dans un lieu unique. Situés au point le plus bas de la planète, à plus de 300 mètres sous le niveau de la mer, ils sont situés au cœur de la vallée du Jourdain, avec un accès direct à la plage. Passez la journée à vous reposer sur la terrasse de notre ponton flottant dans les magnifiques eaux de la mer Morte pour une merveilleuse escapade. Essayez la nouvelle piscine Sarab, avec 330 mètres carrés, avec une vue imprenable sur la mer Morte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Mieux connu pour: 2 piscines à débordement et un club pour enfants surveillé avec piscine et activités, accès direct à la plage, ponton flottant, terrasse et bains de boue, 7 restaurants et bars avec repas tout au long de la journée, restaurants spécialisés et bar à la piscine , Une salle de sport ouverte 24h / 24, des salles de soins de massage aromathérapie, 2 salles de réunion et un espace événementiel au centre de conventions voisin du roi Hussein Bin Talal et au complexe panoramique situé au point le plus bas de la planète, à proximité des principales attractions touriste.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Imaginez organiser votre prochain événement à côté de la belle piscine à débordement avec la magnifique toile de fond de la mer Morte. Ils offrent également deux grandes salles de réunion et 133 000 pieds carrés d&#039;espace modulable pour les réceptions au centre des congrès voisin du roi Hussein Bin Talal, géré par Hilton.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Hilton.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d435266.0062337131!2d35.210091116816514!3d31.537459641166173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a42245ddd89:0x26f6ee5d3ad475ea!2sKing Hussein Bin Talal Convention Centre Managed by Hilton!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568205786163!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 632, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'hilton-dead-sea-resort-amp-spa'),
(636, 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', 'Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Soggiorna all&#039;Hilton Dead Sea Resort &amp;amp; Spa per un&#039;esperienza esclusiva in una posizione unica. Situati nel punto più basso della terra, a oltre 1.312 piedi sotto il livello del mare, si trovano nel cuore della Valle del Giordano, con accesso diretto alla spiaggia. Trascorri la giornata riposando sulla terrazza del nostro pontone galleggiante nelle splendide acque del Mar Morto per una vacanza meravigliosa. Prova la nuova piscina Sarab, con 330 metri quadrati, con splendide viste infinite sul Mar Morto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Meglio conosciuto per: 2 piscine a sfioro e un club per bambini con supervisione con piscina e attività, accesso diretto alla spiaggia, pontile galleggiante, terrazza e bagni di fango, 7 ristoranti e bar con pasti durante il giorno, ristoranti specializzati e bar a bordo piscina , Palestra aperta 24 ore al giorno, sale per massaggi con aromaterapia, 2 sale riunioni e spazi per eventi presso l&#039;adiacente centro congressi King Hussein Bin Talal e resort panoramico nel punto più basso della Terra, vicino alle principali attrazioni turismo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Immagina di organizzare il tuo prossimo evento accanto alla splendida piscina a sfioro con lo splendido sfondo del Mar Morto. Offrono anche due grandi sale riunioni e 133.000 piedi quadrati di spazio flessibile per le funzioni presso l&#039;adiacente King Hussein Bin Talal Convention Center, gestito da Hilton.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Hilton.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d435266.0062337131!2d35.210091116816514!3d31.537459641166173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a42245ddd89:0x26f6ee5d3ad475ea!2sKing Hussein Bin Talal Convention Centre Managed by Hilton!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568205786163!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 632, 'it', '', 'one col', 'hilton-dead-sea-resort-amp-spa');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(637, 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A one-of-a-kind vacation awaits you in Jordan at Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp;amp; Spa. You&#039;ll find the deluxe hotel nestled on the shores of the iconic Dead Sea, a short distance from attractions including Mount Nebo, The Baptism Site, Mujib Reserve and more.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gracefully designed, spacious rooms offer flat-screen TVs, marble bathrooms, ergonomic workspaces, high-speed Wi-Fi and incredible Dead Sea views.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Savor a meal at one of our several on-site restaurants, break a sweat in the 24-hour fitness center or spend time in the signature hotel spa, which includes a Dead Sea salt pool.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They also offer several indoor and outdoor pools, including a family-friendly pool that kids will love. If you&#039;re hosting a meeting or social event in Jordan, you&#039;ll be thrilled with our elegant and adaptable venues, including a striking ballroom and a two-tier terrace with absolutely beautiful sea vistas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Whatever your reason for visiting, they are confident that Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp;amp; Spa will exceed your every expectation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Marriott2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.8971073909943!2d35.58474931466207!3d31.718705544496157!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a6b3e90a02d:0xa46d86ff50252265!2sMarriott Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568206452270!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 637, 'en', '', 'one col', 'dead-sea-marriott-resort-amp-spa'),
(638, 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A one-of-a-kind vacation awaits you in Jordan at Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp;amp; Spa. You&#039;ll find the deluxe hotel nestled on the shores of the iconic Dead Sea, a short distance from attractions including Mount Nebo, The Baptism Site, Mujib Reserve and more.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gracefully designed, spacious rooms offer flat-screen TVs, marble bathrooms, ergonomic workspaces, high-speed Wi-Fi and incredible Dead Sea views.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Savor a meal at one of our several on-site restaurants, break a sweat in the 24-hour fitness center or spend time in the signature hotel spa, which includes a Dead Sea salt pool.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They also offer several indoor and outdoor pools, including a family-friendly pool that kids will love. If you&#039;re hosting a meeting or social event in Jordan, you&#039;ll be thrilled with our elegant and adaptable venues, including a striking ballroom and a two-tier terrace with absolutely beautiful sea vistas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Whatever your reason for visiting, they are confident that Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp;amp; Spa will exceed your every expectation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Marriott2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.8971073909943!2d35.58474931466207!3d31.718705544496157!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a6b3e90a02d:0xa46d86ff50252265!2sMarriott Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568206452270!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 637, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'dead-sea-marriott-resort-amp-spa'),
(639, 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le esperan unas vacaciones únicas en Jordania en Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp;amp; Spa. Encontrarás el hotel de lujo ubicado a orillas del emblemático Mar Muerto, a poca distancia de atracciones como el Monte Nebo, El Sitio del Bautismo, la Reserva Mujib y más.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las amplias habitaciones, elegantemente diseñadas, ofrecen televisores de pantalla plana, baños de mármol, espacios de trabajo ergonómicos, Wi-Fi de alta velocidad e increíbles vistas al Mar Muerto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Disfrute de una comida en uno de nuestros varios restaurantes en el lugar, haga ejercicio en el gimnasio abierto las 24 horas o pase el tiempo en el exclusivo spa del hotel, que incluye una piscina de sal del Mar Muerto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;También ofrecen varias piscinas cubiertas y al aire libre, incluye una piscina familiar que encantará a los niños. Si está organizando una reunión o evento social en Jordania, estará encantado con nuestros lugares elegantes y adaptables, que incluyen un sorprendente salón de baile y una terraza de dos niveles con vistas al mar absolutamente hermosas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cualquiera sea el motivo de su visita, confían en que Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp;amp; Spa superará todas sus expectativas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Marriott2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.8971073909943!2d35.58474931466207!3d31.718705544496157!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a6b3e90a02d:0xa46d86ff50252265!2sMarriott Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568206452270!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 637, 'es', '', 'one col', 'dead-sea-marriott-resort-amp-spa'),
(640, 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un séjour unique en Jordanie vous attend au Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp;amp; Spa. Vous trouverez cet hôtel de luxe situé sur les rives de l&#039;emblématique Mer Morte, à quelques minutes de marche d&#039;attractions telles que le mont Nebo, le site du baptême, la réserve de Mujib, etc.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres spacieuses et élégantes sont équipées d&#039;une télévision à écran plat, d&#039;une salle de bains en marbre, d&#039;un espace de travail ergonomique, d&#039;une connexion Wi-Fi haut débit et d&#039;une vue incroyable sur la mer Morte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Savourez un repas dans l&#039;un de nos nombreux restaurants sur place, faites de l&#039;exercice dans la salle de sport ouverte 24h / 24 ou passez du temps dans le spa exclusif de l&#039;hôtel, qui comprend une piscine de sel de la mer Morte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ils offrent également plusieurs piscines intérieure et extérieure, y compris une piscine familiale qui ravira les enfants. Si vous organisez une réunion ou un événement social en Jordanie, vous serez ravis de nos lieux élégants et adaptables, qui comprennent une salle de bal incroyable et une terrasse à deux niveaux avec une vue absolument magnifique sur la mer.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Quelle que soit la raison de votre visite, ils comptent que le Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp;amp; Spa dépassera toutes vos attentes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Marriott2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.8971073909943!2d35.58474931466207!3d31.718705544496157!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a6b3e90a02d:0xa46d86ff50252265!2sMarriott Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568206452270!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 637, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'dead-sea-marriott-resort-amp-spa'),
(641, 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', 'Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Una vacanza unica in Giordania ti aspetta al Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp;amp; Spa. Troverai l&#039;hotel di lusso situato sulle rive dell&#039;iconico Mar Morto, a pochi passi da attrazioni come il Monte Nebo, il sito del Battesimo, la Riserva di Mujib e altro ancora.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le spaziose camere dal design elegante offrono TV a schermo piatto, bagni in marmo, spazi di lavoro ergonomici, connessione Wi-Fi ad alta velocità e viste incredibili sul Mar Morto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Goditi un pasto in uno dei nostri numerosi ristoranti in loco, allenati nella palestra aperta 24 ore su 24 o trascorri del tempo nell&#039;esclusivo centro benessere dell&#039;hotel, che comprende una piscina di sale del Mar Morto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Offrono anche diverse piscine interne ed esterne, tra cui una piscina per famiglie che delizierà i bambini. Se stai organizzando un incontro o un evento sociale in Giordania, rimarrai deliziato dai nostri luoghi eleganti e adattabili, che includono un&#039;incredibile sala da ballo e una terrazza a due livelli con vista sul mare assolutamente meravigliosa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qualunque sia il motivo della tua visita, si fidano che Dead Sea Marriott Resort &amp;amp; Spa supererà tutte le tue aspettative.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Marriott2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.8971073909943!2d35.58474931466207!3d31.718705544496157!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a6b3e90a02d:0xa46d86ff50252265!2sMarriott Beach!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568206452270!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 637, 'it', '', 'one col', 'dead-sea-marriott-resort-amp-spa'),
(642, 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel is 20 miles away from The Jordan Museum and 17 miles from Children&#039;s Museum. This property is located in a prestigious area of Dead Sea. Lagoon Hotel &amp;amp; Resort can be reached in 40 minutes by car from Queen Alia Intl airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dead Sea Lagoon Hotel &amp;amp; Resort is a comfortable venue with a total of 251 rooms. You can make use of dry cleaning service, concierge service and room service on the premises of the accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;High-speed internet, a private balcony and a trouser press are featured at luxury rooms. Most of the rooms offer a beautiful view over the lake. There is a shower, a hairdryer and toiletries provided for guests in the bathrooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests will also appreciate welcoming atmosphere at an outdoor restaurant on site. The accommodation offers Turkish steam bath and massage treatments on-site. Activities for active guests include hiking, cycling and ping pong.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wireless internet is available in public areas for free. Private parking is possible on site for free.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Lagoon-Hotel-Resort-photos-Exterior.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3390.5530172571434!2d35.636440600544944!3d31.809929703994868!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzHCsDQ4JzM1LjciTiAzNcKwMzgnMTUuOSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568209770002!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 642, 'en', '', 'one col', 'lagoon-hotel-amp-resort-dead-sea'),
(643, 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel is 20 miles away from The Jordan Museum and 17 miles from Children&#039;s Museum. This property is located in a prestigious area of Dead Sea. Lagoon Hotel &amp;amp; Resort can be reached in 40 minutes by car from Queen Alia Intl airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dead Sea Lagoon Hotel &amp;amp; Resort is a comfortable venue with a total of 251 rooms. You can make use of dry cleaning service, concierge service and room service on the premises of the accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;High-speed internet, a private balcony and a trouser press are featured at luxury rooms. Most of the rooms offer a beautiful view over the lake. There is a shower, a hairdryer and toiletries provided for guests in the bathrooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests will also appreciate welcoming atmosphere at an outdoor restaurant on site. The accommodation offers Turkish steam bath and massage treatments on-site. Activities for active guests include hiking, cycling and ping pong.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wireless internet is available in public areas for free. Private parking is possible on site for free.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Lagoon-Hotel-Resort-photos-Exterior.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3390.5530172571434!2d35.636440600544944!3d31.809929703994868!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzHCsDQ4JzM1LjciTiAzNcKwMzgnMTUuOSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568209770002!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 642, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'lagoon-hotel-amp-resort-dead-sea'),
(644, 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel está a 32 km del Museo Jordan y a 27 km del Museo de los Niños. Esta propiedad está ubicada en una prestigiosa zona del Mar Muerto. El Lagoon Hotel &amp;amp; Resort está ubicado a 40 minutos en coche desde el aeropuerto Queen Alia Intl.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dead Sea Lagoon Hotel &amp;amp; Resort es un lugar confortable con un total de 251 habitaciones. Puede hacer uso del servicio de limpieza en seco, servicio de conserjería y servicio de habitaciones en las instalaciones del alojamiento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones de lujo cuentan con internet de alta velocidad, un balcón privado y plancha para pantalones. La mayoría de las habitaciones ofrecen una hermosa vista sobre el lago. Se disponen de los baños con una ducha, un secador de pelo y artículos de tocador.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los huéspedes también apreciarán un ambiente acogedor en el restaurante al aire libre del hotel. El alojamiento ofrece baño de vapor turco y tratamientos de masaje en el establecimiento. Las actividades para los huéspedes activos incluyen senderismo, ciclismo y ping pong.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Internet Wi-Fi disponible en las zonas públicas de forma gratuita. El establecimiento dispone de aparcamiento privado gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Lagoon-Hotel-Resort-photos-Exterior.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3390.5530172571434!2d35.636440600544944!3d31.809929703994868!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzHCsDQ4JzM1LjciTiAzNcKwMzgnMTUuOSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568209770002!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 642, 'es', '', 'one col', 'lagoon-hotel-amp-resort-dead-sea'),
(645, 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel se trouve à 32 km du musée de la Jordanie et à 27 km du musée des enfants. Cette propriété est située dans un quartier prestigieux de la mer Morte. On peut rejoindre Lagoon Hotel &amp;amp; Resort dans 40 minutes en voiture de l&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia Intl.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dead Sea Lagoon Hotel &amp;amp; Resort est un lieu de séjour confortable avec 251 chambres. Vous pouvez utiliser le service de nettoyage à sec, le service de conciergerie et le service de chambre des installations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres de luxe disposent d&#039;une connexion haut débit à Internet, d&#039;un balcon privé et d&#039;une presse à pantalons. La plupart des chambres offrent une vue magnifique sur le lac. Les salles de bains sont équipées d&#039;une douche, d&#039;un sèche-cheveux et d&#039;articles de toilette.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les clients apprécieront également l&#039;atmosphère chaleureuse du restaurant en plein air de l&#039;hôtel. L&#039;établissement propose un bain à vapeur turc et des massages sur place. Les activités proposées aux clients actifs incluent la randonnée, le cyclisme et le tennis de table.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Une connexion Wi-Fi est disponible dans les parties communes gratuitement. L&#039;établissement propose un parking privé gratuit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Lagoon-Hotel-Resort-photos-Exterior.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3390.5530172571434!2d35.636440600544944!3d31.809929703994868!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzHCsDQ4JzM1LjciTiAzNcKwMzgnMTUuOSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568209770002!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 642, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'lagoon-hotel-amp-resort-dead-sea'),
(646, 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', 'Lagoon Hotel &amp; Resort Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel dista 32 km dal Museo Giordano e 27 km dal Museo dei bambini. Questa proprietà si trova in una prestigiosa area del Mar Morto. Lagoon Hotel &amp;amp; Resort può essere raggiunto in 40 minuti d&#039;auto dall&#039;aeroporto Queen Alia Intl.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dead Sea Lagoon Hotel &amp;amp; Resort è un luogo confortevole con un totale di 251 camere. È possibile usufruire del servizio di lavaggio a secco, concierge e servizio in camera presso le strutture abitative.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camere deluxe dispongono di connessione internet ad alta velocità, balcone privato e stirapantaloni. La maggior parte delle camere offre una splendida vista sul lago. Sono dotate di bagni con una doccia, un asciugacapelli e articoli da toeletta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gli ospiti apprezzeranno anche un&#039;atmosfera accogliente nel ristorante all&#039;aperto dell&#039;hotel. La struttura offre un bagno turco e massaggi in loco. Le attività per gli ospiti attivi includono escursioni a piedi, in bicicletta e ping-pong.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La connessione Wi-Fi è disponibile nelle aree pubbliche gratuitamente. La struttura offre un parcheggio privato gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Lagoon-Hotel-Resort-photos-Exterior.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3390.5530172571434!2d35.636440600544944!3d31.809929703994868!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzHCsDQ4JzM1LjciTiAzNcKwMzgnMTUuOSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568209770002!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 642, 'it', '', 'one col', 'lagoon-hotel-amp-resort-dead-sea'),
(647, 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Kempinski Hotel Ishtar is located on the shore of the Dead Sea, 434 m (1,312.3 ft) below sea level. It is accessible via car from Amman and close to many touristic and historical sites, such as Madaba, Wadi Mujib, Mount Nibo and the Baptism site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy mouth-watering buffets at the Obelisk Restaurant, or indulge in a delightful Thai experience at The Codes Restaurant; where the Chef will delight your soul with the best of her hometown cuisine.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For light snacks and meals during the day, Akkad Pool Grill team -located by the famous Infinity pool- will take care of your appetite. If you are a fan of Italian cuisine, our talented chef will treat your taste buds with the finest Italian recipes at Ashur Pizza &amp;amp; Grill Restaurant.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;No venue is quite like Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea, an awe-inspiring paradise located beside the Dead Sea. Take in the eclectic architecture of its grandeur, or simply immerse yourself in the sumptuous experiences within. The 7 event rooms, all in the Main Building, as well as 5 outdoor spaces, are the perfect event venues to host your occasion.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Kempinski.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.02033349415!2d35.58397931466192!3d31.715339544662925!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a1510cbe0ad:0x89a69a69249d6661!2sKempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568210583499!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 647, 'en', '', 'one col', 'kempinski-hotel-ishtar-dead-sea'),
(648, 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Kempinski Hotel Ishtar is located on the shore of the Dead Sea, 434 m (1,312.3 ft) below sea level. It is accessible via car from Amman and close to many touristic and historical sites, such as Madaba, Wadi Mujib, Mount Nibo and the Baptism site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy mouth-watering buffets at the Obelisk Restaurant, or indulge in a delightful Thai experience at The Codes Restaurant; where the Chef will delight your soul with the best of her hometown cuisine.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For light snacks and meals during the day, Akkad Pool Grill team -located by the famous Infinity pool- will take care of your appetite. If you are a fan of Italian cuisine, our talented chef will treat your taste buds with the finest Italian recipes at Ashur Pizza &amp;amp; Grill Restaurant.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;No venue is quite like Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea, an awe-inspiring paradise located beside the Dead Sea. Take in the eclectic architecture of its grandeur, or simply immerse yourself in the sumptuous experiences within. The 7 event rooms, all in the Main Building, as well as 5 outdoor spaces, are the perfect event venues to host your occasion.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Kempinski.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.02033349415!2d35.58397931466192!3d31.715339544662925!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a1510cbe0ad:0x89a69a69249d6661!2sKempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568210583499!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 647, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'kempinski-hotel-ishtar-dead-sea'),
(649, 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Kempinski Hotel Ishtar está ubicado en la costa del Mar Muerto, 434 m (1,312.3 pies) debajo del nivel del mar. Se puede acceder en automóvil desde Amman y cerca de muchos sitios turísticos e históricos, como Madaba, Wadi Mujib, Mount Nibo y el sitio del Bautismo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Disfrute de deliciosos buffets en el restaurante Obelisk, o disfrute de una deliciosa experiencia tailandesa en el restaurante The Codes; donde el Chef deleitará tu alma con lo mejor de la cocina de su ciudad natal.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para aperitivos y comidas ligeras durante el día, el equipo de Akkad Pool Grill, ubicado en la famosa piscina Infinity, se encargará de su apetito. Si eres fanático de la cocina italiana, nuestro talentoso chef tratará tus papilas gustativas con las mejores recetas italianas en el restaurante Ashur Pizza &amp;amp; Grill.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ningún lugar es como el Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea, un paraíso impresionante ubicado junto al Mar Muerto. Disfruta de la arquitectura ecléctica de su grandeza, o simplemente sumérgete en las suntuosas experiencias en tu interior. Las 7 salas de eventos, todas en el Edificio Principal, así como los 5 espacios al aire libre, son los lugares perfectos para celebrar su ocasión.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Kempinski.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.02033349415!2d35.58397931466192!3d31.715339544662925!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a1510cbe0ad:0x89a69a69249d6661!2sKempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568210583499!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 647, 'es', '', 'one col', 'kempinski-hotel-ishtar-dead-sea'),
(650, 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Kempinski Hotel Ishtar est situé sur la côte de la mer Morte, à 434 m au-dessous du niveau de la mer. On peut y accéder en voiture depuis Amman et à proximité de nombreux sites touristiques et historiques, tels que Madaba, Wadi Mujib, le mont Nibo et le site du baptême.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Savourez de délicieux buffets au restaurant Obelisk ou vivez une expérience thaïlandaise savoureuse au restaurant The Codes; où le chef ravira votre âme avec le meilleur de la cuisine de sa ville natale.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour les collations et les repas légers pendant la journée, l’équipe Akkad Pool Grill, située dans la célèbre piscine Infinity, prendra soin de votre appétit. Si vous êtes amateur de cuisine italienne, notre chef talentueux saura combler vos papilles avec les meilleures recettes italiennes du restaurant Ashur Pizza &amp;amp; Grill.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il n’ya nulle part ailleurs le Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea, un paradis impressionnant situé à proximité de la mer Morte. Profitez de l&#039;architecture éclectique de sa grandeur ou immergez-vous simplement dans les expériences somptueuses à l&#039;intérieur. Les 7 salles de réunion, toutes situées dans le bâtiment principal, ainsi que les 5 espaces extérieurs, sont des lieux parfaits pour célébrer votre occasion.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Kempinski.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.02033349415!2d35.58397931466192!3d31.715339544662925!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a1510cbe0ad:0x89a69a69249d6661!2sKempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568210583499!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 647, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'kempinski-hotel-ishtar-dead-sea'),
(651, 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', 'Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Kempinski Hotel Ishtar si trova sulla costa del Mar Morto, a 434 m (1.312,3 piedi) sotto il livello del mare. È possibile accedervi in ​​auto da Amman e vicino a numerosi siti turistici e storici, come Madaba, Wadi Mujib, il monte Nibo e il sito del Battesimo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Goditi deliziosi buffet al ristorante Obelisk o goditi una deliziosa esperienza tailandese al ristorante The Codes; dove lo Chef delizierà la tua anima con il meglio della cucina della sua città natale.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per spuntini e pasti leggeri durante il giorno, il team Akkad Pool Grill, situato nella famosa piscina Infinity, si prenderà cura del tuo appetito. Se sei un fan della cucina italiana, il nostro talentuoso chef tratterà le tue papille gustative con le migliori ricette italiane presso il ristorante Ashur Pizza &amp;amp; Grill.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In nessun posto è come il Kempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea, un paradiso impressionante situato vicino al Mar Morto. Goditi l&#039;architettura eclettica della sua grandezza o semplicemente immergiti nelle sontuose esperienze al suo interno. Le 7 sale per eventi, tutte nell&#039;edificio principale, così come i 5 spazi all&#039;aperto, sono i luoghi perfetti per festeggiare la tua occasione.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dead Sea/5 Star/Kempinski.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.02033349415!2d35.58397931466192!3d31.715339544662925!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15034a1510cbe0ad:0x89a69a69249d6661!2sKempinski Hotel Ishtar Dead Sea!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568210583499!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 647, 'it', '', 'one col', 'kempinski-hotel-ishtar-dead-sea'),
