(653, 'Hotels in Madaba', 'Hotels in Madaba', 'Hotels in Madaba', 'Hotels in Madaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/4 Star/Grand Hotel Madaba.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Grand Hotel Madaba&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Grand Hotel Madaba&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Grand Hotel Madaba is a modern four stars hotel with 81 comfortably spacious furnished rooms, each is&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/grand-hotel-madaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Saint John.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Saint John Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Saint John Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This 3-star hotel is located next to the Catholic school. Nearby attractions include Mount Nebo which is only...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/saint-john-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemana