ired by the city it is located in, as Madaba has been dubbed the “city of m...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/mosaic-city-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/madaba-hotel_15188047471.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Madaba Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Madaba Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This renovated hotel is 20 meters from the Saint George Church in Madaba. It offers air-conditioned...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/madaba-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/2 Star/Rumman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Rumman Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Rumman Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rumman Hotel offers its valuable visitors bed and breakfast, free Internet connection Wi-Fi...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/rumman-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/2 Star/Salome.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Salome Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Salome Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Salome Hotel is a new generation economy hotel, offering an intimate, relaxing, young and dynamic design...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/salome-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/2 Star/Mariam.jpg&quot; alt=&quot; Mariam Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Mariam Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Mariam Hotel is a 2 star hotel in Madaba and within 25 min driving from Queen Alia International Airport. It is...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/mariam-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/2 Star/Black iris2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Black Iris Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Black Iris Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Black Iris Hotel is located in the center of the Mosaic City of Madaba, has been the preferred destina...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/black-iris-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 653, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'hotels-in-madaba'),
(658, 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Grand Hotel Madaba is a modern four stars hotel with 81 comfortably spacious furnished rooms, each is fully equipped in accordance to the international standards as well as the necessities of the modern today.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Whether your trip is for business or pleasure, everything will be done for your comfort through our business Center and up-to-date conference facilities, 24 hour services, lobby bar, restaurants, cafe, our outdoor pool &amp;amp; Bar and terraces and most importantly our professional staff serving you with diligence and passion.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sit comfortably in the hotel lounge, have a drink and let yourself go in a relaxing and classy atmosphere. Our bar will be pleased to serve you one of his many drinks or cocktails from all over the world.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;You can choose between our oriental cuisine with the famous Maza and other specialties or the occidental cuisine and its various Western dishes chef&#039;s favorites. The main restaurant offers you a variety of International Food and Wine.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/4 Star/Grand Hotel Madaba.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.6738354982485!2d35.79305931466228!3d31.72480354419398!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacdcad3219ff:0xcffe9bd9b9a464a8!2sGrand Hotel Madaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568269321219!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 658, 'en', '', 'one col', 'grand-hotel-madaba'),
(659, 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Grand Hotel Madaba is a modern four stars hotel with 81 comfortably spacious furnished rooms, each is fully equipped in accordance to the international standards as well as the necessities of the modern today.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Whether your trip is for business or pleasure, everything will be done for your comfort through our business Center and up-to-date conference facilities, 24 hour services, lobby bar, restaurants, cafe, our outdoor pool &amp;amp; Bar and terraces and most importantly our professional staff serving you with diligence and passion.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sit comfortably in the hotel lounge, have a drink and let yourself go in a relaxing and classy atmosphere. Our bar will be pleased to serve you one of his many drinks or cocktails from all over the world.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;You can choose between our oriental cuisine with the famous Maza and other specialties or the occidental cuisine and its various Western dishes chef&#039;s favorites. The main restaurant offers you a variety of International Food and Wine.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/4 Star/Grand Hotel Madaba.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.6738354982485!2d35.79305931466228!3d31.72480354419398!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacdcad3219ff:0xcffe9bd9b9a464a8!2sGrand Hotel Madaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568269321219!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 658, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'grand-hotel-madaba'),
(660, 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Grand Hotel Madaba es un moderno hotel de cuatro estrellas con 81 habitaciones amuebladas cómodamente espaciosas, cada una totalmente equipada de acuerdo con los estándares internacionales, así como con las necesidades de los modernos de hoy.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ya sea que su viaje sea por negocios o por placer, todo se hará para su comodidad a través de nuestro centro de negocios e instalaciones de conferencias actualizadas, servicios las 24 horas, lobby bar, restaurantes, cafetería, nuestra piscina y bar al aire libre y terrazas y lo más importante Nuestro personal profesional lo atiende con diligencia y pasión.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Siéntese cómodamente en el salón del hotel, tome una copa y déjese llevar en un ambiente relajante y elegante. Nuestro bar estará encantado de servirle una de sus muchas bebidas o cócteles de todo el mundo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Puede elegir entre nuestra cocina oriental con la famosa Maza y otras especialidades o la cocina occidental y sus platos occidentales favoritos del chef. El restaurante principal le ofrece una variedad de comida y vino internacionales.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/4 Star/Grand Hotel Madaba.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.6738354982485!2d35.79305931466228!3d31.72480354419398!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacdcad3219ff:0xcffe9bd9b9a464a8!2sGrand Hotel Madaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568269321219!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 658, 'es', '', 'one col', 'grand-hotel-madaba');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(661, 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Grand Hotel Madaba est un hôtel quatre étoiles moderne proposant 81 chambres spacieuses et confortablement meublées, toutes entièrement équipées conformément aux normes internationales et aux besoins du monde moderne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Que votre voyage soit pour affaires ou pour le plaisir, tout sera mis en oeuvre pour votre confort grâce à notre centre d&#039;affaires et à nos installations de conférence actualisées, à nos services 24h / 24, à notre bar du hall, à nos restaurants, à notre cafétéria, à notre piscine et à notre bar en plein air et les terrasses et surtout notre personnel professionnel vous assiste avec diligence et passion.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Asseyez-vous confortablement dans le salon de l&#039;hôtel, prenez un verre et laissez-vous aller dans une atmosphère relaxante et élégante. Notre bar se fera un plaisir de vous servir une de ses nombreuses boissons ou cocktails du monde entier.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous pouvez choisir entre notre cuisine orientale avec la célèbre masse et d&#039;autres spécialités ou la cuisine occidentale et vos plats occidentaux préférés du chef. Le restaurant principal propose une variété de plats et de vins internationaux.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/4 Star/Grand Hotel Madaba.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.6738354982485!2d35.79305931466228!3d31.72480354419398!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacdcad3219ff:0xcffe9bd9b9a464a8!2sGrand Hotel Madaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568269321219!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 658, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'grand-hotel-madaba'),
(662, 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', 'Grand Hotel Madaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Grand Hotel Madaba è un moderno hotel a quattro stelle con 81 camere arredate in modo confortevole e spazioso, ognuna completamente attrezzata secondo gli standard internazionali, nonché le esigenze del moderno di oggi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sia che il tuo viaggio sia per lavoro o per piacere, tutto sarà fatto per la tua convenienza attraverso il nostro centro business e strutture per conferenze aggiornate, servizi 24 ore, lobby bar, ristoranti, caffetteria, la nostra piscina e bar all&#039;aperto e terrazze e, soprattutto, il nostro staff professionale vi assiste con diligenza e passione.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sedersi comodamente nel salone dell&#039;hotel, sorseggiare un drink e lasciarsi andare in un&#039;atmosfera rilassante ed elegante. Il nostro bar sarà felice di servirti uno dei suoi numerosi drink o cocktail da tutto il mondo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Puoi scegliere tra la nostra cucina orientale con la famosa Mazza e altre specialità o la cucina occidentale e i tuoi piatti occidentali preferiti dello chef. Il ristorante principale offre una varietà di cibi e vini internazionali.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/4 Star/Grand Hotel Madaba.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.6738354982485!2d35.79305931466228!3d31.72480354419398!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacdcad3219ff:0xcffe9bd9b9a464a8!2sGrand Hotel Madaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568269321219!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 658, 'it', '', 'one col', 'grand-hotel-madaba'),
(663, 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This 3-star hotel is located next to the Catholic school. Nearby attractions include Mount Nebo which is only 8.6 km away from the place. Saint John Hotel is 18 km away from Queen Alia international airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel offers free private parking. Saint John Hotel has a restaurant that offers local and international cuisines throughout the day, special diet menus are available on request. There is also a snack bar for guest’s enjoyment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms have tiled floors, with seating areas and a mini-bar, in addition to a flat-screen TV. Rooms feature spacious balconies which offer views of the city. In-room breakfast is available on request and free Wi-Fi is available in all areas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel features a 24-hour front desk and a tour desk for tour services. Facilities at Saint John Hotel include a conference and meeting room for business travelers and a fitness center. Laundry, dry cleaning, ironing services, Child services are also available. Other services include car rentals, horse riding, and cycling. Non-smoking areas are available in the hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Saint John.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.0236647561806!2d35.791461314662016!3d31.71524854466752!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacd18c6cd873:0x21f6c61e1867d137!2sSaint John Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568271320629!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 663, 'en', '', 'one col', 'saint-john-hotel'),
(664, 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This 3-star hotel is located next to the Catholic school. Nearby attractions include Mount Nebo which is only 8.6 km away from the place. Saint John Hotel is 18 km away from Queen Alia international airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel offers free private parking. Saint John Hotel has a restaurant that offers local and international cuisines throughout the day, special diet menus are available on request. There is also a snack bar for guest’s enjoyment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms have tiled floors, with seating areas and a mini-bar, in addition to a flat-screen TV. Rooms feature spacious balconies which offer views of the city. In-room breakfast is available on request and free Wi-Fi is available in all areas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel features a 24-hour front desk and a tour desk for tour services. Facilities at Saint John Hotel include a conference and meeting room for business travelers and a fitness center. Laundry, dry cleaning, ironing services, Child services are also available. Other services include car rentals, horse riding, and cycling. Non-smoking areas are available in the hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Saint John.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.0236647561806!2d35.791461314662016!3d31.71524854466752!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacd18c6cd873:0x21f6c61e1867d137!2sSaint John Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568271320629!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 663, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'saint-john-hotel'),
(665, 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este hotel de 3 estrellas está situado al lado de la escuela católica. Las atracciones cercanas incluyen el Monte Nebo, que está a solo 8,6 km del lugar. El Saint John Hotel está a 18 km del aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel ofrece aparcamiento privado gratuito. Saint John Hotel tiene un restaurante que ofrece cocina local e internacional durante todo el día, menús de dietas especiales disponibles bajo petición. También hay un snack bar para el disfrute de los huéspedes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones tienen suelos de baldosas, con zonas de estar y mini-bar, además de TV de pantalla plana. Las habitaciones cuentan con amplios balcones con vistas a la ciudad. El desayuno en la habitación está disponible bajo petición y hay conexión Wi-Fi gratuita en todas las áreas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel cuenta con recepción 24 horas y mostrador de información turística para servicios turísticos. Las instalaciones del Saint John Hotel incluyen una sala de conferencias y reuniones para viajeros de negocios y un gimnasio. Servicio de lavandería, limpieza en seco, servicio de planchado, servicios para niños también están disponibles. Otros servicios incluyen alquiler de autos, equitación y ciclismo. Áreas para no fumadores están disponibles en el hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Saint John.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.0236647561806!2d35.791461314662016!3d31.71524854466752!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacd18c6cd873:0x21f6c61e1867d137!2sSaint John Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568271320629!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 663, 'es', '', 'one col', 'saint-john-hotel'),
(666, 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel 3 étoiles est situé à côté de l&#039;école catholique. Les attractions à proximité incluent le mont Nebo, situé à seulement 8,6 km de la place. Le Saint John Hotel se trouve à 18 km de l&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel propose un parking privé gratuit. Le Saint John Hotel abrite un restaurant qui propose une cuisine locale et internationale toute la journée. Des menus adaptés à un régime alimentaire particulier sont disponibles sur demande. Un snack-bar est à la disposition des clients.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres disposent de carrelage au sol, d’un coin salon, d’un minibar et d’une télévision à écran plat. Les chambres disposent de grands balcons donnant sur la ville. Un petit-déjeuner en chambre est disponible sur demande. Une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite est disponible dans tout l&#039;établissement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel dispose d&#039;une réception ouverte 24h / 24 et d&#039;un bureau d&#039;excursions proposant des services touristiques. Les installations de l&#039;hôtel Saint John comprennent une salle de conférence et de réunion pour les voyageurs d&#039;affaires et une salle de sport. Blanchisserie, nettoyage à sec, service de repassage, services pour enfants sont également disponibles. Les autres services comprennent la location de voitures, l&#039;équitation et le vélo. Des zones non-fumeurs sont disponibles à l&#039;hôtel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Saint John.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.0236647561806!2d35.791461314662016!3d31.71524854466752!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacd18c6cd873:0x21f6c61e1867d137!2sSaint John Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568271320629!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 663, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'saint-john-hotel'),
(667, 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', 'Saint John Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo hotel a 3 stelle si trova vicino alla scuola cattolica. Le attrazioni nelle vicinanze includono il Monte Nebo, che dista solo 8,6 km dal luogo. Il Saint John Hotel dista 18 km dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel offre un parcheggio privato gratuito. Il Saint John Hotel dispone di un ristorante che offre cucina locale e internazionale per tutto il giorno, menù dietetici speciali disponibili su richiesta. C&#039;è anche uno snack bar per gli ospiti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere sono dotate di pavimenti piastrellati, area salotto, minibar e TV a schermo piatto. Le camere dispongono di ampi balconi con vista sulla città. La colazione in camera è disponibile su richiesta e la connessione Wi-Fi è gratuita in tutte le aree.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel dispone di una reception aperta 24 ore su 24 e di un banco escursioni per i servizi turistici. I servizi del Saint John Hotel includono una sala conferenze e riunioni per viaggiatori d&#039;affari e una palestra. Sono inoltre disponibili servizio lavanderia, lavaggio a secco, servizio stiratura e servizi per bambini. Altri servizi includono noleggio auto, equitazione e ciclismo. Le aree non fumatori sono disponibili presso l&#039;hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Saint John.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3394.0236647561806!2d35.791461314662016!3d31.71524854466752!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacd18c6cd873:0x21f6c61e1867d137!2sSaint John Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568271320629!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 663, 'it', '', 'one col', 'saint-john-hotel'),
(668, 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you are traveling to Jordan and you want a hotel that is close to the Holy sites of Jordan, Delilah Hotel would be a perfect choice for you. It is conveniently located in the Madaba district, which is the fifth most popular destination in the country.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you are arriving to Jordan through the Amman airport, you can arrange for the Delilah Hotel’s transportation service. One can also ask for tour shuttles for a surcharge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The rooms in Delilah Hotel are modern and sleek, and the minimal furnishing works for a less distracting and comfortable rest.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Free parking is also available onsite. The hotel’s restaurant serves delicious international and local dishes; a bar is also available in the lobby lounge for you to enjoy refreshing drinks and beverages. A 24-hour multilingual front desk is available to serve customers and visitors’ needs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Delilah.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.7249373249892!2d35.7924799146621!3d31.72340794426312!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacdb37a62a69:0x5b611f80d7c61767!2zRGVsaWxhaCBIb3RlbNmB2YbYr9mCINiv2YTZitmE2KkgLg!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568272170211!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 668, 'en', '', 'one col', 'delilah-hotel'),
(669, 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you are traveling to Jordan and you want a hotel that is close to the Holy sites of Jordan, Delilah Hotel would be a perfect choice for you. It is conveniently located in the Madaba district, which is the fifth most popular destination in the country.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you are arriving to Jordan through the Amman airport, you can arrange for the Delilah Hotel’s transportation service. One can also ask for tour shuttles for a surcharge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The rooms in Delilah Hotel are modern and sleek, and the minimal furnishing works for a less distracting and comfortable rest.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Free parking is also available onsite. The hotel’s restaurant serves delicious international and local dishes; a bar is also available in the lobby lounge for you to enjoy refreshing drinks and beverages. A 24-hour multilingual front desk is available to serve customers and visitors’ needs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Delilah.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.7249373249892!2d35.7924799146621!3d31.72340794426312!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacdb37a62a69:0x5b611f80d7c61767!2zRGVsaWxhaCBIb3RlbNmB2YbYr9mCINiv2YTZitmE2KkgLg!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568272170211!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 668, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'delilah-hotel'),
(670, 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si viaja a Jordania y desea un hotel que esté cerca de los lugares sagrados de Jordania, Delilah Hotel sería la elección perfecta para usted. Está convenientemente ubicado en el distrito de Madaba, que es el quinto destino más popular del país.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si llega a Jordania a través del aeropuerto de Amman, puede organizar el servicio de transporte del Hotel Delilah. También se pueden solicitar traslados turísticos por un recargo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones en Delilah Hotel son modernas y elegantes, y el mobiliario mínimo funciona para un descanso menos molesto y molesto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Aparcamiento gratuito también está disponible en el sitio. El restaurante del hotel sirve deliciosos platos internacionales y locales; También hay un bar disponible en el salón del vestíbulo para que disfrute de refrescantes bebidas. Hay una recepción multilingüe disponible las 24 horas para atender las necesidades de los clientes y visitantes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Delilah.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.7249373249892!2d35.7924799146621!3d31.72340794426312!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacdb37a62a69:0x5b611f80d7c61767!2zRGVsaWxhaCBIb3RlbNmB2YbYr9mCINiv2YTZitmE2KkgLg!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568272170211!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 668, 'es', '', 'one col', 'delilah-hotel'),
(671, 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si vous voyagez en Jordanie et que vous voulez un hôtel proche des lieux saints de la Jordanie, l’hôtel Delilah serait le choix parfait pour vous. Il est idéalement situé dans le district de Madaba, qui est la cinquième destination la plus populaire du pays.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si vous arrivez en Jordanie via l&#039;aéroport d&#039;Amman, vous pouvez organiser le service de transport de l&#039;hôtel Delilah. Des transferts touristiques peuvent également être demandés moyennant un supplément.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres de l’hôtel Delilah sont modernes et élégantes et le mobilier minimaliste permet de faire une pause moins agaçante et gênante.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un parking gratuit est également disponible sur place. Le restaurant de l&#039;hôtel sert de délicieux plats internationaux et locaux. Vous trouverez également un bar dans le salon du hall pour siroter des boissons rafraîchissantes. Une réception multilingue est disponible 24h / 24 pour répondre aux besoins des clients et des visiteurs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Delilah.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.7249373249892!2d35.7924799146621!3d31.72340794426312!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacdb37a62a69:0x5b611f80d7c61767!2zRGVsaWxhaCBIb3RlbNmB2YbYr9mCINiv2YTZitmE2KkgLg!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568272170211!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 668, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'delilah-hotel'),
(672, 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', 'Delilah Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se viaggi in Giordania e desideri un hotel vicino ai luoghi santi della Giordania, Delilah Hotel sarebbe la scelta perfetta per te. È situato nel quartiere di Madaba, che è la quinta destinazione più popolare del paese.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se arrivate in Giordania attraverso l&#039;aeroporto di Amman, è possibile organizzare il servizio di trasporto dell&#039;Hotel Delilah. I trasferimenti turistici possono anche essere richiesti con un supplemento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camere del Delilah Hotel sono moderne ed eleganti e mobili minimali per una pausa meno fastidiosa e fastidiosa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In loco è disponibile anche un parcheggio gratuito. Il ristorante dell&#039;hotel serve deliziosi piatti internazionali e locali; C&#039;è anche un bar disponibile nella hall per gustare bevande rinfrescanti. C&#039;è una reception multilingue disponibile 24 ore per soddisfare le esigenze di clienti e visitatori.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Delilah.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.7249373249892!2d35.7924799146621!3d31.72340794426312!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacdb37a62a69:0x5b611f80d7c61767!2zRGVsaWxhaCBIb3RlbNmB2YbYr9mCINiv2YTZitmE2KkgLg!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568272170211!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 668, 'it', '', 'one col', 'delilah-hotel'),
(673, 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Madaba 1880 Hotel is minutes from Madaba Archaeological Park and Basilica of Saint George. This hotel is within the vicinity of Madaba Museum and Mount Nebo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel has 33 air-conditioned rooms featuring mini-bars. Complimentary wireless Internet access keeps you connected, and satellite programming is available for your entertainment. Private bathrooms with shower/tub combinations feature deep soaking bathtubs and complimentary toiletries. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Satisfy your appetite at the hotel&#039;s restaurant, which serves breakfast, lunch, and dinner. Dining is also available at a coffee shop/café, and 24-hour room service is provided. Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at a bar/lounge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Featured amenities include dry cleaning/laundry services, a 24-hour front desk, and multilingual staff.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Madaba 1880.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.9064065014104!2d35.791035314662054!3d31.718451544508767!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacd1ea0aa94d:0x7e5d5b4f260e5508!2sMadaba 1880 Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568273036776!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 673, 'en', '', 'one col', 'madaba-1880-hotel'),
(674, 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Madaba 1880 Hotel is minutes from Madaba Archaeological Park and Basilica of Saint George. This hotel is within the vicinity of Madaba Museum and Mount Nebo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel has 33 air-conditioned rooms featuring mini-bars. Complimentary wireless Internet access keeps you connected, and satellite programming is available for your entertainment. Private bathrooms with shower/tub combinations feature deep soaking bathtubs and complimentary toiletries. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Satisfy your appetite at the hotel&#039;s restaurant, which serves breakfast, lunch, and dinner. Dining is also available at a coffee shop/café, and 24-hour room service is provided. Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at a bar/lounge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Featured amenities include dry cleaning/laundry services, a 24-hour front desk, and multilingual staff.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Madaba 1880.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.9064065014104!2d35.791035314662054!3d31.718451544508767!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacd1ea0aa94d:0x7e5d5b4f260e5508!2sMadaba 1880 Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568273036776!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 673, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'madaba-1880-hotel'),
(675, 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Madaba 1880 Hotel está a minutos del parque arqueológico Madaba y la basílica de San Jorge. Este hotel se encuentra a pocos kilómetros de Museo Madaba y de Monte Nebo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel dispone de 33 habitaciones con aire acondicionado y mini-bar. El acceso inalámbrico a Internet de cortesía lo mantiene conectado, y la programación satelital está disponible para su entretenimiento. El baño privado con ducha y bañera combinadas está provisto de bañera profunda y artículos de higiene personal gratuitos. Las comodidades incluyen teléfono, caja fuerte y escritorio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Satisfaga tu apetito en el restaurante del hotel, que sirve desayunos, almuerzos y cenas. También se puede comer en una cafetería y se ofrece servicio de habitaciones las 24 horas. Apaga tu sed con tu bebida favorita en el bar o lounge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las comodidades destacadas incluyen servicio de tintorería, servicio de recepción 24 horas y atención multilingüe.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Madaba 1880.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.9064065014104!2d35.791035314662054!3d31.718451544508767!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacd1ea0aa94d:0x7e5d5b4f260e5508!2sMadaba 1880 Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568273036776!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 673, 'es', '', 'one col', 'madaba-1880-hotel'),
(676, 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Madaba 1880 Hotel se trouve à quelques minutes du parc archéologique de Madaba et de la basilique Saint-Georges. Cet hôtel se trouve aux environs de Madaba Museum et Mount Nebo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel dispose de 33 chambres avec climatisation et mini-bar. L&#039;accès gratuit à Internet sans fil vous permet de rester en contact avec le monde entier et la programmation par satellite est disponible pour votre divertissement. La salle de bain privée avec douche et baignoire est pourvue d&#039;une baignoire profonde et d&#039;articles de toilette gratuits. Les installations comprennent le téléphone, un coffre-fort et un bureau.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pendant votre séjour dans cet hôtel, profitez du restaurant qui sert le petit-déjeuner, le déjeuner et le dîner. Vous pouvez également manger dans une cafétéria et un service de chambre disponible 24h / 24. Éteignez votre soif avec votre boisson préférée au bar / salon.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les équipements et services proposés incluent un service de nettoyage à sec, une réception ouverte 24 heures sur 24 et un personnel multilingue.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Madaba 1880.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.9064065014104!2d35.791035314662054!3d31.718451544508767!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacd1ea0aa94d:0x7e5d5b4f260e5508!2sMadaba 1880 Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568273036776!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 673, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'madaba-1880-hotel'),
(677, 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', 'Madaba 1880 Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Madaba 1880 Hotel dista pochi minuti dal parco archeologico di Madaba e dalla Basilica di San Giorgio. Questo hotel si trova vicino ai seguenti luoghi d&#039;interesse: Museo Madaba e Monte Nebo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel dispone di 33 camere con aria condizionata e mini-bar. L&#039;accesso wireless a Internet gratuito ti consente di restare connesso e la programmazione satellitare è disponibile per l&#039;intrattenimento. Il bagno privato con combinazione doccia e vasca è dotato di vasca da bagno a immersione totale e set di cortesia. I servizi includono telefono, cassaforte e scrivania.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Soddisfa il tuo appetito nel ristorante dell&#039;hotel, che serve colazione, pranzo e cena. È inoltre possibile mangiare in una caffetteria e viene offerto il servizio in camera 24 ore al giorno. Disattiva la sete con il tuo drink preferito nel bar / lounge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Potrai usufruire di un servizio di lavaggio a secco, personale alla reception 24 ore su 24 e personale poliglotta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Madaba/3 Star/Madaba 1880.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.9064065014104!2d35.791035314662054!3d31.718451544508767!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cacd1ea0aa94d:0x7e5d5b4f260e5508!2sMadaba 1880 Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568273036776!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 673, 'it', '', 'one col', 'madaba-1880-hotel'),
