t &quot;&gt;  Petra Mars Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Mars Camp está ubicado en la famosa ciudad arqueológica e histórica de Petra, a 8 km de la puerta...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/petra-mars-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/the-rock-camp-petra.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;The Rock Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  The Rock Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Rock Camp en Petra tiene para ofrecer momentos memorables y experiencias inolvidables para que su...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/the-rock-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 693, 'es', '', 'one col', 'hoteles-en-petra'),
(697, 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Renovated in 2018, explore the magnificent Red Rose City of Petra from an elevated fortress-style hotel in the rolling hills of the captivating Rift Valley. Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel is a 10-minute drive from the historic site of Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy the free minibar in the 90 renovated rooms and suites, with balconies and terraces that face the striking landscape.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;After a day of discovery and exploration at Petra, relax in the heated indoor pool. In summer, they open the windows and offer access to the terrace.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relish sumptuous Jordanian specialties and international fare at the restaurant, bar and outdoor terraces, indoor heated swimming pool with terrace, meeting rooms are available for events. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick nabatean castle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3445.1966588432174!2d35.45450301462603!3d30.28846261395983!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150113c796ffc1e9:0xc2ea4a567df4b8a2!2sMövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568283524498!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 697, 'en', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-nabatean-castle-hotel'),
(698, 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Renovated in 2018, explore the magnificent Red Rose City of Petra from an elevated fortress-style hotel in the rolling hills of the captivating Rift Valley. Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel is a 10-minute drive from the historic site of Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy the free minibar in the 90 renovated rooms and suites, with balconies and terraces that face the striking landscape.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;After a day of discovery and exploration at Petra, relax in the heated indoor pool. In summer, they open the windows and offer access to the terrace.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Relish sumptuous Jordanian specialties and international fare at the restaurant, bar and outdoor terraces, indoor heated swimming pool with terrace, meeting rooms are available for events. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick nabatean castle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3445.1966588432174!2d35.45450301462603!3d30.28846261395983!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150113c796ffc1e9:0xc2ea4a567df4b8a2!2sMövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568283524498!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 697, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-nabatean-castle-hotel'),
(699, 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Renovado en 2018, explore la magnífica ciudad de la Rosa Roja de Petra desde un hotel elevado de estilo fortaleza en las colinas del cautivador Valle del Rift. El Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel se encuentra a 10 minutos en coche del sitio histórico de Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Disfrute del mini-bar gratuito en de las 90 habitaciones y suites renovadas, con balcones y terrazas que dan al impresionante paisaje.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Después de un día de descubrimiento y exploración en Petra, relájese en la piscina cubierta climatizada. En verano, abren las ventanas y ofrecen acceso a la terraza.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Disfrute de suntuosas especialidades jordanas y platos internacionales en el restaurante, bar y terrazas al aire libre, piscina cubierta climatizada con terraza, salas de reuniones disponibles para eventos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick nabatean castle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3445.1966588432174!2d35.45450301462603!3d30.28846261395983!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150113c796ffc1e9:0xc2ea4a567df4b8a2!2sMövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568283524498!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 697, 'es', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-nabatean-castle-hotel'),
(700, 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rénové en 2018, explorez la magnifique ville de la rose rouge de Pétra depuis un hôtel de style fort surélevé dans les collines de la captivante vallée du Rift. Le Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel se trouve à 10 minutes de route du site historique de Pétra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Profitez du mini-bar gratuit dans les 90 chambres et suites rénovées, dotées de balcons et de terrasses donnant sur un paysage magnifique.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Après une journée de découverte et d’exploration à Petra, détendez-vous dans la piscine intérieure chauffée. En été, ils ouvrent les fenêtres et donnent accès à la terrasse.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dégustez de somptueuses spécialités jordaniennes et des plats internationaux au restaurant, au bar et sur les terrasses extérieures, à la piscine intérieure chauffée avec terrasse et aux salles de réunion pouvant accueillir des événements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick nabatean castle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3445.1966588432174!2d35.45450301462603!3d30.28846261395983!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150113c796ffc1e9:0xc2ea4a567df4b8a2!2sMövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568283524498!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 697, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-nabatean-castle-hotel'),
(701, 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', 'Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ristrutturato nel 2018, esplora la magnifica città della Rosa Rossa di Petra da un elevato hotel in stile forte tra le colline dell&#039;accattivante Rift Valley. Il Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel si trova a 10 minuti di auto dal sito storico di Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Goditi il mini-bar gratuito nelle 90 camere e suite rinnovate, con balconi e terrazze che si affacciano sullo splendido paesaggio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dopo una giornata di scoperte ed esplorazioni a Petra, rilassati nella piscina interna riscaldata. In estate aprono le finestre e offrono accesso alla terrazza.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gustate sontuose specialità giordane e piatti internazionali nel ristorante, bar e terrazze all&#039;aperto, piscina interna riscaldata con terrazza, sale riunioni disponibili per eventi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick nabatean castle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3445.1966588432174!2d35.45450301462603!3d30.28846261395983!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150113c796ffc1e9:0xc2ea4a567df4b8a2!2sMövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568283524498!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 697, 'it', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-nabatean-castle-hotel'),
(702, 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Mövenpick Resort Petra is located directly at the entrance to the historic Jordanian city of Petra. This resort with an oriental flair features an exciting combination of natural stone, handcrafted wood and Middle Eastern fabrics and textures.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This hotel has 183 rooms and suites plus a wide variety of restaurants for your culinary cravings, the Mövenpick Resort Petra will certainly provide long lasting memories.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy your time spent in one of the world’s most extraordinary destinations, amazing views over the Great Rift Valley, 7 dining options, fitness and wellness center, meeting facilities for events or incentives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can also relax in the outdoor swimming pool or enjoy a cocktail in the hotel’s stately lobby. This property also has one of the best-rated locations in Wadi Musa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick resort2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3443.894884816218!2d35.46731131462689!3d30.325507612196173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15041513a8a243a1:0xb39ae6d865e19db1!2sMövenpick Resort Petra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568284295700!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 702, 'en', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-petra'),
(703, 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Mövenpick Resort Petra is located directly at the entrance to the historic Jordanian city of Petra. This resort with an oriental flair features an exciting combination of natural stone, handcrafted wood and Middle Eastern fabrics and textures.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This hotel has 183 rooms and suites plus a wide variety of restaurants for your culinary cravings, the Mövenpick Resort Petra will certainly provide long lasting memories.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy your time spent in one of the world’s most extraordinary destinations, amazing views over the Great Rift Valley, 7 dining options, fitness and wellness center, meeting facilities for events or incentives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can also relax in the outdoor swimming pool or enjoy a cocktail in the hotel’s stately lobby. This property also has one of the best-rated locations in Wadi Musa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick resort2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3443.894884816218!2d35.46731131462689!3d30.325507612196173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15041513a8a243a1:0xb39ae6d865e19db1!2sMövenpick Resort Petra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568284295700!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 702, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-petra'),
(704, 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Mövenpick Resort Petra se encuentra directamente a la entrada de la histórica ciudad jordana de Petra. Este complejo con un toque oriental presenta una emocionante combinación de piedra natural, madera artesanal y telas y texturas del Medio Oriente.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este hotel cuenta con 183 habitaciones y suites, además de una amplia variedad de restaurantes para sus antojos culinarios, el Mövenpick Resort Petra le proporcionará recuerdos duraderos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Disfrute de su tiempo en uno de los destinos más extraordinarios del mundo, vistas increíbles del Gran Valle del Rift, 7 opciones gastronómicas, gimnasio y centro de bienestar, instalaciones para reuniones para eventos o incentivos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los huéspedes también pueden relajarse en la piscina al aire libre o disfrutar de un cóctel en el majestuoso vestíbulo del hotel. Esta propiedad también tiene una de las ubicaciones mejor calificadas en Wadi Musa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick resort2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3443.894884816218!2d35.46731131462689!3d30.325507612196173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15041513a8a243a1:0xb39ae6d865e19db1!2sMövenpick Resort Petra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568284295700!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 702, 'es', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-petra'),
(705, 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Mövenpick Resort Petra est situé directement à l&#039;entrée de la ville historique jordanienne de Petra. Ce complexe avec une touche orientale présente une combinaison passionnante de pierre naturelle, de bois artisanal, de tissus et de textures du Moyen-Orient.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel dispose de 183 chambres et suites, en plus d&#039;une grande variété de restaurants pour vos envies culinaires, le Mövenpick Resort Petra vous procurera des souvenirs impérissables.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Profitez de votre temps dans l&#039;une des destinations les plus extraordinaires du monde, des vues incroyables sur la vallée du Grand Rift, 7 restaurants, une salle de sport et un centre de bien-être, des salles de réunion pour des événements ou des événements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez également vous détendre dans la piscine extérieure ou siroter un cocktail dans le majestueux hall de l&#039;hôtel. Cette propriété possède également l&#039;un des emplacements les mieux notés à Wadi Musa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick resort2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3443.894884816218!2d35.46731131462689!3d30.325507612196173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15041513a8a243a1:0xb39ae6d865e19db1!2sMövenpick Resort Petra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568284295700!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 702, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-petra'),
(706, 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', 'Mövenpick Resort Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Mövenpick Resort Petra si trova direttamente all&#039;ingresso della storica città giordana di Petra. Questo complesso con un tocco orientale presenta un&#039;eccitante combinazione di pietra naturale, legno artigianale e tessuti e trame dal Medio Oriente.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo hotel dispone di 183 camere e suite, oltre a un&#039;ampia varietà di ristoranti per le vostre voglie culinarie, il Mövenpick Resort Petra vi regalerà ricordi duraturi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Goditi il tuo tempo in una delle destinazioni più straordinarie al mondo, viste incredibili sulla Great Rift Valley, 7 punti di ristoro, palestra e centro benessere, sale riunioni per eventi o incentivi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gli ospiti possono anche rilassarsi nella piscina all&#039;aperto o sorseggiare un cocktail nella maestosa hall dell&#039;hotel. Questa proprietà ha anche una delle posizioni più votate a Wadi Musa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick resort2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3443.894884816218!2d35.46731131462689!3d30.325507612196173!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15041513a8a243a1:0xb39ae6d865e19db1!2sMövenpick Resort Petra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568284295700!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 702, 'it', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-petra'),
(707, 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Marriott Hotel offers anticipatory &amp;amp; traditional service designed to exceed all expectations. The hotel is a haven for comfort and luxury.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Almost all the spacious rooms have spectacular views of the valley. There are several culinary choices such as Dushara Restaurant where you can start your day with an elaborate breakfast buffet or enjoy Middle Eastern specialties for lunch or dinner and L&#039;Affresco, the Italian restaurant where you can feast on homemade pizza and pasta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For relaxation, you can swim in the outdoor pool and enjoy the breathtaking views of the Petra Mountains or rejuvenate your body with a Turkish bath, sauna or massage. For a banquet or special event, you couldn&#039;t find a finer choice as the hotel also features 1,790 square feet of event space overlooking the Petra Mountains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Stay Connected with the complimentary Wi-Fi connection in Public Areas. Wireless connection is also available in our guest rooms with surcharge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/Marriott.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3444.6346427092485!2d35.46143361462633!3d30.304461113198368!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016ea4ee9fcb03:0x12d6dd06b48d4330!2sPetra Marriott Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568284989044!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 707, 'en', '', 'one col', 'petra-marriott-hotel'),
(708, 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Marriott Hotel offers anticipatory &amp;amp; traditional service designed to exceed all expectations. The hotel is a haven for comfort and luxury.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Almost all the spacious rooms have spectacular views of the valley. There are several culinary choices such as Dushara Restaurant where you can start your day with an elaborate breakfast buffet or enjoy Middle Eastern specialties for lunch or dinner and L&#039;Affresco, the Italian restaurant where you can feast on homemade pizza and pasta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For relaxation, you can swim in the outdoor pool and enjoy the breathtaking views of the Petra Mountains or rejuvenate your body with a Turkish bath, sauna or massage. For a banquet or special event, you couldn&#039;t find a finer choice as the hotel also features 1,790 square feet of event space overlooking the Petra Mountains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Stay Connected with the complimentary Wi-Fi connection in Public Areas. Wireless connection is also available in our guest rooms with surcharge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/Marriott.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3444.6346427092485!2d35.46143361462633!3d30.304461113198368!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016ea4ee9fcb03:0x12d6dd06b48d4330!2sPetra Marriott Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568284989044!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 707, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'petra-marriott-hotel'),
(709, 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Marriott Hotel ofrece un servicio anticipatorio y tradicional diseñado para superar todas las expectativas. El hotel es un paraíso de confort y lujo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Casi todas las habitaciones espaciosas tienen vistas espectaculares del valle. Hay varias opciones culinarias, como el restaurante Dushara, donde puede comenzar el día con un elaborado desayuno bufé o disfrutar de especialidades de Oriente Medio para el almuerzo o la cena, y L&#039;Affresco, el restaurante italiano donde puede deleitarse con pizzas y pastas caseras.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para relajarse, puede nadar en la piscina al aire libre y disfrutar de las impresionantes vistas de las montañas de Petra o rejuvenecer su cuerpo con un baño turco, sauna o masaje. Para un banquete o evento especial, no puede encontrar una mejor opción ya que el hotel también cuenta con 1,790 pies cuadrados de espacio para eventos con vista a las montañas de Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Manténgase conectado con nuestra conexión Wi-Fi gratuita en las áreas públicas. La conexión inalámbrica también está disponible en nuestras habitaciones con recargo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/Marriott.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3444.6346427092485!2d35.46143361462633!3d30.304461113198368!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016ea4ee9fcb03:0x12d6dd06b48d4330!2sPetra Marriott Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568284989044!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 707, 'es', '', 'one col', 'petra-marriott-hotel'),
(710, 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Petra Marriott Hotel propose un service d&#039;anticipation et traditionnel conçu pour dépasser toutes les attentes. L&#039;hôtel est un paradis de confort et de luxe.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Presque toutes les chambres spacieuses offrent une vue spectaculaire sur la vallée. Il existe plusieurs options culinaires, telles que le restaurant Dushara, où vous pouvez commencer votre journée avec un copieux petit-déjeuner buffet ou déguster des spécialités du Moyen-Orient pour le déjeuner ou le dîner, et L&#039;Affresco, le restaurant italien où vous pourrez déguster des pizzas et des pâtes maison. .&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour vous détendre, vous pouvez nager dans la piscine extérieure et profiter de la vue imprenable sur les montagnes de Petra ou revigorer votre corps avec un bain turc, un sauna ou un massage. Pour un banquet ou un événement spécial, vous ne pouvez pas trouver une meilleure option car l&#039;hôtel dispose également de 1 790 pieds carrés d&#039;espace dédié à des événements donnant sur les montagnes de Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Restez connecté avec notre connexion Wi-Fi gratuite dans les espaces publics. La connexion sans fil est également disponible dans nos chambres avec supplément.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/Marriott.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3444.6346427092485!2d35.46143361462633!3d30.304461113198368!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016ea4ee9fcb03:0x12d6dd06b48d4330!2sPetra Marriott Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568284989044!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 707, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'petra-marriott-hotel');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(711, 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', 'Petra Marriott Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Marriott Hotel offre un servizio tradizionale e anticipato progettato per superare tutte le aspettative. L&#039;hotel è un paradiso di comfort e lusso.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Quasi tutte le spaziose camere hanno una vista spettacolare sulla valle. Ci sono diverse opzioni culinarie, come il ristorante Dushara, dove puoi iniziare la giornata con un&#039;elaborata colazione a buffet o gustare specialità mediorientali a pranzo o cena, e L&#039;Affresco, il ristorante italiano dove puoi gustare pizza e pasta fatte in casa .&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per rilassarti, puoi nuotare nella piscina all&#039;aperto e goderti la vista mozzafiato sui Monti Petra o ringiovanire il tuo corpo con un bagno turco, una sauna o un massaggio. Per un banchetto o un evento speciale, non è possibile trovare un&#039;opzione migliore poiché l&#039;hotel dispone anche di 1790 piedi quadrati di spazi per eventi con vista sui Monti Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Resta connesso con la nostra connessione Wi-Fi gratuita nelle aree comuni. La connessione wireless è disponibile anche nelle nostre camere con supplemento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/Marriott.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3444.6346427092485!2d35.46143361462633!3d30.304461113198368!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016ea4ee9fcb03:0x12d6dd06b48d4330!2sPetra Marriott Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568284989044!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 707, 'it', '', 'one col', 'petra-marriott-hotel'),
(712, 'Hotels in Aqaba', 'Hotels in Aqaba', 'Hotels in Aqaba', 'Hotels in Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Kempinski.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Kempinski Hotel Aqaba&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Kempinski Hotel Aqaba&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Kempinski Hotel Aqaba is strategically located in the city center of Aqaba, only ten minutes away from Aqaba International Airport...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/kempinski-hotel-aqaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/movenpick.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Tala Bay&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Set near the shores of South Beach, the Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba is a striking palm-fringed image. Despite its..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-tala-bay-aqaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/intercontinental2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;InterContinental Aqaba &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; InterContinental Aqaba&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Perfect for Red Sea holidays and business, this Aqaba resort has a private white-sand beach lapped by turquoise waters&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/intercontinental-aqaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Hyatt.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla Resort is a scenic retreat nestled midst towering mountains, dazzling blue lagoons, exclusive marina...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/hyatt-regency-aqaba-ayla/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/tala-bay-resort.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba is located next door to Tala Bay and features wedding services, turndown service and porter service...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/grand-tala-bay-resort-aqaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Al-Manara-Hotel-Saraya-Aqaba.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Al Manara, a Luxury Collection Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;The business Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba is a 5-star property placed 40 km from...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/al-manara-a-luxury-collection-hotel-saraya-aqaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/DoubleTree3.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; DoubleTree by Hilton Hotel Aqaba&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Located on the southern tip of Jordan overlooking the Red Sea’s Gulf of Aqaba, DoubleTree by Hilton Aqaba is a 5 star ..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/doubletree-by-hilton-hotel-aqaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Oryx2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Oryx Hotel Aqaba&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Oryx Hotel Aqaba&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;At Oryx Hotel Aqaba there is something for everyone whether you prefer to spend your day swimming or lying down under the sunshine..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/oryx-hotel-aqaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/4 Star/Marina PLaza.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Marina Plaza Tala Bay&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Ideally located in the newly and high luxurious developed resorts destination of Tala Bay, only 20 kilometers south of King Hussein...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/marina-plaza-hotel-tala-bay/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/4 Star/golden tulip2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Golden Tulip Aqaba &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Golden Tulip Hotel Aqaba&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;The Golden Tulip Aqaba Red Sea, 4stars, is located in the heart of Aqaba, 10 Km from Aqaba International Airport &amp;amp; 5 Min walking distance to...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/golden-tulip-hotel-aqaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/4 Star/lacosta.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Lacosta Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Lacosta Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Lacosta Hotel successfully combines the modern with the comfortable and achieves a subtle blend of the modern...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/lacosta-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/4 Star/Dayshotel.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Days Hotel Aqaba&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Days Hotel Aqaba&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Days Hotel Aqaba is near Aqaba National Aquarium. Within walking distance from the Red Sea, our Aqaba location is surrounded by...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/days-hotel-aqaba/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 712, 'en', '', 'one col', 'hotels-in-aqaba'),
(713, 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Kempinski Hotel Aqaba is strategically located in the city center of Aqaba, only ten minutes away from Aqaba International Airport. Queen Alia International Airport is almost three hours away through the most inspiring of routes: the desert road.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Aqaba Kempinski offers a range of water sports such as jet-skiing, banana boat riding, parasailing, and scuba diving. Alternatively, poolside loungers provide sunbathing possibilities in the shade of bamboo trees.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The bright and airy rooms at the Kempinski feature a private balcony with direct sea view. Each one has a flat-screen satellite TV mounted on the wall. The spacious bathroom offers a bathrobe and hairdryer.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For relaxation, various body therapies are offered at the spa. It also features a dry and wet sauna and a hot tub. The gym with sea views allows guests to keep in shape.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Kempinski.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.464483542912!2d34.995171914475236!3d29.531964782071615!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500703501a8066b:0xad0bd370a58ece40!2sKempinski Hotel Aqaba Red Sea!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568287137845!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 713, 'en', '', 'one col', 'kempinski-hotel-aqaba'),
(714, 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Kempinski Hotel Aqaba is strategically located in the city center of Aqaba, only ten minutes away from Aqaba International Airport. Queen Alia International Airport is almost three hours away through the most inspiring of routes: the desert road.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Aqaba Kempinski offers a range of water sports such as jet-skiing, banana boat riding, parasailing, and scuba diving. Alternatively, poolside loungers provide sunbathing possibilities in the shade of bamboo trees.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The bright and airy rooms at the Kempinski feature a private balcony with direct sea view. Each one has a flat-screen satellite TV mounted on the wall. The spacious bathroom offers a bathrobe and hairdryer.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For relaxation, various body therapies are offered at the spa. It also features a dry and wet sauna and a hot tub. The gym with sea views allows guests to keep in shape.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Kempinski.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.464483542912!2d34.995171914475236!3d29.531964782071615!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500703501a8066b:0xad0bd370a58ece40!2sKempinski Hotel Aqaba Red Sea!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568287137845!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 713, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'kempinski-hotel-aqaba'),
(715, 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Kempinski Hotel Aqaba está estratégicamente ubicado en el centro de la ciudad de Aqaba, a solo diez minutos del aeropuerto internacional de Aqaba. El Aeropuerto Internacional Queen Alia está a casi tres horas de distancia a través de las rutas más inspiradoras: el camino del desierto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Aqaba Kempinski ofrece una variedad de deportes acuáticos como jet ski, banana boat, parasailing y buceo. Alternativamente, las tumbonas junto a la piscina ofrecen posibilidades para tomar el sol a la sombra de los árboles de bambú.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones amplias y luminosas del Kempinski disponen de balcón privado con vistas directas al mar. Cada uno tiene un televisor de pantalla plana vía satélite montado en la pared. El amplio baño dispone de albornoz y secador de pelo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para relajarse, se ofrecen varias terapias corporales en el spa. También cuenta con sauna seca y húmeda y bañera de hidromasaje. El gimnasio con vistas al mar permite a los huéspedes mantenerse en forma.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Kempinski.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.464483542912!2d34.995171914475236!3d29.531964782071615!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500703501a8066b:0xad0bd370a58ece40!2sKempinski Hotel Aqaba Red Sea!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568287137845!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 713, 'es', '', 'one col', 'kempinski-hotel-aqaba'),
(716, 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Kempinski Hotel Aqaba est stratégiquement situé dans le centre-ville d&#039;Aqaba, à seulement dix minutes de l&#039;aéroport international d&#039;Aqaba. L’aéroport international Queen Alia est à près de trois heures de route par les routes les plus inspirantes: la route du désert.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Aqaba Kempinski propose une variété de sports nautiques tels que le jet ski, la banane en bateau, le parachute ascensionnel et la plongée. Sinon, les chaises longues au bord de la piscine offrent la possibilité de prendre un bain de soleil à l&#039;ombre des bambous.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres spacieuses et lumineuses du Kempinski possèdent un balcon privé avec vue directe sur la mer. Chacune dispose d&#039;une télévision par satellite à écran plat murale. La salle de bains spacieuse est dotée d&#039;un peignoir et d&#039;un sèche-cheveux.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour vous détendre, plusieurs soins corporels sont proposés au spa. Il dispose également d&#039;un sauna sec et humide et d&#039;un bain à remous. La salle de sport avec vue sur la mer permet aux clients de rester en forme.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Kempinski.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.464483542912!2d34.995171914475236!3d29.531964782071615!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500703501a8066b:0xad0bd370a58ece40!2sKempinski Hotel Aqaba Red Sea!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568287137845!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 713, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'kempinski-hotel-aqaba'),
(717, 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', 'Kempinski Hotel Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Kempinski Hotel Aqaba è strategicamente situato nel centro della città di Aqaba, a soli dieci minuti dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale di Aqaba. L&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia è a quasi tre ore di distanza attraverso i percorsi più stimolanti: la strada del deserto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Aqaba Kempinski offre una varietà di sport acquatici come jet ski, banana boat, parapendio e immersioni. In alternativa, i lettini a bordo piscina offrono la possibilità di prendere il sole all&#039;ombra degli alberi di bambù.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le spaziose e luminose camere del Kempinski dispongono di balcone privato con vista diretta sul mare. Ognuno ha una TV satellitare a schermo piatto a parete. L&#039;ampio bagno è dotato di accappatoio e asciugacapelli.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per rilassarsi, nel centro benessere sono disponibili diverse terapie per il corpo. Ha anche una sauna secca e umida e una vasca idromassaggio. La palestra con vista sul mare consente agli ospiti di mantenersi in forma.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Kempinski.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.464483542912!2d34.995171914475236!3d29.531964782071615!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500703501a8066b:0xad0bd370a58ece40!2sKempinski Hotel Aqaba Red Sea!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568287137845!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 713, 'it', '', 'one col', 'kempinski-hotel-aqaba'),
