(722, 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Set near the shores of South Beach, the Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba is a striking palm-fringed image. Despite its physical appearance of an oasis in the desert, it is actually only15 minutes away from the city centre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is easy to relax or have fun within the resort because the staff is accommodating and it’s very easy to book water sports like snorkeling, Turkish baths and Canoeing for the day with their help.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Selan Restaurant offers luxurious dining options. They have delightful Italian cuisines and if having a light meal is preferable, there’s a pub that serves it with some interesting beverage options. Guests can also simply snack in their room where a mini bar is available.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Typically beach-themed, Mövenpick Resort offers light colored rooms. They are not only spacious; they are also brightly lit especially in the day because of the large floor-to-ceiling windows. The lagoon-style pool and the Zara Spa Tala Bay is can easily be reached if guests want to completely unwind from a long day of deep sea diving.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/movenpick.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d868.9574968047403!2d34.97888382918348!3d29.404529167219568!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMjnCsDI0JzE2LjMiTiAzNMKwNTgnNDYuMCJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568633895426!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 722, 'en', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-tala-bay-aqaba'),
(723, 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Set near the shores of South Beach, the Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba is a striking palm-fringed image. Despite its physical appearance of an oasis in the desert, it is actually only15 minutes away from the city centre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is easy to relax or have fun within the resort because the staff is accommodating and it’s very easy to book water sports like snorkeling, Turkish baths and Canoeing for the day with their help.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Selan Restaurant offers luxurious dining options. They have delightful Italian cuisines and if having a light meal is preferable, there’s a pub that serves it with some interesting beverage options. Guests can also simply snack in their room where a mini bar is available.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Typically beach-themed, Mövenpick Resort offers light colored rooms. They are not only spacious; they are also brightly lit especially in the day because of the large floor-to-ceiling windows. The lagoon-style pool and the Zara Spa Tala Bay is can easily be reached if guests want to completely unwind from a long day of deep sea diving.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/movenpick.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d868.9574968047403!2d34.97888382918348!3d29.404529167219568!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMjnCsDI0JzE2LjMiTiAzNMKwNTgnNDYuMCJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568633895426!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 722, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-tala-bay-aqaba'),
(724, 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ubicado cerca de las costas de South Beach, el Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba es una imagen sorprendente bordeada de palmeras. A pesar de la apariencia física de un oasis en el desierto, en realidad está a solo 15 minutos del centro de la ciudad.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Es fácil relajarse o divertirse en el complejo porque el personal es servicial y es muy fácil reservar deportes acuáticos como snorkel, baños turcos y piragüismo por el día con su ayuda.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El restaurante Selan ofrece opciones gastronómicas de lujo. Tienen deliciosas cocinas italianas y si es preferible una comida ligera, hay un pub que lo sirve con algunas opciones interesantes de bebidas. Los huéspedes también pueden simplemente tomar un aperitivo en su habitación, donde hay un mini bar disponible.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Típicamente inspirado en la playa, el Mövenpick Resort ofrece habitaciones de colores claros. No solo son espaciosos; También están bien iluminadas, especialmente en el día debido a las grandes ventanas de piso a techo. Se puede llegar fácilmente a la piscina estilo laguna y al Zara Spa Tala Bay si los huéspedes desean relajarse por completo de un largo día de buceo en alta mar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/movenpick.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d868.9574968047403!2d34.97888382918348!3d29.404529167219568!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMjnCsDI0JzE2LjMiTiAzNMKwNTgnNDYuMCJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568633895426!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 722, 'es', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-tala-bay-aqaba'),
(725, 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situé près des rives de South Beach, le Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba est une image saisissante bordée de palmiers. Malgré l&#039;apparence physique d&#039;une oasis dans le désert, il se trouve à seulement 15 minutes du centre-ville.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il est facile de se détendre ou de s’amuser dans le complexe car le personnel est serviable et il est très facile de réserver des sports nautiques comme la plongée avec tuba, les bains turcs et le canoë-kayak pour la journée avec votre aide.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le restaurant Selan propose des options de restauration de luxe. Ils ont une délicieuse cuisine italienne et si un repas léger est préférable, il y a un pub qui le sert avec des boissons intéressantes. Vous pourrez également simplement prendre un en-cas dans votre chambre, où un mini-bar est à votre disposition.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Typiquement inspiré par la plage, le Mövenpick Resort propose des chambres aux couleurs claires. Ils ne sont pas seulement spacieux; Ils sont également bien éclairés, surtout pendant la journée en raison des grandes fenêtres allant du sol au plafond. La piscine de style lagon et la baie de Zara Spa Tala sont facilement accessibles si vous souhaitez vous détendre complètement après une longue journée de plongée en haute mer.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/movenpick.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d868.9574968047403!2d34.97888382918348!3d29.404529167219568!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMjnCsDI0JzE2LjMiTiAzNMKwNTgnNDYuMCJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568633895426!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 722, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-tala-bay-aqaba'),
(726, 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', 'Mövenpick Resort &amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situato vicino alle rive di South Beach, il Mövenpick Resort &amp;amp; Spa Tala Bay Aqaba è un&#039;immagine suggestiva fiancheggiata da palme. Nonostante l&#039;aspetto fisico di un&#039;oasi nel deserto, in realtà è a soli 15 minuti dal centro della città.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;È facile rilassarsi o divertirsi nel complesso perché il personale è disponibile ed è molto facile prenotare sport acquatici come snorkeling, bagni turchi e canoa per la giornata con il vostro aiuto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il ristorante Selan offre opzioni gastronomiche di lusso. Hanno deliziose cucine italiane e se è preferibile un pasto leggero, c&#039;è un pub che serve alcune interessanti opzioni di bevande. Gli ospiti possono anche semplicemente fare uno spuntino in camera, dove è disponibile un mini bar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tipicamente ispirato alla spiaggia, il Mövenpick Resort offre camere di colore chiaro. Non sono solo spaziosi; Sono anche ben illuminate, soprattutto durante il giorno a causa delle grandi finestre dal pavimento al soffitto. La piscina in stile laguna e la Zara Spa Tala Bay sono facilmente raggiungibili se gli ospiti desiderano rilassarsi completamente da una lunga giornata di immersioni in acque profonde.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/movenpick.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d868.9574968047403!2d34.97888382918348!3d29.404529167219568!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMjnCsDI0JzE2LjMiTiAzNMKwNTgnNDYuMCJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568633895426!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 722, 'it', '', 'one col', 'mövenpick-resort-amp-spa-tala-bay-aqaba'),
(727, 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Perfect for Red Sea holidays and business, this Aqaba resort has a private white-sand beach lapped by turquoise waters.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;With a private beach along the Gulf of Aqaba, this elegant hotel offers rooms with balconies overlooking the 200-m², lagoon-style pool and the Red Sea. It also features an extensive spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel’s spa features hot tubs, a steam room, and a wellness centre offering an extensive menu of facial and body treatments. There is also a gym with plenty of cardio machines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Chic restaurants, guests can choose from the buffet-style Corniche Restaurant and the Bourj Al Hamam, offering Lebanese al fresco dining. The Cote D’or wine cellar also serves fine meals and quality wines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Downtown Aqaba is a short stroll away, and King Hussein Airport can be reached in 15 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/intercontinental2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.4073612776333!2d34.99330071460776!3d29.533628949477613!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500703492839e27:0xe3bb2a520e39cebe!2sInterContinental Aqaba (Resort Aqaba)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568636734837!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 727, 'en', '', 'one col', 'intercontinental-aqaba'),
(728, 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Perfect for Red Sea holidays and business, this Aqaba resort has a private white-sand beach lapped by turquoise waters.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;With a private beach along the Gulf of Aqaba, this elegant hotel offers rooms with balconies overlooking the 200-m², lagoon-style pool and the Red Sea. It also features an extensive spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel’s spa features hot tubs, a steam room, and a wellness centre offering an extensive menu of facial and body treatments. There is also a gym with plenty of cardio machines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Chic restaurants, guests can choose from the buffet-style Corniche Restaurant and the Bourj Al Hamam, offering Lebanese al fresco dining. The Cote D’or wine cellar also serves fine meals and quality wines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Downtown Aqaba is a short stroll away, and King Hussein Airport can be reached in 15 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/intercontinental2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.4073612776333!2d34.99330071460776!3d29.533628949477613!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500703492839e27:0xe3bb2a520e39cebe!2sInterContinental Aqaba (Resort Aqaba)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568636734837!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 727, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'intercontinental-aqaba'),
(729, 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Perfecto para vacaciones y negocios en el Mar Rojo, este complejo de Aqaba tiene una playa privada de arena blanca bañada por aguas turquesas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Con una playa privada a lo largo del Golfo de Aqaba, este elegante hotel ofrece habitaciones con balcones con vistas a la piscina estilo laguna de 200 m² y al Mar Rojo. También cuenta con un amplio spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El spa del hotel cuenta con bañeras de hidromasaje, baño de vapor y un centro de bienestar que ofrece un amplio menú de tratamientos faciales y corporales. También hay un gimnasio con muchas máquinas de cardio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Restaurantes elegantes, los huéspedes pueden elegir entre el restaurante de estilo buffet Corniche y el Bourj Al Hamam, que ofrece comida libanesa al aire libre. La bodega Cote D’or también sirve excelentes comidas y vinos de calidad.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El centro de Aqaba está a pocos pasos y el aeropuerto Rey Hussein se encuentra a 15 minutos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/intercontinental2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.4073612776333!2d34.99330071460776!3d29.533628949477613!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500703492839e27:0xe3bb2a520e39cebe!2sInterContinental Aqaba (Resort Aqaba)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568636734837!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 727, 'es', '', 'one col', 'intercontinental-aqaba'),
(730, 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Idéal pour les vacances et les affaires en mer Rouge, ce complexe d’Aqaba possède une plage privée de sable blanc baignée par des eaux turquoises.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Doté d&#039;une plage privée le long du golfe d&#039;Aqaba, cet élégant hôtel propose des chambres avec balcon donnant sur la piscine lagon de 200 m² et la mer Rouge. Il a également un grand spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le spa de l&#039;hôtel propose des bains à remous, des bains à vapeur et un centre de bien-être proposant un grand choix de soins du visage et du corps. Il y a aussi une salle de sport avec de nombreuses machines de cardio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Restaurants élégants, vous pourrez choisir entre le restaurant buffet de la Corniche et le Bourj Al Hamam, qui propose une cuisine libanaise en plein air. Le vignoble Cote D’or sert également une cuisine excellente et des vins de qualité.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le centre d&#039;Aqaba se trouve à quelques pas et l&#039;aéroport du roi Hussein est à 15 minutes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/intercontinental2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.4073612776333!2d34.99330071460776!3d29.533628949477613!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500703492839e27:0xe3bb2a520e39cebe!2sInterContinental Aqaba (Resort Aqaba)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568636734837!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 727, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'intercontinental-aqaba'),
(731, 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', 'InterContinental Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Perfetto per vacanze e affari nel Mar Rosso, questo resort di Aqaba ha una spiaggia privata di sabbia bianca bagnata da acque turchesi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dotato di una spiaggia privata lungo il Golfo di Aqaba, questo elegante hotel offre camere con balcone affacciato sulla piscina laguna di 200 m² e sul Mar Rosso. Ha anche una grande spa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il centro benessere dell&#039;hotel offre vasche idromassaggio, bagni di vapore e un centro benessere che offre un ampio menu di trattamenti viso e corpo. C&#039;è anche una palestra con molte macchine cardio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Eleganti ristoranti, gli ospiti possono scegliere tra il ristorante a buffet Corniche e il Bourj Al Hamam, che offre cibo libanese all&#039;aperto. La cantina Cote D’or serve anche cibo eccellente e vini di qualità.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il centro di Aqaba è a pochi passi e l&#039;aeroporto King Hussein a 15 minuti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/intercontinental2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.4073612776333!2d34.99330071460776!3d29.533628949477613!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500703492839e27:0xe3bb2a520e39cebe!2sInterContinental Aqaba (Resort Aqaba)!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568636734837!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 727, 'it', '', 'one col', 'intercontinental-aqaba'),
(732, 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla Resort is a scenic retreat nestled midst towering mountains, dazzling blue lagoons, exclusive marina and the fairways of the 18-hole Ayla Golf Club. Indulge yourself at our tranquil spa, build sand castles with the kids or simply sit back and relax by one of our pools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms offer spectacular water views from a private terrace over the marina or the lagoons. Book the Regency Suite and enjoy 84m2 of space featuring a separate living room.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Adventure seeking kids, will be thrilled at this impressive Camp Hyatt facility where they will have the opportunity to engage and socialize, asserting their freedom and leaving them with lasting happy memories. Camp Hyatt welcomes all young guests. Kids below 4 years old must be accompanied by an adult.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tee off on this 18-hole par-72 championship course, which has been designed by golf legendary Greg Norman and is undoubtedly one of the most beautiful in the Middle East.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/hyatt2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d9002.890136006277!2d34.98743510640131!3d29.546393321306027!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500719572618741:0x2464280b5075c8de!2sHyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla Resort!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568637783592!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 732, 'en', '', 'one col', 'hyatt-regency-aqaba-ayla');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(733, 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla Resort is a scenic retreat nestled midst towering mountains, dazzling blue lagoons, exclusive marina and the fairways of the 18-hole Ayla Golf Club. Indulge yourself at our tranquil spa, build sand castles with the kids or simply sit back and relax by one of our pools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms offer spectacular water views from a private terrace over the marina or the lagoons. Book the Regency Suite and enjoy 84m2 of space featuring a separate living room.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Adventure seeking kids, will be thrilled at this impressive Camp Hyatt facility where they will have the opportunity to engage and socialize, asserting their freedom and leaving them with lasting happy memories. Camp Hyatt welcomes all young guests. Kids below 4 years old must be accompanied by an adult.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tee off on this 18-hole par-72 championship course, which has been designed by golf legendary Greg Norman and is undoubtedly one of the most beautiful in the Middle East.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/hyatt2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d9002.890136006277!2d34.98743510640131!3d29.546393321306027!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500719572618741:0x2464280b5075c8de!2sHyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla Resort!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568637783592!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 732, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'hyatt-regency-aqaba-ayla'),
(734, 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla Resort es un refugio pintoresco enclavado en medio de montañas imponentes, deslumbrantes lagunas azules, puerto deportivo exclusivo y las calles del club de golf Ayla de 18 hoyos. Deléitese en nuestro tranquilo spa, construya castillos de arena con los niños o simplemente siéntese y relájese en una de nuestras piscinas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones ofrecen espectaculares vistas al agua desde una terraza privada sobre el puerto deportivo o las lagunas. Reserve la Suite Regency y disfrute de 84m2 de espacio con una sala de estar separada.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los niños que buscan aventuras estarán encantados con esta impresionante instalación de Camp Hyatt, donde tendrán la oportunidad de participar y socializar, afirmando su libertad y dejándoles recuerdos felices y duraderos. Camp Hyatt da la bienvenida a todos los huéspedes jóvenes. Los niños menores de 4 años deben estar acompañados por un adulto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Juegue en este campo de campeonato de 18 hoyos par 72, que ha sido diseñado por el legendario Greg Norman y sin duda es uno de los más hermosos en el Medio Oriente.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/hyatt2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d9002.890136006277!2d34.98743510640131!3d29.546393321306027!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500719572618741:0x2464280b5075c8de!2sHyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla Resort!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568637783592!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 732, 'es', '', 'one col', 'hyatt-regency-aqaba-ayla'),
(735, 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla Resort est un refuge pittoresque niché au cœur de superbes montagnes, de lagons bleus éblouissants, d&#039;un port de plaisance exclusif et des rues du club de golf 18 trous d&#039;Ayla. Faites-vous plaisir dans notre spa paisible, construisez des châteaux de sable avec les enfants ou détendez-vous simplement dans l&#039;une de nos piscines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres offrent une vue spectaculaire sur l’eau depuis une terrasse privée donnant sur le port de plaisance ou les lagons. Réservez la suite Regency et profitez de 84 m² d&#039;espace avec un salon séparé.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les enfants en quête d&#039;aventures seront ravis de cette impressionnante installation de Camp Hyatt, où ils auront l&#039;occasion de participer et de socialiser, affirmant leur liberté et leur laissant des souvenirs heureux et durables. Le Camp Hyatt accueille tous les jeunes invités. Les enfants de moins de 4 ans doivent être accompagnés d&#039;un adulte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Jouez sur ce parcours de championnat 18 trous par 72 conçu par le légendaire Greg Norman et sans aucun doute l&#039;un des plus beaux du Moyen-Orient.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/hyatt2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d9002.890136006277!2d34.98743510640131!3d29.546393321306027!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500719572618741:0x2464280b5075c8de!2sHyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla Resort!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568637783592!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 732, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'hyatt-regency-aqaba-ayla'),
(736, 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', 'Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Hyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla Resort è un pittoresco rifugio incastonato tra splendide montagne, abbaglianti lagune blu, porto turistico esclusivo e le strade del golf club a 18 buche Ayla. Concediti nella nostra tranquilla spa, costruisci castelli di sabbia con i bambini o semplicemente rilassati in una delle nostre piscine.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere offrono spettacolari viste sull&#039;acqua da una terrazza privata sul porto turistico o sulle lagune. Prenota la Regency Suite e goditi 84m2 di spazio con un soggiorno separato.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;I bambini in cerca di avventure saranno felici con questa imponente installazione di Camp Hyatt, dove avranno l&#039;opportunità di partecipare e socializzare, affermando la loro libertà e lasciando loro ricordi felici e duraturi. Camp Hyatt accoglie tutti i giovani ospiti. I bambini sotto i 4 anni devono essere accompagnati da un adulto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gioca in questo campo da campionato a 72 buche par 72, che è stato progettato dal leggendario Greg Norman ed è senza dubbio uno dei più belli del Medio Oriente.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/hyatt2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d9002.890136006277!2d34.98743510640131!3d29.546393321306027!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500719572618741:0x2464280b5075c8de!2sHyatt Regency Aqaba Ayla Resort!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568637783592!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 732, 'it', '', 'one col', 'hyatt-regency-aqaba-ayla'),
(737, 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba is located next door to Tala Bay and features wedding services, turndown service and porter service for guests&#039; convenience. The venue comprises 336 luxurious rooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This stylish hotel is located close to Golden Mountain and the Red Sea. It offers good access to South Beach Highway.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tea and coffee making equipment, a coffee maker and panoramic windows are standard in each room. Guests can enjoy rooms with breathtaking views of the river. Certain units feature a dishwasher, a kettle and an ice machine.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It serves a super breakfast every morning. Heatwave restaurant offers a menu with local cuisine. Guests can enjoy time in the café bar. There is a coffee shop serving Mediterranean food within 350 meters away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It has a lap pool, as well as a hot tub, a poolside snack bar and sun loungers. Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba provides such sport activities as canoeing, water skiing and beach volleyball.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/tala-bay-resort.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2922.5639123546725!2d34.97769299601655!3d29.413191249941192!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500763971f0d113:0x5f1d742b8678d7b3!2sTala Bay Resort, Aqaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568640037666!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 737, 'en', '', 'one col', 'grand-tala-bay-resort-aqaba'),
(738, 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba is located next door to Tala Bay and features wedding services, turndown service and porter service for guests&#039; convenience. The venue comprises 336 luxurious rooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This stylish hotel is located close to Golden Mountain and the Red Sea. It offers good access to South Beach Highway.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tea and coffee making equipment, a coffee maker and panoramic windows are standard in each room. Guests can enjoy rooms with breathtaking views of the river. Certain units feature a dishwasher, a kettle and an ice machine.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It serves a super breakfast every morning. Heatwave restaurant offers a menu with local cuisine. Guests can enjoy time in the café bar. There is a coffee shop serving Mediterranean food within 350 meters away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It has a lap pool, as well as a hot tub, a poolside snack bar and sun loungers. Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba provides such sport activities as canoeing, water skiing and beach volleyball.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/tala-bay-resort.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2922.5639123546725!2d34.97769299601655!3d29.413191249941192!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500763971f0d113:0x5f1d742b8678d7b3!2sTala Bay Resort, Aqaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568640037666!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 737, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'grand-tala-bay-resort-aqaba'),
(739, 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba se encuentra al lado de Tala Bay y ofrece servicios de bodas, servicio de cobertura y servicio de portería para la comodidad de los huéspedes. El lugar comprende 336 lujosas habitaciones.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este elegante hotel está situado cerca de la Montaña Dorada y el Mar Rojo. Ofrece buen acceso a la autopista South Beach.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El equipamiento para preparar té y café, una cafetera y ventanas panorámicas son estándar en cada habitación. Los huéspedes pueden disfrutar de habitaciones con impresionantes vistas del río. Algunas unidades cuentan con lavavajillas, hervidor de agua y máquina de hielo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se sirve un súper desayuno todas las mañanas. El restaurante Heatwave ofrece un menú con cocina local. Los huéspedes pueden disfrutar del tiempo en el bar cafetería. A 350 metros hay una cafetería que sirve comida mediterránea.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cuenta con piscina de entrenamiento, bañera de hidromasaje, chiringuito y tumbonas. Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba ofrece actividades deportivas como piragüismo, esquí acuático y voleibol de playa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/tala-bay-resort.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2922.5639123546725!2d34.97769299601655!3d29.413191249941192!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500763971f0d113:0x5f1d742b8678d7b3!2sTala Bay Resort, Aqaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568640037666!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 737, 'es', '', 'one col', 'grand-tala-bay-resort-aqaba'),
(740, 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba est situé à côté de la baie de Tala et propose un service de mariage, un service de couverture et un service de conciergerie. Le lieu comprend 336 chambres luxueuses.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet élégant hôtel est situé près de la montagne dorée et de la mer Rouge. Il offre un bon accès à l&#039;autoroute de South Beach.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un plateau / bouilloire, une cafetière et des fenêtres panoramiques sont compris dans toutes les chambres. Vous pourrez profiter de chambres offrant une vue imprenable sur la rivière. Certains logements possèdent un lave-vaisselle, une bouilloire et une machine à glace.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un super petit-déjeuner est servi chaque matin. Le restaurant Heatwave propose un menu avec une cuisine locale. Vous pourrez passer du temps au café-bar. Une cafétéria servant une cuisine méditerranéenne est à 350 mètres.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il possède un bassin d&#039;entraînement, un bain à remous, un bar de plage et des chaises longues. Le Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba propose des activités sportives telles que le canoë-kayak, le ski nautique et le beach-volley.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/tala-bay-resort.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2922.5639123546725!2d34.97769299601655!3d29.413191249941192!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500763971f0d113:0x5f1d742b8678d7b3!2sTala Bay Resort, Aqaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568640037666!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 737, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'grand-tala-bay-resort-aqaba'),
(741, 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', 'Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba si trova vicino a Tala Bay e offre servizi per matrimoni, servizio di copertura e servizio di facchinaggio per la comodità degli ospiti. Il posto comprende 336 camere lussuose.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo elegante hotel si trova vicino alla Golden Mountain e al Mar Rosso. Offre un buon accesso alla South Beach Highway.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ogni camera è dotata di set per la preparazione di tè e caffè, macchina per il caffè e finestre panoramiche. Gli ospiti possono godere di camere con vista mozzafiato sul fiume. Alcune unità sono dotate di lavastoviglie, bollitore e macchina per il ghiaccio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Una super colazione viene servita ogni mattina. Il ristorante Heatwave offre un menu con cucina locale. Gli ospiti possono godersi il tempo nel bar caffetteria. A 350 metri di distanza troverete una caffetteria che serve cucina mediterranea.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dispone di piscina per allenamenti, vasca idromassaggio, bar sulla spiaggia e lettini. Il Grand Tala Bay Resort Aqaba offre attività sportive come canoa, sci nautico e beach volley.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/tala-bay-resort.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2922.5639123546725!2d34.97769299601655!3d29.413191249941192!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500763971f0d113:0x5f1d742b8678d7b3!2sTala Bay Resort, Aqaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568640037666!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 737, 'it', '', 'one col', 'grand-tala-bay-resort-aqaba'),
(742, 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The business Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba is a 5-star property placed 40 km from Wadi Rum. Behind the ancient facade of Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba lies modern interior.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba is settled 3.2 km away from Kings City. A beachfront setting near a port offers good public transport connections.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nearby you will find a museum and a castle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba features individual climate control, cable TV with on-demand movies, pay television, a microwave and high ceiling in every room. Also, the venue offers rooms with great views of the lagoon. Soundproof rooms also have beds with hypo-allergenic pillows, a pillow-top mattress and foam pillows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Residents can have breakfast in the restaurant. Dishes of seafood cuisine are served in the gourmet restaurant. A beach area features Captain’s restaurant and Pasta Bay within 600 meters of the accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Al-Manara-Hotel-Saraya-Aqaba.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.362534431949!2d34.99272241460768!3d29.53493484941682!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15007100f525e9eb:0xee46e07291f4d590!2sAl Manara, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568642765729!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 742, 'en', '', 'one col', 'al-manara-a-luxury-collection-hotel-saraya-aqaba'),
(743, 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The business Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba is a 5-star property placed 40 km from Wadi Rum. Behind the ancient facade of Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba lies modern interior.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba is settled 3.2 km away from Kings City. A beachfront setting near a port offers good public transport connections.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nearby you will find a museum and a castle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba features individual climate control, cable TV with on-demand movies, pay television, a microwave and high ceiling in every room. Also, the venue offers rooms with great views of the lagoon. Soundproof rooms also have beds with hypo-allergenic pillows, a pillow-top mattress and foam pillows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Residents can have breakfast in the restaurant. Dishes of seafood cuisine are served in the gourmet restaurant. A beach area features Captain’s restaurant and Pasta Bay within 600 meters of the accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Al-Manara-Hotel-Saraya-Aqaba.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.362534431949!2d34.99272241460768!3d29.53493484941682!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15007100f525e9eb:0xee46e07291f4d590!2sAl Manara, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568642765729!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 742, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'al-manara-a-luxury-collection-hotel-saraya-aqaba'),
(744, 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel empresarial Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba es un establecimiento de 5 estrellas situado a 40 km de Wadi Rum. Detrás de la antigua fachada de Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba se encuentra el interior moderno.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba se encuentra a 3,2 km de Kings City. Un entorno frente a la playa cerca de un puerto ofrece buenas conexiones de transporte público.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cerca encontrará un museo y un castillo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba cuenta con climatización individual, televisión por cable con películas a la carta, televisión de pago, microondas y techos altos en todas las habitaciones. Además, el lugar ofrece habitaciones con excelentes vistas de la laguna. Las habitaciones insonorizadas también tienen camas con almohadas hipoalergénicas, un colchón con cubierta tipo almohada y almohadas de espuma.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los residentes pueden desayunar en el restaurante. En el restaurante gourmet se sirven platos de cocina marinera. Hay una zona de playa con el Restaurante de Capitanes y Pasta Bay a 600 metros del alojamiento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Al-Manara-Hotel-Saraya-Aqaba.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.362534431949!2d34.99272241460768!3d29.53493484941682!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15007100f525e9eb:0xee46e07291f4d590!2sAl Manara, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568642765729!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 742, 'es', '', 'one col', 'al-manara-a-luxury-collection-hotel-saraya-aqaba'),
(745, 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel d&#039;affaires 5 étoiles situé à 40 km de Wadi Rum est un hôtel d&#039;affaires à Al Manara, le A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba. Derrière la vieille façade d’Al Manara, le A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba, abrite un intérieur moderne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Manara, un hôtel luxueux, Saraya Aqaba, est situé à 3 km de Kings City. Un emplacement en bord de mer près d&#039;un port offre de bonnes liaisons de transport en commun.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;À proximité, vous trouverez un musée et un château.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Manara, un hôtel luxueux de la collection, Saraya Aqaba, dispose de la climatisation à réglage individuel, de la télévision par câble avec films à la demande, d&#039;une télévision payante, d&#039;un four micro-ondes et de hauts plafonds dans toutes les chambres. En outre, l&#039;endroit propose des chambres avec une vue imprenable sur le lagon. Les chambres insonorisées disposent également de lits avec des oreillers hypoallergéniques, d&#039;un matelas à oreiller et d&#039;oreillers en mousse.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les résidents peuvent prendre leur petit déjeuner au restaurant. Des plats de fruits de mer sont servis dans le restaurant gastronomique. Vous trouverez une plage avec Capitanes et le restaurant Pasta Bay à 600 mètres de l&#039;hébergement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Al-Manara-Hotel-Saraya-Aqaba.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.362534431949!2d34.99272241460768!3d29.53493484941682!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15007100f525e9eb:0xee46e07291f4d590!2sAl Manara, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568642765729!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 742, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'al-manara-a-luxury-collection-hotel-saraya-aqaba'),
(746, 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', 'Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il business hotel Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba è una struttura a 5 stelle situata a 40 km da Wadi Rum. Dietro la vecchia facciata di Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba è l&#039;interno moderno.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba si trova a 3,2 km da Kings City. Una posizione fronte mare vicino a un porto offre buoni collegamenti con i mezzi pubblici.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nelle vicinanze troverete un museo e un castello.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Manara, A Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba dispone di controllo della climatizzazione individuale, TV via cavo con film su richiesta, pay TV, microonde e soffitti alti in tutte le camere. Inoltre, il luogo offre camere con un&#039;eccellente vista sulla laguna. Le camere sono insonorizzate e dispongono di letti con cuscini ipoallergenici, materasso con imbottitura a cuscino e cuscini in espanso.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;I residenti possono fare colazione al ristorante. Il ristorante gourmet serve piatti di pesce. Vi è una spiaggia con Capitanes e Pasta Bay Restaurant a 600 metri dalla struttura.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/5 Star/Al-Manara-Hotel-Saraya-Aqaba.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3471.362534431949!2d34.99272241460768!3d29.53493484941682!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15007100f525e9eb:0xee46e07291f4d590!2sAl Manara, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Saraya Aqaba!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568642765729!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 742, 'it', '', 'one col', 'al-manara-a-luxury-collection-hotel-saraya-aqaba'),
(747, 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ideally located in the newly and high luxurious developed resorts destination of Tala Bay, only 20 kilometers south of King Hussein International Airport (Aqaba) and 15 kilometers south of the city of Aqaba, stretching along the coast of Aqaba Gulf, Marina Plaza Hotel is the cornerstone of its most famous of bays, offering breathtaking views of the golden mountains, with impressive collection of alluring restaurants and bars, modern stylish rooms as well as numerous leisure facilities. Guests can enjoy the free Wi-Fi connection available in public areas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located along the Red Sea shore, this 4-star hotel offers modern rooms with air conditioning and satellite TV. Facilities include Tala Bay Beach Club and outdoor pools. Each room at Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay is equipped with a private balcony. Some rooms have limited sea view, while others offer views of the swimming pool or the surrounding Aqaba Mountains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Marina Plaza’s spa offers a variety of health and beauty treatments, specialising in Dead Sea treatments. The hotel also offers daily activities, such as aqua aerobics and yoga and other activities for kids.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Marina Plaza’s main restaurant, Solero, serves both international and regional dishes. Guests can enjoy local teas and coffees, live music and a hookah by the pools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/4 Star/Marina PLaza.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3475.6286774909177!2d34.97891301460478!3d29.41041675519976!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500704637bab1f7:0x3abcf0c43c596aaa!2sMarina Plaza Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568645106418!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 747, 'en', '', 'one col', 'marina-plaza-hotel-tala-bay'),
(748, 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ideally located in the newly and high luxurious developed resorts destination of Tala Bay, only 20 kilometers south of King Hussein International Airport (Aqaba) and 15 kilometers south of the city of Aqaba, stretching along the coast of Aqaba Gulf, Marina Plaza Hotel is the cornerstone of its most famous of bays, offering breathtaking views of the golden mountains, with impressive collection of alluring restaurants and bars, modern stylish rooms as well as numerous leisure facilities. Guests can enjoy the free Wi-Fi connection available in public areas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located along the Red Sea shore, this 4-star hotel offers modern rooms with air conditioning and satellite TV. Facilities include Tala Bay Beach Club and outdoor pools. Each room at Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay is equipped with a private balcony. Some rooms have limited sea view, while others offer views of the swimming pool or the surrounding Aqaba Mountains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Marina Plaza’s spa offers a variety of health and beauty treatments, specialising in Dead Sea treatments. The hotel also offers daily activities, such as aqua aerobics and yoga and other activities for kids.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Marina Plaza’s main restaurant, Solero, serves both international and regional dishes. Guests can enjoy local teas and coffees, live music and a hookah by the pools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/4 Star/Marina PLaza.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3475.6286774909177!2d34.97891301460478!3d29.41041675519976!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500704637bab1f7:0x3abcf0c43c596aaa!2sMarina Plaza Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568645106418!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 747, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'marina-plaza-hotel-tala-bay'),
(749, 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Con una ubicación ideal en el nuevo y lujoso destino de resorts desarrollados de Tala Bay, a solo 20 kilómetros al sur del Aeropuerto Internacional Rey Hussein (Aqaba) y a 15 kilómetros al sur de la ciudad de Aqaba, que se extiende a lo largo de la costa del Golfo de Aqaba, Marina Plaza Hotel es el piedra angular de su bahía más famosa, que ofrece impresionantes vistas de las montañas doradas, con una impresionante colección de atractivos restaurantes y bares, habitaciones modernas y elegantes, así como numerosas instalaciones de ocio. Los huéspedes pueden disfrutar de la conexión Wi-Fi gratuita disponible en las áreas públicas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situado a lo largo de la costa del Mar Rojo, este hotel de 4 estrellas ofrece habitaciones modernas con aire acondicionado y TV vía satélite. Las instalaciones incluyen Tala Bay Beach Club y piscinas al aire libre. Todas las habitaciones del Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay están equipadas con un balcón privado. Algunas habitaciones tienen vistas limitadas al mar, mientras que otras ofrecen vistas a la piscina o las montañas de Aqaba.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El spa de Marina Plaza ofrece una variedad de tratamientos de salud y belleza, especializados en tratamientos del Mar Muerto. El hotel también ofrece actividades diarias, como aeróbico acuático y yoga y otras actividades para niños.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El restaurante principal de Marina Plaza, Solero, sirve platos internacionales y regionales. Los huéspedes pueden disfrutar de tés y cafés locales, música en vivo y una cachimba junto a las piscinas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/4 Star/Marina PLaza.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3475.6286774909177!2d34.97891301460478!3d29.41041675519976!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500704637bab1f7:0x3abcf0c43c596aaa!2sMarina Plaza Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568645106418!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 747, 'es', '', 'one col', 'marina-plaza-hotel-tala-bay'),
(750, 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Idéalement situé dans la nouvelle et luxueuse destination des complexes développés de la baie de Tala, à seulement 20 km au sud de l&#039;aéroport international King Hussein (Aqaba) et à 15 km au sud de la ville d&#039;Aqaba, qui longe la Golfe d&#039;Aqaba, l&#039;hôtel Marina Plaza est la pierre angulaire de sa plus célèbre baie, offrant une vue imprenable sur les montagnes dorées, avec une collection impressionnante de restaurants et de bars attrayants, de chambres modernes et élégantes, ainsi que de nombreuses installations de loisirs. Vous pourrez profiter de la connexion Wi-Fi gratuite disponible dans les parties communes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situé sur la côte de la mer Rouge, cet hôtel 4 étoiles propose des chambres modernes avec climatisation et télévision par satellite. Les installations comprennent le club de plage de Tala Bay et des piscines extérieures. Toutes les chambres de l&#039;hôtel Marina Plaza Tala Bay sont équipées d&#039;un balcon privé. Certaines chambres offrent une vue limitée sur la mer, tandis que d&#039;autres offrent une vue sur la piscine ou les montagnes d&#039;Aqaba.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le spa Marina Plaza propose une variété de soins de santé et de beauté, spécialisés dans les soins de la mer Morte. L&#039;hôtel propose également des activités quotidiennes telles que de l&#039;aérobic aquatique et du yoga, ainsi que d&#039;autres activités pour les enfants.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le restaurant principal du Marina Plaza, Solero, sert des plats internationaux et régionaux. Vous pourrez déguster des thés et des cafés locaux, de la musique en direct et un narguilé au bord des piscines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/4 Star/Marina PLaza.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3475.6286774909177!2d34.97891301460478!3d29.41041675519976!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500704637bab1f7:0x3abcf0c43c596aaa!2sMarina Plaza Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568645106418!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 747, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'marina-plaza-hotel-tala-bay'),
(751, 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', 'Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Idealmente situato nella nuova e lussuosa destinazione dei resort sviluppati nella baia di Tala, a soli 20 chilometri a sud dell&#039;aeroporto internazionale King Hussein (Aqaba) e 15 chilometri a sud della città di Aqaba, che corre lungo il Costa del Golfo di Aqaba, Marina Plaza Hotel è la pietra angolare della sua baia più famosa, che offre una vista mozzafiato sulle montagne dorate, con un&#039;impressionante collezione di ristoranti e bar attraenti, camere moderne ed eleganti, nonché numerose strutture ricreative. Gli ospiti possono usufruire della connessione Wi-Fi gratuita disponibile nelle aree pubbliche.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situato lungo la costa del Mar Rosso, questo hotel a 4 stelle offre camere moderne con aria condizionata e TV satellitare. I servizi includono il Tala Bay Beach Club e le piscine all&#039;aperto. Tutte le camere del Marina Plaza Hotel Tala Bay sono dotate di balcone privato. Alcune camere hanno una vista limitata sul mare, mentre altre offrono una vista sulla piscina o sulle montagne di Aqaba.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La spa Marina Plaza offre una varietà di trattamenti di bellezza e benessere, specializzati in trattamenti del Mar Morto. L&#039;hotel offre anche attività quotidiane come aerobica in acqua e yoga e altre attività per bambini.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il ristorante principale del Marina Plaza, Solero, serve piatti internazionali e regionali. Gli ospiti possono gustare tè e caffè locali, musica dal vivo e un narghilè a bordo piscina.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Aqaba/4 Star/Marina PLaza.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3475.6286774909177!2d34.97891301460478!3d29.41041675519976!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500704637bab1f7:0x3abcf0c43c596aaa!2sMarina Plaza Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568645106418!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 747, 'it', '', 'one col', 'marina-plaza-hotel-tala-bay'),
(752, 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Wadi Musa, Crowne Plaza Resort Petra is minutes from Petra Visitor Center and Street of Facades. This 5-star hotel is within close proximity of Obelisk Tomb and Wadi Musa Crusader Castle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Immerse yourself in Petra&#039;s ancient landscape from the moment you arrive at the Crowne Plaza Resort Petra, with its backdrop of the Petra Mountains. The bright Lobby has floor-to-ceiling windows so the mountain views flood in, while the terrace and outdoor pool will rejuvenate you. Many of the welcoming rooms have mountain views and the chalets nestle up to the rockface.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Queen Alia International Airport is 2.5 hours away by car, while the coast at Aqaba is within 1.5 hours. Wadi Musa Desert is a short drive away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;After sightseeing, watch the sun set on Petra&#039;s Mountains from the outdoor pool or play a game of doubles on our tennis court. Dine from the Olive Tree Restaurant&#039;s buffet, best enjoyed on the outdoor terrace by the fabulous scenery. You can try international favorites such as Caesar salad or penne arrabbiata from the a la carte menu at Aretas Restaurant.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/crowne-plaza-resort-petra- copy.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1721.93678216114!2d35.46441865795354!3d30.326113995445187!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzDCsDE5JzM0LjAiTiAzNcKwMjcnNTUuOSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568647759267!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 752, 'en', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-resort-petra');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(753, 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Wadi Musa, Crowne Plaza Resort Petra is minutes from Petra Visitor Center and Street of Facades. This 5-star hotel is within close proximity of Obelisk Tomb and Wadi Musa Crusader Castle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Immerse yourself in Petra&#039;s ancient landscape from the moment you arrive at the Crowne Plaza Resort Petra, with its backdrop of the Petra Mountains. The bright Lobby has floor-to-ceiling windows so the mountain views flood in, while the terrace and outdoor pool will rejuvenate you. Many of the welcoming rooms have mountain views and the chalets nestle up to the rockface.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Amman Queen Alia International Airport is 2.5 hours away by car, while the coast at Aqaba is within 1.5 hours. Wadi Musa Desert is a short drive away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;After sightseeing, watch the sun set on Petra&#039;s Mountains from the outdoor pool or play a game of doubles on our tennis court. Dine from the Olive Tree Restaurant&#039;s buffet, best enjoyed on the outdoor terrace by the fabulous scenery. You can try international favorites such as Caesar salad or penne arrabbiata from the a la carte menu at Aretas Restaurant.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/crowne-plaza-resort-petra- copy.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1721.93678216114!2d35.46441865795354!3d30.326113995445187!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzDCsDE5JzM0LjAiTiAzNcKwMjcnNTUuOSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568647759267!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 752, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-resort-petra'),
(754, 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Crowne Plaza Resort Petra, en Wadi Musa, se sitúa a pocos minutos de Centro de visitantes de Petra y Calle de las fachadas. Este hotel de 5 estrellas se encuentra muy cerca de Tumba del Obelisco y Castillo de las Cruzado de Wadi Musa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sumérjase en el antiguo paisaje de Petra desde el momento en que llega al Crowne Plaza Resort Petra, con el telón de fondo de las montañas de Petra. El luminoso vestíbulo tiene ventanas de piso a techo para que las vistas a la montaña le inunden, mientras que la terraza y piscina al aire libre lo rejuvenecerán. Muchas de las acogedoras habitaciones tienen vistas a la montaña y los chalets se encuentran en la roca.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El aeropuerto internacional Amman Queen Alia está a 2,5 horas en coche, mientras que la costa de Aqaba está a 1,5 horas. El desierto de Wadi Musa está a poca distancia en coche.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Después de los lugares de interes, puede ver la puesta de sol en las montañas de Petra desde la piscina al aire libre o jugar un partido de dobles en nuestra cancha de tenis. Cene en el buffet del restaurante Olive Tree, que se disfruta mejor en la terraza al aire libre junto al fabuloso paisaje. Puede probar los favoritos internacionales como la ensalada César o la penne arrabbiata del menú a la carta en el restaurante Aretas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/crowne-plaza-resort-petra- copy.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1721.93678216114!2d35.46441865795354!3d30.326113995445187!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzDCsDE5JzM0LjAiTiAzNcKwMjcnNTUuOSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568647759267!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 752, 'es', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-resort-petra'),
(755, 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Crowne Plaza Resort Petra de Wadi Musa se trouve à quelques minutes du centre des visiteurs de Petra et de Facade Street. Cet hôtel 5 étoiles se trouve tout près de Tombeau de l&#039;obélisque et Château des croisés de Wadi Musa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Immergez-vous dans le paysage ancien de Petra dès votre arrivée au Crowne Plaza Resort Petra, dans le contexte des montagnes de Petra. Le hall lumineux est doté de baies vitrées vous permettant de profiter pleinement de la vue sur la montagne, tandis que la terrasse et la piscine extérieure vous rajeuniront. La plupart des chambres confortables offrent une vue sur la montagne et les chalets sont situés sur le rocher.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;aéroport international Amman Queen Alia est à 2 heures et demie en voiture, tandis que la côte d&#039;Aqaba est à une heure et demie. Le désert de Wadi Musa se trouve à quelques minutes de route.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Après la visite, vous pourrez regarder le coucher de soleil dans les montagnes de Petra depuis la piscine extérieure ou faire une partie de double sur notre court de tennis. Dînez au buffet du restaurant Olive Tree, que vous pourrez savourer sur la terrasse extérieure à côté du fabuleux paysage. Vous pouvez essayer des plats internationaux comme la salade César ou la penne arrabbiata dans le menu à la carte du restaurant Aretas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/crowne-plaza-resort-petra- copy.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1721.93678216114!2d35.46441865795354!3d30.326113995445187!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzDCsDE5JzM0LjAiTiAzNcKwMjcnNTUuOSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568647759267!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 752, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-resort-petra'),
(756, 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', 'Crowne Plaza Resort Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Crowne Plaza Resort Petra a Wadi Musa è a pochi minuti da Petra Visitor Centre e Facade Street. Questo hotel 5 stelle si trova vicino ai seguenti luoghi d&#039;interesse: Tomba dell&#039;obelisco e Castello crociato di Wadi Musa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Immergiti nell&#039;antico paesaggio di Petra dal momento in cui arrivi al Crowne Plaza Resort Petra, sullo sfondo delle montagne di Petra. La luminosa hall ha finestre dal pavimento al soffitto in modo che la vista sulle montagne vi inondi, mentre la terrazza e la piscina all&#039;aperto vi ringiovaniranno. Molte delle accoglienti camere hanno vista sulle montagne e gli chalet si trovano sulla roccia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;aeroporto internazionale Amman Queen Alia è raggiungibile in 2,5 ore in auto, mentre la costa di Aqaba è raggiungibile in 1,5 ore. Il deserto del Wadi Musa è facilmente raggiungibile in auto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dopo le attrazioni, puoi guardare il tramonto sulle montagne di Petra dalla piscina all&#039;aperto o giocare una partita di doppio sul nostro campo da tennis. Cenate al buffet del ristorante Olive Tree, da gustare sulla terrazza all&#039;aperto accanto al favoloso paesaggio. Puoi provare piatti internazionali come l&#039;insalata Caesar o le penne arrabbiate dal menu à la carte del ristorante Aretas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/crowne-plaza-resort-petra- copy.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1721.93678216114!2d35.46441865795354!3d30.326113995445187!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzDCsDE5JzM0LjAiTiAzNcKwMjcnNTUuOSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1568647759267!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 752, 'it', '', 'one col', 'crowne-plaza-resort-petra'),
(757, 'Hotels in Petra', 'Hotels in Petra', 'Hotels in Petra', 'Hotels in Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick nabatean castle.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Mövenpick Nabatean Castle Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Renovated in 2018, explore the magnificent Red Rose City of Petra from an elevated fortress-style hotel...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/mövenpick-nabatean-castle-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/5 Star/movenpick resort2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Mövenpick Resort Petra&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Mövenpick Resort Petra&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Mövenpick Resort Petra is located directly at the entrance to the historic Jordanian city of Petra...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/mövenpick-resort-petra/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;wh