-text &quot;&gt; Dana Guest House&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Dana Guest House, situado en Dana, ofrece conexión Wi-Fi gratuita en las zonas comunes. Incluye una amplia terraza y un.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/dana-guest-house/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/rummanacamp.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Rummana Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Rummana Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;El Rummana Campsite, situado en Dana, a 34 km del castillo de Shobak, ofrece un restaurante y vistas a la montaña...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/rummana-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Al Nawatef.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Al Nawatef Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Al Nawatef Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Ubicado a 5 km del pueblo de Dana, Al Nawatef Camp es un campamento ecológico que ofrece a los huéspedes una experiencia beduina...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/al-nawatef-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Wadi Dana eco camp.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Wadi Dana Eco-camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Wadi Dana Eco-camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;El campamento Wadi Dana Eco-camp está trabajando para alcanzar el estatus ecológico. Se compone de 4 chalets dobles (en suite)...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/wadi-dana-eco-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/ein lahda camp site.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ein Lahda Camp-site&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Ein Lahda Camp-site&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;El Ein Lahda Camp-site se encuentra en Dana y ofrece una terraza. El establecimiento, situado a 33 km del castillo de Shobak...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/ein-lahda-camp-site/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1053, 'es', '', 'one col', 'hoteles-y-campamentos-en-dana'),
(1062, 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dana Hotel was the first hotel in Jordan run by the local community, and was Dana Cooperative’s first tourism venture. It is in the heart of the 15th century, Ottoman village of Dana which is under restoration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Double, triple, quad and family rooms are available with en-suite or shared facilities. All rooms are the restored, village homes of the people of Dana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The rooms are clean and comfortable; they are popular with guests on a tight budget.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There are several public areas such as: large Bedouin tent for dining and socializing, and a second tent for guests who prefer a quieter environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.5341521531795!2d35.60802051463561!3d30.675243895453107!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f58beafacf:0xdf1b4d437a1897d0!2sDana Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570523165011!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1062, 'en', '', 'one col', 'dana-hotel'),
(1063, 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dana Hotel was the first hotel in Jordan run by the local community, and was Dana Cooperative’s first tourism venture. It is in the heart of the 15th century, Ottoman village of Dana which is under restoration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Double, triple, quad and family rooms are available with en-suite or shared facilities. All rooms are the restored, village homes of the people of Dana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The rooms are clean and comfortable; they are popular with guests on a tight budget.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There are several public areas such as: large Bedouin tent for dining and socializing, and a second tent for guests who prefer a quieter environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.5341521531795!2d35.60802051463561!3d30.675243895453107!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f58beafacf:0xdf1b4d437a1897d0!2sDana Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570523165011!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1062, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'dana-hotel'),
(1064, 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dana Hotel fue el primer hotel en Jordania dirigido por la comunidad local, y fue la primera aventura turística de Dana Cooperative. Está en el corazón del siglo 15, el pueblo otomano de Dana, que está en restauración.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones dobles, triples, cuádruples y familiares están disponibles con baño privado o compartido. Todas las habitaciones son las casas de pueblo restauradas de la gente de Dana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones son limpias y cómodas; Son populares entre los huéspedes con un presupuesto ajustado.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hay varias áreas públicas como: una gran carpa beduina para cenar y socializar, y una segunda carpa para los huéspedes que prefieren un ambiente más tranquilo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.5341521531795!2d35.60802051463561!3d30.675243895453107!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f58beafacf:0xdf1b4d437a1897d0!2sDana Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570523165011!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1062, 'es', '', 'one col', 'dana-hotel'),
(1065, 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Dana Hotel a été le premier hôtel en Jordanie géré par la communauté locale et la première aventure touristique de la coopérative Dana. C&#039;est au coeur du 15ème siècle, la ville ottomane de Dana, qui est en cours de restauration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres doubles, triples, quadruples et familiales sont disponibles avec une salle de bain privée ou commune. Toutes les chambres sont les maisons de village restaurées du peuple de Dana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres sont propres et confortables. Ils sont populaires auprès des clients sur un budget serré.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il existe plusieurs espaces publics tels qu&#039;une grande tente bédouine pour les dîners et les rencontres, et une seconde tente pour les clients qui préfèrent un environnement plus calme.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.5341521531795!2d35.60802051463561!3d30.675243895453107!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f58beafacf:0xdf1b4d437a1897d0!2sDana Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570523165011!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1062, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'dana-hotel'),
(1066, 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', 'Dana Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dana Hotel è stato il primo hotel in Giordania gestito dalla comunità locale ed è stata la prima avventura turistica della Cooperativa Dana. È nel cuore del 15 ° secolo, la città ottomana di Dana, che è in fase di restauro.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sono disponibili camere doppie, triple, quadruple e familiari con bagno privato o in comune. Tutte le camere sono le case del villaggio restaurate del popolo di Dana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camere sono pulite e confortevoli; Sono popolari tra gli ospiti con un budget limitato.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ci sono diverse aree pubbliche come: una grande tenda beduina per cena e socializzazione e una seconda tenda per gli ospiti che preferiscono un ambiente più tranquillo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.5341521531795!2d35.60802051463561!3d30.675243895453107!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f58beafacf:0xdf1b4d437a1897d0!2sDana Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570523165011!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1062, 'it', '', 'one col', 'dana-hotel'),
(1067, 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This hotel consist of 20 traditional rooms, the rooms were given names like honey moon room, the cave room, the sunset royal, the meditation room and many others.  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is their goal to make you feel as comfortable and relaxed as possible while you stay in the Dana Tower Hotel. You can contact any member of the staff at any time as they should there be to make your stay more pleasant.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They have an oriental restaurant which provides all Jordanian cuisine (ancient and modern). Or if you prefer they can provide the visitors with tents and mobile kitchen for camping outside the hotel in the mountains, valleys and deserts.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They also offer free transportation from the hotel to the main road in Qadisya to catch the buses, free internet connection Wi-Fi and laundry.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/tower-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.52217627311!2d35.607218014635606!3d30.67558099543688!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e85f5097d767:0xd4c79a86b6ef8167!2sDana Tower Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570523975992!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1067, 'en', '', 'one col', 'dana-tower-hotel'),
(1068, 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This hotel consist of 20 traditional rooms, the rooms were given names like honey moon room, the cave room, the sunset royal, the meditation room and many others.  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is their goal to make you feel as comfortable and relaxed as possible while you stay in the Dana Tower Hotel. You can contact any member of the staff at any time as they should there be to make your stay more pleasant.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They have an oriental restaurant which provides all Jordanian cuisine (ancient and modern). Or if you prefer they can provide the visitors with tents and mobile kitchen for camping outside the hotel in the mountains, valleys and deserts.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They also offer free transportation from the hotel to the main road in Qadisya to catch the buses, free internet connection Wi-Fi and laundry.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/tower-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.52217627311!2d35.607218014635606!3d30.67558099543688!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e85f5097d767:0xd4c79a86b6ef8167!2sDana Tower Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570523975992!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1067, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'dana-tower-hotel'),
(1069, 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este hotel consta de 20 habitaciones tradicionales, las habitaciones recibieron nombres como sala de luna de miel, la sala de la cueva, la puesta de sol real, la sala de meditación y muchos otros.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Su objetivo es hacer que se sienta lo más cómodo y relajado posible mientras se hospeda en el Dana Tower Hotel. Puede ponerse en contacto con cualquier miembro del personal en cualquier momento, como debería ser, para que su estadía sea más placentera.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tienen un restaurante oriental que ofrece toda la cocina jordana (antigua y moderna). O si lo prefiere, pueden proporcionar a los visitantes tiendas de campaña y cocina móvil para acampar fuera del hotel en las montañas, valles y desiertos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ellos también ofrecen transporte gratuito desde el hotel hasta la carretera principal de Qadisya para tomar los autobuses, conexión gratuita a internet, Wi-Fi y lavandería.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/tower-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.52217627311!2d35.607218014635606!3d30.67558099543688!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e85f5097d767:0xd4c79a86b6ef8167!2sDana Tower Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570523975992!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1067, 'es', '', 'one col', 'dana-tower-hotel'),
(1070, 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel se compose de 20 chambres traditionnelles, les chambres ont reçu des noms tels que chambre de lune de miel, chambre de la grotte, coucher de soleil royal, salle de méditation et bien d&#039;autres.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Votre objectif est de vous faire sentir aussi à l&#039;aise et détendu que possible pendant votre séjour à l&#039;hôtel Dana Tower. Vous pouvez contacter n&#039;importe quel membre du personnel à tout moment, comme il se doit, pour rendre votre séjour plus agréable.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ils ont un restaurant oriental qui propose toute la cuisine jordanienne (ancienne et moderne). Ou, si vous préférez, vous pouvez fournir aux visiteurs tentes et cuisine mobile pour camper devant l&#039;hôtel dans les montagnes, les vallées et les déserts.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ils offrent également le transport gratuit de l&#039;hôtel à la route principale de Qadisya pour prendre les bus, la connexion Internet gratuite, le Wi-Fi et la blanchisserie.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/tower-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.52217627311!2d35.607218014635606!3d30.67558099543688!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e85f5097d767:0xd4c79a86b6ef8167!2sDana Tower Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570523975992!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1067, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'dana-tower-hotel'),
(1071, 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', 'Dana Tower Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo hotel è composto da 20 camere tradizionali, le camere hanno ricevuto nomi come camera luna di miele, camera grotta, tramonto reale, sala meditazione e molti altri.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il tuo obiettivo è farti sentire il più a tuo agio e rilassato possibile durante il tuo soggiorno presso il Dana Tower Hotel. Puoi contattare qualsiasi membro dello staff in qualsiasi momento, come dovrebbe essere, per rendere il tuo soggiorno più piacevole.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hanno un ristorante orientale che offre tutta la cucina giordana (antica e moderna). Oppure, se preferisci, puoi fornire ai visitatori tende e cucina mobile per campeggiare fuori dall&#039;hotel in montagna, vallate e deserti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Offrono anche il trasporto gratuito dall&#039;hotel alla strada principale di Qadisya per prendere autobus, connessione internet gratuita, Wi-Fi e lavanderia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/tower-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.52217627311!2d35.607218014635606!3d30.67558099543688!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e85f5097d767:0xd4c79a86b6ef8167!2sDana Tower Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570523975992!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1067, 'it', '', 'one col', 'dana-tower-hotel'),
(1072, 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Dana Village, Dana Moon Hotel offers simply furnished accommodation. It features a 24-hour front desk and a restaurant that offers a 24-hour room service.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All units are fitted with tiled and carpeted floors, A shower is fitted in the bathroom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This hotel offers a traditional restaurant with special diet menus, free high speed internet Wi-Fi, rooftop terrace.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Shobak Castle is 20 km from Dana Moon Hotel. Queen Alia International Airport is 160 km away. Free private parking is possible on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Moon Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.5501529656954!2d35.6081787146357!3d30.674793495474717!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503c03d61ccd53b:0x9b34a299a8f6ea40!2sDana Moon Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570524642379!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1072, 'en', '', 'one col', 'dana-moon-hotel'),
(1073, 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Dana Village, Dana Moon Hotel offers simply furnished accommodation. It features a 24-hour front desk and a restaurant that offers a 24-hour room service.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All units are fitted with tiled and carpeted floors, A shower is fitted in the bathroom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This hotel offers a traditional restaurant with special diet menus, free high speed internet Wi-Fi, rooftop terrace.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Shobak Castle is 20 km from Dana Moon Hotel. Queen Alia International Airport is 160 km away. Free private parking is possible on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Moon Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.5501529656954!2d35.6081787146357!3d30.674793495474717!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503c03d61ccd53b:0x9b34a299a8f6ea40!2sDana Moon Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570524642379!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1072, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'dana-moon-hotel'),
(1074, 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Dana Moon Hotel, situado en Dana Village, ofrece alojamiento con muebles sencillos. Cuenta con recepción las 24 horas y un restaurante que ofrece servicio de habitaciones las 24 horas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todos los alojamientos están equipados con suelo de baldosa y moqueta. El baño dispone de ducha.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este hotel ofrece un restaurante tradicional con menús dietéticos especiales, conexión gratuita a internet de alta velocidad, terraza en la azotea.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El castillo de Shobak se encuentra a 20 km del Dana Moon Hotel. El aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia está a 160 km. El establecimiento dispone de aparcamiento privado gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Moon Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.5501529656954!2d35.6081787146357!3d30.674793495474717!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503c03d61ccd53b:0x9b34a299a8f6ea40!2sDana Moon Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570524642379!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1072, 'es', '', 'one col', 'dana-moon-hotel'),
(1075, 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situé dans le village de Dana, le Dana Moon Hotel propose un hébergement avec un mobilier simple. Il dispose d&#039;une réception ouverte 24h / 24 et d&#039;un restaurant proposant un service d&#039;étage 24h / 24.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les unités sont équipées de carrelage et de moquette. La salle de bain a une douche.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel propose un restaurant traditionnel avec des menus diététiques spéciaux, une connexion Internet haut débit gratuite, un toit-terrasse.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le château de Shobak se trouve à 20 km du Dana Moon Hotel. L&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia est à 160 km. L&#039;établissement propose un parking privé gratuit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Moon Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.5501529656954!2d35.6081787146357!3d30.674793495474717!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503c03d61ccd53b:0x9b34a299a8f6ea40!2sDana Moon Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570524642379!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1072, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'dana-moon-hotel');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1076, 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', 'Dana Moon Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situato nel villaggio di Dana, il Dana Moon Hotel offre sistemazioni con mobili semplici. Dispone di una reception aperta 24 ore su 24 e di un ristorante che offre il servizio in camera 24 ore su 24.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le unità sono dotate di pavimenti piastrellati e moquette. Il bagno ha una doccia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo hotel offre un ristorante tradizionale con menu dietetici speciali, connessione internet ad alta velocità gratuita, terrazza panoramica.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il castello di Shobak si trova a 20 km dal Dana Moon Hotel. L&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia dista 160 km. La struttura offre un parcheggio privato gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Moon Hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.5501529656954!2d35.6081787146357!3d30.674793495474717!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503c03d61ccd53b:0x9b34a299a8f6ea40!2sDana Moon Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570524642379!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1072, 'it', '', 'one col', 'dana-moon-hotel'),
(1077, 'Hotels and Camps in Dana', 'Hotels and Camps in Dana', 'Hotels and Camps in Dana', 'Hotels and Camps in Dana', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Feynan.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Feynan Ecolodge&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Feynan Ecolodge&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Deep in the heart of the mountainous Dana Biosphere Reserve, an idyllic candle-lit lodge rests in the magnificent Wadi Feynan...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/feynan-ecolodge/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana-hotel.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Dana Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Dana Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dana Hotel was the first hotel in Jordan run by the local community, and was Dana Cooperative’s first tourism venture. It is in the heart.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/dana-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/tower-hotel.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Dana Tower Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Dana Tower Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This hotel consist of 20 traditional rooms, the rooms were given names like honey moon room, the cave room, the sunset royal, the.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/dana-tower-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Moon Hotel.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Dana Moon Hotel &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Dana Moon Hotel &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Dana Village, Dana Moon Hotel offers simply furnished accommodation. It features a 24-hour front desk.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/dana-moon-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Castle.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Dana Castle Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Dana Castle Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Set 12 miles from Montreal in Dana, Dana Castle Hotel features storage for belongings and a car parking. Dana Castle Hotel&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/dana-castle-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana panorama.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Dana Panorama Hotel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Dana Panorama Hotel&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Featuring views over the castle, Dana Panorama Hotel is located 11 miles from Shobak Castle and Dana Biosphere Reserve is less.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/dana-panorama-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana guesthouse.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Dana Guest House&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Dana Guest House&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Dana, Dana Guest House offers free Wi-Fi in public areas. It includes a spacious terrace and a restaurant. Free private.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/dana-guest-house/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/rummanacamp.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Rummana Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Rummana Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Dana, 34 km from Shobak Castle, Rummana Campsite provides a restaurant and mountain views.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/rummana-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Al Nawatef.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Al Nawatef Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Al Nawatef Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located 5 km away from the village of Dana, Al Nawatef Camp is an eco-friendly camp that offers guests a traditional Bedouin.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/al-nawatef-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Wadi Dana eco camp.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Wadi Dana Eco-camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Wadi Dana Eco-camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Dana Eco-camp is working towards eco-status. It comprises 4 double chalets (en-suite) &amp;amp; 9 tents each sleeping one or two.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/wadi-dana-eco-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/ein lahda camp site.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ein Lahda Camp-site&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Ein Lahda Camp-site&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ein Lahda Camp-site is set in Dana and offers a terrace. Situated 33 km from Shobak Castle, the property features barbecue facilities and free.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/ein-lahda-camp-site/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1053, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'hotels-and-camps-in-dana'),
(1078, 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Set 12 miles from Montreal in Dana, Dana Castle Hotel features storage for belongings and a car parking. Dana Castle Hotel comprises of 8 rooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rooms feature LCD TV set, a dining area and a closet, also offering shared bathrooms. Every room is fitted with a shower and towels.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In addition, airport shuttles, room service and grocery delivery service are available. Guests of Dana Castle Hotel will be able to enjoy hiking and horse riding.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wireless internet is available in the hotel rooms for free.  Little Petra Triclinium is nearly 23 miles from the venue. The center of Dana is about a 10-minute walk away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Castle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.549826452152!2d35.60817871447273!3d30.67480268642345!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f5c9d6f561:0xcbab357e84b8a976!2sDana Castle Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570528519731!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1078, 'en', '', 'one col', 'dana-castle-hotel'),
(1079, 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Set 12 miles from Montreal in Dana, Dana Castle Hotel features storage for belongings and a car parking. Dana Castle Hotel comprises of 8 rooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rooms feature LCD TV set, a dining area and a closet, also offering shared bathrooms. Every room is fitted with a shower and towels.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In addition, airport shuttles, room service and grocery delivery service are available. Guests of Dana Castle Hotel will be able to enjoy hiking and horse riding.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wireless internet is available in the hotel rooms for free.  Little Petra Triclinium is nearly 23 miles from the venue. The center of Dana is about a 10-minute walk away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Castle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.549826452152!2d35.60817871447273!3d30.67480268642345!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f5c9d6f561:0xcbab357e84b8a976!2sDana Castle Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570528519731!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1078, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'dana-castle-hotel'),
(1080, 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Dana Castle Hotel se encuentra a 20 km de Montreal, en Dana, y ofrece almacenamiento de sus pertenencias y aparcamiento. Dana Castle Hotel consta de 8 habitaciones.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones cuentan con televisor LCD, un comedor y un armario, que también ofrecen baños compartidos. Cada habitación está equipada con una ducha y toallas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Además, hay servicio de transporte al aeropuerto, servicio de habitaciones y servicio de entrega de comestibles. Los huéspedes del Dana Castle Hotel podrán practicar senderismo y equitación.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Internet Wi-Fi disponible en las habitaciones del hotel de forma gratuita. Little Petra Triclinium está a casi 37 km del lugar. El centro de Dana está a unos 10 minutos a pie.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Castle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.549826452152!2d35.60817871447273!3d30.67480268642345!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f5c9d6f561:0xcbab357e84b8a976!2sDana Castle Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570528519731!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1078, 'es', '', 'one col', 'dana-castle-hotel'),
(1081, 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Dana Castle Hotel est situé à 20 km de Montréal, à Dana, et propose le stockage de vos biens et un parking. L&#039;hôtel Dana Castle possède 8 chambres.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres disposent d&#039;une télévision à écran LCD, d&#039;une salle à manger et d&#039;un placard, ainsi que de salles de bains communes. Chaque chambre est équipée d&#039;une douche et de serviettes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un service de navette aéroport, un service de chambre et un service de livraison de courses sont également disponibles. Lors de votre séjour au Dana Castle Hotel, vous pourrez faire de la randonnée et de l&#039;équitation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Internet Wi-Fi disponible dans les chambres d&#039;hôtel gratuitement. Little Petra Triclinium est à près de 37 km de la place. Le centre de Dana est à environ 10 minutes à pied.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Castle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.549826452152!2d35.60817871447273!3d30.67480268642345!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f5c9d6f561:0xcbab357e84b8a976!2sDana Castle Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570528519731!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1078, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'dana-castle-hotel'),
(1082, 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', 'Dana Castle Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Dana Castle Hotel si trova a 20 km da Montreal, a Dana, e offre un deposito bagagli e un parcheggio. Dana Castle Hotel ha 8 camere.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camere dispongono di TV LCD, sala da pranzo e armadio, che offrono anche bagni in comune. Ogni camera è dotata di doccia e asciugamani.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Inoltre, è disponibile un servizio navetta per l&#039;aeroporto, il servizio in camera e il servizio di consegna di generi alimentari. Gli ospiti del Dana Castle Hotel possono fare escursioni e passeggiate a cavallo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Internet Wi-Fi disponibile nelle camere d&#039;albergo gratuitamente. Little Petra Triclinium è a quasi 37 km dal luogo. Il centro di Dana dista circa 10 minuti a piedi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Dana Castle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.549826452152!2d35.60817871447273!3d30.67480268642345!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f5c9d6f561:0xcbab357e84b8a976!2sDana Castle Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570528519731!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1078, 'it', '', 'one col', 'dana-castle-hotel'),
(1083, 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Featuring views over the castle, Dana Panorama Hotel is located 11 miles from Shobak Castle and Dana Biosphere Reserve is less than 8 miles away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All guest rooms are equipped with a seating area, panoramic windows and a bay window.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Buffet breakfasts are available upon request. Wireless internet is available in public areas for free. Private parking is possible on site for free. This hotel has 8 rooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana panorama.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.636338262914!2d35.61112!3d30.6723674!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e9df3e1ab0bb:0xcbb6320236192471!2sDana panorama hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570531003280!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1083, 'en', '', 'one col', 'dana-panorama-hotel'),
(1084, 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Featuring views over the castle, Dana Panorama Hotel is located 11 miles from Shobak Castle and Dana Biosphere Reserve is less than 8 miles away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All guest rooms are equipped with a seating area, panoramic windows and a bay window.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Buffet breakfasts are available upon request. Wireless internet is available in public areas for free. Private parking is possible on site for free. This hotel has 8 rooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana panorama.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.636338262914!2d35.61112!3d30.6723674!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e9df3e1ab0bb:0xcbb6320236192471!2sDana panorama hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570531003280!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1083, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'dana-panorama-hotel'),
(1085, 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Dana Panorama Hotel ofrece vistas al castillo y se encuentra a 17 km del castillo de Shobak. La Reserva de la Biosfera de Dana está a menos de 13 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones están equipadas con una zona de estar, ventanas panorámicas y un ventanal.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Desayuno buffet disponible bajo petición. Internet Wi-Fi disponible en las zonas públicas de forma gratuita. El establecimiento dispone de aparcamiento privado gratuito. Este hotel cuenta con 8 habitaciones.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana panorama.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.636338262914!2d35.61112!3d30.6723674!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e9df3e1ab0bb:0xcbb6320236192471!2sDana panorama hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570531003280!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1083, 'es', '', 'one col', 'dana-panorama-hotel'),
(1086, 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Dana Panorama Hotel offre une vue sur le château et se trouve à 17 km du château de Shobak. La réserve de biosphère de Dana est à moins de 13 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres sont équipées d&#039;un coin salon, de fenêtres panoramiques et d&#039;une grande fenêtre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petit-déjeuner buffet disponible sur demande. Internet Wi-Fi disponible dans les espaces publics gratuitement. L&#039;établissement propose un parking privé gratuit. Cet hôtel dispose de 8 chambres.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana panorama.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.636338262914!2d35.61112!3d30.6723674!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e9df3e1ab0bb:0xcbb6320236192471!2sDana panorama hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570531003280!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1083, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'dana-panorama-hotel'),
(1087, 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', 'Dana Panorama Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Dana Panorama Hotel offre una vista sul castello e si trova a 17 km dal Castello di Shobak. La Riserva della biosfera di Dana dista meno di 13 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere sono dotate di area salotto, finestre panoramiche e una grande finestra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Colazione a buffet disponibile su richiesta. Internet Wi-Fi disponibile nelle aree pubbliche gratuitamente. La struttura offre un parcheggio privato gratuito. Questo hotel ha 8 camere.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana panorama.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3431.636338262914!2d35.61112!3d30.6723674!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e9df3e1ab0bb:0xcbb6320236192471!2sDana panorama hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570531003280!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1083, 'it', '', 'one col', 'dana-panorama-hotel'),
(1088, 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Dana, Dana Guest House offers free Wi-Fi in public areas. It includes a spacious terrace and a restaurant. Free private parking is possible on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms at Dana Guest House are simply furnished and fitted with carpeted floors. Each one offers a balcony, a wardrobe and an outdoor dining area. It has a shared bathroom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;At Dana Guest House you will find a 24-hour front desk. Other facilities offered at the property include meeting facilities. An array of activities can be enjoyed on site or in the surroundings, including hiking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana guesthouse.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d219684.5381466002!2d35.427776636321404!3d30.646048338559766!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f59261e9e9:0x1f358d0ba5928eef!2sDana Guest House!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570533633264!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1088, 'en', '', 'one col', 'dana-guest-house'),
(1089, 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Dana, Dana Guest House offers free Wi-Fi in public areas. It includes a spacious terrace and a restaurant. Free private parking is possible on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms at Dana Guest House are simply furnished and fitted with carpeted floors. Each one offers a balcony, a wardrobe and an outdoor dining area. It has a shared bathroom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;At Dana Guest House you will find a 24-hour front desk. Other facilities offered at the property include meeting facilities. An array of activities can be enjoyed on site or in the surroundings, including hiking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana guesthouse.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d219684.5381466002!2d35.427776636321404!3d30.646048338559766!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f59261e9e9:0x1f358d0ba5928eef!2sDana Guest House!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570533633264!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1088, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'dana-guest-house'),
(1090, 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Dana Guest House, situado en Dana, ofrece conexión Wi-Fi gratuita en las zonas comunes. Incluye una amplia terraza y un restaurante. El establecimiento dispone de aparcamiento privado gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones del Dana Guest House están amuebladas de forma sencilla y cuentan con suelo de moqueta. Todas disponen de balcón, armario y zona de comedor al aire libre. Dispone de baño compartido.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Dana Guest House alberga una recepción abierta las 24 horas. Otras instalaciones que se ofrecen en la propiedad incluyen salas de reuniones. En el establecimiento o en los alrededores se pueden practicar diversas actividades, como senderismo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana guesthouse.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d219684.5381466002!2d35.427776636321404!3d30.646048338559766!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f59261e9e9:0x1f358d0ba5928eef!2sDana Guest House!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570533633264!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1088, 'es', '', 'one col', 'dana-guest-house'),
(1091, 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Dana Guest House, situé à Dana, propose une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite dans les parties communes. Il comprend une grande terrasse et un restaurant. L&#039;établissement propose un parking privé gratuit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres du Dana Guest House sont meublées simplement et revêtues de moquette. Tous disposent d&#039;un balcon, d&#039;un placard et d&#039;un coin repas extérieur. Il a une salle de bain partagée.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Dana Guest House dispose d&#039;une réception ouverte 24h / 24. Les autres installations proposées sur la propriété comprennent des salles de réunion. Diverses activités, telles que la randonnée, peuvent être pratiquées sur place ou dans les environs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana guesthouse.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d219684.5381466002!2d35.427776636321404!3d30.646048338559766!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f59261e9e9:0x1f358d0ba5928eef!2sDana Guest House!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570533633264!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1088, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'dana-guest-house'),
(1092, 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', 'Dana Guest House', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Dana Guest House, situata a Dana, offre la connessione Wi-Fi gratuita nelle aree comuni. Comprende una grande terrazza e un ristorante. La struttura offre un parcheggio privato gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere della Dana Guest House sono arredate in modo semplice e presentano pavimenti in moquette. Tutte dispongono di balcone, armadio e zona pranzo all&#039;aperto. Ha un bagno in comune.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Dana Guest House dispone di una reception aperta 24 ore al giorno. Altri servizi offerti sulla proprietà includono sale riunioni. Varie attività, come l&#039;escursionismo, possono essere praticate nei locali o nei dintorni.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/dana guesthouse.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d219684.5381466002!2d35.427776636321404!3d30.646048338559766!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f59261e9e9:0x1f358d0ba5928eef!2sDana Guest House!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570533633264!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1088, 'it', '', 'one col', 'dana-guest-house'),
(1093, 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Dana, 34 km from Shobak Castle, Rummana Campsite provides a restaurant and mountain views.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests at the camping can enjoy a buffet or a halal breakfast.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you would like to discover the area, hiking is possible in the surroundings.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Free public parking is possible at a location nearby, reservation is not needed.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/rummanacamp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d54898.66164973745!2d35.508683409782044!3d30.68559526738736!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e823935454fd:0x97507ceeff21360a!2sRumana Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570536857434!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1093, 'en', '', 'one col', 'rummana-camp'),
(1094, 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Dana, 34 km from Shobak Castle, Rummana Campsite provides a restaurant and mountain views.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests at the camping can enjoy a buffet or a halal breakfast.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you would like to discover the area, hiking is possible in the surroundings.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Free public parking is possible at a location nearby, reservation is not needed.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/rummanacamp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d54898.66164973745!2d35.508683409782044!3d30.68559526738736!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e823935454fd:0x97507ceeff21360a!2sRumana Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570536857434!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1093, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'rummana-camp'),
(1095, 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Rummana Campsite, situado en Dana, a 34 km del castillo de Shobak, ofrece un restaurante y vistas a la montaña.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los huéspedes del camping pueden disfrutar de un desayuno buffet o halal.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si desea descubrir la zona, es posible practicar senderismo en los alrededores.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Aparcamiento público gratuito disponible en las inmediaciones, no es necesario reservar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/rummanacamp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d54898.66164973745!2d35.508683409782044!3d30.68559526738736!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e823935454fd:0x97507ceeff21360a!2sRumana Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570536857434!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1093, 'es', '', 'one col', 'rummana-camp'),
(1096, 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situé à Dana, à 34 km du château de Shobak, le Rummana Campsite propose un restaurant et une vue sur la montagne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les campeurs pourront savourer un petit-déjeuner buffet ou halal.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si vous souhaitez découvrir la région, vous pourrez faire de la randonnée dans les environs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un parking public gratuit est disponible à proximité, sans réservation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/rummanacamp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d54898.66164973745!2d35.508683409782044!3d30.68559526738736!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e823935454fd:0x97507ceeff21360a!2sRumana Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570536857434!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1093, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'rummana-camp'),
(1097, 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', 'Rummana Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situato a Dana, a 34 km dal Castello di Shobak, il Rummana Campsite offre un ristorante e la vista sulle montagne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gli ospiti del campeggio possono gustare una colazione a buffet o halal.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se vuoi scoprire la zona, è possibile fare escursioni nei dintorni.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nelle vicinanze è disponibile un parcheggio pubblico gratuito, non è richiesta la prenotazione.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/rummanacamp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d54898.66164973745!2d35.508683409782044!3d30.68559526738736!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e823935454fd:0x97507ceeff21360a!2sRumana Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570536857434!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1093, 'it', '', 'one col', 'rummana-camp'),
(1098, 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located 5 km away from the village of Dana, Al Nawatef Camp is an eco-friendly camp that offers guests a traditional Bedouin experience. It arranges hiking and walking trips upon request.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The rooms at Al Nawatef Camp are decorated with simple furnishings and a shared bathroom. It is fitted with mattresses, pillows and blankets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The restaurant serves a traditional breakfast buffet every morning. Food delivery service is available upon request.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Nawatef Camp is 2 km away from the road of King and 160 km from King Hussein Airport. Souvenirs can be purchased from the small gift shop available on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Al Nawatef.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3433.518185425066!2d35.62425431463419!3d30.619350598140205!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e643847eaaad:0xf4c6e6c205100151!2sAl Nawatef Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570608840576!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1098, 'en', '', 'one col', 'al-nawatef-camp');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1099, 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located 5 km away from the village of Dana, Al Nawatef Camp is an eco-friendly camp that offers guests a traditional Bedouin experience. It arranges hiking and walking trips upon request.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The rooms at Al Nawatef Camp are decorated with simple furnishings and a shared bathroom. It is fitted with mattresses, pillows and blankets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The restaurant serves a traditional breakfast buffet every morning. Food delivery service is available upon request.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Nawatef Camp is 2 km away from the road of King and 160 km from King Hussein Airport. Souvenirs can be purchased from the small gift shop available on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Al Nawatef.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3433.518185425066!2d35.62425431463419!3d30.619350598140205!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e643847eaaad:0xf4c6e6c205100151!2sAl Nawatef Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570608840576!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1098, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'al-nawatef-camp'),
(1100, 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ubicado a 5 km del pueblo de Dana, Al Nawatef Camp es un campamento ecológico que ofrece a los huéspedes una experiencia beduina tradicional. Organiza excursiones de senderismo y senderismo bajo petición.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones del Al Nawatef Camp están decoradas con muebles sencillos y baño compartido. Está equipado con colchones, almohadas y mantas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El restaurante sirve un desayuno bufé tradicional todas las mañanas. El servicio de entrega de alimentos está disponible bajo petición.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El campamento Al Nawatef está a 2 km de la carretera de King y a 160 km del aeropuerto King Hussein. Los recuerdos se pueden comprar en la pequeña tienda de regalos disponible en el sitio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Al Nawatef.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3433.518185425066!2d35.62425431463419!3d30.619350598140205!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e643847eaaad:0xf4c6e6c205100151!2sAl Nawatef Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570608840576!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1098, 'es', '', 'one col', 'al-nawatef-camp'),
(1101, 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ajouter à 5 km de distance de Dana, Al Nawatef Le pays est un camp écologique où il fait bon vivre et vivre une expérience traditionnelle. Organiza excursiones de senderismo et senderismo bajo petición.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres du camp sont décorées avec des meubles et des compartiments. Está equipado con colchones, almohadas y mantas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le restaurant est un desiuno bufé traditionnel à las mañanas. Le service des aliments est disponible dans la plupart des cas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camp Al Nawatef est situé à 2 km de la chaussée du roi et à 160 km de l&#039;aéroport King Hussein. Vous êtes ici pour comprendre ce que vous devez savoir sur le règlement disponible dans notre site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Al Nawatef.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3433.518185425066!2d35.62425431463419!3d30.619350598140205!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e643847eaaad:0xf4c6e6c205100151!2sAl Nawatef Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570608840576!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1098, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'al-nawatef-camp'),
(1102, 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', 'Al Nawatef Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ubicato a 5 km dal pueblo di Dana, Al Nawatef Camp è un campeggio ecológico che spesso riceve una vacanza da sogno tradizionale. Organizzazione di escursioni di senderismo e senderismo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones of Al Nawatef Camp están decoradas with muebles sencillos y baño compartido. Está equipado con colchones, almohadas y mantas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El restaurante sirve un desayuno bufé tradicional todas las mañanas. Il servizio di registrazione degli alimenti è disponibile come petizione.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il campeggio Al Nawatef è a 2 km dalla carretera del re e 160 km dall&#039;aeroporto di Saddam Hussein. I ricordi che si possono comprendere in questo momento tienda dei regali disponibili in sitio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Al Nawatef.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3433.518185425066!2d35.62425431463419!3d30.619350598140205!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e643847eaaad:0xf4c6e6c205100151!2sAl Nawatef Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570608840576!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1098, 'it', '', 'one col', 'al-nawatef-camp'),
(1103, 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Dana Eco-camp is working towards eco-status. It comprises 4 double chalets (en-suite) &amp;amp; 9 tents each sleeping one or two persons and it has shared facilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The camp is &#039;off-grid&#039; &amp;amp; is a joint venture between the local community cooperative (Dana Cooperative) and local farmers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It roosts in a stunning mountain location in southern Jordan overlooking Wadi Dana, Dana Nature Reserve &amp;amp; the ottoman village of Dana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Wadi Dana eco camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2885.566746825151!2d35.60874902730166!3d30.675177634474593!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f917586c79:0x1c58ee10a733f749!2swadi dana eco camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570610447029!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1103, 'en', '', 'one col', 'wadi-dana-eco-camp'),
(1104, 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Dana Eco-camp is working towards eco-status. It comprises 4 double chalets (en-suite) &amp;amp; 9 tents each sleeping one or two persons and it has shared facilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The camp is &#039;off-grid&#039; &amp;amp; is a joint venture between the local community cooperative (Dana Cooperative) and local farmers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It roosts in a stunning mountain location in southern Jordan overlooking Wadi Dana, Dana Nature Reserve &amp;amp; the ottoman village of Dana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Wadi Dana eco camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2885.566746825151!2d35.60874902730166!3d30.675177634474593!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f917586c79:0x1c58ee10a733f749!2swadi dana eco camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570610447029!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1103, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'wadi-dana-eco-camp'),
(1105, 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El campamento Wadi Dana Eco-camp está trabajando para alcanzar el estatus ecológico. Se compone de 4 chalets dobles (en suite) y 9 carpas cada una con capacidad para una o dos personas y las instalaciones son compartidas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El campamento está &#039;fuera de la red&#039; y es una empresa conjunta entre la cooperativa comunitaria local (Dana Cooperative) y los agricultores locales.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se posa en una impresionante ubicación de montaña en el Sur de Jordania con vistas a Wadi Dana, la Reserva Natural de Dana y el pueblo otomano de Dana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Wadi Dana eco camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2885.566746825151!2d35.60874902730166!3d30.675177634474593!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f917586c79:0x1c58ee10a733f749!2swadi dana eco camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570610447029!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1103, 'es', '', 'one col', 'wadi-dana-eco-camp'),
(1106, 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Wadi Dana Eco-camp travaille pour un statut écologique. Il se compose de 4 chalets doubles (avec salle de bains privative) et de 9 tentes pouvant accueillir une ou deux personnes. Les installations sont communes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camp est «hors du réseau» et est une coentreprise entre la coopérative communautaire locale (Coopérative Dana) et les agriculteurs locaux.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il est perché sur une montagne impressionnante du sud de la Jordanie surplombant Wadi Dana, la réserve naturelle de Dana et le village ottoman de Dana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Wadi Dana eco camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2885.566746825151!2d35.60874902730166!3d30.675177634474593!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f917586c79:0x1c58ee10a733f749!2swadi dana eco camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570610447029!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1103, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'wadi-dana-eco-camp'),
(1107, 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', 'Wadi Dana Eco-camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Wadi Dana Eco-camp sta lavorando verso l&#039;eco-status. Si compone di 4 chalet doppi (con bagno) e 9 tende ciascuna con una capacità di una o due persone e le strutture sono condivise.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il campo è &quot;fuori dalla rete&quot; ed è una joint venture tra la cooperativa della comunità locale (Cooperativa Dana) e gli agricoltori locali.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si appollaia su un&#039;imponente posizione montana nel sud della Giordania, che domina Wadi Dana, la Riserva naturale di Dana e il villaggio ottomano di Dana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/Wadi Dana eco camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2885.566746825151!2d35.60874902730166!3d30.675177634474593!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e8f917586c79:0x1c58ee10a733f749!2swadi dana eco camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570610447029!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1103, 'it', '', 'one col', 'wadi-dana-eco-camp'),
(1108, 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ein Lahda Camp-site is set in Dana and offers a terrace. Situated 33 km from Shobak Castle, the property features barbecue facilities and free private parking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It also features a kitchen with a dining area, as well as 6 bathrooms with a shower and free toiletries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The tented camp offers a à la carte or halal breakfast.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/ein lahda camp site.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3056.2285201152654!2d35.58328259962478!3d30.70432506345721!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e9754537cfe9:0xe1b30c7b9771341a!2sein lahda camp site!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570611371728!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1108, 'en', '', 'one col', 'ein-lahda-camp-site'),
(1109, 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ein Lahda Camp-site is set in Dana and offers a terrace. Situated 33 km from Shobak Castle, the property features barbecue facilities and free private parking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It also features a kitchen with a dining area, as well as 6 bathrooms with a shower and free toiletries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The tented camp offers a à la carte or halal breakfast.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/ein lahda camp site.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3056.2285201152654!2d35.58328259962478!3d30.70432506345721!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e9754537cfe9:0xe1b30c7b9771341a!2sein lahda camp site!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570611371728!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1108, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'ein-lahda-camp-site'),
(1110, 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El campamento Ein Lahda Camp-site se encuentra en Dana y ofrece una terraza. El establecimiento, situado a 33 km del castillo de Shobak, cuenta con zona de barbacoa y aparcamiento privado gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;También cuenta con cocina con zona de comedor y 6 baños con ducha y artículos de aseo gratuitos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El campamento de tiendas ofrece un desayuno a la carta o halal.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/ein lahda camp site.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3056.2285201152654!2d35.58328259962478!3d30.70432506345721!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e9754537cfe9:0xe1b30c7b9771341a!2sein lahda camp site!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570611371728!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1108, 'es', '', 'one col', 'ein-lahda-camp-site'),
(1111, 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camping Ein Lahda Camp-site est situé à Dana et dispose d&#039;une terrasse. Situé à 33 km du château de Shobak, cet établissement propose un barbecue et un parking privé gratuit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il comprend également une cuisine avec coin repas et 6 salles de bains avec douche et articles de toilette gratuits.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camp de tentes propose un petit-déjeuner à la carte ou halal.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/ein lahda camp site.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3056.2285201152654!2d35.58328259962478!3d30.70432506345721!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e9754537cfe9:0xe1b30c7b9771341a!2sein lahda camp site!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570611371728!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1108, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'ein-lahda-camp-site'),
(1112, 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', 'Ein Lahda Camp-site', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il campeggio Ein Lahda Camp-site si trova a Dana e offre una terrazza. La struttura, a 33 km dal Castello di Shobak, offre attrezzature per barbecue e un parcheggio privato gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Include anche una cucina con zona pranzo e 6 bagni con doccia e set di cortesia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il campo tendato offre una colazione à la carte o halal.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Dana/ein lahda camp site.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3056.2285201152654!2d35.58328259962478!3d30.70432506345721!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503e9754537cfe9:0xe1b30c7b9771341a!2sein lahda camp site!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570611371728!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1108, 'it', '', 'one col', 'ein-lahda-camp-site'),
(1113, 'Hotels and Camps in Wadi Rum', 'Hotels and Camps in Wadi Rum', 'Hotels and Camps in Wadi Rum', 'Hotels and Camps in Wadi Rum', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sun-city-camp-wadi-rum.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Sun City Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Sun City Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sun City Camp is located in Wadi Rum. It features a coffee shop and a 24-hour front desk. There is à la carte and buffet restaurant; the&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/sun-city-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/memories-aicha-luxury.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Memories Aicha Luxury Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Memories Aicha Luxury Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Memories Aicha Luxury Camp is luxury desert camp in Wadi Rum, is an ideal base for your Arabian Desert adventure and stay, with.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/memories-aicha-luxury-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&q