ot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/bedouin-bivouac-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/7 pillars.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp is located 2.4 km from Jebel Khazali. Rooms like Basic triple room, budget single room, budget double room.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/wadi-rum-7-pillars-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1113, 'en', '', 'one col', 'hotels-and-camps-in-wadi-rum'),
(1114, 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sun City Camp is located in Wadi Rum. It features a coffee shop and a 24-hour front desk.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is à la carte and buffet restaurant; the tents include a dining area and a private entrance. The bathroom is fitted with a bathtub or a shower.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Other facilities offered at the property include a tour desk. An array of activities can be enjoyed on site or in the surroundings, including horse riding and hiking. They also offer evening entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sun-city-camp-wadi-rum.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3467.177897314145!2d35.4801279!3d29.6566117!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e94d677b2665:0x8da3f3ea3e357eda!2sSun City Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570614575917!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1114, 'en', '', 'one col', 'sun-city-camp'),
(1115, 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sun City Camp is located in Wadi Rum. It features a coffee shop and a 24-hour front desk.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is à la carte and buffet restaurant; the tents include a dining area and a private entrance. The bathroom is fitted with a bathtub or a shower.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Other facilities offered at the property include a tour desk. An array of activities can be enjoyed on site or in the surroundings, including horse riding and hiking. They also offer evening entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sun-city-camp-wadi-rum.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3467.177897314145!2d35.4801279!3d29.6566117!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e94d677b2665:0x8da3f3ea3e357eda!2sSun City Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570614575917!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1114, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'sun-city-camp'),
(1116, 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sun City Camp se encuentra en Wadi Rum. Cuenta con una cafetería y servicio de recepción las 24 horas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hay un restaurante a la carta y buffet; Las tiendas incluyen zona de comedor y entrada privada. El baño está equipado con bañera o ducha.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El establecimiento también ofrece mostrador de información turística. En el establecimiento o en los alrededores se pueden practicar diversas actividades, como equitación y senderismo. También ofrecen entretenimiento nocturno.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sun-city-camp-wadi-rum.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3467.177897314145!2d35.4801279!3d29.6566117!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e94d677b2665:0x8da3f3ea3e357eda!2sSun City Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570614575917!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1114, 'es', '', 'one col', 'sun-city-camp'),
(1117, 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Sun City Camp est situé dans le Wadi Rum. Il dispose d&#039;une cafétéria et d&#039;une réception ouverte 24h / 24.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il y a un restaurant à la carte et buffet; Les magasins comprennent un coin repas et une entrée privée. La salle de bain est équipée d&#039;une baignoire ou d&#039;une douche.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;établissement propose également un bureau d&#039;excursions. Diverses activités, telles que l&#039;équitation et la randonnée, peuvent être pratiquées sur place ou dans les environs. Ils offrent également des animations en soirée.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sun-city-camp-wadi-rum.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3467.177897314145!2d35.4801279!3d29.6566117!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e94d677b2665:0x8da3f3ea3e357eda!2sSun City Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570614575917!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1114, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'sun-city-camp'),
(1118, 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', 'Sun City Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sun City Camp si trova a Wadi Rum. Dispone di una caffetteria e di una reception aperta 24 ore al giorno.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;C&#039;è un ristorante à la carte e buffet; I negozi includono una zona pranzo e un ingresso privato. Il bagno è dotato di vasca o doccia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La struttura offre anche un banco escursioni. Varie attività, come l&#039;equitazione e le escursioni, possono essere praticate in loco o nella zona circostante. Offrono anche intrattenimento serale.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sun-city-camp-wadi-rum.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3467.177897314145!2d35.4801279!3d29.6566117!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e94d677b2665:0x8da3f3ea3e357eda!2sSun City Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570614575917!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1114, 'it', '', 'one col', 'sun-city-camp'),
(1119, 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Memories Aicha Luxury Camp is luxury desert camp in Wadi Rum, is an ideal base for your Arabian Desert adventure and stay, with spectacular mountains in the distance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is only a 10-15 minutes’ drive away from Wadi Rum village and Wadi Rum Visitors center. The camp is sprawled across 4 kilometers square.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The camp has 40 luxurious tents await those who seek the ultimate desert adventure. Memories Aicha Luxury Camp has a barbecue, garden and sun terrace.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/memories-aicha-luxury.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3470.982196336446!2d35.43371891447562!3d29.546012782066324!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500930258d7d373:0xbd34129cc3ce84f1!2sMemories Aicha Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570615905867!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 0, 1119, 'en', 'fa-no-icon', 'one col', 'memories-aicha-luxury-camp'),
(1120, 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Memories Aicha Luxury Camp is luxury desert camp in Wadi Rum, is an ideal base for your Arabian Desert adventure and stay, with spectacular mountains in the distance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is only a 10-15 minutes’ drive away from Wadi Rum village and Wadi Rum Visitors center. The camp is sprawled across 4 kilometers square.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The camp has 40 luxurious tents await those who seek the ultimate desert adventure. Memories Aicha Luxury Camp has a barbecue, garden and sun terrace.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/memories-aicha-luxury.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3470.982196336446!2d35.43371891447562!3d29.546012782066324!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500930258d7d373:0xbd34129cc3ce84f1!2sMemories Aicha Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570615905867!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1119, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'memories-aicha-luxury-camp');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1121, 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Memories Aicha Luxury Camp es un campamento desértico de lujo en Wadi Rum, es una base ideal para su aventura y estancia en el desierto de Arabia, con espectaculares montañas en la distancia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Está a solo 10-15 minutos en coche del pueblo de Wadi Rum y del centro de visitantes de Wadi Rum. El campamento se extiende a lo largo de 4 kilómetros cuadrados.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El campamento cuenta con 40 lujosas carpas que esperan a aquellos que buscan la mejor aventura en el desierto. El Memories Aicha Luxury Camp cuenta con barbacoa, jardín y solárium.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/memories-aicha-luxury.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3470.982196336446!2d35.43371891447562!3d29.546012782066324!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500930258d7d373:0xbd34129cc3ce84f1!2sMemories Aicha Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570615905867!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1119, 'es', '', 'one col', 'memories-aicha-luxury-camp'),
(1122, 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Memories Aicha Luxury Camp est un camp de luxe situé dans le désert du Wadi Rum. Il constitue un pied-à-terre idéal pour votre aventure et votre séjour dans le désert d&#039;Arabie, avec des montagnes spectaculaires au loin.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il est à seulement 10-15 minutes en voiture de la ville de Wadi Rum et du centre d&#039;accueil de Wadi Rum. Le camp s&#039;étend sur 4 kilomètres carrés.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camp compte 40 tentes luxueuses qui attendent ceux qui recherchent la meilleure aventure dans le désert. Le Memories Aicha Luxury Camp possède un barbecue, un jardin et un solarium.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/memories-aicha-luxury.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3470.982196336446!2d35.43371891447562!3d29.546012782066324!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500930258d7d373:0xbd34129cc3ce84f1!2sMemories Aicha Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570615905867!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1119, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'memories-aicha-luxury-camp'),
(1123, 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', 'Memories Aicha Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Memories Aicha Luxury Camp è un lussuoso campo nel deserto nel Wadi Rum, una base ideale per la tua avventura e il tuo soggiorno nel deserto arabo, con spettacolari montagne in lontananza.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;È a soli 10-15 minuti di auto dalla città di Wadi Rum e dal centro visitatori di Wadi Rum. Il campo si estende su 4 chilometri quadrati.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il campo ha 40 tende lussuose in attesa di chi cerca la migliore avventura nel deserto. Memories Aicha Luxury Camp dispone di barbecue, giardino e solarium.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/memories-aicha-luxury.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3470.982196336446!2d35.43371891447562!3d29.546012782066324!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500930258d7d373:0xbd34129cc3ce84f1!2sMemories Aicha Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570615905867!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1119, 'it', '', 'one col', 'memories-aicha-luxury-camp'),
(1124, 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hasan Zawaideh Camp is located within 6 km from the Wadi Rum city center, featuring a free car park, a restaurant and allergy friendly rooms, currency exchange, a designated place for smoking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Offering an oriental interior, the rooms come with an in-room safe, Wi-Fi and pay television as well as luxury furnishings. Free toiletries and bath sheets are included in the bathroom. Each bedroom is fitted with hypo-allergenic pillows and feather pillows for all the beds. These rooms also comprise of private bathrooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hasan Zawaideh Camp Villa offers different sport activities such as horse riding and hiking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Hasan Zawaideh2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3467.0605956661657!2d35.48486651461068!3d29.660015943586!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500ec758f8d695b:0x6c5066ca0fd659e8!2sHasan Zawaideh Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570617074182!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1124, 'en', '', 'one col', 'hasan-zawaideh-camp'),
(1125, 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hasan Zawaideh Camp is located within 6 km from the Wadi Rum city center, featuring a free car park, a restaurant and allergy friendly rooms, currency exchange, a designated place for smoking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Offering an oriental interior, the rooms come with an in-room safe, Wi-Fi and pay television as well as luxury furnishings. Free toiletries and bath sheets are included in the bathroom. Each bedroom is fitted with hypo-allergenic pillows and feather pillows for all the beds. These rooms also comprise of private bathrooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hasan Zawaideh Camp Villa offers different sport activities such as horse riding and hiking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Hasan Zawaideh2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3467.0605956661657!2d35.48486651461068!3d29.660015943586!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500ec758f8d695b:0x6c5066ca0fd659e8!2sHasan Zawaideh Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570617074182!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1124, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'hasan-zawaideh-camp'),
(1126, 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Hasan Zawaideh Camp se encuentra a 6 km del centro de la ciudad de Wadi Rum y ofrece aparcamiento gratuito, restaurante y habitaciones aptas para alérgicos, cambio de divisas, un lugar designado para fumar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Con un interior oriental, las habitaciones cuentan con caja de seguridad, Wi-Fi y televisión de pago, así como muebles de lujo. El baño incluye artículos de aseo gratuitos y toallas de baño. Cada habitación está equipada con almohadas hipoalergénicas y almohadas de plumas para todas las camas. Estas habitaciones también incluyen baño privado.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Hasan Zawaideh Camp Villa ofrece diferentes actividades deportivas, como equitación y senderismo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Hasan Zawaideh2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3467.0605956661657!2d35.48486651461068!3d29.660015943586!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500ec758f8d695b:0x6c5066ca0fd659e8!2sHasan Zawaideh Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570617074182!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1124, 'es', '', 'one col', 'hasan-zawaideh-camp'),
(1127, 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Hasan Zawaideh Camp est situé à 6 km du centre-ville de Wadi Rum et propose un parking gratuit, un restaurant et des chambres hypoallergéniques, un service de change de devises et une zone fumeurs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Avec un intérieur oriental, les chambres disposent d&#039;un coffre-fort, d&#039;une connexion Wi-Fi et d&#039;une télévision payante, ainsi que d&#039;un mobilier de luxe. La salle de bains comprend des articles de toilette gratuits et des serviettes de bain. Chaque chambre est équipée d&#039;oreillers hypoallergéniques et d&#039;oreillers en plumes pour tous les lits. Ces chambres comprennent également une salle de bains privative.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Hasan Zawaideh Camp Villa propose différentes activités sportives, telles que l&#039;équitation et la randonnée.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Hasan Zawaideh2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3467.0605956661657!2d35.48486651461068!3d29.660015943586!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500ec758f8d695b:0x6c5066ca0fd659e8!2sHasan Zawaideh Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570617074182!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1124, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'hasan-zawaideh-camp'),
(1128, 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', 'Hasan Zawaideh Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situato a 6 km dal centro della città di Wadi Rum, l&#039;Hasan Zawaideh Camp offre un parcheggio gratuito, un ristorante e camere anallergiche, cambio valuta e un&#039;area fumatori.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Con interni orientali, le camere dispongono di cassaforte, connessione Wi-Fi e pay-TV, nonché mobili di lusso. Il bagno include set di cortesia e asciugamani. Ogni camera è dotata di cuscini ipoallergenici e cuscini in piuma per tutti i letti. Queste camere includono anche un bagno privato.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Hasan Zawaideh Camp Villa offre diverse attività sportive, come l&#039;equitazione e le escursioni.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Hasan Zawaideh2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3467.0605956661657!2d35.48486651461068!3d29.660015943586!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500ec758f8d695b:0x6c5066ca0fd659e8!2sHasan Zawaideh Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570617074182!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1124, 'it', '', 'one col', 'hasan-zawaideh-camp'),
(1129, 'Hotels and Camps in Wadi Rum', 'Hotels and Camps in Wadi Rum', 'Hotels and Camps in Wadi Rum', 'Hotels and Camps in Wadi Rum', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sun-city-camp-wadi-rum.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Sun City Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Sun City Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sun City Camp is located in Wadi Rum. It features a coffee shop and a 24-hour front desk. There is à la carte and buffet restaurant; the&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/sun-city-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/memories-aicha-luxury.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Memories Aicha Luxury Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Memories Aicha Luxury Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Memories Aicha Luxury Camp is luxury desert camp in Wadi Rum, is an ideal base for your Arabian Desert adventure and stay, with.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/memories-aicha-luxury-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&q