amps/Atallahs Camp.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Atallah´s Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Atallah´s Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Atallah&#039;s Camp se encuentra en el desierto de Wadi Rum; ofrece a los huéspedes una experiencia beduina. Cuenta con tiendas de campaña.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/atallahs-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bedouincamp.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp se encuentra dentro del área protegida de Wadi Rum, a solo 6 km de la aldea de Wadi Rum y rodeado.&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;..&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/wadi-rum-bedouin-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/starlight.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Wadi Rum Starlight Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quo