ustify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Il Sand Dunes Camp offre un perfetto alloggio da campo in stile beduino per soggiornare a Wadi Rum. Ci sono 20 camere. ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/sand-dunes-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/aritas.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Aritas Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Aritas Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Aritas Camp Villa è adiacente alla sorgente di Lawrence, Jebel Khazali e Aqaba Fort. Sono inoltre disponibili escursionismo&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/aritas-camp/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bivouac.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Bedouin Bivouac Camp&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt; Bedouin Bivouac Camp&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;Il Bedouin Bivouac Camp si trova nel luogo del tramonto nel cuore dell&#039;area protetta del Wadi Rum. Il campo è pro