(1133, 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel is located in Wadi Rum and has a restaurant and a 24-hour front desk. Complimentary WiFi is provided.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel provides a terrace, with mountain views.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is a private bathroom with bidet and a hairdryer in each unit, along with free toiletries, air conditioning, non smoking rooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/UFO.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3464.9848830638493!2d35.4848082146121!3d29.720197140772786!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e941dc211b63:0xec84e448b82be389!2sWadi Rum UFO Luxotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570693973028!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1133, 'en', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-ufo-luxotel'),
(1134, 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel is located in Wadi Rum and has a restaurant and a 24-hour front desk. Complimentary WiFi is provided.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel provides a terrace, with mountain views.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is a private bathroom with bidet and a hairdryer in each unit, along with free toiletries, air conditioning, non smoking rooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/UFO.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3464.9848830638493!2d35.4848082146121!3d29.720197140772786!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e941dc211b63:0xec84e448b82be389!2sWadi Rum UFO Luxotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570693973028!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1133, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-ufo-luxotel'),
(1135, 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel se encuentra en Wadi Rum y cuenta con un restaurante y servicio de recepción las 24 horas. Se proporciona internet Wi-Fi de cortesía.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel ofrece una terraza con vistas a la montaña.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hay un baño privado con bidet y secador de pelo en cada unidad, junto con artículos de aseo gratuitos, aire acondicionado, habitaciones para no fumadores.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/UFO.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3464.9848830638493!2d35.4848082146121!3d29.720197140772786!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e941dc211b63:0xec84e448b82be389!2sWadi Rum UFO Luxotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570693973028!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1133, 'es', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-ufo-luxotel'),
(1136, 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel situé à Wadi Rum, possède un restaurant et une réception ouverte 24h / 24. Une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite est fournie.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel dispose d&#039;une terrasse avec vue sur la montagne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les salles de bains privatives sont pourvues d&#039;un bidet, d&#039;un sèche-cheveux, d&#039;articles de toilette gratuits, de la climatisation et de chambres non-fumeurs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/UFO.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3464.9848830638493!2d35.4848082146121!3d29.720197140772786!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e941dc211b63:0xec84e448b82be389!2sWadi Rum UFO Luxotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570693973028!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1133, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-ufo-luxotel'),
(1137, 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', 'Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel si trova a Wadi Rum e offre un ristorante e una reception aperta 24 ore al giorno. La connessione internet Wi-Fi è gratuita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Wadi Rum UFO Luxotel offre una terrazza con vista sulle montagne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;C&#039;è un bagno privato con bidet e asciugacapelli in ogni unità, articoli da toeletta gratuiti, aria condizionata, camere per non fumatori.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/UFO.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3464.9848830638493!2d35.4848082146121!3d29.720197140772786!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e941dc211b63:0xec84e448b82be389!2sWadi Rum UFO Luxotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570693973028!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1133, 'it', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-ufo-luxotel'),
(1138, 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Atallah&#039;s Camp is located in the Wadi Rum Desert; it offers guests a Bedouin experience. It has traditionally furnished tents with shared bathrooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Free transfers from the Wadi Rum Visitors Centre which is 12 km away and free desert tours are included.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can enjoy a traditional breakfast in the main tent. Dinner is served on request. Drinking water, tea, and coffee is available throughout the day.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In the evening, guests can sit around the campfire with a drink.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Atallahs Camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3472.8288008862755!2d35.39699881460669!3d29.492192151404307!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500939441411831:0x6e5137d842d96ae8!2sAtallah&#039;s Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570696829803!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1138, 'en', '', 'one col', 'atallahs-camp'),
(1139, 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Atallah&#039;s Camp is located in the Wadi Rum Desert; it offers guests a Bedouin experience. It has traditionally furnished tents with shared bathrooms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Free transfers from the Wadi Rum Visitors Centre which is 12 km away and free desert tours are included.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can enjoy a traditional breakfast in the main tent. Dinner is served on request. Drinking water, tea, and coffee is available throughout the day.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In the evening, guests can sit around the campfire with a drink.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Atallahs Camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3472.8288008862755!2d35.39699881460669!3d29.492192151404307!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500939441411831:0x6e5137d842d96ae8!2sAtallah&#039;s Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570696829803!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1138, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'atallahs-camp'),
(1140, 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Atallah&#039;s Camp se encuentra en el desierto de Wadi Rum; ofrece a los huéspedes una experiencia beduina. Cuenta con tiendas de campaña tradicionalmente amuebladas y baños compartidos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se incluyen traslados gratuitos desde el Centro de visitantes de Wadi Rum, que está a 12 km, y recorridos gratuitos por el desierto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los huéspedes pueden disfrutar de un desayuno tradicional en la tienda principal. La cena se sirve bajo petición. Hay agua potable, té y café disponibles durante todo el día.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Por la noche, los huéspedes pueden sentarse alrededor de la fogata con una bebida.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Atallahs Camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3472.8288008862755!2d35.39699881460669!3d29.492192151404307!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500939441411831:0x6e5137d842d96ae8!2sAtallah&#039;s Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570696829803!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1138, 'es', '', 'one col', 'atallahs-camp'),
(1141, 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Atallah&#039;s Camp est situé dans le désert du Wadi Rum; offre à ses clients une expérience bédouine. Il dispose de tentes meublées de façon traditionnelle et d&#039;une salle de bains commune.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Transferts gratuits depuis le centre d&#039;accueil du Wadi Rum à 12 km et visites gratuites du désert incluses.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez savourer un petit-déjeuner traditionnel dans le magasin principal. Le dîner est servi sur demande. De l&#039;eau potable, du thé et du café sont disponibles toute la journée.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le soir, vous pourrez prendre un verre autour du feu de camp.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Atallahs Camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3472.8288008862755!2d35.39699881460669!3d29.492192151404307!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500939441411831:0x6e5137d842d96ae8!2sAtallah&#039;s Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570696829803!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1138, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'atallahs-camp'),
(1142, 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', 'Atallah&#039;s Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Atallah&#039;s Camp si trova nel deserto del Wadi Rum; offre agli ospiti un&#039;esperienza beduina. Dispone di tende arredate in stile tradizionale e bagni in comune.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sono inclusi i trasferimenti gratuiti dal centro visitatori di Wadi Rum, che dista 12 km, e tour gratuiti nel deserto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gli ospiti possono gustare una colazione tradizionale nel negozio principale. La cena viene servita su richiesta. Acqua potabile, tè e caffè sono disponibili tutto il giorno.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La sera, gli ospiti possono sedersi attorno al fuoco con un drink.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Atallahs Camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3472.8288008862755!2d35.39699881460669!3d29.492192151404307!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500939441411831:0x6e5137d842d96ae8!2sAtallah&#039;s Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570696829803!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1138, 'it', '', 'one col', 'atallahs-camp'),
(1143, 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp consist of twenty five fully equipped luxury tents, each spacious guest tent is luxurious furnished completed with comfortable king-size, twin, or triple beds, Bedouin sofa, mirrors, lamps, and the finest bed linens. All the furniture is hand-made.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is cozy relaxation area outside the tent to watch the stars at night. Electricity is provided in the guest tents in the evenings via solar power.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each tent has a private terrace with a fantastic view over the Wadi Rum Mountains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13881.94649910584!2d35.44242376977539!3d29.5604414!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500933a720085d5:0x318d4fbaf07dd0ab!2sWadi Rum Night Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570698016805!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1143, 'en', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-night-luxury-camp');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1144, 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp consist of twenty five fully equipped luxury tents, each spacious guest tent is luxurious furnished completed with comfortable king-size, twin, or triple beds, Bedouin sofa, mirrors, lamps, and the finest bed linens. All the furniture is hand-made.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is cozy relaxation area outside the tent to watch the stars at night. Electricity is provided in the guest tents in the evenings via solar power.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each tent has a private terrace with a fantastic view over the Wadi Rum Mountains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13881.94649910584!2d35.44242376977539!3d29.5604414!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500933a720085d5:0x318d4fbaf07dd0ab!2sWadi Rum Night Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570698016805!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1143, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-night-luxury-camp'),
(1145, 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp consta de veinticinco carpas de lujo totalmente equipadas, cada espaciosa carpa para invitados está lujosamente amueblada con cómodas camas extra grandes, dobles o triples, sofá beduino, espejos, lámparas y la mejor ropa de cama. Todos los muebles están hechos a mano.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hay una acogedora zona de relajación fuera de la tienda para ver las estrellas por la noche. La electricidad se proporciona en las tiendas de invitados por las tardes a través de energía solar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cada tienda tiene una terraza privada con una vista fantástica sobre las montañas de Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13881.94649910584!2d35.44242376977539!3d29.5604414!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500933a720085d5:0x318d4fbaf07dd0ab!2sWadi Rum Night Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570698016805!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1143, 'es', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-night-luxury-camp'),
(1146, 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp se compose de vingt-cinq tentes de luxe entièrement équipées. Chaque tente d&#039;hôtes spacieuse est luxueusement meublée et comprend de très grands lits doubles ou triples très confortables, un canapé bédouin, des miroirs, des lampes et la meilleure literie. Tous les meubles sont faits à la main.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il y a un espace de détente confortable à l&#039;extérieur du magasin pour voir les étoiles la nuit. L&#039;électricité est fournie dans les magasins dans l&#039;après-midi grâce à l&#039;énergie solaire.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Chaque tente dispose d&#039;une terrasse privée avec une vue fantastique sur les montagnes du Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13881.94649910584!2d35.44242376977539!3d29.5604414!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500933a720085d5:0x318d4fbaf07dd0ab!2sWadi Rum Night Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570698016805!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1143, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-night-luxury-camp'),
(1147, 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', 'Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp è composto da venticinque tende di lusso completamente attrezzate, ciascuna spaziosa tenda per gli ospiti è lussuosamente arredata con comodi letti extra large, matrimoniali o tripli, divano letto, specchi, lampade e i migliori letti. Tutti i mobili sono fatti a mano.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;C&#039;è un&#039;accogliente area relax fuori dal negozio per vedere le stelle di notte. L&#039;elettricità è fornita nei negozi degli ospiti nel pomeriggio attraverso l&#039;energia solare.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ogni tenda ha una terrazza privata con una fantastica vista sulle montagne del Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/Wadi Rum Night Luxury Camp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13881.94649910584!2d35.44242376977539!3d29.5604414!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500933a720085d5:0x318d4fbaf07dd0ab!2sWadi Rum Night Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570698016805!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1143, 'it', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-night-luxury-camp'),
(1148, 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp is located inside Wadi Rum’s Protected Area, only 6 km from the Wadi Rum Village and surrounded by magnificent sandstone formations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp offers high quality, goat-hair tents provide you with a comfortable night in our desert. The tents are raised and private and can accommodate many different sized groups.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each tent is equipped with its own indoor light so you can move around easily at all times of day. They offer double, triple, and family-sized tents, all come with fresh sheets, warm blankets, and towels.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bedouincamp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.73738111619!2d35.41615889562411!3d29.560529845224444!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093072599055f:0x49e15f41954fb326!2sWadi Rum Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570700685206!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1148, 'en', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-bedouin-camp'),
(1149, 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp is located inside Wadi Rum’s Protected Area, only 6 km from the Wadi Rum Village and surrounded by magnificent sandstone formations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp offers high quality, goat-hair tents provide you with a comfortable night in our desert. The tents are raised and private and can accommodate many different sized groups.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each tent is equipped with its own indoor light so you can move around easily at all times of day. They offer double, triple, and family-sized tents, all come with fresh sheets, warm blankets, and towels.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bedouincamp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.73738111619!2d35.41615889562411!3d29.560529845224444!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093072599055f:0x49e15f41954fb326!2sWadi Rum Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570700685206!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1148, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-bedouin-camp'),
(1150, 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp se encuentra dentro del área protegida de Wadi Rum, a solo 6 km de la aldea de Wadi Rum y rodeado de magníficas formaciones de arenisca.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este campamento ofrece carpas de pelo de cabra de alta calidad que le brindan una noche cómoda en nuestro desierto. Las carpas son elevadas y privadas y pueden acomodar muchos grupos de diferentes tamaños.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cada tienda está equipada con su propia luz interior para que pueda moverse fácilmente en todo momento del día. Ofrecen carpas dobles, triples y familiares, todas vienen con sábanas frescas, mantas calientes y toallas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bedouincamp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.73738111619!2d35.41615889562411!3d29.560529845224444!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093072599055f:0x49e15f41954fb326!2sWadi Rum Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570700685206!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1148, 'es', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-bedouin-camp'),
(1151, 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp est situé dans la zone protégée de Wadi Rum, à seulement 6 km du village de Wadi Rum et est entouré de magnifiques formations de grès.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ce camp propose des tentes en poils de chèvre de haute qualité qui vous garantissent une nuit confortable dans notre désert. Les tentes sont hautes et privées et peuvent accueillir de nombreux groupes de différentes tailles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Chaque magasin est équipé de son propre éclairage intérieur, ce qui vous permet de vous déplacer facilement à toute heure de la journée. Elles proposent des tentes doubles, triples et familiales, toutes équipées de draps frais, de couvertures chaudes et de serviettes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bedouincamp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.73738111619!2d35.41615889562411!3d29.560529845224444!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093072599055f:0x49e15f41954fb326!2sWadi Rum Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570700685206!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1148, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-bedouin-camp'),
(1152, 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', 'Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Wadi Rum Bedouin Camp si trova nell&#039;area protetta del Wadi Rum, a soli 6 km dal villaggio di Wadi Rum e circondato da magnifiche formazioni di arenaria.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo campo offre tende di pelo di capra di alta qualità che ti regalano una notte confortevole nel nostro deserto. Le tende sono alte e private e possono ospitare molti gruppi di diverse dimensioni.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ogni negozio è dotato di una propria luce interna che ti consente di spostarti facilmente in ogni momento della giornata. Offrono tende doppie, triple e familiari, tutte dotate di lenzuola fresche, coperte calde e asciugamani.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bedouincamp.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.73738111619!2d35.41615889562411!3d29.560529845224444!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093072599055f:0x49e15f41954fb326!2sWadi Rum Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570700685206!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1148, 'it', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-bedouin-camp'),
(1153, 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum Starlight Camp has been established for over 18 years now. This camp offers guided Jeep Tours, Camel Tours and Hiking Tours of Wadi Rum Desert.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The staff was born and raised in this desert so they will show you the best areas to visit. It would be a pleasure to show you the Bedouin way in the village and in the desert plus the great cuisine and tea.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Stay in this beautiful camp in your private tent, relax with the view of the sunset, a glass of traditional Bedouin tea or wander around to admire the wonderful rock formations. We offer twin rooms, double rooms and family rooms to the guests.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/starlight.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.66035356502!2d35.41615885339056!3d29.56066997999848!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500ed1a35cdc973:0xc390eb5573e80257!2sWadi Rum Starlight Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570702796265!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1153, 'en', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-starlight-camp'),
(1154, 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum Starlight Camp has been established for over 18 years now. This camp offers guided Jeep Tours, Camel Tours and Hiking Tours of Wadi Rum Desert.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The staff was born and raised in this desert so they will show you the best areas to visit. It would be a pleasure to show you the Bedouin way in the village and in the desert plus the great cuisine and tea.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Stay in this beautiful camp in your private tent, relax with the view of the sunset, a glass of traditional Bedouin tea or wander around to admire the wonderful rock formations. We offer twin rooms, double rooms and family rooms to the guests.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/starlight.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.66035356502!2d35.41615885339056!3d29.56066997999848!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500ed1a35cdc973:0xc390eb5573e80257!2sWadi Rum Starlight Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570702796265!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1153, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-starlight-camp'),
(1155, 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum Starlight Camp se estableció hace más de 18 años. Este campamento ofrece visitas guiadas en jeep, tours en camello y caminatas por el desierto de Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El personal nació y creció en este desierto, por lo que le mostraran las mejores áreas para visitar. Sería un placer mostrarle el estilo beduino del pueblo y en el desierto, además de la excelente cocina y el té.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Quédese en este hermoso campamento en su tienda privada, relájese con la vista del atardecer, un vaso de té beduino tradicional o pasee para admirar las maravillosas formaciones rocosas. Ofrecemos habitaciones dobles, dobles y familiares para los huéspedes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/starlight.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.66035356502!2d35.41615885339056!3d29.56066997999848!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500ed1a35cdc973:0xc390eb5573e80257!2sWadi Rum Starlight Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570702796265!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1153, 'es', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-starlight-camp'),
(1156, 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Wadi Rum Starlight Camp a été créé il y a plus de 18 ans. Ce camp propose des visites guidées en jeep, des visites de chameaux et des promenades dans le désert du Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le personnel est né et a grandi dans ce désert, alors il vous montrera les meilleurs endroits à visiter. Ce serait un plaisir de vous montrer le style bédouin de la ville et du désert, en plus de l&#039;excellente cuisine et du thé.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Restez dans ce magnifique camp dans votre tente privée, détendez-vous avec la vue sur le coucher de soleil, un verre de thé bédouin traditionnel ou promenez-vous pour admirer les merveilleuses formations rocheuses. Nous proposons des chambres doubles, doubles et familiales pour les invités.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/starlight.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.66035356502!2d35.41615885339056!3d29.56066997999848!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500ed1a35cdc973:0xc390eb5573e80257!2sWadi Rum Starlight Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570702796265!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1153, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-starlight-camp'),
(1157, 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', 'Wadi Rum Starlight Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Wadi Rum Starlight Camp è stato fondato più di 18 anni fa. Questo campo offre tour guidati in jeep, tour in cammello e passeggiate nel deserto del Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il personale è nato e cresciuto in questo deserto, quindi ti mostreranno le migliori aree da visitare. Sarebbe un piacere mostrarti lo stile beduino della città e nel deserto, oltre all&#039;eccellente cucina e tè.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Soggiorna in questo bellissimo campo nella tua tenda privata, rilassati con la vista del tramonto, un bicchiere di tè tradizionale beduino o passeggia per ammirare le meravigliose formazioni rocciose. Offriamo camere doppie, doppie e familiari per gli ospiti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/starlight.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.66035356502!2d35.41615885339056!3d29.56066997999848!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500ed1a35cdc973:0xc390eb5573e80257!2sWadi Rum Starlight Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570702796265!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1153, 'it', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-starlight-camp'),
(1158, 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ideal for fun and relaxation, Bedouin Lifestyle Camp is located inside Wadi Rum protected area, about 11kms from Rum Village.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It’s based around a number of Bedouin tents prepared with comfortable beds just down an impressive rock. With its convenient location, the camp offers easy access to the desert&#039;s must-see destinations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All tents have comfortable beds and we provide pillows, blankets, sheets and towels. If you want to sleep outside on the nearby sand dune, they can offer you the blankets and the mattress at no extra charge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/lifestyle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.5833258104!2d35.416158811157125!3d29.560810114538484!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15009019118c8231:0x9037b93a2eedc103!2sBedouin Lifestyle Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570704236327!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1158, 'en', '', 'one col', 'bedouin-lifestyle-camp'),
(1159, 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ideal for fun and relaxation, Bedouin Lifestyle Camp is located inside Wadi Rum protected area, about 11kms from Rum Village.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It’s based around a number of Bedouin tents prepared with comfortable beds just down an impressive rock. With its convenient location, the camp offers easy access to the desert&#039;s must-see destinations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All tents have comfortable beds and we provide pillows, blankets, sheets and towels. If you want to sleep outside on the nearby sand dune, they can offer you the blankets and the mattress at no extra charge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/lifestyle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.5833258104!2d35.416158811157125!3d29.560810114538484!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15009019118c8231:0x9037b93a2eedc103!2sBedouin Lifestyle Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570704236327!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1158, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'bedouin-lifestyle-camp'),
(1160, 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ideal para la diversión y la relajación, Bedouin Lifestyle Camp se encuentra dentro del área protegida de Wadi Rum, a unos 11 km de Rum Village.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se basa en una serie de tiendas beduinas preparadas con camas cómodas junto a una roca impresionante. Con su ubicación conveniente, el campamento ofrece fácil acceso a los destinos imperdibles del desierto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las tiendas tienen camas cómodas y ofrecemos almohadas, mantas, sábanas y toallas. Si desea dormir en la cercana duna de arena, pueden ofrecerle las mantas y el colchón sin cargo adicional.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/lifestyle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.5833258104!2d35.416158811157125!3d29.560810114538484!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15009019118c8231:0x9037b93a2eedc103!2sBedouin Lifestyle Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570704236327!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1158, 'es', '', 'one col', 'bedouin-lifestyle-camp'),
(1161, 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bedouin Lifestyle Camp, situé dans la zone protégée de Wadi Rum, à environ 11 km du village de Rum, est un lieu de séjour idéal.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il est basé sur une série de tentes bédouines préparées avec des lits confortables à côté d&#039;un impressionnant rocher. Grâce à son emplacement idéal, le camp offre un accès facile aux destinations incontournables du désert.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tous les magasins ont des lits confortables et nous offrons des oreillers, des couvertures, des draps et des serviettes. Si vous souhaitez dormir dans la dune de sable voisine, des couvertures et des matelas peuvent vous être proposés sans frais supplémentaires.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/lifestyle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.5833258104!2d35.416158811157125!3d29.560810114538484!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15009019118c8231:0x9037b93a2eedc103!2sBedouin Lifestyle Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570704236327!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1158, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'bedouin-lifestyle-camp'),
(1162, 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', 'Bedouin Lifestyle Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ideale per divertimento e relax, il Bedouin Lifestyle Camp si trova nell&#039;area protetta del Wadi Rum, a circa 11 km dal Rum Village.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si basa su una serie di tende beduine preparate con comodi letti accanto a una roccia impressionante. Con la sua comoda posizione, il campo offre un facile accesso alle destinazioni del deserto da non perdere.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutti i negozi hanno letti confortevoli e offriamo cuscini, coperte, lenzuola e asciugamani. Se desideri dormire nella vicina duna di sabbia, coperte e materassi possono essere offerti senza costi aggiuntivi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/lifestyle.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55527.5833258104!2d35.416158811157125!3d29.560810114538484!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15009019118c8231:0x9037b93a2eedc103!2sBedouin Lifestyle Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570704236327!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1158, 'it', '', 'one col', 'bedouin-lifestyle-camp'),
(1163, 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Khaled&#039;s Camp is a certified eco-friendly accommodation provider located in the Wadi Rum Protected Area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp is located 14kms from Rum Village in the desert, with 18 tents nestled against iconic sandstone cliffs and provides stunning views of the sunset year round.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There are private tents which can accommodate up to 6 people. In addition, we offer family tents that cater to the needs of families or larger groups.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The nearest airport is King Hussein International Airport, 41 km from Khaled&#039;s Camp.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/khaled.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55568.16924404085!2d35.35910007910156!3d29.486889300000005!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150092410d90c0ff:0xe992554af5d074cb!2sKhaled`s Camp - Wadi Rum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570705928258!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1163, 'en', '', 'one col', 'khaleds-camp'),
(1164, 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Khaled&#039;s Camp is a certified eco-friendly accommodation provider located in the Wadi Rum Protected Area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp is located 14kms from Rum Village in the desert, with 18 tents nestled against iconic sandstone cliffs and provides stunning views of the sunset year round.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There are private tents which can accommodate up to 6 people. In addition, we offer family tents that cater to the needs of families or larger groups.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The nearest airport is King Hussein International Airport, 41 km from Khaled&#039;s Camp.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/khaled.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55568.16924404085!2d35.35910007910156!3d29.486889300000005!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150092410d90c0ff:0xe992554af5d074cb!2sKhaled`s Camp - Wadi Rum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570705928258!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1163, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'khaleds-camp'),
(1165, 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Khaled&#039;s Camp es un proveedor certificado de alojamiento ecológico ubicado en el área protegida de Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este campamento está ubicado a 14 km de Rum Village en el desierto, con 18 tiendas de campaña ubicadas contra icónicos acantilados de arenisca y ofrece impresionantes vistas de la puesta del sol durante todo el año.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hay carpas privadas que pueden acomodar hasta 6 personas. Además, ofrecemos tiendas familiares que satisfacen las necesidades de familias o grupos más grandes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El aeropuerto más cercano es el aeropuerto internacional Rey Hussein, a 41 km del Khaled&#039;s Camp.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/khaled.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55568.16924404085!2d35.35910007910156!3d29.486889300000005!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150092410d90c0ff:0xe992554af5d074cb!2sKhaled`s Camp - Wadi Rum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570705928258!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1163, 'es', '', 'one col', 'khaleds-camp'),
(1166, 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Khaled&#039;s Camp est un fournisseur certifié d&#039;hébergements écologiques situé dans la zone protégée de Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ce camp est situé à 14 km du village de Rum, dans le désert, avec 18 tentes situées contre des falaises de grès emblématiques. Il offre une vue imprenable sur le coucher de soleil toute l&#039;année.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il existe des tentes privées pouvant accueillir jusqu&#039;à 6 personnes. De plus, nous proposons des magasins familiaux répondant aux besoins de familles ou de groupes plus importants.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;aéroport international King Hussein, le plus proche, se trouve à 41 km du Khaled&#039;s Camp.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/khaled.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55568.16924404085!2d35.35910007910156!3d29.486889300000005!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150092410d90c0ff:0xe992554af5d074cb!2sKhaled`s Camp - Wadi Rum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570705928258!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1163, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'khaleds-camp'),
(1167, 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', 'Khaled`s Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Khaled&#039;s Camp è un fornitore certificato di alloggi ecologici situati nell&#039;area protetta del Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo campo si trova a 14 km dal Rum Village nel deserto, con 18 tende situate contro le iconiche scogliere di arenaria e offre splendide viste sul tramonto durante tutto l&#039;anno.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ci sono tende private che possono ospitare fino a 6 persone. Inoltre, offriamo negozi per famiglie che soddisfano le esigenze di famiglie o gruppi più numerosi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;aeroporto più vicino è l&#039;aeroporto internazionale King Hussein, a 41 km da Khaled&#039;s Camp.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/khaled.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55568.16924404085!2d35.35910007910156!3d29.486889300000005!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150092410d90c0ff:0xe992554af5d074cb!2sKhaled`s Camp - Wadi Rum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570705928258!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1163, 'it', '', 'one col', 'khaleds-camp'),
(1168, 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Beyond Wadi Rum Camp, a Bedouin family-run camp, located in the Little Bridge Area in the heart of Wadi Rum which has the best location for sun set and Wadi Rum views.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp has new furniture and mid-range luxury tents. It is an eco-friendly camp offering a traditional and real Bedouin experience. All tents are private, single tents, twin or double tents, triple, quadruple and family tents; equipped with mattresses, blankets and pillows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The bathrooms and the showers are shared, Beyond Wadi Rum Camp offers easy access to major archaeological sites.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/beyondwadi.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111087.97699056804!2d35.36671418009738!3d29.530950972341785!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093b6e4a623d5:0xad55537f4e707dd0!2sBeyond Wadi Rum Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570780227221!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1168, 'en', '', 'one col', 'beyond-wadi-rum-camp'),
(1169, 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Welcome to Beyond Wadi Rum Camp, a Bedouin family-run camp, located in the Little Bridge Area in the heart of Wadi Rum which has the best location for sun set and Wadi Rum views.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp has new furniture and mid-range luxury tents. It is an eco-friendly camp offering a traditional and real Bedouin experience. All tents are private, single tents, twin or double tents, triple, quadruple and family tents; equipped with mattresses, blankets and pillows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The bathrooms and the showers are shared, Beyond Wadi Rum Camp offers easy access to major archaeological sites.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/beyondwadi.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111087.97699056804!2d35.36671418009738!3d29.530950972341785!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093b6e4a623d5:0xad55537f4e707dd0!2sBeyond Wadi Rum Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570780227221!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1168, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'beyond-wadi-rum-camp'),
(1170, 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bienvenido a Beyond Wadi Rum Camp, un campamento beduino de gestión familiar, ubicado en el área de Little Bridge en el corazón de Wadi Rum, que tiene la mejor ubicación para la puesta de sol y las vistas de Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este campamento cuenta con nuevos muebles y carpas de lujo de gama media. Es un campamento ecológico que ofrece una experiencia beduina tradicional y real. Todas las carpas son privadas, carpas individuales, carpas gemelas o dobles, carpas triples, cuádruples y familiares; Equipado con colchones, mantas y almohadas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los baños y las duchas son compartidos, Beyond Wadi Rum Camp ofrece fácil acceso a los principales sitios arqueológicos. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/beyondwadi.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111087.97699056804!2d35.36671418009738!3d29.530950972341785!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093b6e4a623d5:0xad55537f4e707dd0!2sBeyond Wadi Rum Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570780227221!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1168, 'es', '', 'one col', 'beyond-wadi-rum-camp'),
(1171, 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bienvenue au Beyond Wadi Rum Camp, un camp de bédouins à la gestion familiale situé dans le quartier de Little Bridge, au cœur du Wadi Rum, qui bénéficie du meilleur emplacement pour admirer le coucher du soleil et profiter de la vue sur le Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ce camp dispose de nouveaux meubles et de tentes de luxe de milieu de gamme. C&#039;est un camp écologique qui offre une expérience bédouine traditionnelle et réelle. Toutes les tentes sont privées, individuelles, doubles ou doubles, triples, quadruples et familiales; Equipé de matelas, couvertures et oreillers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les salles de bains et les douches sont partagées. Beyond Wadi Rum Camp offre un accès facile aux principaux sites archéologiques.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/beyondwadi.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111087.97699056804!2d35.36671418009738!3d29.530950972341785!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093b6e4a623d5:0xad55537f4e707dd0!2sBeyond Wadi Rum Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570780227221!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1168, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'beyond-wadi-rum-camp');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1172, 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', 'Beyond Wadi Rum Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Benvenuti al Beyond Wadi Rum Camp, un campo beduino a conduzione familiare, situato nell&#039;area di Little Bridge nel cuore del Wadi Rum, che ha la posizione migliore per il tramonto e la vista sul Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo campo ha nuovi mobili e tende di lusso di fascia media. È un campo ecologico che offre un&#039;esperienza beduina tradizionale e reale. Tutte le tende sono private, tende singole, doppie o matrimoniali, triple, quadruple e tende familiari; Dotato di materassi, coperte e cuscini.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;I bagni e le docce sono in comune, Beyond Wadi Rum Camp offre un facile accesso ai principali siti archeologici.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/beyondwadi.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111087.97699056804!2d35.36671418009738!3d29.530950972341785!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093b6e4a623d5:0xad55537f4e707dd0!2sBeyond Wadi Rum Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570780227221!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1168, 'it', '', 'one col', 'beyond-wadi-rum-camp'),
(1173, 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum is located in Wadi Rum and has a restaurant and a 24-hour front desk and complimentary Wi-Fi is provided.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Step into a world of luxury, with extensive living space inside and out, and panoramic mountains view, it is the ideal setting for an unforgettable stay at the heart of Wadi Rum protected area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each Bubble has its own bathroom and toilet, showers with hot water, bathrobes, and bathroom toiletries. A comfortable overnight stay together with breakfast and dinner included.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bubble2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d297.5483747600063!2d35.48286480313873!3d29.71925980448727!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e9576c5d0a3d:0x30cebeac72872cf3!2sBubble Luxotel Wadi Rum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570784100938!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1173, 'en', '', 'one col', 'bubble-luxotel-wadi-rum'),
(1174, 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum is located in Wadi Rum and has a restaurant and a 24-hour front desk and complimentary Wi-Fi is provided.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Step into a world of luxury, with extensive living space inside and out, and panoramic mountains view, it is the ideal setting for an unforgettable stay at the heart of Wadi Rum protected area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each Bubble has its own bathroom and toilet, showers with hot water, bathrobes, and bathroom toiletries. A comfortable overnight stay together with breakfast and dinner included.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bubble2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d297.5483747600063!2d35.48286480313873!3d29.71925980448727!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e9576c5d0a3d:0x30cebeac72872cf3!2sBubble Luxotel Wadi Rum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570784100938!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1173, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'bubble-luxotel-wadi-rum'),
(1175, 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum se encuentra en Wadi Rum y ofrece un restaurante, servicio de recepción las 24 horas y conexión Wi-Fi gratuita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ingrese a un mundo de lujo, con un amplio espacio habitable por dentro y por fuera, y vistas panorámicas a las montañas, es el escenario ideal para una estadía inolvidable en el corazón del área protegida de Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cada burbuja tiene su propio baño y aseo, duchas con agua caliente, albornoces y artículos de tocador. Una cómoda estancia de una noche con desayuno y cena incluidos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bubble2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d297.5483747600063!2d35.48286480313873!3d29.71925980448727!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e9576c5d0a3d:0x30cebeac72872cf3!2sBubble Luxotel Wadi Rum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570784100938!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1173, 'es', '', 'one col', 'bubble-luxotel-wadi-rum'),
(1176, 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum est situé à Wadi Rum et propose un restaurant, une réception ouverte 24h / 24 et une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Entrez dans un monde de luxe, avec de vastes espaces de vie intérieurs et extérieurs et une vue panoramique sur les montagnes, constitue le cadre idéal pour un séjour inoubliable au cœur de la zone protégée de Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Chaque bulle a sa propre salle de bain et toilette, douches chaudes, peignoirs et articles de toilette. Une nuit confortable avec petit-déjeuner et dîner inclus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bubble2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d297.5483747600063!2d35.48286480313873!3d29.71925980448727!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e9576c5d0a3d:0x30cebeac72872cf3!2sBubble Luxotel Wadi Rum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570784100938!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1173, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'bubble-luxotel-wadi-rum'),
(1177, 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', 'Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Bubble Luxotel Wadi Rum si trova a Wadi Rum e offre un ristorante, una reception aperta 24 ore su 24 e la connessione Wi-Fi gratuita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Entra in un mondo di lusso, con ampi spazi abitativi dentro e fuori e viste panoramiche sulle montagne, è la cornice ideale per un soggiorno indimenticabile nel cuore dell&#039;area protetta del Wadi Rum.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ogni bolla ha il proprio bagno e toilette, docce con acqua calda, accappatoi e articoli da toeletta. Un pernottamento confortevole con colazione e cena incluse.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bubble2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d297.5483747600063!2d35.48286480313873!3d29.71925980448727!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1500e9576c5d0a3d:0x30cebeac72872cf3!2sBubble Luxotel Wadi Rum!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570784100938!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1173, 'it', '', 'one col', 'bubble-luxotel-wadi-rum'),
(1178, 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sand Dunes Camp offers a perfect Bedouin-style camp accommodation to stay in Wadi Rum. There are 20 rooms. The hotel offers airport shuttle bus service, 24-hour front desk and room services for the guest’s convenience.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Meal offers include breakfast, lunch and dinner. Enjoy your dinner under the stars, sitting around the campfire.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Sand Dunes Camp offers private single tent, private double tent, triple tent and quadruple tent accommodations, each bed is provided with a warm quilt against the chill of desert nights.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sand dunes.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55543.08512153629!2d35.398873560210774!3d29.532595922586044!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093aa49acc6f9:0x2c4e8e92b982f0af!2sSand Dunes Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570787081798!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1178, 'en', '', 'one col', 'sand-dunes-camp'),
(1179, 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sand Dunes Camp offers a perfect Bedouin-style camp accommodation to stay in Wadi Rum. There are 20 rooms. The hotel offers airport shuttle bus service, 24-hour front desk and room services for the guest’s convenience.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Meal offers include breakfast, lunch and dinner. Enjoy your dinner under the stars, sitting around the campfire.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Sand Dunes Camp offers private single tent, private double tent, triple tent and quadruple tent accommodations, each bed is provided with a warm quilt against the chill of desert nights.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sand dunes.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55543.08512153629!2d35.398873560210774!3d29.532595922586044!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093aa49acc6f9:0x2c4e8e92b982f0af!2sSand Dunes Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570787081798!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1178, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'sand-dunes-camp'),
(1180, 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sand Dunes Camp ofrece un alojamiento perfecto de campamento de estilo beduino para alojarse en Wadi Rum. Hay 20 habitaciones. El hotel ofrece servicio de traslado en autobús al aeropuerto, recepción las 24 horas y servicio de habitaciones para la comodidad de los huéspedes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;                         &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las ofertas de comidas incluyen desayuno, almuerzo y cena. Disfruta de tu cena bajo las estrellas, sentado alrededor de la fogata.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Sand Dunes Camp ofrece alojamiento en carpa individual privada, carpa doble privada, carpa triple y carpa cuádruple, cada cama cuenta con una cálida colcha contra el frío de las noches del desierto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sand dunes.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55543.08512153629!2d35.398873560210774!3d29.532595922586044!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093aa49acc6f9:0x2c4e8e92b982f0af!2sSand Dunes Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570787081798!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1178, 'es', '', 'one col', 'sand-dunes-camp'),
(1181, 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Sand Dunes Camp offre un perfetto alloggio da campo in stile beduino per soggiornare a Wadi Rum. Ci sono 20 camere. L&#039;hotel offre un servizio navetta per l&#039;aeroporto, reception 24 ore e servizio in camera per la comodità degli ospiti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le offerte per i pasti comprendono colazione, pranzo e cena. Goditi la cena sotto le stelle, seduto attorno al fuoco.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Sand Dunes Camp offre alloggio in tenda singola privata, doppia tenda privata, tripla e quadrupla, ogni letto ha un copriletto caldo contro il freddo delle notti del deserto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sand dunes.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55543.08512153629!2d35.398873560210774!3d29.532595922586044!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093aa49acc6f9:0x2c4e8e92b982f0af!2sSand Dunes Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570787081798!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1178, 'it', '', 'one col', 'sand-dunes-camp'),
(1182, 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', 'Sand Dunes Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sand Dunes Camp offre un hébergement de style bédouin idéal pour séjourner à Wadi Rum. Il y a 20 chambres. L&#039;hôtel propose un service de navette pour l&#039;aéroport, une réception ouverte 24h / 24 et un service de chambre pour la commodité des clients.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les repas comprennent le petit-déjeuner, le déjeuner et le dîner. Profitez de votre dîner sous les étoiles, assis autour du feu de camp.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Sand Dunes Camp propose un hébergement dans des tentes individuelles, doubles, triples et quadruples privées. Chaque lit dispose d&#039;un couvre-lit chaud contre le froid des nuits du désert.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/sand dunes.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55543.08512153629!2d35.398873560210774!3d29.532595922586044!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150093aa49acc6f9:0x2c4e8e92b982f0af!2sSand Dunes Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570787081798!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1178, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'sand-dunes-camp'),
(1183, 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Aritas Camp Villa is located next to Lawrence&#039;s spring, Jebel Khazali and Aqaba Fort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hiking, horse riding and cycling are also available. The accommodation offers meals and a play area for guests with children.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A buffet breakfast is available every morning at the luxury tent. The restaurant at Aritas camp specializes in International cuisine. A garden, grill and a playground are available at the accommodation. The nearest airport is King Hussein International, 44 miles from Aritas camp, and the property offers a free shuttle service.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/aritas.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55543.08512153629!2d35.398873560210774!3d29.532595922586044!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x91ced8a241561d0a!2sAritas camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570789780569!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1183, 'en', '', 'one col', 'aritas-camp'),
(1184, 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Aritas Camp Villa is located next to Lawrence&#039;s spring, Jebel Khazali and Aqaba Fort.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hiking, horse riding and cycling are also available. The accommodation offers meals and a play area for guests with children.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A buffet breakfast is available every morning at the luxury tent. The restaurant at Aritas camp specializes in International cuisine. A garden, grill and a playground are available at the accommodation. The nearest airport is King Hussein International, 44 miles from Aritas camp, and the property offers a free shuttle service.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/aritas.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55543.08512153629!2d35.398873560210774!3d29.532595922586044!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x91ced8a241561d0a!2sAritas camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570789780569!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1183, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'aritas-camp'),
(1185, 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Aritas Camp Villa se encuentra junto al manantial de Lawrence, Jebel Khazali y el Fuerte Aqaba.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Senderismo, equitación y ciclismo también están disponibles. El alojamiento ofrece comidas y una zona de juegos para los huéspedes con niños.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las mañanas se sirve un desayuno bufé en la tienda de lujo. El restaurante del campamento Aritas está especializado en cocina internacional. Un jardín, parrilla y un parque infantil están disponibles en el alojamiento. El aeropuerto más cercano es el King Hussein International, a 72 km del campamento Aritas, y el establecimiento ofrece un servicio de traslado gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/aritas.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55543.08512153629!2d35.398873560210774!3d29.532595922586044!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x91ced8a241561d0a!2sAritas camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570789780569!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1183, 'es', '', 'one col', 'aritas-camp'),
(1186, 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Aritas Camp Villa est adjacente à la source de Lawrence, à Jebel Khazali et au fort d&#039;Aqaba&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Des randonnées à pied, à cheval et à vélo sont également possibles. Le logement propose des repas et une aire de jeux pour les enfants avec enfants.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un petit-déjeuner buffet est servi chaque matin dans le magasin de luxe. Le restaurant du camping Aritas est spécialisé dans la cuisine internationale. Un jardin, un barbecue et une aire de jeux sont disponibles sur place. L&#039;aéroport le plus proche, l&#039;aéroport international King Hussein, à 72 km du camp Aritas, assure un service de navette gratuit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/aritas.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55543.08512153629!2d35.398873560210774!3d29.532595922586044!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x91ced8a241561d0a!2sAritas camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570789780569!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1183, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'aritas-camp'),
(1187, 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', 'Aritas Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Aritas Camp Villa è adiacente alla sorgente di Lawrence, Jebel Khazali e Aqaba Fort&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sono inoltre disponibili escursionismo, equitazione e ciclismo. La struttura offre pasti e un parco giochi per gli ospiti con bambini.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Una colazione a buffet viene servita ogni mattina nel negozio di lusso. Il ristorante del campo Aritas è specializzato in cucina internazionale. Un giardino, grill e un parco giochi sono disponibili presso la struttura. L&#039;aeroporto più vicino è King Hussein International, a 72 km da Aritas Camp, e la struttura offre un servizio navetta gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/aritas.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d55543.08512153629!2d35.398873560210774!3d29.532595922586044!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x91ced8a241561d0a!2sAritas camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570789780569!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1183, 'it', '', 'one col', 'aritas-camp'),
(1188, 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bedouin Bivouac Camp is located on the sunset site in the heart of Wadi Rum Protected Area. The camp is designed to give you an authentic Bedouin experience and introduce you to original local culture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There are two options to sleep in our camp, first one – you can sleep inside your private tent, with private shower and bathroom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Another one, more budget friendly option is sleeping outside – under the stars, in the cave just next to the camp and use shared bathroom and facilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bivouac.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111088.43110307773!2d35.37430755534649!3d29.53053751325456!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x9c081be3ccd67608!2sBedouin Bivouac Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570792489882!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1188, 'en', '', 'one col', 'bedouin-bivouac-camp'),
(1189, 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bedouin Bivouac Camp is located on the sunset site in the heart of Wadi Rum Protected Area. The camp is designed to give you an authentic Bedouin experience and introduce you to original local culture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There are two options to sleep in our camp, first one – you can sleep inside your private tent, with private shower and bathroom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Another one, more budget friendly option is sleeping outside – under the stars, in the cave just next to the camp and use shared bathroom and facilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bivouac.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111088.43110307773!2d35.37430755534649!3d29.53053751325456!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x9c081be3ccd67608!2sBedouin Bivouac Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570792489882!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1188, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'bedouin-bivouac-camp'),
(1190, 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bedouin Bivouac Camp está ubicado en el sitio de puesta de sol en el corazón del área protegida de Wadi Rum. El campamento está diseñado para brindarle una auténtica experiencia beduina y presentarle la cultura local original.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hay dos opciones para dormir en nuestro campamento, la primera: puede dormir dentro de su tienda privada, con baño y ducha privados.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Otra opción más económica es dormir afuera, bajo las estrellas, en la cueva justo al lado del campamento y usar el baño y las instalaciones compartidas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bivouac.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111088.43110307773!2d35.37430755534649!3d29.53053751325456!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x9c081be3ccd67608!2sBedouin Bivouac Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570792489882!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1188, 'es', '', 'one col', 'bedouin-bivouac-camp'),
(1191, 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Bedouin Bivouac Camp est situé au coucher du soleil, au cœur de la zone protégée de Wadi Rum. Le camp est conçu pour vous faire vivre une expérience bédouine authentique et vous familiariser avec la culture locale originale.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il existe deux options pour dormir dans notre camp, la première: vous pouvez dormir dans votre tente privée, avec salle de bain privée et douche.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Une autre option moins chère est de dormir dehors, sous les étoiles, dans la grotte juste à côté du camp et d&#039;utiliser les toilettes et les installations communes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bivouac.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111088.43110307773!2d35.37430755534649!3d29.53053751325456!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x9c081be3ccd67608!2sBedouin Bivouac Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570792489882!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1188, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'bedouin-bivouac-camp'),
(1192, 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', 'Bedouin Bivouac Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Bedouin Bivouac Camp si trova nel luogo del tramonto nel cuore dell&#039;area protetta del Wadi Rum. Il campo è progettato per offrirti un&#039;autentica esperienza beduina e farti conoscere la cultura locale originale.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ci sono due opzioni per dormire nel nostro campo, il primo: puoi dormire nella tua tenda privata, con bagno privato e doccia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un&#039;altra opzione più economica è dormire fuori, sotto le stelle, nella grotta proprio accanto al campo e usare il bagno e le strutture in comune.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/bivouac.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111088.43110307773!2d35.37430755534649!3d29.53053751325456!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x9c081be3ccd67608!2sBedouin Bivouac Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570792489882!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1188, 'it', '', 'one col', 'bedouin-bivouac-camp'),
(1193, 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp is located 2.4 km from Jebel Khazali.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rooms like Basic triple room, budget single room, budget double room and triple room are equipped with climate control, a LCD TV, coffee/tea makers, a dining area and a seating area as well as pillow-top mattresses, foam pillows and linens.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They are also furnished with a carpet floor. The hostel has private bathrooms with guest toiletries and bath sheets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/7 pillars.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111088.43110307773!2d35.37430755534649!3d29.53053751325456!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x2858e332ff563ed3!2sWadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570794100455!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1193, 'en', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-7-pillars-camp'),
(1194, 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp is located 2.4 km from Jebel Khazali.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rooms like Basic triple room, budget single room, budget double room and triple room are equipped with climate control, a LCD TV, coffee/tea makers, a dining area and a seating area as well as pillow-top mattresses, foam pillows and linens.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They are also furnished with a carpet floor. The hostel has private bathrooms with guest toiletries and bath sheets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/7 pillars.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111088.43110307773!2d35.37430755534649!3d29.53053751325456!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x2858e332ff563ed3!2sWadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570794100455!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1193, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-7-pillars-camp'),
(1195, 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp se encuentra a 2,4 km de Jebel Khazali.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones como Habitación triple básica, Habitación individual económica, Habitación doble económica y Habitación triple están equipadas con climatizador, televisor LCD, cafetera / tetera, un comedor y una zona de estar, así como colchones con una capa de acolchado adicional, almohadas de espuma y ropa de cama. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;También están amuebladas con suelo de moqueta. El albergue cuenta con baño privado con artículos de aseo y toallas de baño.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/7 pillars.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111088.43110307773!2d35.37430755534649!3d29.53053751325456!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x2858e332ff563ed3!2sWadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570794100455!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1193, 'es', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-7-pillars-camp'),
(1196, 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp se trouve à 2,4 km du Jebel Khazali.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres telles que Chambre Triple Basique, Chambre Simple Économique, Chambre Double Économique et Chambre Triple sont équipées de la climatisation, d&#039;une télévision à écran LCD, d&#039;une cafetière / théière, d&#039;une salle à manger et d&#039;un coin salon, ainsi que de matelas avec un rembourrage supplémentaire, des oreillers en mousse et la literie. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ils sont également équipés de moquette. L&#039;auberge de jeunesse dispose d&#039;une salle de bains privative avec des articles de toilette et des serviettes de bain.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/7 pillars.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111088.43110307773!2d35.37430755534649!3d29.53053751325456!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x2858e332ff563ed3!2sWadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570794100455!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1193, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-7-pillars-camp'),
(1197, 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', 'Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Wadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp si trova a 2,4 km da Jebel Khazali.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camere come Camera Tripla Basic, Camera Singola Economy, Camera Matrimoniale Economy e Camera Tripla sono dotate di aria condizionata, TV LCD, kit per la preparazione di tè e caffè, una sala da pranzo e un&#039;area salotto, nonché materassi con un ulteriore strato di imbottitura, cuscini in schiuma e biancheria da letto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sono inoltre arredate con pavimenti in moquette. L&#039;ostello dispone di bagno privato con articoli da toeletta e asciugamani.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Wadi Rum Camps/7 pillars.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d111088.43110307773!2d35.37430755534649!3d29.53053751325456!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x2858e332ff563ed3!2sWadi Rum 7 Pillars Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1570794100455!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1193, 'it', '', 'one col', 'wadi-rum-7-pillars-camp'),
(1198, 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Little Petra Bedouin Camp is located only 5 minutes away from Petra and Little Petra. Experience the traditional Jordanian hospitality, traditions and culture over a cup of tea. Taste the exquisite tradition Bedouin dishes that will test your palette.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All tents are private (Single Tents, Twin/Double Tents, Triple Tents and quadruple Tents/Family Tents), the bathrooms and the showers are shared.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They also have tents with private bathrooms. Each tent is equipped with beds, mattresses, blankets and pillows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sleeping under the stars is an amazing way to experience the desert. Everyone should try it at least once in their lifetime.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/little petra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d19472.83537501112!2d35.46002216114178!3d30.370669309403922!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f5daac78de1:0x40db390302a723b7!2sLittle Petra Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571041158233!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1198, 'en', '', 'one col', 'little-petra-bedouin-camp'),
(1199, 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Little Petra Bedouin Camp is located only 5 minutes away from Petra and Little Petra. Experience the traditional Jordanian hospitality, traditions and culture over a cup of tea. Taste the exquisite tradition Bedouin dishes that will test your palette.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All tents are private (Single Tents, Twin/Double Tents, Triple Tents and quadruple Tents/Family Tents), the bathrooms and the showers are shared.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They also have tents with private bathrooms. Each tent is equipped with beds, mattresses, blankets and pillows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sleeping under the stars is an amazing way to experience the desert. Everyone should try it at least once in their lifetime.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/little petra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d19472.83537501112!2d35.46002216114178!3d30.370669309403922!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f5daac78de1:0x40db390302a723b7!2sLittle Petra Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571041158233!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1198, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'little-petra-bedouin-camp'),
(1200, 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Little Petra Bedouin Camp se encuentra a solo 5 minutos de Petra y Little Petra. Experimente la tradicional hospitalidad jordana, las tradiciones y la cultura con una taza de té. Pruebe los exquisitos platos beduinos de tradición que pondrán a prueba su paladar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las carpas son privadas (carpas individuales, carpas dobles / gemelas, carpas triples y carpas cuádruples / carpas familiares), los baños y las duchas son compartidos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;También tienen carpas con baño privado. Cada tienda está equipada con camas, colchones, mantas y almohadas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dormir bajo las estrellas es una forma increíble de experimentar el desierto. Todos deberían intentarlo al menos una vez en su vida.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/little petra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d19472.83537501112!2d35.46002216114178!3d30.370669309403922!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f5daac78de1:0x40db390302a723b7!2sLittle Petra Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571041158233!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1198, 'es', '', 'one col', 'little-petra-bedouin-camp');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1201, 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Little Petra Bedouin Camp est à seulement 5 minutes de Petra et Little Petra. Découvrez l&#039;hospitalité, les traditions et la culture jordaniennes traditionnelles avec une tasse de thé. Essayez les délicieux plats traditionnels bédouins qui mettront votre palais à l&#039;épreuve.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les tentes sont privées (tentes simples, doubles / jumelles, triples et quadruples / familiales), les salles de bains et les douches sont partagées.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ils ont aussi des tentes avec salles de bains privées. Chaque magasin est équipé de lits, matelas, couvertures et oreillers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dormir à la belle étoile est une façon incroyable de vivre le désert. Tout le monde devrait essayer au moins une fois dans sa vie.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/little petra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d19472.83537501112!2d35.46002216114178!3d30.370669309403922!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f5daac78de1:0x40db390302a723b7!2sLittle Petra Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571041158233!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1198, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'little-petra-bedouin-camp'),
(1202, 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', 'Little Petra Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Little Petra Bedouin Camp è a soli 5 minuti da Petra e Little Petra. Scopri l&#039;ospitalità tradizionale giordana, le tradizioni e la cultura con una tazza di tè. Prova gli squisiti piatti tradizionali beduini che metteranno alla prova il tuo palato.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le tende sono private (tende singole, doppie / matrimoniali, triple e quadruple / tende familiari), i bagni e le docce sono in comune.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hanno anche tende con bagno privato. Ogni negozio è dotato di letti, materassi, coperte e cuscini.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dormire sotto le stelle è un modo incredibile di vivere il deserto. Tutti dovrebbero provare almeno una volta nella vita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/little petra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d19472.83537501112!2d35.46002216114178!3d30.370669309403922!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f5daac78de1:0x40db390302a723b7!2sLittle Petra Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571041158233!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1198, 'it', '', 'one col', 'little-petra-bedouin-camp'),
(1203, 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The Seven Wonders Luxury Camp is a great base for visiting the main site of Petra and it is only a 20 minute walk away to Little Petra Site. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;They are also close to the beginning of the Back Way Hike to the Monastery in Petra. They can do jeep transfers so that the hike is just over 1 hr or we can provide a guide and you can walk the entire way (4hrs). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Buffet breakfasts and dinners are served in the on-site restaurant and soft drinks, tea, coffee and shisha are available in the coffee shop.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/Sevenwonders2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.433098878566!2d35.46002215590556!3d30.370720506163973!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f148728a981:0x3400583251e6fc26!2sSeven Wonders Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571043236367!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1203, 'en', '', 'one col', 'seven-wonders-luxury-camp'),
(1204, 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Seven Wonders Luxury Camp is a great base for visiting the main site of Petra and it is only a 20 minute walk away to Little Petra Site. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;They are also close to the beginning of the Back Way Hike to the Monastery in Petra. They can do jeep transfers so that the hike is just over 1 hr or we can provide a guide and you can walk the entire way (4hrs). &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Buffet breakfasts and dinners are served in the on-site restaurant and soft drinks, tea, coffee and shisha are available in the coffee shop.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/Sevenwonders2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.433098878566!2d35.46002215590556!3d30.370720506163973!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f148728a981:0x3400583251e6fc26!2sSeven Wonders Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571043236367!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1203, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'seven-wonders-luxury-camp'),
(1205, 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Seven Wonders Luxury Camp es una base ideal para visitar el sitio principal de Petra y está a solo 20 minutos a pie del sitio de Little Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;También están cerca del comienzo de la caminata de regreso al Monasterio en Petra. Pueden hacer transferencias en jeep para que la caminata sea de poco más de 1 hora o podemos proporcionarle una guía y puede caminar todo el camino (4 horas).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En el restaurante del hotel se sirven desayunos bufé y cenas, y en la cafetería se ofrecen refrescos, té, café y shisha.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/Sevenwonders2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.433098878566!2d35.46002215590556!3d30.370720506163973!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f148728a981:0x3400583251e6fc26!2sSeven Wonders Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571043236367!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1203, 'es', '', 'one col', 'seven-wonders-luxury-camp'),
(1206, 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Seven Wonders Luxury Camp constitue un pied-à-terre idéal pour visiter le site principal de Pétra et se trouve à seulement 20 minutes à pied du site de Little Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ils sont également près du début de la marche vers le monastère de Petra. Ils peuvent effectuer des transferts en jeep pour que la randonnée dure un peu plus d&#039;une heure ou nous pouvons vous fournir un guide et vous permettre de marcher jusqu&#039;à l&#039;aller (4 heures).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le petit-déjeuner buffet et le dîner sont servis au restaurant de l&#039;hôtel. Des rafraîchissements, du thé, du café et une chicha sont proposés à la cafétéria.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/Sevenwonders2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.433098878566!2d35.46002215590556!3d30.370720506163973!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f148728a981:0x3400583251e6fc26!2sSeven Wonders Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571043236367!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1203, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'seven-wonders-luxury-camp'),
(1207, 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', 'Seven Wonders Luxury Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Seven Wonders Luxury Camp è una base ideale per visitare il sito principale di Petra e si trova a soli 20 minuti a piedi dal sito di Little Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sono anche vicino all&#039;inizio della passeggiata per tornare al Monastero di Petra. Possono effettuare trasferimenti in jeep in modo che la camminata sia di poco più di 1 ora o possiamo fornirti una guida e puoi camminare fino in fondo (4 ore).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La colazione e la cena a buffet vengono servite nel ristorante dell&#039;hotel, mentre nella caffetteria vengono offerti rinfreschi, tè, caffè e narghilè.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/Sevenwonders2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.433098878566!2d35.46002215590556!3d30.370720506163973!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f148728a981:0x3400583251e6fc26!2sSeven Wonders Luxury Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571043236367!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1203, 'it', '', 'one col', 'seven-wonders-luxury-camp'),
(1208, 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Beidha, Ammarin Bedouin Camp is an eco-friendly camp that offers guests a traditional Bedouin experience. It arranges horse riding and hiking trips upon request.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The rooms at Ammarin Bedouin Camp are decorated with simple furnishings and a shared bathroom. It is fitted with mattresses, pillows and blankets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp is 1.4 km away from Little Petra archaeological site and a shuttle service to the Petra is available upon request. Queen Alia International Airport is 94 km from the property.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/ammarin.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1501658987b30beb:0xe6e7d24bafc65208!2sAmmarin Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571044452774!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1208, 'en', '', 'one col', 'ammarin-bedouin-camp'),
(1209, 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located in Beidha, Ammarin Bedouin Camp is an eco-friendly camp that offers guests a traditional Bedouin experience. It arranges horse riding and hiking trips upon request.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The rooms at Ammarin Bedouin Camp are decorated with simple furnishings and a shared bathroom. It is fitted with mattresses, pillows and blankets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp is 1.4 km away from Little Petra archaeological site and a shuttle service to the Petra is available upon request. Queen Alia International Airport is 94 km from the property.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/ammarin.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1501658987b30beb:0xe6e7d24bafc65208!2sAmmarin Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571044452774!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1208, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'ammarin-bedouin-camp'),
(1210, 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ubicado en Beidha, Ammarin Bedouin Camp es un campamento ecológico que ofrece a los huéspedes una experiencia beduina tradicional. Se organizan excursiones a caballo y senderismo bajo petición.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones del Ammarin Bedouin Camp están decoradas con muebles sencillos y baño compartido. Está equipado con colchones, almohadas y mantas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este campamento se encuentra a 1,4 km del sitio arqueológico de Little Petra y se ofrece un servicio de traslado al Petra bajo petición. El aeropuerto internacional Queen Alia se encuentra a 94 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/ammarin.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1501658987b30beb:0xe6e7d24bafc65208!2sAmmarin Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571044452774!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1208, 'es', '', 'one col', 'ammarin-bedouin-camp'),
(1211, 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situé à Beidha, le camp bédouin Ammarin est un camp écologique offrant à ses clients une expérience bédouine traditionnelle. Des randonnées à cheval et à pied sont organisées sur demande.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres de l’Ammarin Bedouin Camp sont décorées avec un mobilier simple et une salle de bains commune. Il est équipé de matelas, oreillers et couvertures.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ce camp se trouve à 1,4 km du site archéologique de Little Petra. Un service de navette pour Petra est disponible sur demande. L&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia est à 94 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/ammarin.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1501658987b30beb:0xe6e7d24bafc65208!2sAmmarin Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571044452774!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1208, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'ammarin-bedouin-camp'),
(1212, 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', 'Ammarin Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Situato a Beidha, l&#039;Ammarin Bedouin Camp è un campo ecologico che offre agli ospiti un&#039;esperienza beduina tradizionale. Su richiesta sono organizzate passeggiate a cavallo ed escursioni.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le camere dell&#039;Ammarin Bedouin Camp sono arredate con mobili semplici e un bagno in comune. È dotata di materassi, cuscini e coperte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo campo si trova a 1,4 km dal sito archeologico di Little Petra e un servizio navetta per Petra è disponibile su richiesta. L&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia dista 94 km.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/ammarin.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1501658987b30beb:0xe6e7d24bafc65208!2sAmmarin Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571044452774!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1208, 'it', '', 'one col', 'ammarin-bedouin-camp'),
(1213, 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bubble Luxotel Petra is located in a dramatic setting of breath-taking view of Petra Mountains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bubble Luxotel Petra has 20 bubble suites each has its own private Hot Tub and sun deck, perfect for relaxing and unwinding after a day exploring the surrounding area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;As the sun sets over the mountains you can sit back and take in nature’s spectacular show.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This Luxotel offers overnight stay together with breakfast and dinner included. Free shuttle service to Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/petra-bubble-luxotel (2).jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016faa8ef0e247:0xc79496df81164ef!2sBubble Luxotel Petra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571045912945!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1213, 'en', '', 'one col', 'bubble-luxotel-petra'),
(1214, 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bubble Luxotel Petra is located in a dramatic setting of breath-taking view of Petra Mountains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bubble Luxotel Petra has 20 bubble suites each has its own private Hot Tub and sun deck, perfect for relaxing and unwinding after a day exploring the surrounding area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;As the sun sets over the mountains you can sit back and take in nature’s spectacular show.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This Luxotel offers overnight stay together with breakfast and dinner included. Free shuttle service to Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/petra-bubble-luxotel (2).jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016faa8ef0e247:0xc79496df81164ef!2sBubble Luxotel Petra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571045912945!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1213, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'bubble-luxotel-petra'),
(1215, 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bubble Luxotel Petra se encuentra en un entorno espectacular de impresionantes vistas de las montañas de Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bubble Luxotel Petra cuenta con 20 suites de burbujas, cada una con su propio jacuzzi privado y terraza para tomar el sol, ideal para relajarse y descansar después de un día explorando los alrededores.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A medida que el sol se pone sobre las montañas, puedes sentarte y disfrutar del fabuloso espectáculo de la naturaleza.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este Luxotel ofrece alojamiento durante la noche junto con desayuno y cena incluidos. Servicio de transporte gratuito a Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/petra-bubble-luxotel (2).jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016faa8ef0e247:0xc79496df81164ef!2sBubble Luxotel Petra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571045912945!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1213, 'es', '', 'one col', 'bubble-luxotel-petra'),
(1216, 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Bubble Luxotel Petra se trouve dans un cadre spectaculaire avec une vue imprenable sur les montagnes de Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Bubble Luxotel Petra dispose de 20 suites Bubble, chacune avec son propre jacuzzi privé et sa terrasse bien exposée, idéale pour se détendre et se reposer après une journée passée à explorer les environs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lorsque le soleil se couche sur les montagnes, vous pourrez vous asseoir et profiter du fabuleux spectacle de la nature.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ce Luxotel propose une nuitée avec petit-déjeuner et dîner inclus. Service de navette gratuit pour Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/petra-bubble-luxotel (2).jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016faa8ef0e247:0xc79496df81164ef!2sBubble Luxotel Petra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571045912945!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1213, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'bubble-luxotel-petra'),
(1217, 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', 'Bubble Luxotel Petra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bubble Luxotel Petra è in una cornice spettacolare con vista mozzafiato sulle montagne di Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Bubble Luxotel Petra dispone di 20 suite di bolle, ognuna con la propria jacuzzi privata e terrazza solarium, ideale per rilassarsi e riposarsi dopo una giornata trascorsa esplorando i dintorni.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Mentre il sole tramonta sulle montagne, puoi rilassarti e goderti il favoloso spettacolo della natura.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo Luxotel offre pernottamento con colazione e cena incluse. Servizio navetta gratuito per Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/petra-bubble-luxotel (2).jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016faa8ef0e247:0xc79496df81164ef!2sBubble Luxotel Petra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571045912945!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1213, 'it', '', 'one col', 'bubble-luxotel-petra'),
(1218, 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp is in an ideal location only 15 minute drive away from Wadi Musa and Petra, offers you traditional accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Desert camping in a Bedouin camp is an experience that every traveler should try at least once because you will feel closer to the landscape and the people and the memories will last forever.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp offers private tents with carpeted floors and wrought-iron beds. The camp includes shared bathrooms with showers. In the morning a buffet breakfast is served in the restaurant for the guests.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/7wonders.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0xfb62ac256103d1d2!2sSeven Wonders Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571048883312!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1218, 'en', '', 'one col', 'seven-wonders-bedouin-camp'),
(1219, 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp is in an ideal location only 15 minute drive away from Wadi Musa and Petra, offers you traditional accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Desert camping in a Bedouin camp is an experience that every traveler should try at least once because you will feel closer to the landscape and the people and the memories will last forever.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp offers private tents with carpeted floors and wrought-iron beds. The camp includes shared bathrooms with showers. In the morning a buffet breakfast is served in the restaurant for the guests.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/7wonders.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0xfb62ac256103d1d2!2sSeven Wonders Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571048883312!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1218, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'seven-wonders-bedouin-camp'),
(1220, 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp está en una ubicación ideal, a solo 15 minutos en coche de Wadi Musa y Petra, y le ofrece alojamiento tradicional.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Acampar en el desierto en un campamento beduino es una experiencia que todo viajero debería probar al menos una vez porque se sentirá más cerca del paisaje y de las personas y los recuerdos durarán para siempre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este campamento ofrece tiendas privadas con pisos alfombrados y camas de hierro forjado. El campamento incluye baños compartidos con duchas. Por la mañana se sirve un desayuno bufé en el restaurante para los huéspedes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/7wonders.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0xfb62ac256103d1d2!2sSeven Wonders Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571048883312!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1218, 'es', '', 'one col', 'seven-wonders-bedouin-camp'),
(1221, 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp est idéalement situé, à seulement 15 minutes de route de Wadi Musa et de Pétra, et vous propose un hébergement traditionnel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Camper dans le désert dans un camp bédouin est une expérience que chaque voyageur devrait essayer au moins une fois, car il se sentira plus proche du paysage et des personnes et des souvenirs durables.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ce camp propose des tentes privées avec moquette et lits en fer forgé. Le camp comprend des salles de bains communes avec douches. Dans la matinée, un petit-déjeuner buffet est servi au restaurant.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/7wonders.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0xfb62ac256103d1d2!2sSeven Wonders Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571048883312!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1218, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'seven-wonders-bedouin-camp'),
(1222, 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', 'Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Seven Wonders Bedouin Camp si trova in una posizione ideale, a soli 15 minuti di auto da Wadi Musa e Petra, e offre sistemazioni tradizionali.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Campeggiare nel deserto in un campo beduino è un&#039;esperienza che ogni viaggiatore dovrebbe provare almeno una volta perché si sentiranno più vicini al paesaggio e alle persone e i ricordi dureranno per sempre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo campo offre tende private con pavimenti in moquette e letti in ferro battuto. Il campo comprende bagni in comune con docce. Al mattino una colazione a buffet viene servita nel ristorante per gli ospiti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/7wonders.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.392698474312!2d35.460022134961!3d30.370863943863643!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0xfb62ac256103d1d2!2sSeven Wonders Bedouin Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571048883312!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1218, 'it', '', 'one col', 'seven-wonders-bedouin-camp'),
(1223, 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Mars Camp is located in the famous, archaeological and historical city of Petra at 8km from Petra main gate and 1km from Little Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Mars Camp is supplied with modern facilities like bathrooms, hot water powered by solar energy.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp offers accommodation in tents equipped with beds, table, and electricity outlet. Also, it offers amazing small caves for those who would love to live the experience of sleeping in a cave.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Preparing food on wood fire in the wildlife is their passion, they serve you with the best Bedouin dishes from the area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/mars.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.372498231856!2d35.46002212448871!3d30.370935662627097!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f5c78914599:0x903cf190e38c95c0!2sPetra mars camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571050757757!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1223, 'en', '', 'one col', 'petra-mars-camp'),
(1224, 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Mars Camp is located in the famous, archaeological and historical city of Petra at 8km from Petra Main Gate and 1km from Little Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Mars Camp is supplied with modern facilities like bathrooms, hot water powered by solar energy.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This camp offers accommodation in tents equipped with beds, table, and electricity outlet. Also, it offers amazing small caves for those who would love to live the experience of sleeping in a cave.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Preparing food on wood fire in the wildlife is their passion, they serve you with the best Bedouin dishes from the area.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/mars.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.372498231856!2d35.46002212448871!3d30.370935662627097!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f5c78914599:0x903cf190e38c95c0!2sPetra mars camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571050757757!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1223, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'petra-mars-camp'),
(1225, 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Mars Camp está ubicado en la famosa ciudad arqueológica e histórica de Petra, a 8 km de la puerta principal de Petra y a 1 km de Little Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Mars Camp cuenta con instalaciones modernas como baños, agua caliente alimentada por energía solar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este campamento ofrece alojamiento en carpas equipadas con camas, mesa y toma de corriente. Además, ofrece increíbles cuevas pequeñas para aquellos a quienes les encantaría vivir la experiencia de dormir en una cueva.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Preparar comida al fuego de leña en la vida salvaje es su pasión, te sirven los mejores platos beduinos de la zona.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/mars.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.372498231856!2d35.46002212448871!3d30.370935662627097!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f5c78914599:0x903cf190e38c95c0!2sPetra mars camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571050757757!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1223, 'es', '', 'one col', 'petra-mars-camp'),
(1226, 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Petra Mars Camp est situé dans la célèbre ville archéologique et historique de Pétra, à 8 km de la porte principale de Pétra et à 1 km de Little Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Mars Camp dispose d’installations modernes telles que des salles de bains et de l’eau chaude alimentée par l’énergie solaire.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ce camp propose un hébergement dans des tentes équipées de lits, d&#039;une table et d&#039;un point de vente. En outre, il offre d&#039;incroyables petites grottes pour ceux qui aimeraient vivre l&#039;expérience de dormir dans une grotte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sa passion est de préparer de la nourriture au feu de bois dans la vie sauvage. Ils vous servent les meilleurs plats bédouins de la région.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/mars.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.372498231856!2d35.46002212448871!3d30.370935662627097!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f5c78914599:0x903cf190e38c95c0!2sPetra mars camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571050757757!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1223, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'petra-mars-camp'),
(1227, 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', 'Petra Mars Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Mars Camp si trova nella famosa città archeologica e storica di Petra, a 8 km dalla porta principale di Petra e 1 km da Little Petra.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Petra Mars Camp dispone di servizi moderni come bagni, acqua calda alimentata da energia solare.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo campo offre alloggio in tende dotate di letti, tavolo e presa. Inoltre, offre incredibili piccole grotte per coloro che vorrebbero vivere l&#039;esperienza di dormire in una grotta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Preparare il cibo sul fuoco a legna nella fauna selvatica è la loro passione, ti servono i migliori piatti beduini della zona.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/mars.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d27538.372498231856!2d35.46002212448871!3d30.370935662627097!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15016f5c78914599:0x903cf190e38c95c0!2sPetra mars camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571050757757!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1223, 'it', '', 'one col', 'petra-mars-camp'),
(1228, 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Rock Camp in Petra has to offer memorable moments and unforgettable experiences to make your journey through our land truly exceptional.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Rock Camp has captured the beauty and comfort of lodging in hand-made Bedouin tents or regular luxury tents all furnished in a colorful Bedouin rustic touch with remarkable views of the soaring rocks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each Bedouin tent can accommodate 2 guests, while the spacious luxury tent can take up to 4 guests; featuring comfortable beds with sheets, pillows and blankets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/the-rock-camp-petra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d110109.25373317508!2d35.448512099999995!3d30.410176699999997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150165ba66e22e79:0xf9166e0d20be37cd!2sThe Rock Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571053771445!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1228, 'en', '', 'one col', 'the-rock-camp');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1229, 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Rock Cam in Petra has to offer memorable moments and unforgettable experiences to make your journey through our land truly exceptional.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Rock camp has captured the beauty and comfort of lodging in hand-made Bedouin tents or regular luxury tents all furnished in a colorful Bedouin rustic touch with remarkable views of the soaring rocks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each Bedouin tent can accommodate 2 guests, while the spacious luxury tent can take up to 4 guests; featuring comfortable beds with sheets, pillows and blankets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/the-rock-camp-petra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d110109.25373317508!2d35.448512099999995!3d30.410176699999997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150165ba66e22e79:0xf9166e0d20be37cd!2sThe Rock Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571053771445!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1228, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'the-rock-camp'),
(1230, 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Rock Camp en Petra tiene para ofrecer momentos memorables y experiencias inolvidables para que su viaje por nuestra tierra sea realmente excepcional.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Rock Camp ha capturado la belleza y la comodidad de alojarse en tiendas beduinas hechas a mano o en tiendas de lujo regulares, todas amuebladas en un colorido toque rústico beduino con vistas notables de las rocas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cada tienda beduina tiene capacidad para 2 personas, mientras que la espaciosa tienda de lujo puede alojar hasta 4 personas; Cuenta con cómodas camas con sábanas, almohadas y mantas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/the-rock-camp-petra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d110109.25373317508!2d35.448512099999995!3d30.410176699999997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150165ba66e22e79:0xf9166e0d20be37cd!2sThe Rock Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571053771445!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1228, 'es', '', 'one col', 'the-rock-camp'),
(1231, 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Rock Camp à Petra a à offrir des moments mémorables et des expériences inoubliables pour que votre voyage à travers notre pays soit vraiment exceptionnel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Rock Camp a capturé la beauté et le confort de rester dans des tentes bédouines faites à la main ou des tentes de luxe régulières, toutes meublées dans une touche bédouine rustique colorée avec une vue remarquable sur les rochers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Chaque tente bédouine peut accueillir 2 personnes, tandis que le grand magasin de luxe peut accueillir jusqu&#039;à 4 personnes. Il dispose de lits confortables avec draps, oreillers et couvertures.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/the-rock-camp-petra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d110109.25373317508!2d35.448512099999995!3d30.410176699999997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150165ba66e22e79:0xf9166e0d20be37cd!2sThe Rock Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571053771445!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1228, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'the-rock-camp'),
(1232, 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', 'The Rock Camp', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Rock Camp di Petra deve offrire momenti memorabili ed esperienze indimenticabili in modo che il tuo viaggio attraverso la nostra terra sia davvero eccezionale.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Rock Camp ha catturato la bellezza e il comfort di soggiornare in tende beduine fatte a mano o in tende di lusso regolari, tutte arredate in un colorato tocco beduino rustico con una straordinaria vista sulle rocce.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ogni tenda beduina può ospitare 2 persone, mentre l&#039;ampio negozio di lusso può ospitare fino a 4 persone; Dispone di comodi letti con lenzuola, cuscini e coperte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Petra/camps/the-rock-camp-petra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d110109.25373317508!2d35.448512099999995!3d30.410176699999997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150165ba66e22e79:0xf9166e0d20be37cd!2sThe Rock Camp!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571053771445!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1228, 'it', '', 'one col', 'the-rock-camp'),
