(1238, 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel is a family-owned hotel, located in Jerash directly opposite the Hadrian Gate the memorial gate built in Gerasa in about 129 AD.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Hotel is only few minutes away from major historical and ancient sites such as Jerash center which is a five minute walk. Hadrian Gate Hotel offers a perfect accommodation with five air-conditioned comfortable rooms feature a modern decoration and a flat-screen TV.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; Wi-Fi is available throughout and you can enjoy hot drinks for free. Guests have access to a rooftop terrace while staying at Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/Hadrian.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d53967.12462999722!2d35.870983104374865!3d32.28644886531097!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c804ab9d1e0df:0xed24ff97c5fc4b15!2sHadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571129236114!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1238, 'en', '', 'one col', 'hadrians-gate-hotel'),
(1239, 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel is a family-owned hotel, located in Jerash directly opposite the Hadrian Gate the memorial gate built in Gerasa in about 129 AD.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Hotel is only few minutes away from major historical and ancient sites such as Jerash center which is a five minute walk. Hadrian Gate Hotel offers a perfect accommodation with five air-conditioned comfortable rooms feature a modern decoration and a flat-screen TV.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; Wi-Fi is available throughout and you can enjoy hot drinks for free. Guests have access to a rooftop terrace while staying at Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/Hadrian.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d53967.12462999722!2d35.870983104374865!3d32.28644886531097!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c804ab9d1e0df:0xed24ff97c5fc4b15!2sHadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571129236114!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1238, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'hadrians-gate-hotel'),
(1240, 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel es un hotel de propiedad familiar, ubicado en Jerash, justo enfrente de la Puerta de Adriano, la puerta conmemorativa construida en Gerasa alrededor del año 129 DC.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El hotel está a solo unos minutos de los principales sitios históricos y antiguos, como el centro de Jerash, que está a cinco minutos a pie. Hadrian Gate Hotel ofrece un alojamiento perfecto con cinco cómodas habitaciones con aire acondicionado, decoración moderna y TV de pantalla plana.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hay conexión Wi-Fi disponible en todo el establecimiento y puedes disfrutar de bebidas calientes gratis. Los huéspedes tienen acceso a una terraza en la azotea mientras se alojan en el Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel. Y, para mayor comodidad, hay estacionamiento gratuito disponible para los huéspedes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/Hadrian.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d53967.12462999722!2d35.870983104374865!3d32.28644886531097!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c804ab9d1e0df:0xed24ff97c5fc4b15!2sHadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571129236114!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1238, 'es', '', 'one col', 'hadrians-gate-hotel'),
(1241, 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel est un hôtel à la gestion familiale situé à Jerash, juste en face de la porte d&#039;Hadrien, la porte du mémorial construite à Gerasa autour de 129 ap.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hôtel se trouve à seulement quelques minutes des principaux sites historiques et anciens, tels que le centre-ville de Jerash, à cinq minutes à pied. L&#039;Hadrian Gate Hotel propose un hébergement parfait avec cinq chambres confortables avec climatisation, décor moderne et télévision à écran plat.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Une connexion Wi-Fi est disponible dans tout l&#039;établissement et vous pourrez déguster des boissons chaudes gratuites. Vous aurez accès à un toit-terrasse pendant votre séjour à l&#039;Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel. Et, pour plus de commodité, un parking gratuit est disponible pour les clients.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/Hadrian.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d53967.12462999722!2d35.870983104374865!3d32.28644886531097!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c804ab9d1e0df:0xed24ff97c5fc4b15!2sHadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571129236114!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1238, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'hadrians-gate-hotel'),
(1242, 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', 'Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel è un hotel a conduzione familiare, situato a Jerash, proprio di fronte alla Porta di Adriano, la porta commemorativa costruita a Gerasa intorno al 129 d.C.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;hotel si trova a pochi minuti dai principali siti storici e antichi, come il centro di Jerash, a cinque minuti a piedi. L&#039;Hadrian Gate Hotel offre sistemazioni perfette con cinque camere confortevoli con aria condizionata, arredi moderni e TV a schermo piatto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La connessione Wi-Fi è disponibile in tutta la struttura e potrete gustare bevande calde gratuite. Durante il vostro soggiorno presso l&#039;Hadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel potrete accedere a una terrazza panoramica. E, per maggiore comodità, è disponibile un parcheggio gratuito per gli ospiti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/Hadrian.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d53967.12462999722!2d35.870983104374865!3d32.28644886531097!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c804ab9d1e0df:0xed24ff97c5fc4b15!2sHadrian&#039;s Gate Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571129236114!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1238, 'it', '', 'one col', 'hadrians-gate-hotel'),
(1243, 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wooden Arcs Resort &amp;amp; Spa offers its guests 2 the outdoor swimming pools and a kids&#039; pool. There are 2 restaurants on site, as well as a coffee shop and a nearby snack bar/deli.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;You can enjoy a drink at the bar/lounge. Public spaces have free Wi-Fi. There&#039;s an onsite 24-hour business centre. Spa services, a terrace, and tour or ticket assistance are also featured at Wooden Arcs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; A round-trip airport shuttle (available 24 hours) is available for a fee. Free self parking and valet parking are available.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/Wooden2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3373.3754411516293!2d35.89491764254816!3d32.274882539573134!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzLCsDE2JzI5LjYiTiAzNcKwNTMnNDYuMSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571131295579!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1243, 'en', '', 'one col', 'wooden-arcs-resort-amp-spa'),
(1244, 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wooden Arcs Resort &amp;amp; Spa offers its guests 2 the outdoor swimming pools and a kids&#039; pool. There are 2 restaurants on site, as well as a coffee shop and a nearby snack bar/deli.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;You can enjoy a drink at the bar/lounge. Public spaces have free Wi-Fi. There&#039;s an onsite 24-hour business centre. Spa services, a terrace, and tour or ticket assistance are also featured at Wooden Arcs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; A round-trip airport shuttle (available 24 hours) is available for a fee. Free self parking and valet parking are available.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/Wooden2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3373.3754411516293!2d35.89491764254816!3d32.274882539573134!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzLCsDE2JzI5LjYiTiAzNcKwNTMnNDYuMSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571131295579!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1243, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'wooden-arcs-resort-amp-spa'),
(1245, 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wooden Arcs Resort &amp;amp; Spa ofrece a sus huéspedes 2 piscinas al aire libre y una piscina infantil. Hay 2 restaurantes en el lugar, así como una cafetería y un snack bar / delicatessen cercano.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Puedes disfrutar de una bebida en el bar o lounge. Los espacios públicos tienen conexión inalámbrica a internet gratuita. Hay un centro de negocios abierto las 24 horas. El Wooden Arcs Resort &amp;amp; Spa también ofrece servicios de spa, una terraza y asistencia turística y para la compra de entradas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se ofrece un servicio de traslado de ida y vuelta al aeropuerto (disponible las 24 horas) por una tarifa. Aparcamiento sin asistencia gratuito y servicio de aparcacoches disponibles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/Wooden2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3373.3754411516293!2d35.89491764254816!3d32.274882539573134!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzLCsDE2JzI5LjYiTiAzNcKwNTMnNDYuMSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571131295579!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1243, 'es', '', 'one col', 'wooden-arcs-resort-amp-spa'),
(1246, 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Wooden Arcs Resort &amp;amp; Spa propose à ses clients 2 piscines extérieures et un bassin pour enfants. Il y a 2 restaurants sur place, ainsi qu&#039;une cafétéria et un snack bar / épicerie fine à proximité.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous pouvez prendre un verre au bar / salon. Les espaces publics disposent d&#039;une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite. Il y a un centre d&#039;affaires ouvert 24h / 24. Le Wooden Arcs Resort &amp;amp; Spa propose également des services de spa, une terrasse et une assistance pour les visites et les billets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un service de navette aller-retour pour l&#039;aéroport (disponible 24h / 24) est disponible moyennant un supplément. Un parking gratuit et un service de voiturier sont disponibles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/Wooden2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3373.3754411516293!2d35.89491764254816!3d32.274882539573134!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzLCsDE2JzI5LjYiTiAzNcKwNTMnNDYuMSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571131295579!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1243, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'wooden-arcs-resort-amp-spa'),
(1247, 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', 'Wooden Arcs Resort &amp; Spa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wooden Arcs Resort &amp;amp; Spa offre ai suoi ospiti 2 piscine all&#039;aperto e una piscina per bambini. Sono presenti 2 ristoranti in loco, nonché una caffetteria e uno snack bar / gastronomia nelle vicinanze.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Potrete sorseggiare un drink nel bar / lounge. Gli spazi pubblici hanno la connessione Wi-Fi gratuita. C&#039;è un business center aperto 24 ore al giorno. Wooden Arcs Resort &amp;amp; Spa offre anche trattamenti spa, una terrazza e supporto per la prenotazione di escursioni / biglietti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; Un servizio navetta di andata e ritorno per l&#039;aeroporto (disponibile 24 ore su 24) è disponibile a pagamento. Parcheggio gratuito e parcheggio custodito disponibili.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/Wooden2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3373.3754411516293!2d35.89491764254816!3d32.274882539573134!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x0!2zMzLCsDE2JzI5LjYiTiAzNcKwNTMnNDYuMSJF!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571131295579!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1243, 'it', '', 'one col', 'wooden-arcs-resort-amp-spa'),
(1248, '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Set 2.3 km from Ruins of Jerash and 2.4 km from Jarash Ruins, 1955 Heart of Jerash in Jerash offers air-conditioned accommodation with views of the city and free WiFi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each unit is fitted with a fully equipped kitchen with a microwave, a seating area with a sofa, a flat-screen TV, a washing machine, and a private bathroom with bidet and a hairdryer. A fridge, an oven and stovetop are also offered, as well as a kettle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests at the apartment can enjoy a à la carte breakfast. 1955 Heart of Jerash offers a terrace.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/1955.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13492.231518658778!2d35.88445877549869!3d32.28342178873913!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c803a85134ceb:0x15be1ed35bd47022!2s1955 Heart of Jerash!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571134113671!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1248, 'en', '', 'one col', '1955-heart-of-jerash'),
(1249, '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Set 2.3 km from Ruins of Jerash and 2.4 km from Jarash Ruins, 1955 Heart of Jerash in Jerash offers air-conditioned accommodation with views of the city and free WiFi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Each unit is fitted with a fully equipped kitchen with a microwave, a seating area with a sofa, a flat-screen TV, a washing machine, and a private bathroom with bidet and a hairdryer. A fridge, an oven and stovetop are also offered, as well as a kettle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests at the apartment can enjoy a à la carte breakfast. 1955 Heart of Jerash offers a terrace.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/1955.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13492.231518658778!2d35.88445877549869!3d32.28342178873913!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c803a85134ceb:0x15be1ed35bd47022!2s1955 Heart of Jerash!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571134113671!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1248, 'Ar', '', 'one col', '1955-heart-of-jerash'),
(1250, '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El 1955 Heart of Jerash en Jerash, está situado a 2,3 km de las ruinas de Jerash y a 2,4 km de las ruinas de Jarash, ofrece alojamiento con aire acondicionado, vistas a la ciudad y conexión WiFi gratuita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todos los alojamientos disponen de cocina totalmente equipada con microondas, zona de estar con sofá, TV de pantalla plana, lavadora y baño privado con bidet y secador de pelo. También hay nevera, horno, fogones y hervidor de agua.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los huéspedes del apartamento pueden disfrutar de un desayuno a la carta. 1955 El Heart of Jerash ofrece una terraza.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/1955.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13492.231518658778!2d35.88445877549869!3d32.28342178873913!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c803a85134ceb:0x15be1ed35bd47022!2s1955 Heart of Jerash!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571134113671!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1248, 'es', '', 'one col', '1955-heart-of-jerash');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1251, '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Proposant un hébergement climatisé avec vue sur la ville et connexion Wi-Fi gratuite, le 1955 Heart of Jerash in Jerash est situé à 2,3 km des ruines de Jerash et à 2,4 km des ruines de Jarash.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tous les logements disposent d&#039;une cuisine entièrement équipée avec un four micro-ondes, d&#039;un coin salon avec un canapé, d&#039;une télévision à écran plat, d&#039;un lave-linge et d&#039;une salle de bains privative avec un bidet et un sèche-cheveux. Il y a aussi un réfrigérateur, un four, une cuisinière et une bouilloire.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez savourer un petit-déjeuner à la carte. 1955 Le Heart of Jerash dispose d&#039;une terrasse.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/1955.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13492.231518658778!2d35.88445877549869!3d32.28342178873913!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c803a85134ceb:0x15be1ed35bd47022!2s1955 Heart of Jerash!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571134113671!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1248, 'fr', '', 'one col', '1955-heart-of-jerash'),
(1252, '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '1955 Heart of Jerash', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dotato di sistemazioni climatizzate con vista sulla città e connessione Wi-Fi gratuita, il 1955 Heart of Jerash in Jerash si trova a 2,3 km dalle rovine di Jerash ea 2,4 km dalle rovine di Jarash.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le unità sono dotate di cucina completamente attrezzata con forno a microonde, area salotto con divano, TV a schermo piatto, lavatrice e bagno privato con bidet e asciugacapelli. C&#039;è anche un frigorifero, forno, piano cottura e bollitore.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gli ospiti dell&#039;appartamento possono gustare una colazione à la carte. 1955 The Heart of Jerash offre una terrazza.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Jerash/1955.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13492.231518658778!2d35.88445877549869!3d32.28342178873913!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c803a85134ceb:0x15be1ed35bd47022!2s1955 Heart of Jerash!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571134113671!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1248, 'it', '', 'one col', '1955-heart-of-jerash'),
(1253, 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel is located 269 km from Wadi Rum, the Amman Queen Alia International Airport is 72 min drive and from Salt Archaeological and Folklore Museum only 5 min walk.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel is a fine accommodation choice in Al Salt. It features dry cleaning, ironing service as well as a storage room, a designated smoking area and a newspaper stand.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz provides guest rooms appointed with a private balcony, a dressing area, a work desk and internet Wi-Fi. Guests can also use a microwave, a dishwasher and a fridge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz offers such leisure options as a sun terrace and a library.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/beitazizjordan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.147836907734!2d35.72327031467039!3d32.03818962859585!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cbd4539bd4017:0xb6cb472b86a1755b!2sBeit Aziz!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571136070146!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1253, 'en', '', 'one col', 'beit-aziz-boutique-hotel'),
(1254, 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel is located 269 km from Wadi Rum, the Amman International Airport Queen Alia is 72 min drive and from Salt Archaeological and Folklore Museum only 5 min walk.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel is a fine accommodation choice in Al Salt. It features dry cleaning, ironing service as well as a storage room, a designated smoking area and a newspaper stand.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz provides guest rooms appointed with a private balcony, a dressing area, a work desk and internet Wi-Fi. Guests can also use a microwave, a dishwasher and a fridge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz offers such leisure options as a sun terrace and a library.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/beitazizjordan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.147836907734!2d35.72327031467039!3d32.03818962859585!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cbd4539bd4017:0xb6cb472b86a1755b!2sBeit Aziz!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571136070146!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1253, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'beit-aziz-boutique-hotel'),
(1255, 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel se encuentra a 269 km de Wadi Rum, el Aeropuerto Internacional Queen Alia en Ammán a 72 minutos en coche y el Museo Arqueológico y de Folclore de Salt a solo 5 minutos a pie.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel ofrece habitaciones buenas en Al Salt. Cuenta con servicio de limpieza en seco, servicio de planchado, así como un trastero, un área para fumadores y un quiosco.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones del Beit Aziz disponen de un balcón privado, un vestidor, un escritorio e internet Wi-Fi. Los huéspedes también pueden utilizar un microondas, un lavavajillas y una nevera.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz ofrece opciones de ocio como una terraza solárium y una biblioteca.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/beitazizjordan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.147836907734!2d35.72327031467039!3d32.03818962859585!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cbd4539bd4017:0xb6cb472b86a1755b!2sBeit Aziz!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571136070146!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1253, 'es', '', 'one col', 'beit-aziz-boutique-hotel'),
(1256, 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel se trouve à 269 km du Wadi Rum, de l&#039;Aéroport International Queen Alia, à 72 minutes de route et du musée archéologique et du folklore du sel, à seulement 5 minutes à pied.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel offre de bonnes chambres à Al Salt. Il comprend un service de nettoyage à sec, un service de repassage, une salle de stockage, un espace fumeur et un kiosque.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres du Beit Aziz disposent d&#039;un balcon privé, d&#039;un dressing, d&#039;un bureau et d&#039;une connexion Wi-Fi. Vous pourrez également utiliser un four micro-ondes, un lave-vaisselle et un réfrigérateur.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz offre des activités de loisirs comme une terrasse ensoleillée et une bibliothèque.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/beitazizjordan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.147836907734!2d35.72327031467039!3d32.03818962859585!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cbd4539bd4017:0xb6cb472b86a1755b!2sBeit Aziz!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571136070146!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1253, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'beit-aziz-boutique-hotel'),
(1257, 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', 'Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel si trova a 269 km da Wadi Rum, dall&#039;Aeroporto Internazionale Queen Alia di Amman, a 72 minuti di auto e dal Museo Archeologico e Folcloristico di Salt a soli 5 minuti a piedi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz Boutique Hotel offre delle belle camere ad Al Salt. Ha un servizio di lavaggio a secco, servizio stiratura, nonché un ripostiglio, una zona fumatori e un chiosco.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere del Beit Aziz sono dotate di balcone privato, spogliatoio, scrivania e Internet Wi-Fi. Gli ospiti possono anche usare una microonde, una lavastoviglie e un frigo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Beit Aziz offre opzioni per il tempo libero come una terrazza solarium e una biblioteca.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/beitazizjordan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.147836907734!2d35.72327031467039!3d32.03818962859585!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151cbd4539bd4017:0xb6cb472b86a1755b!2sBeit Aziz!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571136070146!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1253, 'it', '', 'one col', 'beit-aziz-boutique-hotel'),
