ss=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  Mountain Breeze Resort &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La sistemazione in Mountain Breeze Resort, di incomparabile qualità nel deserto della Giordania, le...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;it/mountain-breeze-resort/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leggi di Più&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1258, 'it', '', 'one col', 'hotel-di-al-salt'),
(1263, 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you’re looking for a romantic small hotel in Al Salt, look no further than Saltus Hotel. This Hotel offers a refrigerator, a mini-bar, and air conditioning in the rooms and it is easy to stay connected during your stay as free Wi-Fi is offered to guests.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;While staying in Al Salt, you can check out a popular Mediterranean restaurant like Restaurant and Grill Sanabel Dahabiya, which is serving up some great dishes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms are decorated in modern tones. Each one offers a satellite TV and a minibar. Featuring a bath or shower, private bathroom also comes with a hairdryer and a bidet. The suite includes a living room.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular history museums such as Abu Jaber Museum. The staff at Saltus Hotel looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/saltus-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.0514334012914!2d35.742661414670415!3d32.040799228465474!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9800d91f7e25:0x9b31cf39d879fbdf!2sSaltus Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571138010846!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1263, 'en', '', 'one col', 'saltus-hotel'),
(1264, 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you’re looking for a romantic small hotel in Al Salt, look no further than Saltus Hotel. This Hotel offers a refrigerator, a mini-bar, and air conditioning in the rooms and it is easy to stay connected during your stay as free Wi-Fi is offered to guests.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;While staying in Al Salt, you can check out a popular Mediterranean restaurant like Restaurant and Grill Sanabel Dahabiya, which is serving up some great dishes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All rooms are decorated in modern tones. Each one offers a satellite TV and a minibar. Featuring a bath or shower, private bathroom also comes with a hairdryer and a bidet. The suite includes a living room.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular history museums such as Abu Jaber Museum. The staff at Saltus Hotel looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/saltus-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.0514334012914!2d35.742661414670415!3d32.040799228465474!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9800d91f7e25:0x9b31cf39d879fbdf!2sSaltus Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571138010846!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1263, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'saltus-hotel'),
(1265, 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si buscas un pequeño hotel romántico en Al Salt, no busques más que en Saltus Hotel. Este Hotel ofrece una nevera, un mini-bar y aire acondicionado en las habitaciones y es fácil mantenerse conectado durante su estancia, ya que se ofrece conexión Wi-Fi gratuita a los huéspedes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Durante su estancia en Al Salt, puede visitar un popular restaurante mediterráneo como Restaurant and Grill Sanabel Dahabiya, que sirve excelentes platos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las habitaciones están decoradas en tonos modernos. Todas disponen de TV vía satélite y mini-bar. El baño privado incluye bañera o ducha, secador de pelo y bidet. La suite incluye una sala de estar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;No hay escasez de cosas que hacer en el área: explore museos de historia populares como el Museo Abu Jaber. El personal de Saltus Hotel espera poder servirle durante su próxima visita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/saltus-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.0514334012914!2d35.742661414670415!3d32.040799228465474!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9800d91f7e25:0x9b31cf39d879fbdf!2sSaltus Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571138010846!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1263, 'es', '', 'one col', 'saltus-hotel'),
(1266, 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si vous cherchez un petit hôtel romantique à Al Salt, ne cherchez pas plus loin que le Saltus Hotel. Cet hôtel propose un réfrigérateur, un mini-bar et la climatisation dans les chambres. Il est facile de rester connecté pendant votre séjour, car il propose une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pendant votre séjour à Al Salt, vous pourrez vous rendre dans un restaurant méditerranéen prisé tel que le restaurant et grill Sanabel Dahabiya, qui sert une excellente cuisine.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les chambres sont décorées dans des tons modernes. Toutes disposent de la télévision par satellite et d&#039;un mini-bar. La salle de bains privative comprend une baignoire ou une douche, un sèche-cheveux et un bidet. La suite comprend un salon.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les activités dans la région ne manquent pas: explorez les musées d’histoire populaires tels que le musée Abu Jaber. Le personnel du Saltus Hotel se fera un plaisir de vous servir lors de votre prochaine visite.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/saltus-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.0514334012914!2d35.742661414670415!3d32.040799228465474!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9800d91f7e25:0x9b31cf39d879fbdf!2sSaltus Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571138010846!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1263, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'saltus-hotel'),
(1267, 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', 'Saltus Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se stai cercando un piccolo hotel romantico ad Al Salt, non cercare oltre il Saltus Hotel. Questo hotel offre un frigorifero, un minibar e aria condizionata nelle camere ed è facile rimanere connessi durante il soggiorno, in quanto offre la connessione Wi-Fi gratuita per gli ospiti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Durante il tuo soggiorno ad Al Salt, puoi visitare un famoso ristorante mediterraneo come Restaurant and Grill Sanabel Dahabiya, che serve piatti eccellenti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le camere sono decorate in toni moderni. Tutte dispongono di TV satellitare e minibar. Il bagno privato è completo di vasca o doccia, asciugacapelli e bidet. La suite comprende un soggiorno.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Non mancano le cose da fare nella zona: esplorare musei di storia popolari come il Museo Abu Jaber. Lo staff del Saltus Hotel non vede l&#039;ora di servirti durante la tua prossima visita.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/saltus-hotel.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3382.0514334012914!2d35.742661414670415!3d32.040799228465474!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9800d91f7e25:0x9b31cf39d879fbdf!2sSaltus Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571138010846!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1263, 'it', '', 'one col', 'saltus-hotel'),
(1268, 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Unparalleled quality wilderness accommodation in Jordan, the Mountain Breeze Resort the luxury log cabins are set in their own private and secluded section of a pine and oak forest within the resort’s grounds.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;These luxury lodges were imported from northern Europe, and are built entirely from wood. All the lodges face amazing views and include a private terrace from which one can watch the sunrise from behind the pine covered mountains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ten lodges are available in total. You can combine the lodges with a team building activity or a conference or the ultimate corporate retreat using our indoor hall.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/mountain.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d216443.75597467844!2d35.76506091257182!3d32.0439863105357!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9a3bacd334cb:0x723ea59b58c3141b!2sMountain Breeze Resort!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571141553419!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1268, 'en', '', 'one col', 'mountain-breeze-resort'),
(1269, 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Unparalleled quality wilderness accommodation in Jordan, the Mountain Breeze Resort the luxury log cabins are set in their own private and secluded section of a pine and oak forest within the resort’s grounds.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;These luxury lodges were imported from northern Europe, and are built entirely from wood. All the lodges face amazing views and include a private terrace from which one can watch the sunrise from behind the pine covered mountains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ten lodges are available in total. You can combine the lodges with a team building activity or a conference or the ultimate corporate retreat using our indoor hall.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/mountain.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d216443.75597467844!2d35.76506091257182!3d32.0439863105357!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9a3bacd334cb:0x723ea59b58c3141b!2sMountain Breeze Resort!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571141553419!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1268, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'mountain-breeze-resort'),
(1270, 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El alojamiento Mountain Breeze Resort, de incomparable calidad en el desierto en Jordania, las lujosas cabañas de madera se encuentran en su propia sección privada y aislada de un bosque de pinos y robles dentro de los terrenos del complejo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Estos refugios de lujo fueron importados del Norte de Europa y están construidos completamente de madera. Todos los alojamientos tienen vistas impresionantes e incluyen una terraza privada desde la que se puede ver el amanecer desde detrás de las montañas cubiertas de pinos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Diez cabañas están disponibles en total. Puede combinar los alojamientos con una actividad de trabajo en equipo o una conferencia o el retiro corporativo definitivo utilizando nuestro salón interior.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/mountain.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d216443.75597467844!2d35.76506091257182!3d32.0439863105357!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9a3bacd334cb:0x723ea59b58c3141b!2sMountain Breeze Resort!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571141553419!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1268, 'es', '', 'one col', 'mountain-breeze-resort'),
(1271, 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hébergement Mountain Breeze Resort, d’une qualité incomparable dans le désert jordanien, les luxueuses cabanes en bois sont situées dans leur propre espace privé et isolées d’une forêt de pins et de chênes dans l’enceinte du complexe.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ces abris de luxe ont été importés d&#039;Europe du Nord et sont entièrement construits en bois. Tous les logements offrent une vue imprenable et comprennent une terrasse privée d&#039;où vous pourrez voir le lever du soleil derrière les montagnes couvertes de pins.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dix cabines sont disponibles au total. Vous pouvez combiner l&#039;hébergement avec une activité de travail d&#039;équipe ou une conférence ou la retraite d&#039;entreprise finale en utilisant notre salon intérieur.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/mountain.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d216443.75597467844!2d35.76506091257182!3d32.0439863105357!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9a3bacd334cb:0x723ea59b58c3141b!2sMountain Breeze Resort!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571141553419!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1268, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'mountain-breeze-resort'),
(1272, 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', 'Mountain Breeze Resort', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La sistemazione in Mountain Breeze Resort, di incomparabile qualità nel deserto della Giordania, le lussuose cabine in legno si trovano nella loro sezione privata e isolata di una foresta di pini e querce all&#039;interno del parco.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questi rifugi di lusso sono stati importati dal Nord Europa e sono costruiti interamente in legno. Tutte le sistemazioni hanno una vista mozzafiato e includono una terrazza privata da cui è possibile vedere l&#039;alba da dietro le montagne ricoperte di pini.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Sono disponibili in totale dieci cabine. Puoi combinare le sistemazioni con un&#039;attività di lavoro di squadra o una conferenza o il ritiro aziendale finale utilizzando la nostra sala interna.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Al-Salt/mountain.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d216443.75597467844!2d35.76506091257182!3d32.0439863105357!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9a3bacd334cb:0x723ea59b58c3141b!2sMountain Breeze Resort!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571141553419!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1268, 'it', '', 'one col', 'mountain-breeze-resort'),
(1273, 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nahas Plaza features a business 3-star accommodation in vicinity of Arabela Mall. The hotel is provided with 35 classic rooms. Just a 1-minute walk from the main gate of Al Yarmouk University, Nahas Plaza is located in Irbid. It offers free Wi-Fi in all areas, classic suites with modern amenities and a Mediterranean Restaurant.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All suites and apartments are fitted with tiled floors. Each one offers a living room with a flat-screen TV and a small kitchenette complete with a microwave. The apartment includes a terrace overlooking the city.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can shop at Al Yarmook Mall which is within a walking distance from Nahas Plaza. Queen Alia International Airport is 90 minutes by car. Free public parking is possible at a location nearby.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Irbid/34368_Nahas-Plaza.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d11313.984687868031!2d35.84823200778505!3d32.53501903041364!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c769533911ffd:0xa371843388dfcb92!2sNahas Plaza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571220045704!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1273, 'en', '', 'one col', 'nahas-plaza'),
(1274, 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nahas Plaza features a business 3-star accommodation in vicinity of Arabela Mall. The hotel is provided with 35 classic rooms. Just a 1-minute walk from the main gate of Al Yarmouk University, Nahas Plaza is located in Irbid. It offers free Wi-Fi in all areas, classic suites with modern amenities and a Mediterranean Restaurant.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;All suites and apartments are fitted with tiled floors. Each one offers a living room with a flat-screen TV and a small kitchenette complete with a microwave. The apartment includes a terrace overlooking the city.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Guests can shop at Al Yarmook Mall which is within a walking distance from Nahas Plaza. Queen Alia International Airport is 90 minutes by car. Free public parking is possible at a location nearby.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Irbid/34368_Nahas-Plaza.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d11313.984687868031!2d35.84823200778505!3d32.53501903041364!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c769533911ffd:0xa371843388dfcb92!2sNahas Plaza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571220045704!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1273, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'nahas-plaza');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1275, 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nahas Plaza ofrece un alojamiento empresarial de 3 estrellas en las inmediaciones de Centro comercial Arabela. El hotel cuenta con 35 habitaciones clásicas. El Nahas Plaza se encuentra en Irbid, a solo 1 minuto a pie de la puerta principal de la Universidad de Yarmouk. Ofrece conexión inalámbrica a internet gratuita en todas las áreas, suites clásicas con comodidades modernas y un restaurante mediterráneo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todas las suites y apartamentos están equipados con suelos de baldosas. Cada uno ofrece un televisor de pantalla plana y una pequeña cocina completa con microondas. El apartamento incluye una terraza con vistas a la ciudad.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los huespedes pueden comprar en el centro comercial Al Yarmook, que se encuentra a poca distancia de Nahas Plaza. El Aeropuerto Internacional Queen Alia está a 90 minutos en coche. Hay aparcamiento público gratuito en las inmediaciones.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Irbid/34368_Nahas-Plaza.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d11313.984687868031!2d35.84823200778505!3d32.53501903041364!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c769533911ffd:0xa371843388dfcb92!2sNahas Plaza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571220045704!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1273, 'es', '', 'one col', 'nahas-plaza'),
(1276, 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Nahas Plaza propose un hébergement d&#039;affaires 3 étoiles à proximité du centre commercial Arabela. L&#039;hôtel dispose de 35 chambres classiques. Le Nahas Plaza est situé à Irbid, à seulement 1 minute à pied de l&#039;entrée principale de l&#039;université de Yarmouk. Il propose une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite dans tout l&#039;établissement, des suites classiques dotées d&#039;équipements modernes et un restaurant méditerranéen.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Toutes les suites et appartements sont équipés de carrelage. Chacune dispose d&#039;une télévision à écran plat et d&#039;une petite cuisine avec four micro-ondes. L&#039;appartement comprend une terrasse surplombant la ville.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez faire des emplettes au centre commercial Al Yarmook, à quelques pas du Nahas Plaza. L&#039;aéroport international Queen Alia est accessible en une heure et demie en voiture. Un parking public gratuit est disponible à proximité.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Irbid/34368_Nahas-Plaza.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d11313.984687868031!2d35.84823200778505!3d32.53501903041364!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c769533911ffd:0xa371843388dfcb92!2sNahas Plaza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571220045704!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1273, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'nahas-plaza'),
(1277, 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', 'Nahas Plaza', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nahas Plaza è un hotel a 3 stelle a soli 1.6 km da Arabela Shopping Center. L&#039;hotel dispone di 35 camere classiche. Il Nahas Plaza si trova a Irbid, a solo 1 minuto a piedi dal cancello principale dell&#039;Università Yarmouk. Offre la connessione Wi-Fi gratuita in tutte le aree, suite classiche con servizi moderni e un ristorante mediterraneo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tutte le suite e gli appartamenti sono dotati di pavimenti piastrellati. Ognuna offre una TV a schermo piatto e una piccola cucina completa di forno a microonde. L&#039;appartamento comprende una terrazza con vista sulla città.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gli ospiti possono fare shopping presso il centro commerciale Al Yarmook, che si trova a pochi passi da Nahas Plaza. L&#039;aeroporto internazionale Queen Alia è raggiungibile in 90 minuti in auto. Nelle vicinanze è disponibile un parcheggio pubblico gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Irbid/34368_Nahas-Plaza.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d11313.984687868031!2d35.84823200778505!3d32.53501903041364!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c769533911ffd:0xa371843388dfcb92!2sNahas Plaza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571220045704!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1273, 'it', '', 'one col', 'nahas-plaza'),
