;En 2011, la UNESCO declaró la reserva de la biosfera de Mujib. Se extiende hasta las montañas Kerak y Madaba hacia el Norte y el Sur, llegando...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/wadi-mujib/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1318, 'es', '', 'one col', 'reservas-naturales-en-jordania'),
(1322, 'محميات طبيعية في الأردن', 'محميات طبيعية في الأردن', 'Natural Reserves in Jordan', 'Natural Reserves in Jordan', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Dana/DanaReserve.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;محمية ضانا للمحيط الحيوي&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   محمية ضانا للمحيط الحيوي&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;محمية ضانا للمحيط الحيوي is Jordan&#039;s largest nature reserve, located in south-central Jordan. محمية ضانا للمحيط الحيوي was founded in 1989 in the area in and around the Dana vil...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/dana-biosphere-reserve/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;المزيد&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/Ajlun_forestreserve.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;محمية غابات عجلون&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   محمية غابات عجلون&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The محمية غابات عجلون is a nature reserve located in the Ajloun Governorate in north-west Jordan. Established by the Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/ajloun-forest-reserve/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;المزيد&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/Dibeen_Forest_Reserve.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Dibbeen Forest Reserve&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Dibbeen Forest Reserve&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dibbeen Forest Reserve is a nature reserve located in the north-west of Jordan. It is situated just south of the Roman site of Jerash and covers an area of 8.5 square kilometers...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/dibbeen-forest-reserve/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;المزيد&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Shawmari Wildlife Reserve2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;محمية الشومري للحياة البرية&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   محمية الشومري للحياة البرية&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The محمية الشومري للحياة البرية is a Jordanian nature reserve near the town of Azraq, approximately 100 km (62 mi) east of Amman.It is a regionally important reserve created in 1975...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/shaumari-wildlife-reserve/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;المزيد&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/wetland.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;محمية الأزرق المائية&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   محمية الأزرق المائية&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The محمية الأزرق المائية is a nature reserve located near the town of Azraq in the eastern desert of Jordan. An oasis for migratory birds, Azraq was established in 1978 and covers 12 square...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/azraq-wetland-reserve/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;المزيد&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Yarmouk.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Yarmouk Forest Reserve&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Yarmouk Forest Reserve&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature is implementing the Integrated Ecosystem Management in the Jordan Rift Valley project, which aims to establish a network of reserves and...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/yarmouk-forest-reserve/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;المزيد&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/River-canyon-of-Wadi-Mujib.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Wadi Mujib&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Wadi Mujib&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In 2011, UNESCO declared Mujib biosphere reserve. It extends to the Kerak and Madaba mountains to the north and south, reaching 900 metres (3,000 ft) above sea level in some places....&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;Ar/wadi-mujib/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;المزيد&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1318, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'natural-reserves-in-jordan'),
(1323, 'Shaumari Wildlife Reserve', 'Shaumari Wildlife Reserve', 'The Shaumari Wildlife Reserve is a Jordanian nature reserve near the town of Azraq, 100km east of Amman.', 'Shaumari Wildlife Reserve', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Shaumari Wildlife Reserve is a Jordanian nature reserve near the town of Azraq, approximately 100 km (62 mi) east of Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is a regionally important reserve created in 1975 by the Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature as a breeding center for maintaining the wildlife in the country.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 22-square-kilometre (8.5 sq mi) reserve is a thriving protected environment in the Middle East. Some of the species in the reserve include Arabian oryx, Somali ostriches, Persian onagers and Gazelles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For visitors a playground and picnic area is located on the outside premises of the Visitors&#039; Centre. The observation tower provides eager animal watchers with a perfect location for spotting the Reserve&#039;s wildlife. The early hours of the morning are in particular the best for observing the Oryx in its natural environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Shaumari website 800x500.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d434296.30246477743!2d36.50174023281251!3d31.744842400000014!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ae73d85479d73:0x62da93d4f0cd05ac!2sShawmari Wildlife Reserve!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571307355790!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1323, 'en', '', 'one col', 'shaumari-wildlife-reserve'),
(1324, 'Shaumari Wildlife Reserve', 'Shaumari Wildlife Reserve', 'Shaumari Wildlife Reserve', 'Shaumari Wildlife Reserve', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Shaumari Wildlife Reserve is a Jordanian nature reserve near the town of Azraq, approximately 100 km (62 mi) east of Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is a regionally important reserve created in 1975 by the Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature as a breeding center for maintaining the wildlife in the country.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The 22-square-kilometre (8.5 sq mi) reserve is a thriving protected environment in the Middle East. Some of the species in the reserve include Arabian oryx, Somali ostriches, Persian onagers and Gazelles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For visitors a playground and picnic area is located on the outside premises of the Visitors&#039; Centre. The observation tower provides eager animal watchers with a perfect location for spotting the Reserve&#039;s wildlife. The early hours of the morning are in particular the best for observing the Oryx in its natural environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Shaumari website 800x500.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d434296.30246477743!2d36.50174023281251!3d31.744842400000014!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ae73d85479d73:0x62da93d4f0cd05ac!2sShawmari Wildlife Reserve!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571307355790!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1323, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'shaumari-wildlife-reserve'),
(1325, 'Reserva de Vida Silvestre Shaumari', 'Reserva de Vida Silvestre Shaumari', 'Reserva de Vida Silvestre Shaumari', 'Reserva de Vida Silvestre Shaumari', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Reserva de Vida Silvestre Shaumari es una reserva natural jordana cerca de la ciudad de Azraq, aproximadamente a 100 km (62 millas) al este de Ammán.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Es una reserva regionalmente importante creada en 1975 por la Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature como un centro de reproducción para mantener la vida silvestre en el país.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La reserva de 22 kilómetros cuadrados (8.5 millas cuadradas) es un próspero entorno protegido en el Medio Oriente. Algunas de las especies en la reserva incluyen el oryx árabe, las avestruces somalíes, los onagers persas y las gacelas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para los visitantes, hay un área de juegos y un área de picnic en las instalaciones exteriores del Centro de Visitantes. La torre de observación ofrece a los ansiosos observadores de animales una ubicación perfecta para observar la vida silvestre de la Reserva. Las primeras horas de la mañana son, en particular, las mejores para observar el Oryx en su entorno natural.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Shaumari website 800x500.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d434296.30246477743!2d36.50174023281251!3d31.744842400000014!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ae73d85479d73:0x62da93d4f0cd05ac!2sShawmari Wildlife Reserve!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571307355790!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1323, 'es', '', 'one col', 'reserva-de-vida-silvestre-shaumari'),
(1326, 'Réserve Faunique de Shaumari', 'Réserve Faunique de Shaumari', 'Réserve Faunique de Shaumari', 'Réserve Faunique de Shaumari', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Réserve Faunique de Shaumari est une réserve naturelle jordanienne située près de la ville d’Azraq, à environ 100 km à l’est de Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il s&#039;agit d&#039;une réserve d&#039;importance régionale créée en 1975 par la Société royale pour la conservation de la nature en tant que centre de reproduction pour le maintien de la faune dans le pays.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La réserve de 22 kilomètres carrés (8,5 milles carrés) est un environnement protégé en plein essor au Moyen-Orient. Parmi les espèces de la réserve, on trouve l&#039;oryx d&#039;Arabie, les autruches de Somalie, les onagres et les gazelles de Perse.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour les visiteurs, il y a une aire de jeux et une aire de pique-nique dans les installations extérieures du centre d&#039;accueil. La tour d&#039;observation offre aux observateurs anxieux des animaux un emplacement idéal pour observer la faune et la flore de la réserve. Les premières heures de la matinée sont particulièrement propices à l&#039;observation de l&#039;Oryx dans son environnement naturel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Shaumari website 800x500.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d434296.30246477743!2d36.50174023281251!3d31.744842400000014!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ae73d85479d73:0x62da93d4f0cd05ac!2sShawmari Wildlife Reserve!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571307355790!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1323, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'reserve-faunique-de-shaumari'),
(1327, 'Riserva Faunistica di Shaumari', 'Riserva Faunistica di Shaumari', 'Riserva Faunistica di Shaumari', 'Riserva Faunistica di Shaumari', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Riserva Faunistica di Shaumari è una riserva naturale giordana vicino alla città di Azraq, a circa 100 km (62 miglia) ad est di Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;È una riserva importante a livello regionale creata nel 1975 dalla Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature come centro di allevamento per la conservazione della fauna selvatica nel paese.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La riserva di 22 chilometri quadrati (8,5 miglia quadrate) è un fiorente ambiente protetto in Medio Oriente. Alcune delle specie presenti nella riserva includono l&#039;orice arabo, gli struzzi somali, gli onager persiani e le gazzelle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per i visitatori, c&#039;è un parco giochi e un&#039;area picnic nelle strutture esterne del Centro visitatori. La torre di osservazione offre agli ansiosi osservatori di animali un luogo perfetto per osservare la fauna selvatica della Riserva. Le prime ore del mattino sono, in particolare, le migliori per osservare l&#039;orice nel suo ambiente naturale.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Shaumari website 800x500.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d434296.30246477743!2d36.50174023281251!3d31.744842400000014!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ae73d85479d73:0x62da93d4f0cd05ac!2sShawmari Wildlife Reserve!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571307355790!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1323, 'it', '', 'one col', 'riserva-faunistica-di-shaumari');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1328, 'Azraq Wetland Reserve', 'Azraq Wetland Reserve', 'The Azraq Wetland Reserve is a nature reserve located near the town of Azraq in the eastern desert of Jordan.', 'Azraq Wetland Reserve', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Azraq Wetland Reserve is a nature reserve located near the town of Azraq in the eastern desert of Jordan. An oasis for migratory birds, Azraq was established in 1978 and covers 12 square kilometres (4.6 sq mi).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The wetlands were created some 250,000 years ago as a result of being fed by aquifers that corresponded with geological changes. Azraq has, since ancient times, been the crossroads of both human trade routes and bird migrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Migratory birds come from Anatolia, Scandinavia, Siberia, and Africa, stopping in Azraq during the long journey.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/wetland.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d434293.6999982929!2d36.5017375889217!3d31.74539733502253!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151aefcdd0feb1e3:0xd129e902745e4a7f!2zQXpyYXEgV2V0bGFuZCBSZXNlcnZlINmF2K3ZhdmK2Kkg2KfZhNij2LLYsdmCINin2YTZhdin2KbZitip!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571310160856!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1328, 'en', '', 'one col', 'azraq-wetland-reserve'),
(1329, 'Azraq Wetland Reserve', 'Azraq Wetland Reserve', 'Azraq Wetland Reserve', 'Azraq Wetland Reserve', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Azraq Wetland Reserve is a nature reserve located near the town of Azraq in the eastern desert of Jordan. An oasis for migratory birds, Azraq was established in 1978 and covers 12 square kilometres (4.6 sq mi).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The wetlands were created some 250,000 years ago as a result of being fed by aquifers that corresponded with geological changes. Azraq has, since ancient times, been the crossroads of both human trade routes and bird migrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Migratory birds come from Anatolia, Scandinavia, Siberia, and Africa, stopping in Azraq during the long journey.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/wetland.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d434293.6999982929!2d36.5017375889217!3d31.74539733502253!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151aefcdd0feb1e3:0xd129e902745e4a7f!2zQXpyYXEgV2V0bGFuZCBSZXNlcnZlINmF2K3ZhdmK2Kkg2KfZhNij2LLYsdmCINin2YTZhdin2KbZitip!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571310160856!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1328, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'azraq-wetland-reserve'),
(1330, 'Reserva de Humedales Azraq', 'Reserva de Humedales Azraq', 'Reserva de Humedales Azraq', 'Reserva de Humedales Azraq', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Reserva de Humedales Azraq es una reserva natural ubicada cerca de la ciudad de Azraq en el desierto oriental de Jordania. Un oasis para las aves migratorias, Azraq se estableció en 1978 y cubre 12 kilómetros cuadrados (4,6 millas cuadradas).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los humedales se crearon hace unos 250,000 años como resultado de ser alimentados por acuíferos que correspondían a cambios geológicos. Azraq ha sido, desde la antigüedad, el paso tanto de las rutas comerciales humanas como de las migraciones de aves.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las aves migratorias provienen de Anatolia, Escandinavia, Siberia y África, deteniéndose en Azraq durante el largo viaje.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/wetland.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d434293.6999982929!2d36.5017375889217!3d31.74539733502253!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151aefcdd0feb1e3:0xd129e902745e4a7f!2zQXpyYXEgV2V0bGFuZCBSZXNlcnZlINmF2K3ZhdmK2Kkg2KfZhNij2LLYsdmCINin2YTZhdin2KbZitip!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571310160856!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1328, 'es', '', 'one col', 'reserva-de-humedales-azraq'),
(1331, 'Réserve de Zones Humides Azraq', 'Réserve de Zones Humides Azraq', 'Réserve de Zones Humides Azraq', 'Réserve de Zones Humides Azraq', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Réserve de Zones Humides Azraq est une réserve naturelle située près de la ville d&#039;Azraq, dans le désert oriental de la Jordanie. Une oasis pour les oiseaux migrateurs, Azraq a été créée en 1978 et couvre une superficie de 12 kilomètres carrés.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les zones humides ont été créées il y a environ 250 000 ans après avoir été alimentées par des aquifères correspondant aux changements géologiques. Azraq est, depuis l&#039;Antiquité, le passage à la fois des routes commerciales et des migrations d&#039;oiseaux.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les oiseaux migrateurs viennent d’Anatolie, de Scandinavie, de Sibérie et d’Afrique, s’arrêtant à Azraq pendant le long voyage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/wetland.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d434293.6999982929!2d36.5017375889217!3d31.74539733502253!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151aefcdd0feb1e3:0xd129e902745e4a7f!2zQXpyYXEgV2V0bGFuZCBSZXNlcnZlINmF2K3ZhdmK2Kkg2KfZhNij2LLYsdmCINin2YTZhdin2KbZitip!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571310160856!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1328, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'reserve-de-zones-humides-azraq'),
(1332, 'Azraq Wetland Reserve', 'Azraq Wetland Reserve', 'Azraq Wetland Reserve', 'Azraq Wetland Reserve', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Azraq Wetland Reserve è una riserva naturale situata vicino alla città di Azraq nel deserto orientale della Giordania. Un&#039;oasi per uccelli migratori, Azraq è stata fondata nel 1978 e copre 12 chilometri quadrati (4,6 miglia quadrate).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le zone umide sono state create circa 250.000 anni fa a seguito dell&#039;alimentazione delle falde acquifere che corrispondevano ai cambiamenti geologici. Azraq è stato, fin dai tempi antichi, il passaggio di entrambe le rotte del commercio umano e le migrazioni degli uccelli.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Gli uccelli migratori provengono da Anatolia, Scandinavia, Siberia e Africa, fermandosi ad Azraq durante il lungo viaggio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/wetland.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d434293.6999982929!2d36.5017375889217!3d31.74539733502253!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151aefcdd0feb1e3:0xd129e902745e4a7f!2zQXpyYXEgV2V0bGFuZCBSZXNlcnZlINmF2K3ZhdmK2Kkg2KfZhNij2LLYsdmCINin2YTZhdin2KbZitip!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571310160856!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1328, 'it', '', 'one col', 'azraq-wetland-reserve'),
(1333, 'Yarmouk Forest Reserve', 'Yarmouk Forest Reserve', 'This reserve is located in the northwestern parts of Jordan, at the border with the Golan Heights.', 'Yarmouk Forest Reserve', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature is implementing the Integrated Ecosystem Management in the Jordan Rift Valley project, which aims to establish a network of reserves and special conservation areas in the Jordan rift valley region, Yarmouk is one area in a network of sites.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It was announced as a natural reserve the 6th of January 2010 by the Prime Minister and became part of the national reserves network, which is run and managed by the RSCN.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Yarmouk Forest Reserve is located in the northwestern parts of Jordan, at the border with Golan hill. The total area of Yarmouk Forest Reserve is 20 km2. It contains two main topographic areas: Mountains which are covered by deciduous oak up to 500 m high above the sea level, punctuated by valleys of small and medium descend towards the Yarmouk river. Those small and medium descend valleys have a seasonal runoff with the exception of Shag Al Bared valley.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Yarmouk.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d429949.15073077497!2d35.406596132812496!3d32.660036500000004!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c6cfa069372d5:0x68b2414e1a73135e!2sYarmouk Nature Reserve!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571312238579!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1333, 'en', '', 'one col', 'yarmouk-forest-reserve'),
(1334, 'Yarmouk Forest Reserve', 'Yarmouk Forest Reserve', 'Yarmouk Forest Reserve', 'Yarmouk Forest Reserve', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature is implementing the Integrated Ecosystem Management in the Jordan Rift Valley project, which aims to establish a network of reserves and special conservation areas in the Jordan rift valley region, Yarmouk is one area in a network of sites.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It was announced as a natural reserve the 6th of January 2010 by the Prime Minister and became part of the national reserves network, which is run and managed by the RSCN.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Yarmouk Forest Reserve is located in the northwestern parts of Jordan, at the border with Golan hill. The total area of Yarmouk Forest Reserve is 20 km2. It contains two main topographic areas: Mountains which are covered by deciduous oak up to 500 m high above the sea level, punctuated by valleys of small and medium descend towards the Yarmouk river. Those small and medium descend valleys have a seasonal runoff with the exception of Shag Al Bared valley.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Yarmouk.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d429949.15073077497!2d35.406596132812496!3d32.660036500000004!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c6cfa069372d5:0x68b2414e1a73135e!2sYarmouk Nature Reserve!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571312238579!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1333, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'yarmouk-forest-reserve'),
(1335, 'Reserva Forestal Yarmouk', 'Reserva Forestal Yarmouk', 'Reserva Forestal Yarmouk', 'Reserva Forestal Yarmouk', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature está implementando la Gestión Integrada de Ecosistemas en el proyecto Jordan Rift Valley, que tiene como objetivo establecer una red de reservas y áreas especiales de conservación en la región de Jordan rift valley, Yarmouk es un área en una red de sitios.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Fue anunciado como reserva natural el 6 de enero de 2010 por el Primer Ministro y se convirtió en parte de la red de reservas nacionales, que es administrada y administrada por la RSCN.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Reserva Forestal Yarmouk se encuentra en el noroeste de Jordania, en la frontera con la colina del Golán. El área total de la Reserva Forestal Yarmouk es de 20 km2. Contiene dos áreas topográficas principales: montañas que están cubiertas por roble caducifolio de hasta 500 m de altura sobre el nivel del mar, puntuado por valles de pequeño y mediano descenso hacia el río Yarmouk. Esos valles de descenso pequeños y medianos tienen una escorrentía estacional con la excepción del valle de Shag Al Bared.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Yarmouk.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d429949.15073077497!2d35.406596132812496!3d32.660036500000004!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c6cfa069372d5:0x68b2414e1a73135e!2sYarmouk Nature Reserve!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571312238579!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1333, 'es', '', 'one col', 'reserva-forestal-yarmouk'),
(1336, 'Réserve Forestière de Yarmouk', 'Réserve Forestière de Yarmouk', 'Réserve Forestière de Yarmouk', 'Réserve Forestière de Yarmouk', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature est en train de mettre en œuvre la gestion intégrée des écosystèmes dans le projet de la vallée du Jourdain jordanien, qui vise à établir un réseau de réserves et d&#039;aires de conservation spéciales dans la région de la vallée du Jourdain jordanien. Yarmouk réseau de sites.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il a été annoncé comme réserve naturelle le 6 janvier 2010 par le Premier ministre et est devenu partie intégrante du réseau de réserves nationales, qui est géré et administré par la RSCN.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Réserve Forestière de Yarmouk est située au nord-ouest de la Jordanie, à la frontière avec la colline du Golan. La superficie totale de la réserve forestière de Yarmouk est de 20 km2. Il contient deux zones topographiques principales: les montagnes couvertes de chênes à feuilles caduques jusqu’à 500 m d’altitude, ponctuées de vallées de moyenne et petite descente vers la rivière Yarmouk. Ces vallées de petite et moyenne descente ont un ruissellement saisonnier à l&#039;exception de la vallée de Shag Al Bared.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Yarmouk.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d429949.15073077497!2d35.406596132812496!3d32.660036500000004!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c6cfa069372d5:0x68b2414e1a73135e!2sYarmouk Nature Reserve!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571312238579!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1333, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'reserve-forestiere-de-yarmouk'),
(1337, 'Riserva Forestale di Yarmouk', 'Riserva Forestale di Yarmouk', 'Riserva Forestale di Yarmouk', 'Riserva Forestale di Yarmouk', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Royal Society for the Conservation of Nature sta implementando la gestione integrata dell&#039;ecosistema nel progetto Jordan Rift Valley, che mira a creare una rete di riserve e aree speciali di conservazione nella regione della Jordan rift valley, Yarmouk è un&#039;area in rete di siti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;È stato annunciato come riserva naturale il 6 gennaio 2010 dal Primo Ministro ed è diventato parte della rete di riserva nazionale, che è gestita e amministrata dalla RSCN.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Riserva Forestale di Yarmouk si trova nella Giordania nordoccidentale, al confine con la collina del Golan. L&#039;area totale della Riserva forestale di Yarmouk è di 20 km2. Contiene due principali aree topografiche: montagne coperte da querce decidue alte fino a 500 m sul livello del mare, punteggiate da valli di piccola e media discesa verso il fiume Yarmouk. Quelle valli di piccola e media discesa hanno un deflusso stagionale ad eccezione della Shag Al Bared Valley.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/Yarmouk.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d429949.15073077497!2d35.406596132812496!3d32.660036500000004!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c6cfa069372d5:0x68b2414e1a73135e!2sYarmouk Nature Reserve!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571312238579!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1333, 'it', '', 'one col', 'riserva-forestale-di-yarmouk'),
(1338, 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In 2011, UNESCO declared Mujib biosphere reserve. It extends to the Kerak and Madaba mountains to the north and south, reaching 900 metres (3,000 ft) above sea level in some places. This 1,300-metre (4,300 ft) variation in elevation, combined with the valley&#039;s year round water flow from seven tributaries, means that Wadi Mujib enjoys a magnificent biodiversity that is still being explored and documented today.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The reserve consists of mountainous, rocky, and sparsely vegetated desert (up to 800 metres (2,600 ft)), with cliffs and gorges cutting through plateaus. Perennial, spring-fed streams flow to the shores of the Dead Sea.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Over 300 species of plants, 10 species of carnivores and numerous species of permanent and migratory birds have been recorded until this date. Some of the remote mountain and valley areas are difficult to reach, and thus offer safe havens for rare species of cats, goats and other mountain animals.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/River-canyon-of-Wadi-Mujib.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d871616.856943661!2d35.26433948772292!3d31.420921119192695!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503389aa3d5d8cf:0xcb15ddf0bb1651df!2sWadi Al Mujib!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571386522932!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1338, 'en', '', 'one col', 'wadi-mujib'),
(1339, 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In 2011, UNESCO declared Mujib biosphere reserve. It extends to the Kerak and Madaba mountains to the north and south, reaching 900 metres (3,000 ft) above sea level in some places. This 1,300-metre (4,300 ft) variation in elevation, combined with the valley&#039;s year round water flow from seven tributaries, means that Wadi Mujib enjoys a magnificent biodiversity that is still being explored and documented today.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The reserve consists of mountainous, rocky, and sparsely vegetated desert (up to 800 metres (2,600 ft)), with cliffs and gorges cutting through plateaus. Perennial, spring-fed streams flow to the shores of the Dead Sea.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Over 300 species of plants, 10 species of carnivores and numerous species of permanent and migratory birds have been recorded until this date. Some of the remote mountain and valley areas are difficult to reach, and thus offer safe havens for rare species of cats, goats and other mountain animals.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/River-canyon-of-Wadi-Mujib.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d871616.856943661!2d35.26433948772292!3d31.420921119192695!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503389aa3d5d8cf:0xcb15ddf0bb1651df!2sWadi Al Mujib!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571386522932!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1338, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'wadi-mujib'),
(1340, 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En 2011, la UNESCO declaró la reserva de la biosfera de Mujib. Se extiende hasta las montañas Kerak y Madaba hacia el Norte y el Sur, llegando a 900 metros (3.000 pies) sobre el nivel del mar en algunos lugares. Esta variación de elevación de 1.300 metros (4.300 pies), combinada con el flujo de agua del valle durante todo el año desde siete afluentes, significa que Wadi Mujib disfruta de una magnífica biodiversidad que todavía se está explorando y documentando hoy.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La reserva consiste en un desierto montañoso, rocoso y escasamente vegetado (hasta 800 metros (2.600 pies)), con acantilados y gargantas que atraviesan mesetas. Las corrientes perennes alimentadas por manantiales fluyen a las orillas del Mar Muerto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hasta esta fecha se han registrado más de 300 especies de plantas, 10 especies de carnívoros y numerosas especies de aves permanentes y migratorias. Algunas de las áreas remotas de montaña y valle son difíciles de alcanzar y, por lo tanto, ofrecen refugios seguros para especies raras de gatos, cabras y otros animales de montaña.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/River-canyon-of-Wadi-Mujib.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d871616.856943661!2d35.26433948772292!3d31.420921119192695!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503389aa3d5d8cf:0xcb15ddf0bb1651df!2sWadi Al Mujib!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571386522932!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1338, 'es', '', 'one col', 'wadi-mujib'),
(1341, 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En 2011, l&#039;UNESCO a déclaré la réserve de biosphère du Mujib. Il s&#039;étend jusqu&#039;aux montagnes de Kerak et de Madaba au nord et au sud, atteignant 900 mètres au-dessus du niveau de la mer à certains endroits. Cette variation d&#039;altitude de 1 300 mètres (4 300 pieds), combinée au débit d&#039;eau de la vallée tout au long de l&#039;année provenant de sept affluents, signifie que Wadi Mujib bénéficie d&#039;une magnifique biodiversité qui est toujours en cours d&#039;exploration et de documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La réserve se compose d&#039;un désert montagneux, rocheux et à la végétation clairsemée (jusqu&#039;à 800 mètres), avec des falaises et des gorges traversant des plateaux. Des cours d&#039;eau pérennes alimentés par des sources se jettent sur les rives de la mer Morte.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;À ce jour, plus de 300 espèces de plantes, 10 espèces de carnivores et de nombreuses espèces d&#039;oiseaux permanents et migrateurs ont été répertoriées. Certaines zones de montagne et de vallée isolées sont difficiles à atteindre et offrent donc des abris sûrs pour les espèces rares de chats, chèvres et autres animaux de montagne.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/River-canyon-of-Wadi-Mujib.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d871616.856943661!2d35.26433948772292!3d31.420921119192695!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503389aa3d5d8cf:0xcb15ddf0bb1651df!2sWadi Al Mujib!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571386522932!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1338, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'wadi-mujib'),
(1342, 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', 'Wadi Mujib', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nel 2011 l&#039;UNESCO ha dichiarato la riserva della biosfera di Mujib. Si estende alle montagne Kerak e Madaba a nord e sud, raggiungendo in alcuni punti 900 metri (3.000 piedi) sul livello del mare. Questa variazione di altitudine di 1.300 metri (4.300 piedi), combinata con il flusso d&#039;acqua della valle durante tutto l&#039;anno da sette affluenti, significa che Wadi Mujib gode di una magnifica biodiversità che è ancora oggi esplorata e documentata.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La riserva è costituita da un deserto montuoso, roccioso e scarsamente vegetato (fino a 800 metri (2.600 piedi)), con scogliere e gole che attraversano altipiani. Flussi perenni alimentati da sorgenti scorrono verso le rive del Mar Morto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ad oggi, sono state registrate oltre 300 specie di piante, 10 specie di carnivori e numerose specie di uccelli permanenti e migratori. Alcune zone remote di montagna e valle sono difficili da raggiungere e offrono quindi rifugi sicuri per specie rare di gatti, capre e altri animali di montagna.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Natural Reserves/River-canyon-of-Wadi-Mujib.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d871616.856943661!2d35.26433948772292!3d31.420921119192695!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503389aa3d5d8cf:0xcb15ddf0bb1651df!2sWadi Al Mujib!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571386522932!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1338, 'it', '', 'one col', 'wadi-mujib'),
(1343, 'Hotels in Karak', 'Hotels in Karak', 'Hotels in Karak', 'Hotels in Kerak', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/cairwan.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Cairwan Hotel &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  Cairwan Hotel &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cairwan Hotel is located downtown Karak, this hotel offers cozy accommodation in a peaceful neighborhood...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/cairwan-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/almujeb.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Al-Mujeb Hotel &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  Al-Mujeb Hotel &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Mujeb Hotel is located in Karak. It provides accommodation with a shared lounge and a terr...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/al-mujeb-hotel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/il-kerak-resthouse-visto.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Karak Rest House &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;  Karak Rest House &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Karak Rest House is located in Al Karak city near the entrance of the ancient Karak Castle, around 130 km...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/karak-rest-house/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1343, 'en', '', 'one col', 'hotels-in-karak'),
(1344, 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cairwan Hotel is located downtown Karak, this hotel offers cozy accommodation in a peaceful neighborhood. It features a restaurant, garden and terrace. Crusaders Castle is a 5-minute drive away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The bright and airy rooms at Cairwan Hotel come with a fridge, TV and wardrobe. Each has a private bathroom that is fitted with a shower.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel’s restaurant offers an à la carte menu along with a 24-hour room service. Local excursions can be arranged by the tour desk.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Queen Alia international Airport is 65 km away. Cairwan Hotel offers free private parking on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/cairwan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d38618.85169238643!2d35.704159352020575!3d31.180353920681718!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150370cd33ec459f:0xa919b65fc38f38c6!2sCairwan Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571388576248!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1344, 'en', '', 'one col', 'cairwan-hotel'),
(1345, 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cairwan Hotel is located downtown Karak, this hotel offers cozy accommodation in a peaceful neighborhood. It features a restaurant, garden and terrace. Crusaders Castle is a 5-minute drive away.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The bright and airy rooms at Cairwan Hotel come with a fridge, TV and wardrobe. Each has a private bathroom that is fitted with a shower.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hotel’s restaurant offers an à la carte menu along with a 24-hour room service. Local excursions can be arranged by the tour desk.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Queen Alia international Airport is 65 km away. Cairwan Hotel offers free private parking on site.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/cairwan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d38618.85169238643!2d35.704159352020575!3d31.180353920681718!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150370cd33ec459f:0xa919b65fc38f38c6!2sCairwan Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571388576248!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1344, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'cairwan-hotel'),
(1346, 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cairwan Hotel está situado en el centro de Karak, este hotel ofrece un alojamiento acogedor en un barrio tranquilo. Cuenta con restaurante, jardín y terraza. El castillo de los cruzados se encuentra a 5 minutos en coche.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las habitaciones amplias y luminosas del Cairwan Hotel cuentan con nevera, TV y armario. Cada uno tiene un baño privado con ducha.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El restaurante del hotel ofrece un menú a la carta y servicio de habitaciones las 24 horas. El mostrador de información turística puede organizar excursiones locales.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Aeropuerto Internacional Queen Alia se encuentra a 65 km. El Cairwan Hotel ofrece aparcamiento privado gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/cairwan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d38618.85169238643!2d35.704159352020575!3d31.180353920681718!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150370cd33ec459f:0xa919b65fc38f38c6!2sCairwan Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571388576248!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1344, 'es', '', 'one col', 'cairwan-hotel'),
(1347, 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Cairwan Hotel est situé dans le centre de Karak. Cet hôtel propose un hébergement confortable dans un quartier calme. Il possède un restaurant, un jardin et une terrasse. Le château des croisés est à 5 minutes en voiture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les chambres lumineuses et spacieuses du Cairwan Hotel disposent d&#039;un réfrigérateur, d&#039;une télévision et d&#039;une armoire. Chacune dispose d&#039;une salle de bains privative avec douche.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le restaurant de l&#039;hôtel propose un menu à la carte et un service d&#039;étage 24h / 24. Le bureau d&#039;excursions peut organiser des excursions locales.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Aéroport International Queen Alia est à 65 km. Le Cairwan Hotel propose un parking privé gratuit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/cairwan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d38618.85169238643!2d35.704159352020575!3d31.180353920681718!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150370cd33ec459f:0xa919b65fc38f38c6!2sCairwan Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571388576248!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1344, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'cairwan-hotel'),
(1348, 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', 'Cairwan Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cairwan Hotel è situato nel centro di Karak, questo hotel offre sistemazioni accoglienti in un quartiere tranquillo. Dispone di ristorante, giardino e terrazza. Il castello di Crusaders è raggiungibile in 5 minuti di auto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le luminose e spaziose camere del Cairwan Hotel dispongono di frigorifero, TV e armadio. Ognuno ha un bagno privato con doccia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il ristorante dell&#039;hotel offre un menù à la carte e il servizio in camera 24 ore al giorno. Il banco escursioni può organizzare escursioni locali.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Aeroporto Internazionale Queen Alia dista 65 km. Il Cairwan Hotel offre un parcheggio privato gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/cairwan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d38618.85169238643!2d35.704159352020575!3d31.180353920681718!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150370cd33ec459f:0xa919b65fc38f38c6!2sCairwan Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571388576248!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1344, 'it', '', 'one col', 'cairwan-hotel'),
