(1353, 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Mujeb Hotel is located in Karak. It provides accommodation with a shared lounge and a terrace. Among the facilities of this property are a restaurant, a 24-hour front desk and room service.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is free Wi-Fi internet for the guests. There is free private parking and the property features paid airport shuttle service.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This hotel offers a buffet breakfast each morning. You will feel the Jordanian hospitality in this hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/almujeb.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13655.17311919788!2d35.71572204464396!3d31.17101102253092!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15037752e5464335:0xeb470798b758e3a9!2sMujeb Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571390023583!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1353, 'en', '', 'one col', 'al-mujeb-hotel'),
(1354, 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Mujeb Hotel is located in Karak. It provides accommodation with a shared lounge and a terrace. Among the facilities of this property are a restaurant, a 24-hour front desk and room service.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is free Wi-Fi internet for the guests. There is free private parking and the property features paid airport shuttle service.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This hotel offers a buffet breakfast each morning. You will feel the Jordanian hospitality in this hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/almujeb.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13655.17311919788!2d35.71572204464396!3d31.17101102253092!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15037752e5464335:0xeb470798b758e3a9!2sMujeb Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571390023583!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1353, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'al-mujeb-hotel'),
(1355, 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Mujeb Hotel está ubicado en Karak. Ofrece alojamiento con salón compartido y terraza. Entre las instalaciones de esta propiedad se encuentran un restaurante, recepción las 24 horas y servicio a la habitación.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hay conexión inalámbrica a internet gratuita para los huéspedes. Hay aparcamiento privado gratuito y el establecimiento ofrece servicio de enlace con el aeropuerto de pago.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Este hotel ofrece un desayuno bufé todas las mañanas. Sentirá la hospitalidad jordana en este hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/almujeb.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13655.17311919788!2d35.71572204464396!3d31.17101102253092!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15037752e5464335:0xeb470798b758e3a9!2sMujeb Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571390023583!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1353, 'es', '', 'one col', 'al-mujeb-hotel'),
(1356, 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;Al-Mujeb Hotel est situé à Karak. Il propose un hébergement avec salle de séjour commune et terrasse. Parmi les installations de cet établissement propose un restaurant, une réception ouverte 24 heures et un service de chambre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite est à votre disposition. Un parking privé gratuit est disponible et l&#039;établissement propose un service de navette aéroport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cet hôtel propose un petit-déjeuner buffet chaque matin. Vous sentirez l&#039;hospitalité jordanienne dans cet hôtel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/almujeb.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13655.17311919788!2d35.71572204464396!3d31.17101102253092!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15037752e5464335:0xeb470798b758e3a9!2sMujeb Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571390023583!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1353, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'al-mujeb-hotel'),
(1357, 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', 'Al-Mujeb Hotel', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Mujeb Hotel si trova a Karak. Offre sistemazioni con condiviso soggiorno e terrazza. Tra i servizi di questa struttura figurano un ristorante, una reception aperta 24 ore su 24 e il servizio in camera.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;C&#039;è la connessione Wi-Fi gratuita per gli ospiti. È disponibile un parcheggio privato gratuito e la struttura offre un servizio navetta per l&#039;aeroporto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questo hotel offre una colazione a buffet ogni mattina. Sentirai l&#039;ospitalità giordana in questo hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/almujeb.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13655.17311919788!2d35.71572204464396!3d31.17101102253092!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15037752e5464335:0xeb470798b758e3a9!2sMujeb Hotel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571390023583!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1353, 'it', '', 'one col', 'al-mujeb-hotel'),
(1358, 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Karak Rest House is located in Al Karak city near the entrance of the ancient Karak Castle, around 130 km from Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It was built on a land plot with a total area of 1,634 sqm, and has a total built up area of 500 sqm. Karak Rest House targets foreign tourists visiting Karak Castle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Karak Rest House features air-conditioned accommodation in Kerak. The rooms are fitted with a terrace with a city view.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is free Wi-Fi internet for the guests. There is free private parking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/il-kerak-resthouse-visto.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13655.46746269022!2d35.70358340396636!3d31.168969343934993!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15037a1f8e1a87a9:0x98bd1406f49b95d4!2sKerak!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571392017369!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1358, 'en', '', 'one col', 'karak-rest-house'),
(1359, 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Karak Rest House is located in Al Karak city near the entrance of the ancient Karak Castle, around 130 km from Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It was built on a land plot with a total area of 1,634 sqm, and has a total built up area of 500 sqm. Karak Rest House targets foreign tourists visiting Karak Castle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Karak Rest House features air-conditioned accommodation in Kerak. The rooms are fitted with a terrace with a city view.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;There is free Wi-Fi internet for the guests. There is free private parking.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/il-kerak-resthouse-visto.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13655.46746269022!2d35.70358340396636!3d31.168969343934993!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15037a1f8e1a87a9:0x98bd1406f49b95d4!2sKerak!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571392017369!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1358, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'karak-rest-house'),
(1360, 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Karak Rest House se encuentra en la ciudad de Al Karak, cerca de la entrada del antiguo castillo de Karak, a unos 130 km de Ammán.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Fue construido en una parcela de tierra con un área total de 1,634 metros cuadrados, y tiene un área total construida de 500 metros cuadrados. Karak Rest House está dirigida a turistas extranjeros que visitan el castillo de Karak.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Karak Rest House ofrece alojamiento con aire acondicionado en Kerak. Las habitaciones disponen de terraza con vistas a la ciudad.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hay conexión inalámbrica a internet gratuita para los huéspedes. Hay aparcamiento privado gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/il-kerak-resthouse-visto.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13655.46746269022!2d35.70358340396636!3d31.168969343934993!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15037a1f8e1a87a9:0x98bd1406f49b95d4!2sKerak!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571392017369!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1358, 'es', '', 'one col', 'karak-rest-house'),
(1361, 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Karak Rest House est situé dans la ville d&#039;Al Karak, près de l&#039;entrée du vieux château de Karak, à environ 130 km d&#039;Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il a été construit sur un terrain d&#039;une superficie totale de 1 634 mètres carrés et d&#039;une surface totale construite de 500 mètres carrés. Le Karak Rest House est destiné aux touristes étrangers visitant le château de Karak.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Karak Rest House propose un hébergement climatisé à Kerak. Les chambres ont une terrasse surplombant la ville.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite est à votre disposition. Il y a un parking privé gratuit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/il-kerak-resthouse-visto.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13655.46746269022!2d35.70358340396636!3d31.168969343934993!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15037a1f8e1a87a9:0x98bd1406f49b95d4!2sKerak!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571392017369!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1358, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'karak-rest-house'),
(1362, 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', 'Karak Rest House', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Karak Rest House si trova nella città di Al Karak, vicino all&#039;ingresso del vecchio castello di Karak, a circa 130 km da Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;È stato costruito su un appezzamento di terreno con una superficie totale di 1.634 metri quadrati e ha una superficie totale costruita di 500 metri quadrati. Karak Rest House è rivolta a turisti stranieri che visitano il Castello di Karak.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Karak Rest House offre sistemazioni climatizzate a Kerak. Le camere hanno una terrazza con vista sulla città.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;C&#039;è la connessione Wi-Fi gratuita per gli ospiti. C&#039;è un parcheggio privato gratuito.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Hotels in Kerak/il-kerak-resthouse-visto.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13655.46746269022!2d35.70358340396636!3d31.168969343934993!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15037a1f8e1a87a9:0x98bd1406f49b95d4!2sKerak!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1571392017369!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1358, 'it', '', 'one col', 'karak-rest-house'),
