;0&quot;&gt;Professional driver with more than 10 years experience in PV travel in Wadi Musa ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Anas.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Anas Al-Zoubi &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Anas Al-Zoubi &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;QmZWSe&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;DHcWmd&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;oSioSc&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div id=&quot;tw-target&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div id=&quot;kAz1tf&quot; class=&quot;g9WsWb&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;tw-ta-container tw-nfl&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;Übersetzung&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Professional driver with more than 3 years experience in PV travel in Wadi Musa ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;Übersetzung&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1363, 'en', '', 'one col', 'pv-travels-team'),
(1364, 'Visas to Jordan', 'Visas to Jordan', 'Visas to Jordan', 'Visas to Jordan', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Single Entry&lt;/strong&gt; visas valid for one month: &lt;strong&gt;40 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (approximately &lt;strong&gt;56 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Double Entry&lt;/strong&gt; visas valid for three months: &lt;strong&gt;60 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (approximately &lt;strong&gt;85 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multiple Entry&lt;/strong&gt; visas valid for six months: &lt;strong&gt;120 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (approximately &lt;strong&gt;170 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Groups of five or more people arriving with a designated Jordanian tour operator are exempt from visa costs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Certain nationalities require an entry visa to be obtained prior to travel. The below list is meant solely as a useful tool and the data within it is subject to change without prior notice. It is recommended that you check with the Jordanian diplomatic mission in your country prior to travel to ensure that you have all the necessary paperwork for travel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Exit service fee applies for land and sea border points. 10.00 JD per passenger and 5.00 JD per vehicle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Africa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa can be obtained upon arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Algeria, Cape Verde, Tunisia (age 18-35), Lesotho, Libya, Morocco, Malawi, Mauritius, Rwanda, São Tomé and Príncipe, Seychelles, South Africa, Tunis.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa must be obtained prior to arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Angola, Benin, Botswana, Burkina Faso, Burundi, Cameroon, Central African Republic, Chad, Comoros Islands, Eswatini, Congo Brazzaville, Cote d’Ivoire (Ivory Coast), Djibouti, Egypt, Equatorial Guinea, Eritrea, Ethiopia, Gabon, Gambia, Ghana, Guinea, Guinea -Bissau, Kenya, Lagos, Liberia, Madagascar, Mali, Mauritania, Mozambique, Namibia, Niger, Nigeria, Senegal, Sierra Leone, Somalia, Sudan, South Sudan, Swaziland, Tanzania, Togo, Uganda, Zambia, Zimbabwe.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; Visa can be obtained upon arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Armenia, Azerbaijan, Bahrain, Bhutan, Brunei, Burma, China, Taiwan, Georgia, Hong Kong, India, Indonesia, Israel, Japan, Kazakhstan, Kuwait, Lebanon, Macau, Malaysia, Maldives, North Korea, Palestine/ PNA Passport Holders, Republic of China,  Qatar, Russia,  Saudi Arabia, Singapore, South Korea, Syria,  Tajikistan, Thailand, Turkmenistan, Turkey, United Arab Emirates, Uzbekistan, Yemen.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa must be obtained prior to arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Afghanistan, Bangladesh, Cambodia, Egypt, Iran, Iraq, Laos, Mongolia, Nepal, Pakistan, Papua New Guinea, Philippines, Sri Lanka, Vietnam.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Europe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa can be obtained upon arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Andorra, Austria, Azerbaijan, Belarus, Belgium, Bosnia &amp;amp;Herzegovina, Britain , Bulgaria, Croatia, Cyprus, Czech Republic, Denmark, Kazakhstan, Estonia, Finland, France, Georgia, Germany, Greece, Holland, Hungary, Iceland, Ireland, Italy, Kosovo, Latvia, Liechtenstein, Luxembourg, Macedonia, Malta, Monaco, Norway, Poland, Portugal, Russia, Romania, San Marino, Spain, Sweden, Switzerland, Turkey, Ukraine, Vatican, Serbia, Slovakia, Slovenia, Yugoslavia.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa must be obtained prior to arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Albania, Moldova.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;North America&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa can be obtained upon arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Canada, Mexico, United States of America, Antigua and Barbuda, Bahamas, Barbados, Costa Rica, Dominica, Dominican Republic, Grenada, Guatemala, Haiti, Honduras, Jamaica, Nicaragua, Panama, El Salvador, Saint Kitts and Nevis, Saint Lucia, Saint Vincent and the Grenadines.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa must be obtained prior to arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Belize, Cuba.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ocean Asia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa can be obtained upon arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Federated States of Micronesia, Fiji, Marshall Islands, New Zealand, Samoa, Solomon Islands, Tonga, Tuvalu, Vanuatu.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa must be obtained prior to arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Papua New Guinea.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Australia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa can be obtained upon arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Australia&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;South America&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa can be obtained upon arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Argentina, Bolivia, Brazil, Chile, Ecuador, Guyana, Paraguay, Peru, Suriname, Uruguay, Trinidad and Tobago, Venezuela.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Visa must be obtained prior to arrival:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Colombia.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/testimonials/collage5.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572514329525!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1364, 'en', '', 'one col', 'visas-to-jordan'),
(1365, 'تأشيرات دخول الأردن', 'تأشيرات دخول الأردن', 'معلومات حول تأشيرات دخول الأردن، التكاليف، والدول المعفاة.', 'Visas to Jordan', '<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"md-7 align-justify d-pad-r\"><h1>تأشيرات دخول الأردن</h1><p><strong>تأشيرة دخول لمرة واحدة</strong> صالحة لمدة شهر واحد: <strong>40 ديناراً أردنياً</strong> (حوالي 56 دولاراً أمريكياً)<br><strong>تأشيرة دخول لمرتين</strong> صالحة لمدة ثلاثة أشهر: <strong>60 ديناراً أردنياً</strong> (حوالي 85 دولاراً أمريكياً)<br><strong>تأشيرة دخول متعددة</strong> صالحة لمدة ستة أشهر: <strong>120 ديناراً أردنياً</strong> (حوالي 170 دولاراً أمريكياً)</p><p>تُعفى المجموعات المكونة من خمسة أشخاص أو أكثر والذين يصلون مع منظم رحلات أردني معتمد من تكاليف التأشيرة.</p><p>تتطلب بعض الجنسيات الحصول على تأشيرة دخول مسبقة قبل السفر. القائمة أدناه هي أداة مساعدة وتخضع للتغيير دون إشعار مسبق. يُنصح بالتحقق مع البعثة الدبلوماسية الأردنية في بلدك قبل السفر.</p><h3>أفريقيا</h3><p>يمكن الحصول على التأشيرة عند الوصول لـ: الجزائر، الرأس الأخضر، تونس، المغرب، سيشل، وجنوب أفريقيا.</p></div><div class=\"md-5\"><img src=\"uploads/filemanager/Photos/testimonials/collage5.jpg\" class=\"full-width\" /></div></div>', 1, 1364, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'visas-to-jordan'),
(1366, 'Visas para Jordania', 'Visas para Jordania', 'Visas para Jordania', 'Visas para Jordania', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Visas de &lt;strong&gt;entrada única&lt;/strong&gt; válidas por un mes: &lt;strong&gt;40 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (aproximadamente &lt;strong&gt;56 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Visas de &lt;strong&gt;doble entrada&lt;/strong&gt; válidas por tres meses: &lt;strong&gt;60 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (aproximadamente &lt;strong&gt;85 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Visas de &lt;strong&gt;entrada múltiple&lt;/strong&gt; válidas por seis meses: &lt;strong&gt;120 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (aproximadamente &lt;strong&gt;170 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los grupos de cinco o más personas que lleguen con un tour-operador jordano designado están exentos de los costes de visado.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ciertas nacionalidades requieren que se obtenga una visa de entrada antes de viajar. La siguiente lista se entiende únicamente como una herramienta útil y los datos que contiene están sujetos a cambios sin previo aviso. Se recomienda que consulte con la Embajada de Jordania en su país antes de viajar para asegurarse de tener toda la documentación necesaria para viajar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se aplica un cargo por servicio de salida para los puntos fronterizos terrestres y marítimos. 10.00 JD por pasajero y 5.00 JD por vehículo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;** Los ciudadanos de los siguientes países están exentos de pagar sus tarifas de visa: Argelia, Marruecos, Sudán, Emiratos Árabes Unidos, Bahrein, KSA, Siria, Palestina, Qatar, Kuwait, Líbano, Malasia, Japón, Yemen, Turquía y la ONU.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;África&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se puede obtener a la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Argelia, Cabo Verde, Túnez (edad 18-35), Lesotho, Libia, Marruecos, Malawi, Mauricio, Ruanda, Santo Tomé y Príncipe, Seychelles, Sudáfrica, Túnez.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se debe obtener antes de la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Angola, Benin, Botswana, Burkina Faso, Burundi, Camerún, República Centroafricana, Chad, Islas Comoras, Eswatini, Congo Brazzaville, Costa de Marfil, Djibouti, Egipto, Guinea Ecuatorial, Eritrea, Etiopía, Gabón, Gambia, Ghana, Guinea, Guinea-Bissau, Kenia, Lagos, Liberia, Madagascar, Malí, Mauritania, Mozambique, Namibia, Níger, Nigeria, Senegal, Sierra Leona, Somalia, Sudán, Sudán del Sur, Suazilandia, Tanzania, Togo, Uganda, Zambia, Zimbabwe.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; La visa se puede obtener a la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Armenia, Azerbaiyán, Bahrein, Bhután, Brunei, Birmania, China, Taiwán, Georgia, Hong Kong, India, Indonesia, Israel, Japón, Kazajstán, Kuwait, Líbano, Macao, Malasia, Maldivas, Corea del Norte, Palestina / Pasajeros de la ANP , República de China, Qatar, Rusia, Arabia Saudita, Singapur, Corea del Sur, Siria, Tayikistán, Tailandia, Turkmenistán, Turquía, Emiratos Árabes Unidos, Uzbekistán, Yemen.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se debe obtener antes de la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Afganistán, Bangladesh, Camboya, Egipto, Irán, Iraq, Laos, Mongolia, Nepal, Pakistán, Papua Nueva Guinea, Filipinas, Sri Lanka, Vietnam.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Europa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se puede obtener a la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Andorra, Austria, Azerbaiyán, Bielorrusia, Bélgica, Bosnia y Herzegovina, Gran Bretaña, Bulgaria, Croacia, Chipre, República Checa, Dinamarca, Kazajstán, Estonia, Finlandia, Francia, Georgia, Alemania, Grecia, Holanda, Hungría, Islandia, Irlanda, Italia , Kosovo, Letonia, Liechtenstein, Luxemburgo, Macedonia, Malta, Mónaco, Noruega, Polonia, Portugal, Rusia, Rumania, San Marino, España, Suecia, Suiza, Turquía, Ucrania, Vaticano, Serbia, Eslovaquia, Eslovenia, Yugoslavia.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se debe obtener antes de la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Albania, Moldavia.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Norteamérica&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se puede obtener a la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Canadá, México, Estados Unidos de América, Antigua y Barbuda, Bahamas, Barbados, Costa Rica, Dominica, República Dominicana, Granada, Guatemala, Haití, Honduras, Jamaica, Nicaragua, Panamá, El Salvador, Saint Kitts y Nevis, Santa Lucía , San Vicente y las Granadinas.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se debe obtener antes de la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Belice, Cuba.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ocean Asia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se puede obtener a la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Estados Federados de Micronesia, Fiji, Islas Marshall, Nueva Zelanda, Samoa, Islas Salomón, Tonga, Tuvalu, Vanuatu.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se debe obtener antes de la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Papúa Nueva Guinea.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Australia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se puede obtener a la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Australia&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sudamérica&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se puede obtener a la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Argentina, Bolivia, Brasil, Chile, Ecuador, Guyana, Paraguay, Perú, Surinam, Uruguay, Trinidad y Tobago, Venezuela.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La visa se debe obtener antes de la llegada:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Colombia.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/testimonials/collage5.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572514329525!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1364, 'es', '', 'one col', 'visas-para-jordania');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1367, 'Visas en Jordanie', 'Visas en Jordanie', 'Visas en Jordanie', 'Visas en Jordanie', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Visas à &lt;strong&gt;entrée unique&lt;/strong&gt; valable un mois: &lt;strong&gt;40 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (environ &lt;strong&gt;56 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Visas à &lt;strong&gt;double entrée&lt;/strong&gt; valables pour trois mois: &lt;strong&gt;60 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (environ &lt;strong&gt;85 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Visas à &lt;strong&gt;entrées multiples&lt;/strong&gt; valables pour six mois: &lt;strong&gt;120 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (environ &lt;strong&gt;170 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les groupes de cinq personnes ou plus arrivant avec un voyagiste jordanien désigné sont exemptés des frais de visa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Certaines nationalités exigent l&#039;obtention d&#039;un visa d&#039;entrée avant de voyager. La liste suivante est uniquement comprise comme un outil utile et les données qu’elle contient sont sujettes à modification sans préavis. Il est recommandé de vérifier auprès de l&#039;ambassade de Jordanie dans votre pays avant de voyager afin de vous assurer que vous disposez de tous les documents nécessaires pour voyager.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Des frais de service en partance s’appliquent aux points frontières terrestres et maritimes. 10.00 JD par passager et 5.00 JD par véhicule.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;** Les citoyens des pays suivants sont exemptés du paiement de leurs frais de visa: Algérie, Émirats arabes unis, Bahreïn, Arabie saoudite, Syrie, Palestine, Qatar, Koweït, Liban, Malaisie, Japon, Yémen, Turquie et Turquie. Un.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Afrique&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa peut être obtenu à l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Algérie, Cap-Vert, Tunisie (18-35 ans), Lesotho, Libye, Maroc, Malawi, Maurice, Rwanda, Sao Tomé-et-Principe, Seychelles, Afrique du Sud, Tunisie.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa doit être obtenu avant l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Angola, Bénin, Botswana, Burkina Faso, Burundi, Cameroun, République centrafricaine, Tchad, Comores, Eswatini, Congo Brazzaville, Côte d&#039;Ivoire, Djibouti, Égypte, Guinée équatoriale, Érythrée, Éthiopie, Gabon, Gambie, Gambie, Ghana, Guinée, Guinée-Bissau, Kenya, Lagos, Libéria, Madagascar, Mali, Mauritanie, Mozambique, Namibie, Niger, Nigéria, Sénégal, Sierra Leone, Somalie, Soudan, Sud-Soudan, Swaziland, Tanzanie, Togo, Ouganda, Zambie, Zimbabwe.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asie&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; Le visa peut être obtenu à l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Arménie, Azerbaïdjan, Bahreïn, Bhoutan, Brunéi, Birmanie, Chine, Taiwan, Géorgie, Hong Kong, Inde, Indonésie, Israël, Japon, Kazakhstan, Koweït, Liban, Macao, Malaisie, Maldives, Corée du Nord, Palestine / Passagers PNA, République de Chine, Qatar, Russie, Arabie saoudite, Singapour, Corée du Sud, Syrie, Tadjikistan, Thaïlande, Turkménistan, Turquie, Émirats arabes unis, Ouzbékistan, Yémen.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa doit être obtenu avant l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Afghanistan, Bangladesh, Cambodge, Égypte, Iran, Iraq, Laos, Mongolie, Népal, Pakistan, Papouasie-Nouvelle-Guinée, Philippines, Sri Lanka, Vietnam.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Europe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa peut être obtenu à l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Andorre, Autriche, Azerbaïdjan, Biélorussie, Belgique, Bosnie-Herzégovine, Grande-Bretagne, Bulgarie, Croatie, Chypre, République tchèque, Danemark, Kazakhstan, Estonie, Finlande, France, Géorgie, Allemagne, Grèce, Hollande, Hongrie, Islande, Irlande , Italie, Kosovo, Lettonie, Liechtenstein, Luxembourg, Macédoine, Malte, Monaco, Norvège, Pologne, Portugal, Russie, Roumanie, Saint-Marin, Espagne, Suède, Suisse, Turquie, Ukraine, Vatican, Serbie, Slovaquie, Slovénie, Yougoslavie.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa doit être obtenu avant l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Albanie, Moldova.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amérique du Nord&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa peut être obtenu à l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Canada, Mexique, États-Unis d&#039;Amérique, Antigua-et-Barbuda, Bahamas, Barbade, Costa Rica, Dominique, République dominicaine, Grenade, Guatemala, Haïti, Honduras, Jamaïque, Nicaragua, Panama, El Salvador, Saint-Kitts-et-Nevis, Sainte-Lucie , Saint-Vincent-et-les Grenadines.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa doit être obtenu avant l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Belize, Cuba.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Océan Asie&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa peut être obtenu à l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;États fédérés de Micronésie, Fidji, Îles Marshall, Nouvelle-Zélande, Samoa, Îles Salomon, Tonga, Tuvalu, Vanuatu.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa doit être obtenu avant l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Papouasie Nouvelle Guinée.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Australie&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa peut être obtenu à l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Australie&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amérique du sud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa peut être obtenu à l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Argentine, Bolivie, Brésil, Chili, Équateur, Guyana, Paraguay, Pérou, Suriname, Uruguay, Trinité-et-Tobago, Venezuela.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le visa doit être obtenu avant l&#039;arrivée:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;La Colombie.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/testimonials/collage5.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572514329525!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1364, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'visas-en-jordanie'),
(1368, 'Visti per la Giordania', 'Visti per la Giordania', 'Visti per la Giordania', 'Visti per la Giordania', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Visti per &lt;strong&gt;ingresso singolo&lt;/strong&gt; valido per un mese: &lt;strong&gt;40 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (circa &lt;strong&gt;56 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Visti per &lt;strong&gt;doppia entrata&lt;/strong&gt; valido per tre mesi: &lt;strong&gt;60 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (circa &lt;strong&gt;85 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Visti per &lt;strong&gt;ingressi multipli&lt;/strong&gt; validi per sei mesi: &lt;strong&gt;120 JOD&lt;/strong&gt; (circa &lt;strong&gt;170 USD&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;I gruppi di cinque o più persone che arrivano con un tour operator giordano designato sono esenti dalle spese di visto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alcune nazionalità richiedono l&#039;ottenimento di un visto d&#039;ingresso prima del viaggio. Il seguente elenco è inteso solo come uno strumento utile e i dati che contiene sono soggetti a modifiche senza preavviso. Si consiglia di verificare con l&#039;ambasciata giordana nel proprio paese prima di viaggiare per assicurarsi di avere tutta la documentazione necessaria per viaggiare.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Una tassa di servizio in uscita si applica ai punti di frontiera terrestri e marittimi. JD 10,00 per passeggero e JD 5,00 per veicolo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;** I cittadini dei seguenti paesi sono esenti dal pagamento delle tasse di visto: Algeria, Marocco, Sudan, Emirati Arabi Uniti, Bahrein, KSA, Siria, Palestina, Qatar, Kuwait, Libano, Malesia, Giappone, Yemen, Turchia e ONU.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Africa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto può essere ottenuto all&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Algeria, Capo Verde, Tunisia (età 18-35), Lesotho, Libia, Marocco, Malawi, Mauritius, Ruanda, Sao Tome e Principe, Seychelles, Sudafrica, Tunisia.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto deve essere ottenuto prima dell&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Angola, Benin, Botswana, Burkina Faso, Burundi, Camerun, Repubblica Centrafricana, Ciad, Comore, Eswatini, Congo Brazzaville, Costa d&#039;Avorio, Gibuti, Egitto, Guinea Equatoriale, Eritrea, Etiopia, Gabon, Gambia, Ghana, Guinea, Guinea-Bissau, Kenya, Lagos, Liberia, Madagascar, Mali, Mauritania, Mozambico, Namibia, Niger, Nigeria, Senegal, Sierra Leone, Somalia, Sudan, Sud Sudan, Swaziland, Tanzania, Togo, Uganda, Zambia, Zimbabwe.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; Il visto può essere ottenuto all&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Armenia, Azerbaigian, Bahrain, Bhutan, Brunei, Birmania, Cina, Taiwan, Georgia, Hong Kong, India, Indonesia, Israele, Giappone, Kazakistan, Kuwait, Libano, Macao, Malesia, Maldive, Corea del Nord, Palestina / Passeggeri PNA, Repubblica di Cina, Qatar, Russia, Arabia Saudita, Singapore, Corea del Sud, Siria, Tagikistan, Tailandia, Turkmenistan, Turchia, Emirati Arabi Uniti, Uzbekistan, Yemen.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto deve essere ottenuto prima dell&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Afghanistan, Bangladesh, Cambogia, Egitto, Iran, Iraq, Laos, Mongolia, Nepal, Pakistan, Papua Nuova Guinea, Filippine, Sri Lanka, Vietnam.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Europa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto può essere ottenuto all&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Andorra, Austria, Azerbaigian, Bielorussia, Belgio, Bosnia ed Erzegovina, Gran Bretagna, Bulgaria, Croazia, Cipro, Repubblica Ceca, Danimarca, Kazakistan, Estonia, Finlandia, Francia, Georgia, Germania, Grecia, Olanda, Ungheria, Islanda, Irlanda , Italia, Kosovo, Lettonia, Liechtenstein, Lussemburgo, Macedonia, Malta, Monaco, Norvegia, Polonia, Portogallo, Russia, Romania, San Marino, Spagna, Svezia, Svizzera, Turchia, Ucraina, Vaticano, Serbia, Slovacchia, Slovenia, Jugoslavia.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto deve essere ottenuto prima dell&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Albania, Moldavia.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nord America&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto può essere ottenuto all&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Canada, Messico, Stati Uniti d&#039;America, Antigua e Barbuda, Bahamas, Barbados, Costa Rica, Dominica, Repubblica Dominicana, Grenada, Guatemala, Haiti, Honduras, Giamaica, Nicaragua, Panama, El Salvador, Saint Kitts e Nevis, Saint Lucia , Saint Vincent e Grenadine.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto deve essere ottenuto prima dell&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Belize, Cuba.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ocean Asia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto può essere ottenuto all&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Stati Federati di Micronesia, Figi, Isole Marshall, Nuova Zelanda, Samoa, Isole Salomone, Tonga, Tuvalu, Vanuatu.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto deve essere ottenuto prima dell&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Papua Nuova Guinea.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Australia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto può essere ottenuto all&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Australia&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;America del sud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto può essere ottenuto all&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Argentina, Bolivia, Brasile, Cile, Ecuador, Guyana, Paraguay, Perù, Suriname, Uruguay, Trinidad e Tobago, Venezuela.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il visto deve essere ottenuto prima dell&#039;arrivo:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Colombia&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/testimonials/collage5.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572514329525!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1364, 'it', '', 'one col', 'visti-per-la-giordania'),
(1369, 'PV Travels Équipe', 'PV Travels Équipe', 'PV Travels Équipe', 'PV Travels Équipe', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/khaled.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Khaled Nawafleh &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Khaled Nawafleh &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;PV Travels General Manager. Offering specialist, professional and competitive travel products&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/f1.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Fatima Ammar &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Fatima Ammar&lt;/strong&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sales Department for Arabic, English, Italian and Spanish in PV Travels in Amman&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Screenshot_20191030-110610.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Fatima Assaf &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Fatima Assaf &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sales Department for Arabic, French and English in PV Travels in Wadi Musa&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Screenshot_20191030-124413.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ramzi Shamaseen &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Ramzi Shamaseen &lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Operations Department in Arabic and English in PV Travels in Wadi Musa&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Screenshot_20191030-124559.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Abeer Al-Hamadeen&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Abeer Al-Hamadeen &lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Reservation Department for Arabic and English in PV Travels in Wadi Musa&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/PvtLogo2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Farah Zitouni &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Farah Zitouni&lt;/strong&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sales Department for Arabic, French and English in PV Travels in Wadi Musa&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Screenshot_20191030-122638.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ahmad Al-Zoubi&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Ahmad Al-Zoubi &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Professional driver with more than 10 year of experience  in PV Travels in Wadi Musa&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Anas.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Anas Al-Zoubi &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Anas Al-Zoubi &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Professional driver with more than 3 year of experience  in PV Travels in Wadi Musa&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1363, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'pv-travels-equipe'),
(1370, 'PV Travels Squadra', 'PV Travels Squadra', 'PV Travels Squadra', 'PV Travels Squadra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/khaled.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Khaled Nawafleh &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Khaled Nawafleh &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;PV Travels General Manager. Offering specialist, professional and competitive travel products&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/f1.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Fatima Ammar &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Fatima Ammar&lt;/strong&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sales Department for Arabic, English, Italian and Spanish in PV Travels in Amman&lt;/span&gt;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Screenshot_20191030-110610.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Fatima Assaf &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;Black-text &quot;&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Fatima Assaf &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quo