(1438, 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Austrian Airlines AG, is the flag carrier of Austria and a subsidiary of the Lufthansa Group. It flies to six domestic and more than 120 international year-round and seasonal destinations in 55 countries as of July 2016, and is a member of the Star Alliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This airline offers on board services such as meals on short routes, they offer snacks with some added depending on the duration of the flight. On longer routes they offer two types of menu, with various types of snacks and drinks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Additionally,  as part of the on board entertainment, they offer movies only on longer flights, as well as audio channels, games and their flight magazine called Skylines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call +1 310 616 55 85.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Austrian-new-logo-e1524235202848-916x515.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1438, 'en', '', 'one col', 'austrian-airlines'),
(1439, 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Austrian Airlines AG, is the flag carrier of Austria and a subsidiary of the Lufthansa Group. It flies to six domestic and more than 120 international year-round and seasonal destinations in 55 countries as of July 2016, and is a member of the Star Alliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This airline offers on board services such as meals on short routes, they offer snacks with some added depending on the duration of the flight. On longer routes they offer two types of menu, with various types of snacks and drinks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Additionally,  as part of the on board entertainment, they offer movies only on longer flights, as well as audio channels, games and their flight magazine called Skylines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call +1 310 616 55 85.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Austrian-new-logo-e1524235202848-916x515.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1438, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'austrian-airlines'),
(1440, 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Austrian Airlines AG, es la aerolínea de bandera de Austria y una subsidiaria del Grupo Lufthansa. Vuela a seis destinos nacionales y más de 120 destinos internacionales durante todo el año y estacionales en 55 países a partir de julio de 2016, y es miembro de Star Alliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Esta aerolínea ofrece servicios a bordo, como comidas en rutas cortas, ofrece refrigerios y algunos adicionales según la duración del vuelo. En rutas más largas ofrecen dos tipos de menú, con varios tipos de bocadillos y bebidas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Además, como parte del entretenimiento a bordo, ofrecen películas solo en vuelos más largos, así como canales de audio, juegos y su revista de vuelo llamada Skylines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para asistencia con su reserva, tarifas, boletos electrónicos, horarios de llegada y salida, equipaje perdido o dañado, soporte de reserva en línea y consultas generales, llame al +1 310 616 55 85.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Austrian-new-logo-e1524235202848-916x515.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1438, 'es', '', 'one col', 'austrian-airlines'),
(1441, 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Austrian Airlines AG, est la compagnie aérienne sous pavillon autrichien et une filiale du groupe Lufthansa. Elle dessert six destinations nationales et plus de 120 destinations internationales tout au long de l&#039;année et est saisonnière dans 55 pays en juillet 2016. Elle est membre de Star Alliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cette compagnie aérienne propose des services à bord, tels que des repas sur des trajets courts, des collations et d&#039;autres supplémentaires en fonction de la durée du vol. Sur des itinéraires plus longs, ils proposent deux types de menus, avec différents types de collations et de boissons.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En outre, dans le cadre du divertissement à bord, ils proposent des films uniquement sur des vols plus longs, ainsi que des chaînes audio, des jeux et leur magazine de bord appelé Skylines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour obtenir de l&#039;aide pour votre réservation, les tarifs, la billetterie électronique, les heures d&#039;arrivée et de départ, les bagages perdus ou endommagés, l&#039;aide à la réservation en ligne et les demandes de renseignements généraux, veuillez appeler le +1 310 616 55 85.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Austrian-new-logo-e1524235202848-916x515.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1438, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'austrian-airlines'),
(1442, 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Austrian Airlines AG, è la compagnia aerea di bandiera austriaca e una consociata del gruppo Lufthansa. Vola verso sei destinazioni nazionali e oltre 120 destinazioni internazionali durante l&#039;anno e stagionale in 55 paesi a partire da luglio 2016, ed è membro della Star Alliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questa compagnia aerea offre servizi a bordo, come pasti su rotte brevi, offre snack e alcuni altri a seconda della durata del volo. Su percorsi più lunghi offrono due tipi di menu, con vari tipi di snack e bevande.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Inoltre, nell&#039;ambito dell&#039;intrattenimento a bordo, offrono film solo su voli più lunghi, nonché canali audio, giochi e la loro rivista di volo chiamata Skylines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per assistenza con la prenotazione, le tariffe, l&#039;e-ticketing, gli orari di arrivo e di partenza, i bagagli smarriti o danneggiati, l&#039;assistenza per la prenotazione online e le domande generali, chiamare il numero +1 310 616 55 85.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Austrian-new-logo-e1524235202848-916x515.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1438, 'it', '', 'one col', 'austrian-airlines'),
(1443, 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;British Airways is the flag carrier airline of the United Kingdom, headquartered at Waterside, Harmondsworth, near its main hub at London Heathrow Airport. It is the second largest airline in the United Kingdom, based on fleet size and passengers carried, behind EasyJet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;British Airways&#039; tiered loyalty program, called the Executive Club, includes access to special lounges and dedicated &quot;fast&quot; queues. BA also invites its top corporate accounts to join a &quot;Premier&quot; incentive program. British Airways operates airside lounges for passengers travelling in premium cabins, and these are available to certain tiers of Executive Club members.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;First class passengers, as well as Gold Executive Club members, are entitled to use First Class Lounges. Business class passengers (called Club World or Club Europe in BA terms) as well as Silver Executive Club members may use Business lounges. At airports in which BA does not operate a departure lounge, a third party lounge is often provided for premium or status passengers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 0344 493 0787.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/british.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1443, 'en', '', 'one col', 'british-airways'),
(1444, 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;British Airways is the flag carrier airline of the United Kingdom, headquartered at Waterside, Harmondsworth, near its main hub at London Heathrow Airport. It is the second largest airline in the United Kingdom, based on fleet size and passengers carried, behind EasyJet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;British Airways&#039; tiered loyalty program, called the Executive Club, includes access to special lounges and dedicated &quot;fast&quot; queues. BA also invites its top corporate accounts to join a &quot;Premier&quot; incentive program. British Airways operates airside lounges for passengers travelling in premium cabins, and these are available to certain tiers of Executive Club members.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;First class passengers, as well as Gold Executive Club members, are entitled to use First Class Lounges. Business class passengers (called Club World or Club Europe in BA terms) as well as Silver Executive Club members may use Business lounges. At airports in which BA does not operate a departure lounge, a third party lounge is often provided for premium or status passengers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 0344 493 0787.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/british.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1443, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'british-airways');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1445, 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;British Airways es la aerolínea de bandera del Reino Unido, con sede en Waterside, Harmondsworth, cerca de su centro principal en el aeropuerto Heathrow de Londres. Es la segunda aerolínea más grande del Reino Unido, según el tamaño de la flota y los pasajeros transportados, detrás de EasyJet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El programa de fidelización escalonada de British Airways, llamado Executive Club, incluye acceso a salas especiales y colas &quot;rápidas&quot; dedicadas. BA también invita a sus principales cuentas corporativas a unirse a un programa de incentivos &quot;Premier&quot;. British Airways opera salas de espera para pasajeros que viajan en cabinas premium, y están disponibles para ciertos niveles de miembros del Executive Club.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Los pasajeros de primera clase, así como los miembros de Gold Executive Club, tienen derecho a usar las salas VIP de primera clase. Los pasajeros de clase ejecutiva (llamados Club World o Club Europe en términos de BA), así como los miembros de Silver Executive Club pueden usar las salas VIP de negocios. En los aeropuertos en los que BA no opera una sala de embarque, a menudo se proporciona una sala de terceros para pasajeros premium o de categoría.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para asistencia con su reserva, tarifas, boletos electrónicos, horarios de llegada y salida, equipaje perdido o dañado, soporte de reserva en línea y consultas generales, llame al 0344 493 0787.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/british.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1443, 'es', '', 'one col', 'british-airways'),
(1446, 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;British Airways est la compagnie aérienne britannique, basée à Waterside, Harmondsworth, près de son hub principal de l&#039;aéroport d&#039;Heathrow à Londres. C&#039;est la deuxième compagnie aérienne du Royaume-Uni, derrière EasyJet, en fonction de la taille de sa flotte et du nombre de passagers transportés.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le programme de fidélité étalé de British Airways, appelé Executive Club, comprend l’accès à des salles spéciales et à des files d’attente &quot;rapides&quot;. BA invite également ses principaux comptes d&#039;entreprise à rejoindre un programme incitatif &quot;Premier&quot;. British Airways exploite des salles d&#039;attente pour les passagers voyageant dans des cabines premium et est disponible pour certains niveaux de membres du Executive Club.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Les passagers de première classe, ainsi que les membres du Gold Executive Club, ont le droit d&#039;utiliser les salons VIP de première classe. Les passagers de la classe affaires (appelés Club World ou Club Europe en termes de BA), ainsi que les membres du Silver Executive Club peuvent utiliser les salons Business VIP. Dans les aéroports où BA n&#039;exploite pas de salle d&#039;embarquement, un salon tiers est souvent fourni aux passagers premium ou de catégorie.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour obtenir de l&#039;aide pour votre réservation, les tarifs, la billetterie électronique, les heures d&#039;arrivée et de départ, les bagages perdus ou endommagés, l&#039;aide à la réservation en ligne et les demandes de renseignements généraux, veuillez appeler le 0344 493 0787.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/british.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1443, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'british-airways'),
(1447, 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;British Airways è la compagnia di bandiera del Regno Unito, con sede a Waterside, Harmondsworth, vicino al suo hub principale all&#039;aeroporto di Heathrow di Londra. È la seconda più grande compagnia aerea del Regno Unito, in base alle dimensioni della flotta e dei passeggeri trasportati, dietro EasyJet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il programma di fidelizzazione della British Airways, chiamato Executive Club, include l&#039;accesso a stanze speciali e code &quot;veloci&quot; dedicate. BA invita inoltre i suoi principali account aziendali a partecipare a un programma di incentivazione &quot;Premier&quot;. British Airways gestisce sale d&#039;attesa per i passeggeri che viaggiano in cabine premium e sono disponibili per determinati livelli di membri dell&#039;Executive Club.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;I passeggeri di prima classe, così come i membri del Gold Executive Club, hanno il diritto di utilizzare le sale VIP di prima classe. I passeggeri della classe Executive (chiamati Club World o Club Europe in termini di BA), nonché i membri del Silver Executive Club possono utilizzare le sale VIP business. Negli aeroporti in cui BA non gestisce una sala partenze, viene spesso fornita una sala di terzi per passeggeri premium o di categoria.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per assistenza con la prenotazione, le tariffe, l&#039;e-ticketing, gli orari di arrivo e di partenza, i bagagli smarriti o danneggiati, l&#039;assistenza per la prenotazione online e le domande generali, chiamare il numero 0344 493 0787.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/british.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1443, 'it', '', 'one col', 'british-airways'),
(1448, 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alitalia – Società Aerea Italiana (Alitalia – Italian Air Company), operating as Alitalia, is the flag carrier of Italy. Alitalia has been in the SkyTeam alliance since 2009; Alitalia-LAI originally joined in 2001.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alitalia has since arranged code-share agreements with SkyTeam members, allowing passengers to fly to numerous destinations (with some or all segments operated by airlines other than Alitalia) using a single Alitalia ticket.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The airline&#039;s frequent-flyer program is named &quot;MilleMiglia&quot; (thousand miles), and is part of the SkyTeam alliance program, allowing passengers to collect miles and redeem them with free tickets across the whole alliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 00 39 06 65649.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/alitalia.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1448, 'en', '', 'one col', 'alitalia'),
(1449, 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alitalia – Società Aerea Italiana (Alitalia – Italian Air Company), operating as Alitalia, is the flag carrier of Italy. Alitalia has been in the SkyTeam alliance since 2009; Alitalia-LAI originally joined in 2001.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alitalia has since arranged code-share agreements with SkyTeam members, allowing passengers to fly to numerous destinations (with some or all segments operated by airlines other than Alitalia) using a single Alitalia ticket.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The airline&#039;s frequent-flyer program is named &quot;MilleMiglia&quot; (thousand miles), and is part of the SkyTeam alliance program, allowing passengers to collect miles and redeem them with free tickets across the whole alliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 00 39 06 65649.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/alitalia.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1448, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'alitalia'),
(1450, 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alitalia - Società Aerea Italiana (Alitalia - Compañía aérea italiana), que opera como Alitalia, es la aerolínea de bandera de Italia. Alitalia ha estado en la alianza SkyTeam desde 2009; Alitalia-LAI se unió originalmente en 2001.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alitalia ha estado en la alianza SkyTeam desde 2009; Alitalia-LAI se unió originalmente en 2001. Desde entonces, Alitalia ha concertado acuerdos de código compartido con miembros de SkyTeam, lo que permite a los pasajeros volar a numerosos destinos (con algunos o todos los segmentos operados por aerolíneas que no sean Alitalia) utilizando un solo boleto de Alitalia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El programa de viajero frecuente de la aerolínea se llama &quot;MilleMiglia&quot; (miles de millas) y forma parte del programa de alianza SkyTeam, que permite a los pasajeros acumular millas y canjearlas con boletos gratis en toda la alianza.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para asistencia con su reserva, tarifas, boletos electrónicos, horarios de llegada y salida, equipaje perdido o dañado, soporte de reserva en línea y consultas generales, llame al 00 39 06 65649.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/alitalia.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1448, 'es', '', 'one col', 'alitalia'),
(1451, 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alitalia - Società Aerea Italiana (compagnie aérienne italienne), qui opère sous le nom d&#039;Alitalia, est la compagnie aérienne nationale de l&#039;Italie. Alitalia fait partie de l&#039;alliance SkyTeam depuis 2009; Alitalia-LAI a rejoint le groupe en 2001.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alitalia fait partie de l&#039;alliance SkyTeam depuis 2009; Alitalia-LAI a initialement adhéré en 2001. Depuis, Alitalia a conclu des accords de partage de codes avec les membres SkyTeam, permettant aux passagers de desservir de nombreuses destinations (avec tout ou partie des segments exploités par des compagnies aériennes autres qu&#039;Alitalia). Un seul billet Alitalia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le programme de fidélisation de la compagnie s&#039;appelle &quot;MilleMiglia&quot; (des milliers de miles) et fait partie du programme d&#039;alliance SkyTeam, qui permet aux passagers d&#039;accumuler des miles et de les échanger avec des billets gratuits dans l&#039;ensemble de l&#039;alliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour obtenir de l&#039;aide pour votre réservation, les tarifs, la billetterie électronique, les heures d&#039;arrivée et de départ, les bagages perdus ou endommagés, l&#039;aide à la réservation en ligne et les demandes de renseignements généraux, veuillez appeler le 00 39 06 65649.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/alitalia.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1448, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'alitalia'),
(1452, 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alitalia - Società Aerea Italiana (Alitalia - compagnia aerea italiana), che opera come Alitalia, è la compagnia di bandiera italiana. Alitalia fa parte dell&#039;alleanza SkyTeam dal 2009; Alitalia-LAI si unì originariamente nel 2001.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Alitalia fa parte dell&#039;alleanza SkyTeam dal 2009; Alitalia-LAI ha aderito originariamente nel 2001. Da allora, Alitalia ha stipulato accordi di code-share con i membri SkyTeam, consentendo ai passeggeri di volare verso numerose destinazioni (con alcuni o tutti i segmenti gestiti da compagnie aeree diverse da Alitalia) utilizzando Un unico biglietto Alitalia.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il programma frequent flyer della compagnia aerea si chiama &quot;MilleMiglia&quot; (migliaia di miglia) e fa parte del programma di alleanza SkyTeam, che consente ai passeggeri di accumulare miglia e riscattarli con biglietti gratuiti in tutta l&#039;alleanza.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per assistenza con la prenotazione, le tariffe, l&#039;e-ticketing, gli orari di arrivo e di partenza, i bagagli smarriti o danneggiati, l&#039;assistenza per la prenotazione online e le domande generali, chiamare il numero 00 39 06 65649.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/alitalia.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1448, 'it', '', 'one col', 'alitalia'),
(1453, 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa (sometimes also as Lufthansa German Airlines), is the flag carrier and largest German airline which, when combined with its subsidiaries, is also the largest airline in Europe in terms of passengers carried.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa is one of the five founding members of Star Alliance, the world&#039;s largest airline alliance, formed in 1997. In total, the group has over 700 aircraft, making it one of the largest airline fleets in the world.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa&#039;s frequent-flyer programme is called Miles &amp;amp; More, and is shared among several European airlines, including all of Lufthansa&#039;s subsidiary airlines. Miles &amp;amp; More members may earn miles on Lufthansa flights and Star Alliance partner flights, as well as through Lufthansa credit cards, and purchases made through the Lufthansa shops.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call +49 (0) 800 - 83 84 267.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Lufthansa.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1453, 'en', '', 'one col', 'lufthansa'),
(1454, 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa (sometimes also as Lufthansa German Airlines), is the flag carrier and largest German airline which, when combined with its subsidiaries, is also the largest airline in Europe in terms of passengers carried.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa is one of the five founding members of Star Alliance, the world&#039;s largest airline alliance, formed in 1997. In total, the group has over 700 aircraft, making it one of the largest airline fleets in the world.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa&#039;s frequent-flyer programme is called Miles &amp;amp; More, and is shared among several European airlines, including all of Lufthansa&#039;s subsidiary airlines. Miles &amp;amp; More members may earn miles on Lufthansa flights and Star Alliance partner flights, as well as through Lufthansa credit cards, and purchases made through the Lufthansa shops.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call +49 (0) 800 - 83 84 267.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Lufthansa.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1453, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'lufthansa'),
(1455, 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa (a veces también como Lufthansa German Airlines), es la aerolínea de bandera y la aerolínea alemana más grande que, cuando se combina con sus filiales, también es la aerolínea más grande de Europa en términos de pasajeros transportados.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa es uno de los cinco miembros fundadores de Star Alliance, la alianza de aerolíneas más grande del mundo, formada en 1997. En total, el grupo tiene más de 700 aviones, por lo que es una de las flotas de aerolíneas más grandes del mundo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El programa de viajero frecuente de Lufthansa se llama Miles &amp;amp; More, y se comparte entre varias aerolíneas europeas, incluidas todas las aerolíneas subsidiarias de Lufthansa. Los miembros de Miles &amp;amp; More pueden ganar millas en vuelos de Lufthansa y vuelos de socios de Star Alliance, así como a través de tarjetas de crédito de Lufthansa y compras realizadas en las tiendas de Lufthansa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para asistencia con su reserva, tarifas, boletos electrónicos, horarios de llegada y salida, equipaje perdido o dañado, soporte de reserva en línea y consultas generales, llame al +49 (0) 800 - 83 84 267.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Lufthansa.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1453, 'es', '', 'one col', 'lufthansa'),
(1456, 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa (parfois aussi comme Lufthansa German Airlines), est la compagnie aérienne nationale et la plus grande compagnie aérienne allemande qui, une fois combinée à ses filiales, est également la plus grande compagnie aérienne d&#039;Europe en termes de passagers transportés.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa est l’un des cinq membres fondateurs de Star Alliance, la plus grande alliance de compagnies aériennes au monde, créée en 1997. Au total, le groupe compte plus de 700 avions, ce qui en fait l’une des plus grandes flottes aériennes au monde. .&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le programme de fidélisation de Lufthansa s&#039;appelle Miles &amp;amp; More et est partagé entre plusieurs compagnies aériennes européennes, y compris toutes les filiales de Lufthansa. Les membres Miles &amp;amp; More peuvent gagner des miles sur les vols Lufthansa et les membres Star Alliance, ainsi que via les cartes de crédit Lufthansa et les achats effectués dans les magasins Lufthansa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour obtenir de l&#039;aide pour votre réservation, les tarifs, la billetterie électronique, les heures d&#039;arrivée et de départ, les bagages perdus ou endommagés, l&#039;aide à la réservation en ligne et les demandes de renseignements généraux, veuillez appeler le +49 (0) 800 - 83 84 267.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Lufthansa.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1453, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'lufthansa'),
(1457, 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa (a volte come anche Lufthansa German Airlines), è la compagnia di bandiera e la più grande compagnia aerea tedesca che, se combinata con le sue filiali, è anche la più grande compagnia aerea in Europa in termini di passeggeri trasportati.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa è uno dei cinque membri fondatori di Star Alliance, la più grande alleanza di compagnie aeree del mondo, formata nel 1997. In totale, il gruppo ha più di 700 aerei, rendendolo una delle flotte più grandi al mondo. .&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il programma frequent flyer di Lufthansa si chiama Miles &amp;amp; More ed è condiviso da diverse compagnie aeree europee, incluse tutte le compagnie aeree sussidiarie di Lufthansa. I membri Miles &amp;amp; More possono guadagnare miglia sui voli Lufthansa e sui voli membri Star Alliance, nonché attraverso le carte di credito Lufthansa e gli acquisti effettuati nei negozi Lufthansa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per assistenza con la prenotazione, le tariffe, l&#039;e-ticketing, gli orari di arrivo e di partenza, i bagagli smarriti o danneggiati, l&#039;assistenza per la prenotazione online e le domande generali, chiamare il numero +49 (0) 800 - 83 84 267.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Lufthansa.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1453, 'it', '', 'one col', 'lufthansa'),
(1458, 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qatar Airways is the state-owned flag carrier of Qatar. The airline operates a hub-and-spoke network, linking over 150 international destinations across Africa, Central Asia, Europe, Far East, South Asia, Middle East, North America, South America and Oceania.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This airline has a fleet of more than 200 aircraft. Qatar Airways Group employs more than 43,000 people. The carrier has been a member of the Oneworld alliance since October 2013, the first Gulf carrier to sign with one of the three airline alliances.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qatar Airways&#039; in-flight entertainment system is called Oryx One. With the exception of some Airbus A320 family aircraft, all aircraft have personal seat-back Info-attainment screens. Some Airbus A320 family aircraft are fitted with main screen entertainment. Qatar is updating Airbus A320 family aircraft to seat-back AVOD. Qatar Airways also offers Onboard Connectivity Wi-Fi, which allows passengers to send SMS and MMS, access email, and browse the internet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 00 974 4022 6000.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/qatar.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1458, 'en', '', 'one col', 'qatar-airways'),
(1459, 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qatar Airways is the state-owned flag carrier of Qatar. The airline operates a hub-and-spoke network, linking over 150 international destinations across Africa, Central Asia, Europe, Far East, South Asia, Middle East, North America, South America and Oceania.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This airline has a fleet of more than 200 aircraft. Qatar Airways Group employs more than 43,000 people. The carrier has been a member of the Oneworld alliance since October 2013, the first Gulf carrier to sign with one of the three airline alliances.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qatar Airways&#039; in-flight entertainment system is called Oryx One. With the exception of some Airbus A320 family aircraft, all aircraft have personal seat-back Info-attainment screens. Some Airbus A320 family aircraft are fitted with main screen entertainment. Qatar is updating Airbus A320 family aircraft to seat-back AVOD. Qatar Airways also offers Onboard Connectivity Wi-Fi, which allows passengers to send SMS and MMS, access email, and browse the internet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 00 974 4022 6000.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/qatar.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1458, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'qatar-airways'),
(1460, 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qatar Airways es la aerolínea de bandera estatal de Qatar. La aerolínea opera una red de concentrador y radio, que une más de 150 destinos internacionales en África, Asia Central, Europa, Lejano Oriente, Asia del Sur, Medio Oriente, América del Norte, América del Sur y Oceanía.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Esta aerolínea tiene una flota de más de 200 aviones. Qatar Airways Group emplea a más de 43,000 personas. La aerolínea ha sido miembro de la alianza Oneworld desde octubre de 2013, la primera aerolínea del Golfo en firmar con una de las tres alianzas de aerolíneas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El sistema de entretenimiento a bordo de Qatar Airways se llama Oryx One. Con la excepción de algunos aviones de la familia Airbus A320, todos los aviones tienen pantallas personales de información de respaldo del asiento. Algunos aviones de la familia Airbus A320 están equipados con pantalla principal de entretenimiento. Qatar está actualizando el avión de la familia Airbus A320 para AVOD en el respaldo del asiento. Qatar Airways también ofrece Wi-Fi de conectividad a bordo, que permite a los pasajeros enviar SMS y MMS, acceder a correos electrónicos y navegar por Internet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para asistencia con su reserva, tarifas, boletos electrónicos, horarios de llegada y salida, equipaje perdido o dañado, soporte de reserva en línea y consultas generales, llame al 00 974 4022 6000.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/qatar.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1458, 'es', '', 'one col', 'qatar-airways'),
(1461, 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qatar Airways est la compagnie aérienne nationale du Qatar. La compagnie aérienne exploite un réseau hub et radio reliant plus de 150 destinations internationales en Afrique, Asie centrale, Europe, Extrême-Orient, Asie du Sud, Moyen-Orient, Amérique du Nord, Amérique du Sud et Océanie.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Cette compagnie aérienne possède une flotte de plus de 200 avions. Qatar Airways Group emploie plus de 43 000 personnes. La compagnie aérienne est membre de l&#039;alliance Oneworld depuis octobre 2013, la première compagnie aérienne du Golfe à signer l&#039;une des trois alliances aériennes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le système de divertissement à bord de Qatar Airways s&#039;appelle Oryx One et, à l&#039;exception de certains appareils de la famille Airbus A320, tous les appareils sont dotés d&#039;écrans d&#039;informations personnels sur le dossier du siège. Certains avions de la famille A320 d’Airbus sont équipés d’un écran de divertissement principal. Le Qatar met à jour l&#039;avion de la famille A320 d&#039;Airbus pour le système AVOD à l&#039;arrière. Qatar Airways propose également une connectivité Wi-Fi à bord, qui permet aux passagers d&#039;envoyer des SMS et des MMS, d&#039;accéder à des courriels et de surfer sur Internet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour obtenir de l&#039;aide pour votre réservation, les tarifs, la billetterie électronique, les heures d&#039;arrivée et de départ, les bagages perdus ou endommagés, l&#039;aide à la réservation en ligne et les demandes de renseignements généraux, veuillez appeler le 00 974 4022 6000.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/qatar.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1458, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'qatar-airways'),
(1462, 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qatar Airways è la compagnia aerea di bandiera dello stato del Qatar. La compagnia aerea gestisce un hub e una rete radio che collega oltre 150 destinazioni internazionali in Africa, Asia centrale, Europa, Estremo Oriente, Asia meridionale, Medio Oriente, Nord America, Sud America e Oceania.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Questa compagnia aerea ha una flotta di oltre 200 aerei. Il gruppo Qatar Airways impiega oltre 43.000 persone. La compagnia aerea è membro dell&#039;alleanza Oneworld dall&#039;ottobre 2013, la prima compagnia aerea del Golfo a firmare con una delle tre alleanze aeree.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il sistema di intrattenimento di bordo di Qatar Airways si chiama Oryx One. Ad eccezione di alcuni aeromobili della famiglia Airbus A320, tutti gli aeromobili dispongono di schermi di informazioni personali sul sedile posteriore. Alcuni aeromobili della famiglia Airbus A320 sono dotati di uno schermo di intrattenimento principale. Il Qatar sta aggiornando l&#039;aereo della famiglia Airbus A320 per AVOD sullo schienale. Qatar Airways offre anche la connettività di bordo Wi-Fi, che consente ai passeggeri di inviare SMS e MMS, accedere a e-mail e navigare in Internet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per assistenza con la prenotazione, le tariffe, l&#039;e-ticketing, gli orari di arrivo e di partenza, i bagagli smarriti o danneggiati, l&#039;assistenza per la prenotazione online e le domande generali, chiamare il numero 00 974 4022 6000.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/qatar.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1458, 'it', '', 'one col', 'qatar-airways'),
(1463, 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air France, is the French flag carrier headquartered in Tremblay-en-France. It is a subsidiary of the Air France–KLM Group and a founding member of the SkyTeam Global Airline Alliance. Serves 36 destinations in France and operates worldwide passenger and cargo services to 168 destinations in 78 countries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air France offers Audio Video on Demand (AVOD) in all cabins on all long haul aircraft. The in flight entertainment system features multiple channels of video, audio, music, and games. Air France Magazine, the airline&#039;s in-flight publication, is included at each seat, and Air France Madame, a fashion luxury magazine with a feminine perspective, is included in La Première and Business cabins and lounges.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Flying Blue, the frequent flyer program of Air France-KLM, awards members points based on miles travelled and class of service. Membership into the program is free. The program is divided into standard (Explorer), Elite (Silver) and Elite Plus (Gold and Platinum) statuses.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 00 33 9 69 39 36 54.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Air-France.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1463, 'en', '', 'one col', 'air-france'),
(1464, 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air France, is the French flag carrier headquartered in Tremblay-en-France. It is a subsidiary of the Air France–KLM Group and a founding member of the SkyTeam Global Airline Alliance. Serves 36 destinations in France and operates worldwide passenger and cargo services to 168 destinations in 78 countries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air France offers Audio Video on Demand (AVOD) in all cabins on all long haul aircraft. The in flight entertainment system features multiple channels of video, audio, music, and games. Air France Magazine, the airline&#039;s in-flight publication, is included at each seat, and Air France Madame, a fashion luxury magazine with a feminine perspective, is included in La Première and Business cabins and lounges.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Flying Blue, the frequent flyer program of Air France-KLM, awards members points based on miles travelled and class of service. Membership into the program is free. The program is divided into standard (Explorer), Elite (Silver) and Elite Plus (Gold and Platinum) statuses.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 00 33 9 69 39 36 54.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Air-France.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1463, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'air-france'),
(1465, 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air France, es la aerolínea de bandera francesa con sede en Tremblay-en-France. Es una subsidiaria de Air France – KLM Group y miembro fundador de SkyTeam Global Airline Alliance. Sirve a 36 destinos en Francia y opera servicios de pasajeros y carga en todo el mundo a 168 destinos en 78 países.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air France ofrece Audio Video on Demand (AVOD) en todas las cabinas de todos los aviones de larga distancia. El sistema de entretenimiento en vuelo presenta múltiples canales de video, audio, música y juegos. Air France Magazine, la publicación en vuelo de la aerolínea, se incluye en cada asiento, y Air France Madame, una revista de moda de lujo con una perspectiva femenina, se incluye en las cabinas y salones La Première y Business.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Flying Blue, el programa de viajero frecuente de Air France-KLM, otorga a los miembros puntos basados en millas recorridas y clase de servicio. La membresía en el programa es gratuita. El programa se divide en estados estándar (Explorer), Elite (Silver) y Elite Plus (Gold y Platinum).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para asistencia con su reserva, tarifas, boletos electrónicos, horarios de llegada y salida, equipaje perdido o dañado, soporte de reserva en línea y consultas generales, llame al 00 33 9 69 39 36 54.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Air-France.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1463, 'es', '', 'one col', 'air-france');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1466, 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air France, est la compagnie aérienne française basée à Tremblay-en-France. Il est une filiale du groupe Air France - KLM et un membre fondateur de SkyTeam Global Airline Alliance. Elle dessert 36 destinations en France et exploite des services de transport de passagers et de fret dans le monde entier vers 168 destinations dans 78 pays.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air France propose de l’audiovisuel sur demande (AVOD) dans toutes les cabines de tous les avions long-courriers. Le système de divertissement en vol comprend plusieurs canaux de vidéo, d’audio, de musique et de jeux. Air France Magazine, la publication en vol de la compagnie aérienne, est inclus dans chaque siège, et Air France Madame, un magazine de mode de luxe avec une perspective féminine, est inclus dans les stands et salons La Première et Business.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Flying Blue, le programme de fidélisation d&#039;Air France-KLM, attribue des points à ses membres en fonction du kilométrage parcouru et de la classe de service. L&#039;adhésion au programme est gratuite. Le programme est divisé en états standard (Explorer), Elite (Argent) et Elite Plus (Or et Platine).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour obtenir de l&#039;aide pour votre réservation, les tarifs, la billetterie électronique, les heures d&#039;arrivée et de départ, les bagages perdus ou endommagés, l&#039;aide à la réservation en ligne et les demandes de renseignements généraux, veuillez appeler le 00 33 9 69 39 36 54.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Air-France.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1463, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'air-france'),
(1467, 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air France, è la compagnia aerea di bandiera francese con sede a Tremblay-en-France. È una consociata di Air France - KLM Group e membro fondatore di SkyTeam Global Airline Alliance. Serve 36 destinazioni in Francia e gestisce servizi passeggeri e merci in tutto il mondo per 168 destinazioni in 78 paesi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Air France offre Audio Video on Demand (AVOD) in tutte le cabine di tutti gli aeromobili a lunga distanza. Il sistema di intrattenimento di volo offre più canali di video, audio, musica e giochi. Air France Magazine, la pubblicazione a bordo della compagnia aerea, è inclusa in ogni posto, e Air France Madame, una rivista di moda di lusso con una prospettiva femminile, è inclusa negli stand e nelle sale La Première e Business.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Flying Blue, il programma frequent flyer di Air France-KLM, fornisce ai membri punti in base alle miglia percorse e alla classe di servizio. L&#039;iscrizione al programma è gratuita. Il programma è suddiviso in stati standard (Explorer), Elite (Argento) ed Elite Plus (Oro e Platino).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per assistenza con la prenotazione, le tariffe, l&#039;e-ticketing, gli orari di arrivo e di partenza, i bagagli smarriti o danneggiati, l&#039;assistenza per la prenotazione online e le domande generali, chiamare il numero 00 33 9 69 39 36 54.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Air-France.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1463, 'it', '', 'one col', 'air-france'),
(1468, 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Emirates airline is based in Garhoud, Dubai, United Arab Emirates. The airline is a subsidiary of The Emirates Group. It is the largest airline in the Middle East, operating over 3,600 flights per week from its hub at Dubai Airport, to more than 150 cities in 80 countries across six continents.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The airline claims to have lower emissions than other airlines due to its fleet which has an average fuel burn of less than four litres for every 100 passenger kilometers it flies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Catering on Emirates flights from Dubai International is provided by Emirates Flight Catering which operates one of the largest airline catering facilities in the world. All the airplanes feature a personal in-flight entertainment (IFE) system on Emirates aircraft. There are two types of entertainment system on Emirates: ICE and ICE Digital Widescreen.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call +962 6 461 5222.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/tr25-July-Emirates.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1468, 'en', '', 'one col', 'emirates'),
(1469, 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Emirates airline is based in Garhoud, Dubai, United Arab Emirates. The airline is a subsidiary of The Emirates Group. It is the largest airline in the Middle East, operating over 3,600 flights per week from its hub at Dubai Airport, to more than 150 cities in 80 countries across six continents.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The airline claims to have lower emissions than other airlines due to its fleet which has an average fuel burn of less than four litres for every 100 passenger kilometers it flies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Catering on Emirates flights from Dubai International is provided by Emirates Flight Catering which operates one of the largest airline catering facilities in the world. All the airplanes feature a personal in-flight entertainment (IFE) system on Emirates aircraft. There are two types of entertainment system on Emirates: ICE and ICE Digital Widescreen.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call +962 6 461 5222.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/tr25-July-Emirates.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1468, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'emirates'),
(1470, 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La aerolínea Emirates tiene su sede en Garhoud, Dubai, Emiratos Árabes Unidos. La aerolínea es una subsidiaria de The Emirates Group. Es la aerolínea más grande de Medio Oriente, opera más de 3,600 vuelos por semana desde su centro de operaciones en el aeropuerto de Dubai, a más de 150 ciudades en 80 países en seis continentes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La aerolínea afirma tener emisiones más bajas que otras aerolíneas debido a su flota que tiene un consumo promedio de combustible de menos de cuatro litros por cada 100 kilómetros de pasajeros que vuela.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El servicio de catering en vuelos de Emirates desde el aeropuerto internacional de Dubái es provisto por Emirates Flight Catering, que opera una de las mayores instalaciones de catering de aerolíneas del mundo. Todos los aviones cuentan con un sistema de entretenimiento personal en vuelo (IFE) en los aviones de Emirates. Hay dos tipos de sistema de entretenimiento en Emirates: ICE e ICE Digital Widescreen.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para asistencia con su reserva, tarifas, boletos electrónicos, horarios de llegada y salida, equipaje perdido o dañado, soporte de reserva en línea y consultas generales, llame al +962 6 461 5222.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/tr25-July-Emirates.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1468, 'es', '', 'one col', 'emirates'),
(1471, 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La compagnie aérienne Emirates est basée à Garhoud, Dubaï, Émirats arabes unis. La compagnie aérienne est une filiale du groupe Emirates. C&#039;est la plus grande compagnie aérienne du Moyen-Orient. Elle exploite plus de 3 600 vols par semaine depuis son centre d&#039;opérations situé à l&#039;aéroport de Dubaï et dessert plus de 150 villes de 80 pays répartis sur six continents.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La compagnie aérienne prétend avoir moins d&#039;émissions que d&#039;autres compagnies aériennes en raison de la consommation moyenne de son parc de carburant, inférieure à quatre litres par 100 kilomètres de passagers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le service de restauration aérienne Emirates depuis l&#039;aéroport international de Dubaï est fourni par Emirates Flight Catering, qui exploite l&#039;une des plus grandes installations de restauration aérienne au monde. Tous les avions sont équipés d’un système de divertissement de vol personnel (IFE) sur les avions Emirates. Il existe deux types de systèmes de divertissement dans Emirates: ICE et ICE Digital Widescreen.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour obtenir de l&#039;aide pour votre réservation, les tarifs, la billetterie électronique, les heures d&#039;arrivée et de départ, les bagages perdus ou endommagés, l&#039;aide à la réservation en ligne et les demandes de renseignements généraux, veuillez appeler le +962 6 461 5222.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/tr25-July-Emirates.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1468, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'emirates'),
(1472, 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La compagnia aerea Emirates ha sede a Garhoud, Dubai, Emirati Arabi Uniti. La compagnia aerea è una filiale del gruppo Emirates. È la più grande compagnia aerea del Medio Oriente, con oltre 3.600 voli settimanali dal suo centro operativo all&#039;aeroporto di Dubai, verso oltre 150 città in 80 paesi in sei continenti.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La compagnia aerea afferma di avere emissioni inferiori rispetto ad altre compagnie aeree a causa della sua flotta che ha un consumo medio di carburante inferiore a quattro litri per 100 chilometri di passeggeri in volo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il servizio di catering per voli Emirates dall&#039;aeroporto internazionale di Dubai è fornito da Emirates Flight Catering, che gestisce una delle più grandi strutture di catering per compagnie aeree al mondo. Tutti gli aeromobili hanno un sistema di intrattenimento di volo personale (IFE) sugli aerei Emirates. Esistono due tipi di sistemi di intrattenimento in Emirates: ICE e ICE Digital Widescreen.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per assistenza con la prenotazione, le tariffe, l&#039;e-ticketing, gli orari di arrivo e di partenza, i bagagli smarriti o danneggiati, l&#039;assistenza per la prenotazione online e le domande generali, chiamare il numero +962 6 461 5222.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/tr25-July-Emirates.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1468, 'it', '', 'one col', 'emirates'),
(1473, 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pegasus Airlines is a Turkish low-cost airline headquartered in the Kurtköy area of Pendik, Istanbul with bases at several Turkish airports. This airline operates a one-class interior configuration on all of their aircraft.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A &quot;Flying Cafe&quot; is available to all passengers whereby food and beverages are provided for an additional charge. Pegasus is also considering installing In-Flight-Entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pegasus Airlines has been named ‘National Winner’ in the 2019 European Business Awards, one of the World’s largest and most prestigious business competitions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 00 90 850 250 6777.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Pegasus_Airlines.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1473, 'en', '', 'one col', 'pegasus-airlines'),
(1474, 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pegasus Airlines is a Turkish low-cost airline headquartered in the Kurtköy area of Pendik, Istanbul with bases at several Turkish airports. This airline operates a one-class interior configuration on all of their aircraft.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A &quot;Flying Cafe&quot; is available to all passengers whereby food and beverages are provided for an additional charge. Pegasus is also considering installing In-Flight-Entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pegasus Airlines has been named ‘National Winner’ in the 2019 European Business Awards, one of the World’s largest and most prestigious business competitions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 00 90 850 250 6777.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Pegasus_Airlines.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1473, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'pegasus-airlines'),
(1475, 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pegasus Airlines es una aerolínea turca de bajo costo con sede en el área de Kurtköy de Pendik, Estambul, con bases en varios aeropuertos turcos. Esta aerolínea opera una configuración interior de una clase en todos sus aviones.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un &quot;Flying Cafe&quot; está disponible para todos los pasajeros mediante el cual se proporcionan alimentos y bebidas por un cargo adicional. Pegasus también está considerando instalar In-Flight-Entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pegasus Airlines ha sido nombrada &quot;Ganador nacional&quot; en los European Business Awards de 2019, una de las competencias comerciales más grandes y prestigiosas del mundo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para asistencia con su reserva, tarifas, boletos electrónicos, horarios de llegada y salida, equipaje perdido o dañado, soporte de reserva en línea y consultas generales, llame al 00 90 850 250 6777.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Pegasus_Airlines.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1473, 'es', '', 'one col', 'pegasus-airlines'),
(1476, 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pegasus Airlines est une compagnie aérienne turque à bas prix basée dans la région de Kurtköy à Pendik, Istanbul, basée dans plusieurs aéroports turcs. Cette compagnie aérienne exploite une configuration intérieure de classe sur tous ses avions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un «café volant» est à la disposition de tous les passagers. Des aliments et des boissons sont fournis moyennant des frais supplémentaires. Pegasus envisage également d&#039;installer In-Flight-Entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pegasus Airlines a été nommée &quot;Gagnant national&quot; aux European Business Awards 2019, l&#039;une des compétitions commerciales les plus importantes et les plus prestigieuses au monde.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour obtenir de l&#039;aide pour votre réservation, les tarifs, la billetterie électronique, les heures d&#039;arrivée et de départ, les bagages perdus ou endommagés, l&#039;aide à la réservation en ligne et les demandes de renseignements généraux, veuillez appeler le 00 90 850 250 6777.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Pegasus_Airlines.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1473, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'pegasus-airlines'),
(1477, 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', 'Pegasus Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pegasus Airlines è una compagnia aerea turca a basso costo con sede nella zona Kurtköy di Pendik, Istanbul, con basi in diversi aeroporti turchi. Questa compagnia aerea opera una configurazione interna di una classe su tutti i suoi aeromobili.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Un &quot;Flying Cafe&quot; è disponibile per tutti i passeggeri attraverso i quali vengono forniti cibo e bevande a un costo aggiuntivo. Pegasus sta inoltre valutando di installare In-Flight-Entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pegasus Airlines è stata nominata &quot;National Winner&quot; agli European Business Awards 2019, una delle più grandi e prestigiose competizioni commerciali al mondo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per assistenza con la prenotazione, le tariffe, l&#039;e-ticketing, gli orari di arrivo e di partenza, i bagagli smarriti o danneggiati, l&#039;assistenza per la prenotazione online e le domande generali, chiamare il numero 00 90 850 250 6777.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Pegasus_Airlines.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1473, 'it', '', 'one col', 'pegasus-airlines'),
(1478, 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Royal Air Maroc, more commonly known as RAM, is the Moroccan national carrier,as well as the country&#039;s largest airline. RAM is fully owned by the government of Morocco, and has its headquarters on the grounds of Casablanca-Anfa Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The carrier operates a domestic network in Morocco, scheduled international flights to Africa, Asia, Europe, and North and South America, and occasional charter flights that include Hajj services.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Magic Universe is an on-board service for children from 0-12 years. For the delight of all ages, Royal Air Maroc has thought of everything to keep your children happy. Toys and games will help your children relax during the flight.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 00 212 5224-89797.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/royalmaroc.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1478, 'en', '', 'one col', 'royal-air-maroc'),
(1479, 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Royal Air Maroc, more commonly known as RAM, is the Moroccan national carrier,as well as the country&#039;s largest airline. RAM is fully owned by the government of Morocco, and has its headquarters on the grounds of Casablanca-Anfa Airport.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The carrier operates a domestic network in Morocco, scheduled international flights to Africa, Asia, Europe, and North and South America, and occasional charter flights that include Hajj services.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Magic Universe is an on-board service for children from 0-12 years. For the delight of all ages, Royal Air Maroc has thought of everything to keep your children happy. Toys and games will help your children relax during the flight.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call 00 212 5224-89797.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/royalmaroc.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1478, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'royal-air-maroc'),
(1480, 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Royal Air Maroc, más comúnmente conocido como RAM, es la aerolínea nacional marroquí, así como la aerolínea más grande del país. RAM es propiedad del gobierno de Marruecos y tiene su sede en los terrenos del aeropuerto de Casablanca-Anfa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La aerolínea opera una red nacional en Marruecos, vuelos internacionales regulares a África, Asia, Europa y América del Norte y del Sur, y vuelos charter ocasionales que incluyen servicios de Hajj.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Magic Universe es un servicio a bordo para niños de 0 a 12 años. Para el deleite de todas las edades, Royal Air Maroc ha pensado en todo para mantener felices a sus hijos. Los juguetes y juegos ayudarán a sus hijos a relajarse durante el vuelo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para asistencia con su reserva, tarifas, boletos electrónicos, horarios de llegada y salida, equipaje perdido o dañado, soporte de reserva en línea y consultas generales, llame al 00 212 5224-89797.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/royalmaroc.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1478, 'es', '', 'one col', 'royal-air-maroc'),
(1481, 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Royal Air Maroc, plus communément appelée RAM, est la compagnie aérienne nationale marocaine, ainsi que la plus grande compagnie aérienne du pays. RAM appartient au gouvernement marocain et est basé sur le terrain de l&#039;aéroport de Casablanca-Anfa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La compagnie aérienne exploite un réseau national au Maroc, des vols internationaux réguliers vers l’Afrique, l’Asie, l’Europe, l’Amérique du Nord et du Sud et des vols charters occasionnels incluant des services Hajj.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Magic Universe est un service à bord pour les enfants de 0 à 12 ans. Pour le plus grand bonheur des petits et des grands, Royal Air Maroc a pensé à tout pour que leurs enfants soient heureux. Les jouets et les jeux aideront vos enfants à se détendre pendant le vol.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour obtenir de l&#039;aide pour votre réservation, les tarifs, la billetterie électronique, les heures d&#039;arrivée et de départ, les bagages perdus ou endommagés, l&#039;aide à la réservation en ligne et les demandes de renseignements généraux, veuillez appeler le 00 212 5224-89797.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/royalmaroc.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1478, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'royal-air-maroc'),
(1482, 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Royal Air Maroc, più comunemente conosciuta come RAM, è la compagnia aerea nazionale marocchina, nonché la più grande compagnia aerea del paese. La RAM è di proprietà del governo marocchino e ha sede nell&#039;area aeroportuale di Casablanca-Anfa.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La compagnia aerea gestisce una rete nazionale in Marocco, voli internazionali regolari verso Africa, Asia, Europa e Nord e Sud America e voli charter occasionali che includono servizi Hajj.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Magic Universe è un servizio a bordo per bambini da 0 a 12 anni. Per la gioia di tutte le età, Royal Air Maroc ha pensato a tutto per rendere felici i propri figli. Giocattoli e giochi aiuteranno i tuoi bambini a rilassarsi durante il volo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per assistenza con la prenotazione, le tariffe, l&#039;e-ticketing, gli orari di arrivo e di partenza, i bagagli smarriti o danneggiati, l&#039;assistenza per la prenotazione online e le domande generali, chiamare il numero 00 212 5224-89797.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/royalmaroc.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1478, 'it', '', 'one col', 'royal-air-maroc'),
(1483, 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ryanair is an Irish budget airline founded in 1984, headquartered in Swords, Dublin, Ireland, with its primary operational bases at Dublin and London Stansted airports. It forms the largest part of the Ryanair Holdings family of airlines, and has Ryanair UK, Ryanair Sun, Malta Air and Lauda as sister airlines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The airline has been characterised by its rapid expansion, a result of the deregulation of the aviation industry in Europe in 1997 and the success of its low-cost business model. Ryanair&#039;s route network serves 38 countries in Europe, North Africa (Morocco), and the Middle East (Israel, Lebanon and Jordan).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ryanair&#039;s largest competitor is EasyJet which has a far greater focus on larger or primary airports such as Amsterdam and Paris-Charles de Gaulle, heavily targeting business passengers. Ryanair also serves sun and beach destinations with bases in the Canary Islands, Cyprus, the Greek Islands and Malta amongst others.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call + 44 871 500 5050.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/ryanair.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1483, 'en', '', 'one col', 'ryanair'),
(1484, 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ryanair is an Irish budget airline founded in 1984, headquartered in Swords, Dublin, Ireland, with its primary operational bases at Dublin and London Stansted airports. It forms the largest part of the Ryanair Holdings family of airlines, and has Ryanair UK, Ryanair Sun, Malta Air and Lauda as sister airlines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The airline has been characterised by its rapid expansion, a result of the deregulation of the aviation industry in Europe in 1997 and the success of its low-cost business model. Ryanair&#039;s route network serves 38 countries in Europe, North Africa (Morocco), and the Middle East (Israel, Lebanon and Jordan).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ryanair&#039;s largest competitor is EasyJet which has a far greater focus on larger or primary airports such as Amsterdam and Paris-Charles de Gaulle, heavily targeting business passengers. Ryanair also serves sun and beach destinations with bases in the Canary Islands, Cyprus, the Greek Islands and Malta amongst others.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;For assistance with your reservation, fares, e-ticketing, arrival and departure times, lost or damaged luggage, online booking support and general enquiries please call + 44 871 500 5050.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/ryanair.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1483, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'ryanair'),
(1485, 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ryanair es una aerolínea de bajo presupuesto irlandesa fundada en 1984, con sede en Swords, Dublín, Irlanda, con sus bases operativas principales en los aeropuertos de Dublín y Londres Stansted. Forma la mayor parte de la familia de aerolíneas Ryanair Holdings, y tiene Ryanair UK, Ryanair Sun, Malta Air y Lauda como aerolíneas hermanas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La aerolínea se ha caracterizado por su rápida expansión, resultado de la desregulación de la industria de la aviación en Europa en 1997 y el éxito de su modelo comercial de bajo costo. La red de rutas de Ryanair sirve a 38 países en Europa, África del Norte (Marruecos) y Medio Oriente (Israel, Líbano y Jordania).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El mayor competidor de Ryanair es EasyJet, que tiene un enfoque mucho mayor en aeropuertos más grandes o primarios como Amsterdam y París-Charles de Gaulle, que apuntan en gran medida a los pasajeros de negocios. Ryanair también sirve destinos de sol y playa con bases en las Islas Canarias, Chipre, las Islas Griegas y Malta, entre otros.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Para asistencia con su reserva, tarifas, boletos electrónicos, horarios de llegada y salida, equipaje perdido o dañado, soporte de reserva en línea y consultas generales, llame al + 44 871 500 5050.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/ryanair.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1483, 'es', '', 'one col', 'ryanair'),
(1486, 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ryanair est une compagnie aérienne irlandaise à petit budget créée en 1984 et basée à Swords, Dublin, Irlande, avec ses principales bases opérationnelles aux aéroports de Dublin et de Londres Stansted. Elle constitue la majorité des compagnies aériennes Ryanair Holdings et compte Ryanair UK, Ryanair Sun, Malta Air et Lauda comme compagnies soeurs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La compagnie aérienne s&#039;est caractérisée par son expansion rapide, résultat de la déréglementation de l&#039;industrie aéronautique en Europe en 1997 et du succès de son modèle économique à faibles coûts. Le réseau de vols Ryanair dessert 38 pays d’Europe, d’Afrique du Nord (Maroc) et du Moyen-Orient (Israël, Liban et Jordanie).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le principal concurrent de Ryanair est EasyJet, qui se concentre beaucoup plus sur les grands aéroports ou les principaux aéroports tels qu&#039;Amsterdam et Paris-Charles de Gaulle, qui ciblent principalement les voyageurs d&#039;affaires. Ryanair propose également des destinations soleil et plage avec des bases aux îles Canaries, à Chypre, aux îles grecques et à Malte, entre autres.    &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Pour obtenir de l&#039;aide pour votre réservation, les tarifs, la billetterie électronique, les heures d&#039;arrivée et de départ, les bagages perdus ou endommagés, l&#039;aide à la réservation en ligne et les demandes de renseignements généraux, veuillez appeler le + 44 871 500 5050.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/ryanair.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1483, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'ryanair'),
(1487, 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ryanair è una compagnia aerea irlandese a basso budget fondata nel 1984, con sede a Swords, Dublino, Irlanda, con le sue principali basi operative negli aeroporti di Dublino e Londra Stansted. Costituisce la maggior parte della famiglia di compagnie aeree Ryanair Holdings e ha Ryanair UK, Ryanair Sun, Malta Air e Lauda come compagnie aeree gemelle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La compagnia aerea è stata caratterizzata dalla sua rapida espansione, il risultato della deregolamentazione dell&#039;industria aeronautica in Europa nel 1997 e il successo del suo modello di business a basso costo. La rete di rotte Ryanair serve 38 paesi in Europa, Nord Africa (Marocco) e Medio Oriente (Israele, Libano e Giordania).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il principale concorrente di Ryanair è EasyJet, che si concentra molto di più su aeroporti più grandi o primari come Amsterdam e Parigi-Charles de Gaulle, che si rivolgono in gran parte a passeggeri d&#039;affari. Ryanair serve anche destinazioni di sole e spiagge con basi nelle Isole Canarie, Cipro, Isole greche e Malta, tra gli altri. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Per assistenza con la prenotazione, le tariffe, l&#039;e-ticketing, gli orari di arrivo e di partenza, i bagagli smarriti o danneggiati, l&#039;assistenza per la prenotazione online e le domande generali, chiamare il numero + 44 871 500 5050.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/ryanair.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1483, 'it', '', 'one col', 'ryanair');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1488, 'Historical Sites in Jordan', 'Historical Sites in Jordan', 'Historical Sites in Jordan', 'Historial Sites in Jordan', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Desert Castles/Qasr_Kharana_in_Jordan.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Desert castles&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Desert Castles&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Stretching East of Amman, the parched desert plain rolls on to Iraq and Saudi Arabia. This is a place where endless sand and barren basalt landscapes give...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/desert-castles/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Ajlun/ajloun-castle-ajloun-4.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ajlun&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Ajloun&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Travelling north of Jordan, Ajloun and its Castle, definitely worth a visit. The hills and green spaces are unparalleled. The road to Ajloun, located 25 kilomet...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/ajloun/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Petra/Little Petra22.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Little Petra&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Little Petra&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Little Petra is also known in Arabic as Siq al-Barid &quot;the cold canyon&quot;. Like Petra, it is a Nabataean site, with buildings carved into the walls of the sandstone...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/little-petra/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Petra/khazna4.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Petra&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Petra &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Undoubtedly the most famous attraction in Jordan is the Nabatean city of Petra, nestled away in the mountains south of the Dead Sea. Petra, which means &quot;...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/petra/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Amra.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Qasr Amra&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Qasr Amra&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Q