a ubicación de las películas ambientadas en el planeta..&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/wadi-rum/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/800px-Ma&#039;in_Hot_Springs2.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Aguas Termales de Ma&#039;in&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Aguas Termales de Ma&#039;in&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Las aguas termales Ma&#039;in se encuentran a 58 km al sur de Ammán, en la Gubernatura de Madaba, y a 27 km de Madaba. Está a 120 metros bajo el nivel del mar...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/aguas-termales-de-main/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/al-rainbow-st.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Calle Rainbow&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;   Calle Rainbow&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La calle Rainbow, originalmente llamada Abu Bakr al Siddiq Street, es un espacio público en el área histórica de Jabal Amman, cerca del centro de Amman...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;es/calle-rainbow/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Leer Mas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1498, 'es', '', 'one col', 'aventura-y-relajacion-en-jordania'),
