(1505, 'Convertitore di Valuta', 'Convertitore di Valuta', 'Convertitore di Valuta', 'Convertitore di Valuta', '&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;                                            Il Dinaro Giordano è la valuta della Giordania. Il codice valuta è JOD. Di seguito troverai un convertitore di valuta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;width: 474px; background-color: #fff; border: 2px solid #888; text-align: center; padding: 0px; margin: 0px auto;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 3px 0px 2px 0px; text-align: center; background-color: #ccc; border: 1px solid #888; width: 472;&quot;&gt;&lt;a title=&quot;Currency Converter&quot; class=&quot;HSlabel&quot; style=&quot;text-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://fx-rate.net/calculator/&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Convertitore di Valuta&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot; src=&quot;https://fx-rate.net/converter.php?size=short&amp;amp;layout=horizontal&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/currencies.jpg&quot; width=&quot;900&quot; height=&quot;239&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1503, 'it', '', 'one col', 'convertitore-di-valuta'),
(1506, 'Convertidor de Divisas', 'Convertidor de Divisas', 'Convertidor de Divisas', 'Convertidor de Divisas', '&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;                                      El Dinar Jordano es la moneda de Jordania. El código de la moneda es JOD. A continuación, encontrará un convertidor de divisas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;width: 474px; background-color: #fff; border: 2px solid #888; text-align: center; padding: 0px; margin: 0px auto;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 3px 0px 2px 0px; text-align: center; background-color: #ccc; border: 1px solid #888; width: 472;&quot;&gt;&lt;a title=&quot;Currency Converter&quot; class=&quot;HSlabel&quot; style=&quot;text-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://fx-rate.net/calculator/&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Convertidor de Divisas&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot; src=&quot;https://fx-rate.net/converter.php?size=short&amp;amp;layout=horizontal&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/currencies.jpg&quot; width=&quot;900&quot; height=&quot;239&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1503, 'es', '', 'one col', 'convertidor-de-divisas'),
(1507, 'Currency Converter', 'Currency Converter', 'Currency Converter', 'Currency Converter', '&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Jordanian Dinar is the currency of Jordan. The currency code is JOD. Below, you will find a currency converter. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;width: 474px; background-color: #fff; border: 2px solid #888; text-align: center; padding: 0px; margin: 0px auto;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 3px 0px 2px 0px; text-align: center; background-color: #ccc; border: 1px solid #888; width: 472;&quot;&gt;&lt;a title=&quot;Currency Converter&quot; class=&quot;HSlabel&quot; style=&quot;text-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://fx-rate.net/calculator/&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Currency Converter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot; src=&quot;https://fx-rate.net/converter.php?size=short&amp;amp;layout=horizontal&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/currencies.jpg&quot; width=&quot;900&quot; height=&quot;239&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1503, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'currency-converter'),
(1508, 'Jordanian Dinar', 'Jordanian Dinar', 'Jordanian Dinar', 'Jordanian Dinar', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Jordanian Dinar, abbreviated as JD has been the currency of Jordan since 1950. The Jordanian dinar is also widely used alongside the Israeli shekel in the West Bank. The dinar is divided into 10 dirhams, 100 qirsh also called piastres or 1000 fulus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In 1949, banknotes were issued by the government in denominations of ​1⁄2, 1, 5, 10 and 50 dinars. From 1959, the Central Bank of Jordan took over note production. 20 dinar notes were introduced in 1977, followed by 50 dinars in 1999. ​1⁄2 dinar notes were replaced by coins in 1999.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The dinar is very strong, not due to a strong national economy or large scale of exports, but because it has been pegged to the American dollar for the last 20 years.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The dinar fixed in dollars served the Jordanian economy well. It achieved monetary stability, reinforced public confidence, attracted Arab and foreign investments, and has been is a successful policy by any measure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Before you travel we recommend you to check the &lt;a href=&quot;en/currency-converter/&quot;&gt;currency converter&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/jordanian-dinar.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1508, 'en', '', 'one col', 'jordanian-dinar'),
(1509, 'الدينار الأردني', 'الدينار الأردني', 'Jordanian Dinar', 'Jordanian Dinar', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-7 align-justify d-pad-r&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;الدينار الأردني&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;الدينار الأردني، ويختصر بـ JD، هو العملة الرسمية للأردن منذ عام 1950. ينقسم الدينار إلى 10 دراهم أو 100 قرش أو 1000 فلس.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;سعر صرف الدينار الأردني مرتبط بالدولار الأمريكي منذ عام 1995 بسعر ثابت تقريباً 1 دينار = 1.41 دولار أمريكي.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;تتوفر أجهزة الصراف الآلي في جميع أنحاء البلاد، ويُقبل على نطاق واسع استخدام بطاقات الائتمان في الفنادق والمطاعم الكبرى ومراكز التسوق.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;يمكن صرف العملات الأجنبية في البنوك ومكاتب الصرافة المنتشرة في المدن الرئيسية والمطارات.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Jordan/Jordan Info2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1508, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'jordanian-dinar'),
(1510, 'Dinar Jordano', 'Dinar Jordano', 'Dinar Jordano', 'Dinar Jordano', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Dinar Jordano, abreviado como JD, ha sido la moneda de Jordania desde 1950. El Dinar Jordano también se usa ampliamente junto con el shekel israelí en Cisjordania. El dinar se divide en 10 dirhams, 100 qirsh también llamados piastres o 1000 fulus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En 1949, el gobierno emitió billetes en denominaciones de 1, 5, 10 y 50 dinares. A partir de 1959, el Banco Central de Jordania se hizo cargo de la producción de billetes. Se introdujeron 20 billetes de dinares en 1977, seguidos de 50 dinares en 1999. 1⁄2 billetes de dinares fueron reemplazados por monedas en 1999.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El dinar es muy fuerte, no debido a una economía nacional fuerte o una gran escala de exportaciones, sino porque se ha vinculado al dólar estadounidense durante los últimos 20 años. El dinar fijado en dólares sirvió bien a la economía jordana. Logró estabilidad monetaria, reforzó la confianza pública, atrajo inversiones árabes y extranjeras, y ha sido una política exitosa por cualquier medida.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Antes de viajar, le recomendamos que consulte el &lt;a href=&quot;es/convertidor-de-divisas/&quot;&gt;convertidor de divisas&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/jordanian-dinar.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1508, 'es', '', 'one col', 'dinar-jordano'),
(1511, 'Dinar Jordanien', 'Dinar Jordanien', 'Dinar Jordanien', 'Dinar Jordanien', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Dinar Jordanien, en abrégé JD, est la devise de la Jordanie depuis 1950. Le Dinar Jordanien est également largement utilisé conjointement avec le shekel israélien en Cisjordanie. Le dinar est divisé en 10 dirhams, 100 qirsh également appelés piastres ou 1000 fulus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En 1949, le gouvernement a émis des billets d&#039;une valeur nominale de 1, 5, 10 et 50 dinars. En 1959, la Banque centrale de Jordanie a repris la production de billets de banque. Les bons de 20 dinars ont été introduits en 1977, suivis de 50 dinars en 1999. Les bons de un dinar sur deux ont été remplacés par des pièces de monnaie en 1999.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le dinar est très fort, non pas en raison d’une économie nationale forte ou d’un volume élevé d’exportations, mais parce qu’il est lié au dollar américain depuis 20 ans. Le dinar dollar a bien servi l’économie jordanienne. Il a atteint la stabilité monétaire, renforcé la confiance du public, attiré les investissements arabes et étrangers et a été une politique réussie à tous les égards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Avant de voyager, nous vous recommandons de vérifier le &lt;a href=&quot;fr/convertisseur-de-devises/&quot;&gt;convertisseur de devises&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/jordanian-dinar.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1508, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'dinar-jordanien'),
(1512, 'Dinaro Giordano', 'Dinaro Giordano', 'Dinaro Giordano', 'Dinaro Giordano', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Dinaro Giordano, abbreviato in JD, è stata la valuta della Giordania dal 1950. Il Dinaro Giordano è anche ampiamente usato in congiunzione con il siclo israeliano in Cisgiordania. Il dinaro è diviso in 10 dirham, 100 qirsh chiamati anche piastre o 1000 fulus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nel 1949, il governo emise banconote in tagli da 1, 5, 10 e 50 dinari. A partire dal 1959, la Banca centrale di Giordania ha assunto la produzione di banconote. Nel 1977 furono introdotte 20 fatture dinari, seguite da 50 dinari nel 1999. 1⁄2 fatture dinari furono sostituite da monete nel 1999.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il dinaro è molto forte, non a causa di una forte economia nazionale o di una grande scala di esportazioni, ma perché è stato collegato al dollaro USA negli ultimi 20 anni. Il dinaro in dollari ha servito bene l&#039;economia giordana. Ha raggiunto la stabilità monetaria, ha rafforzato la fiducia del pubblico, ha attratto investimenti arabi ed esteri ed è stata una politica di successo sotto ogni aspetto.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Prima di viaggiare, ti consigliamo di controllare il &lt;a href=&quot;it/convertitore-di-valuta/&quot;&gt;convertitore di valuta&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/jordanian-dinar.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1508, 'it', '', 'one col', 'dinaro-giordano'),
(1513, 'Company Profile', 'Company Profile', 'Company Profile', 'Company Profile', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;We are &lt;strong&gt;PV Travels&lt;/strong&gt; an Arab Tour Operator, the first truly Middle East travel service. Our leading tour and travel agency was established in Jordan in 2011, having extensive connections in all over the region. PV Travels is looking forward to the opportunity to work as your booking agent for your travel needs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Khaled Nawafleh is the Founder and Managing Director of PV Travels since 2011. He has a vast experience in the Tourism industry for more than 20 years. He was educated in Jordan, the United Kingdom and France. He is involved in the planning and marketing aspects of the business; also, engaged in the day to day management of the company, dealing with customer enquiries and aiming to meet their expectations. Mr. Khaled is fluent in Arabic, English and French.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our main goal is to act as your personal expert holiday designers with our experience in tailor made itineraries. We manage all aspects of your trip, from custom routes, accommodation to tour guides and activities. Our program categories cover all type of travelers, whether you are an eco trekker, spiritual-seeker, business professional or just looking for new adventures in this land of treasures the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan with our vast expertise we can cater to all your individual requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professionalism and Experience &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Due to our 8 years of experience organizing tours in Jordan and Oman, we take great pride in our tradition of tailored attention to our clients; because we care about our reputation for excellence, every of our guests are important to us, we focus our mind to details so you will never forget the experience of travelling with us.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More Value for Your Money &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Since 2011 PV Travels has been providing its clients with the best quality of services and competitive rates. As a local wholesale Jordanian tour company, we maintain favorable rates with Jordan hotels and service providers due to the volume of our business. These savings are passed on to all our clientele.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you have any inquiries please email us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@pvt.jo&quot;&gt;info@pvt.jo&lt;/a&gt; and we will be glad to assist you at any moment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3443.900791644019!2d35.470754314626895!3d30.325339612204143!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1501692d6e66afc9:0x422d1d1f4408faef!2sPv Travels!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573562504645!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1513, 'en', '', 'one col', 'company-profile'),
(1514, 'Company Profile', 'Company Profile', 'Company Profile', 'Company Profile', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;We are &lt;strong&gt;PV Travels&lt;/strong&gt; an Arab Tour Operator, the first truly Middle East travel service. Our leading tour and travel agency was established in Jordan in 2011, having extensive connections in all over the region. PV Travels is looking forward to the opportunity to work as your booking agent for your travel needs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Khaled Nawafleh is the Founder and Managing Director of PV Travels since 2011. He has a vast experience in the Tourism industry for more than 20 years. He was educated in Jordan, the United Kingdom and France. He is involved in the planning and marketing aspects of the business; also, engaged in the day to day management of the company, dealing with customer enquiries and aiming to meet their expectations. Mr. Khaled is fluent in Arabic, English and French.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Our main goal is to act as your personal expert holiday designers with our experience in tailor made itineraries. We manage all aspects of your trip, from custom routes, accommodation to tour guides and activities. Our program categories cover all type of travelers, whether you are an eco trekker, spiritual-seeker, business professional or just looking for new adventures in this land of treasures the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan with our vast expertise we can cater to all your individual requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professionalism and Experience &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Due to our 8 years of experience organizing tours in Jordan and Oman, we take great pride in our tradition of tailored attention to our clients; because we care about our reputation for excellence, every of our guests are important to us, we focus our mind to details so you will never forget the experience of travelling with us.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More Value for Your Money &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Since 2011 PV Travels has been providing its clients with the best quality of services and competitive rates. As a local wholesale Jordanian tour company, we maintain favorable rates with Jordan hotels and service providers due to the volume of our business. These savings are passed on to all our clientele.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;If you have any inquiries please email us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@pvt.jo&quot;&gt;info@pvt.jo&lt;/a&gt; and we will be glad to assist you at any moment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3443.900791644019!2d35.470754314626895!3d30.325339612204143!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1501692d6e66afc9:0x422d1d1f4408faef!2sPv Travels!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573562504645!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1513, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'company-profile'),
(1515, 'Perfil de la Compañía', 'Perfil de la Compañía', 'Perfil de la Compañía', 'Perfil de la Compañía', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Somos &lt;strong&gt;PV Travels&lt;/strong&gt;, un operador turístico árabe, el primer servicio de viajes verdaderamente de Oriente Medio. Nuestra agencia líder de viajes y turismo se estableció en Jordania en 2011, con amplias conexiones en toda la región. PV Travels espera la oportunidad de trabajar como su agente de reservas para sus necesidades de viaje.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director General&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Khaled Nawafleh es el Fundador y Director General de PV Travels desde 2011. Tiene una vasta experiencia en la industria del turismo por más de 20 años. Fue educado en Jordania, Reino Unido y Francia. Está involucrado en los aspectos de planificación y comercialización del negocio; Además, participa en la gestión diaria de la empresa, atendiendo las consultas de los clientes y buscando cumplir con sus expectativas. El Sr. Khaled habla Árabe, Inglés y Francés.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Misión&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nuestro principal objetivo es actuar como sus expertos diseñadores de vacaciones personales con nuestra experiencia en itinerarios a medida. Gestionamos todos los aspectos de su viaje, desde rutas personalizadas, alojamiento hasta guías turísticos y actividades. Nuestras categorías de programas cubren todo tipo de viajeros, ya sea un excursionista ecológico, un buscador espiritual, un profesional de negocios o simplemente está buscando nuevas aventuras en esta tierra de tesoros, el Reino Hachemita de Jordania, con nuestra amplia experiencia, podemos satisfacer todas sus necesidades individuales.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profesionalismo y Experiencia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Debido a nuestros 8 años de experiencia organizando tours en Jordania y Omán, nos enorgullecemos de nuestra tradición de atención personalizada a nuestros clientes; Debido a que nos importa nuestra reputación de excelencia, cada uno de nuestros huéspedes es importante para nosotros, enfocamos nuestra mente en los detalles para que nunca olvide la experiencia de viajar con nosotros.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Más Valor Por Su Dinero&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Desde 2011 PV Travels ha estado proporcionando a sus clientes la mejor calidad de servicios y tarifas competitivas. Como compañía local de turismo jordano mayorista, mantenemos tarifas favorables con los hoteles y proveedores de servicios de Jordan debido al volumen de nuestro negocio. Estos ahorros se pasan a toda nuestra clientela.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si tiene alguna consulta, envíenos un correo electrónico a &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@pvt.jo&quot;&gt;info@pvt.jo&lt;/a&gt; y estaremos encantados de ayudarle en cualquier momento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3443.900791644019!2d35.470754314626895!3d30.325339612204143!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1501692d6e66afc9:0x422d1d1f4408faef!2sPv Travels!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573562504645!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1513, 'es', '', 'one col', 'perfil-de-la-companía'),
(1516, 'Profil de l&#039;Entreprise', 'Profil de l&#039;Entreprise', 'Profil de l&#039;Entreprise', 'Profil de l&#039;Entreprise', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes &lt;strong&gt;PV Travels&lt;/strong&gt;, un voyagiste arabe, le premier service de voyage véritablement du Moyen-Orient. Notre agence de voyages et de tourisme de premier plan a été créée en Jordanie en 2011 et entretient de nombreuses relations dans toute la région. PV Travels attend l’occasion de travailler comme agent de réservation pour vos besoins de voyage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Directeur Général&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Khaled Nawafleh est le Fondateur et Directeur Général de PV Travels depuis 2011. Il possède une vaste expérience dans l&#039;industrie du tourisme depuis plus de 20 ans. Il a fait ses études en Jordanie, au Royaume-Uni et en France. Il est impliqué dans les aspects de planification et de commercialisation de l&#039;entreprise. En outre, il participe à la gestion quotidienne de l&#039;entreprise, répond aux demandes des clients et cherche à répondre à leurs attentes. M. Khaled parle l&#039;Arabe, l&#039;Anglais et le Français.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Notre objectif principal est d&#039;agir en tant que concepteur de vacances personnel avec notre expérience d&#039;itinéraires personnalisés. Nous gérons tous les aspects de votre voyage: itinéraires personnalisés, hébergement, guides touristiques et activités. Nos catégories de programmes couvrent tous les types de voyageurs, qu’il s’agisse d’un randonneur écologique, d’un chercheur spirituel, d’un homme d’affaires ou tout simplement à la recherche de nouvelles aventures dans ce pays de trésors, le Royaume hachémite de Jordanie. Notre vaste expérience nous permet de satisfaire tous les besoins. vos besoins individuels&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professionnalisme et Expérience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Grâce à nos 8 années d’expérience dans l’organisation de voyages en Jordanie et à Oman, nous sommes fiers de notre tradition de service à la clientèle personnalisé. Parce que nous attachons de l&#039;importance à notre réputation d&#039;excellence, chacun de nos clients est important pour nous, nous concentrons notre esprit sur les détails afin de ne jamais oublier l&#039;expérience de voyager avec nous.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plus De Valeur Pour Votre Argent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Depuis 2011, PV Travels fournit à ses clients la meilleure qualité de services et des tarifs compétitifs. En tant qu’entreprise de tourisme jordanienne locale, nous maintenons des tarifs avantageux auprès des hôtels et des fournisseurs de services en Jordanie en raison du volume de nos activités. Ces économies sont transmises à l&#039;ensemble de notre clientèle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si vous avez des questions, envoyez-nous un email à &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@pvt.jo&quot;&gt;info@pvt.jo&lt;/a&gt; et nous serons heureux de vous aider à tout moment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3443.900791644019!2d35.470754314626895!3d30.325339612204143!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1501692d6e66afc9:0x422d1d1f4408faef!2sPv Travels!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573562504645!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1513, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'profil-de-l-entreprise'),
(1517, 'Profilo Aziendale', 'Profilo Aziendale', 'Profilo Aziendale', 'Profilo Aziendale', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Siamo &lt;strong&gt;PV Travels&lt;/strong&gt;, un tour operator arabo, il primo vero servizio di viaggio in Medio Oriente. La nostra agenzia di viaggi e turismo leader è stata fondata in Giordania nel 2011, con numerosi collegamenti in tutta la regione. PV Travels attende l&#039;opportunità di lavorare come agente di prenotazione per le tue esigenze di viaggio.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direttore Generale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Khaled Nawafleh è Fondatore e Direttore Generale di PV Travels dal 2011. Ha una vasta esperienza nel settore turistico da oltre 20 anni. Ha studiato in Giordania, Regno Unito e Francia. È coinvolto negli aspetti di pianificazione e commercializzazione dell&#039;azienda; Inoltre, partecipa alla gestione quotidiana dell&#039;azienda, rispondendo alle richieste dei clienti e cercando di soddisfare le loro aspettative. Il signor Khaled parla arabo, inglese e francese.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missione&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il nostro obiettivo principale è quello di agire come esperti designer di vacanze personali con la nostra esperienza in itinerari personalizzati. Gestiamo tutti gli aspetti del tuo viaggio, da percorsi personalizzati, alloggi a guide e attività turistiche. Le nostre categorie di programmi coprono tutti i tipi di viaggiatori, che si tratti di un escursionista ecologico, un cercatore spirituale, un professionista o semplicemente alla ricerca di nuove avventure in questa terra di tesori, il Regno hascemita di Giordania, con la nostra vasta esperienza, possiamo soddisfare tutti le tue esigenze individuali&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professionalità ed Esperienza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Grazie alla nostra esperienza di 8 anni nell&#039;organizzazione di tour in Giordania e Oman, siamo orgogliosi della nostra tradizione di servizio clienti personalizzato; Poiché ci preoccupiamo della nostra reputazione di eccellenza, ognuno dei nostri ospiti è importante per noi, concentriamo la nostra mente sui dettagli in modo da non dimenticare mai l&#039;esperienza di viaggiare con noi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Più Valore Per i Tuoi Soldi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Dal 2011 PV Travels offre ai suoi clienti la migliore qualità di servizi e tariffe competitive. In quanto azienda turistica locale giordana all&#039;ingrosso, manteniamo tariffe vantaggiose con gli hotel e i fornitori di servizi Jordan a causa del volume della nostra attività. Questi risparmi sono passati a tutta la nostra clientela.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In caso di domande, inviaci una e-mail a &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@pvt.jo&quot;&gt;info@pvt.jo&lt;/a&gt; e saremo felici di aiutarti in qualsiasi momento.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3443.900791644019!2d35.470754314626895!3d30.325339612204143!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1501692d6e66afc9:0x422d1d1f4408faef!2sPv Travels!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573562504645!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1513, 'it', '', 'one col', 'profilo-aziendale'),
(1518, 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Umayyad Palace is a large palatial complex from the Umayyad period, located on the Citadel Hill of Amman, Jordan. Built during the first half of the 8th century, it is now largely ruined, with a restored domed entrance chamber, known as the &quot;kiosk&quot; or &quot;monumental gateway&quot;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Part of the palace was built over pre-existing Roman structures, and an entire colonnaded Roman street was incorporated into it. Built around 730, when Amman was a provincial capital, the complex probably combined the residential quarters of the governor of Amman with administrative offices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It was still in use during the Islamic Abbasid (750–969) and Fatimid (969–1179) periods, although much of the brand-new palace was never rebuilt following a devastating earthquake in 749.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-Umayyad_Palace020.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.2027734119165!2d35.93198841466825!3d31.955395232729813!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f968d005511:0x961d62514c3119b!2sUmayyad Monumental Gateway!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573569271136!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1518, 'en', '', 'one col', 'ummayyad-palace');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1519, 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The Umayyad Palace is a large palatial complex from the Umayyad period, located on the Citadel Hill of Amman, Jordan. Built during the first half of the 8th century, it is now largely ruined, with a restored domed entrance chamber, known as the &quot;kiosk&quot; or &quot;monumental gateway&quot;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Part of the palace was built over pre-existing Roman structures, and an entire colonnaded Roman street was incorporated into it. Built around 730, when Amman was a provincial capital, the complex probably combined the residential quarters of the governor of Amman with administrative offices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It was still in use during the Islamic Abbasid (750–969) and Fatimid (969–1179) periods, although much of the brand-new palace was never rebuilt following a devastating earthquake in 749.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-Umayyad_Palace020.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.2027734119165!2d35.93198841466825!3d31.955395232729813!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f968d005511:0x961d62514c3119b!2sUmayyad Monumental Gateway!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573569271136!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1518, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'ummayyad-palace'),
(1520, 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El Umayyad Palace es un gran complejo palaciego del período omeya, ubicado en la colina de la ciudadela de Amman, Jordania. Construido durante la primera mitad del siglo VIII, ahora está en gran parte en ruinas, con una cámara de entrada abovedada restaurada, conocida como el &quot;quiosco&quot; o &quot;puerta de entrada monumental&quot;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Parte del palacio fue construido sobre estructuras romanas preexistentes, y se incorporó una calle romana con columnas. Construido alrededor de 730, cuando Ammán era una capital provincial, el complejo probablemente combinaba los barrios residenciales del gobernador de Ammán con oficinas administrativas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Todavía estaba en uso durante los períodos Abbasí Islámico (750–969) y Fatimí (969–1179), aunque gran parte del nuevo palacio nunca fue reconstruido después de un devastador terremoto en 749.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-Umayyad_Palace020.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.2027734119165!2d35.93198841466825!3d31.955395232729813!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f968d005511:0x961d62514c3119b!2sUmayyad Monumental Gateway!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573569271136!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1518, 'es', '', 'one col', 'ummayyad-palace'),
(1521, 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le Umayyad Palace est un grand complexe palatial de la période des Omeyyades, situé sur la colline de la citadelle d&#039;Amman, en Jordanie. Construit au cours de la première moitié du 8ème siècle, il est maintenant en grande partie en ruine, avec une chambre d&#039;entrée voûtée restaurée, connue sous le nom de &quot;kiosque&quot; ou &quot;porte d&#039;entrée monumentale&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Une partie du palais a été construite sur des structures romaines préexistantes et une rue romaine avec des colonnes a été incorporée. Construit vers 730, à l&#039;époque où Amman était une capitale de province, le complexe combinait probablement les quartiers résidentiels du gouverneur d&#039;Amman avec des bureaux administratifs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il était encore utilisé pendant les périodes islamique abbasside (750–969) et Fatimí (969–1179), bien qu&#039;une grande partie du nouveau palais n&#039;ait jamais été reconstruite après le tremblement de terre dévastateur de 749.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-Umayyad_Palace020.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.2027734119165!2d35.93198841466825!3d31.955395232729813!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f968d005511:0x961d62514c3119b!2sUmayyad Monumental Gateway!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573569271136!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1518, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'ummayyad-palace'),
(1522, 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', 'Ummayyad Palace', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il Umayyad Palace è un grande complesso sontuoso del periodo omayyade, situato sulla collina della cittadella di Amman, in Giordania. Costruito nella prima metà dell&#039;VIII secolo, oggi è in gran parte in rovina, con una camera d&#039;ingresso a volta restaurata, nota come &quot;chiosco&quot; o &quot;porta d&#039;ingresso monumentale&quot;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Parte del palazzo fu costruita su strutture romane preesistenti e fu incorporata una strada romana con colonne. Costruito intorno al 730, quando Amman era un capoluogo di provincia, il complesso probabilmente combinava i quartieri residenziali del governatore di Amman con uffici amministrativi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Era ancora in uso durante i periodi islamico Abbasid (750-969) e Fatimí (969-1179), sebbene gran parte del nuovo palazzo non fu mai ricostruito dopo un devastante terremoto del 749.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-Umayyad_Palace020.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.2027734119165!2d35.93198841466825!3d31.955395232729813!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f968d005511:0x961d62514c3119b!2sUmayyad Monumental Gateway!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573569271136!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1518, 'it', '', 'one col', 'ummayyad-palace'),
(1523, 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The spacious plaza measures 90mx80m and is surrounded by a broad sidewalk and colonnade of 1st century AD Ionic columns located in Jerash. There are two alters in the middle, and a fountain was added in the 7th Century AD. This square structure now supports a central column, which was recently erected to carry the Jerash Festival Flame.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In addition to its standard function as a marketplace, a forum was a gathering place of great social significance, and often the scene of diverse activities, including political discussions and debates, rendezvous, meetings. In that case it supplemented the function of a conciliabulum or place of assembly.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Oval forum.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3373.274364476112!2d35.88860441467668!3d32.277600716589504!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c8049828c3329:0x3dc1d9cc8c83e18b!2sOval Plaza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573639165853!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1523, 'en', '', 'one col', 'oval-plaza'),
(1524, 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The spacious plaza measures 90mx80m and is surrounded by a broad sidewalk and colonnade of 1st century AD Ionic columns located in Jerash. There are two alters in the middle, and a fountain was added in the 7th Century AD. This square structure now supports a central column, which was recently erected to carry the Jerash Festival Flame.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In addition to its standard function as a marketplace, a forum was a gathering place of great social significance, and often the scene of diverse activities, including political discussions and debates, rendezvous, meetings. In that case it supplemented the function of a conciliabulum or place of assembly.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Oval forum.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3373.274364476112!2d35.88860441467668!3d32.277600716589504!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c8049828c3329:0x3dc1d9cc8c83e18b!2sOval Plaza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573639165853!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1523, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'oval-plaza'),
(1525, 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La espaciosa plaza mide 90mx80m y está rodeada por una amplia acera y columnata de columnas jónicas del siglo I dC ubicadas en Jerash. Hay dos alteraciones en el medio, y se agregó una fuente en el siglo VII DC. Esta estructura cuadrada ahora soporta una columna central, que se erigió recientemente para transportar la Llama del Festival de Jerash.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Además de su función estándar como mercado, un foro era un lugar de reunión de gran importancia social y, a menudo, escenario de diversas actividades, incluidas discusiones y debates políticos, encuentros y reuniones. En ese caso, complementaba la función de un conciliabulum o lugar de reunión.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Oval forum.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3373.274364476112!2d35.88860441467668!3d32.277600716589504!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c8049828c3329:0x3dc1d9cc8c83e18b!2sOval Plaza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573639165853!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1523, 'es', '', 'one col', 'oval-plaza'),
(1526, 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La grande place mesure 90mx80m et est entourée d&#039;un large trottoir et d&#039;une colonnade de colonnes ioniques du Ier siècle après JC situées à Jerash. Il y a deux modifications au milieu et une fontaine a été ajoutée au 7ème siècle après JC. Cette structure carrée supporte maintenant une colonne centrale, récemment construite pour transporter la flamme du festival de Jerash.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Outre son rôle standard en tant que marché, un forum était un lieu de rencontre d’une grande importance sociale et était souvent le théâtre de diverses activités, notamment des discussions et débats politiques, des réunions et des rencontres. Dans ce cas, il complétait la fonction de conciliabulum ou de lieu de réunion.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Oval forum.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3373.274364476112!2d35.88860441467668!3d32.277600716589504!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c8049828c3329:0x3dc1d9cc8c83e18b!2sOval Plaza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573639165853!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1523, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'oval-plaza'),
(1527, 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', 'Oval Plaza', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La spaziosa piazza misura 90mx80m ed è circondata da un ampio marciapiede e colonnato di colonne ioniche del I secolo d.C. situato a Jerash. Ci sono due alterazioni nel mezzo e una fontana fu aggiunta nel VII secolo d.C. Questa struttura quadrata ora supporta una colonna centrale, che è stata recentemente eretta per trasportare la Jerash Festival Flame.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Oltre al suo ruolo standard di mercato, un forum era un luogo di incontro di grande importanza sociale e spesso teatro di varie attività, tra cui discussioni e dibattiti politici, incontri e riunioni. In quel caso, ha integrato la funzione di un conciliabulum o luogo di incontro.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Oval forum.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3373.274364476112!2d35.88860441467668!3d32.277600716589504!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c8049828c3329:0x3dc1d9cc8c83e18b!2sOval Plaza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573639165853!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1523, 'it', '', 'one col', 'oval-plaza'),
(1528, 'King Hussein Bin Talal Mosque', 'King Hussein Bin Talal Mosque', 'King Hussein Bin Talal Mosque', 'King Hussein Bin Talal Mosque', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;King Hussein Bin Talal Mosque, better known as the King Hussein Mosque, is the largest mosque in Jordan. Not to be confused with the 1924 Grand Al-Husseini Mosque, also known as King Hussein Mosque, in Downtown Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; King Hussein Mosque was built in 2005 in the reign of King Abdullah II in West Amman, specifically in Al Hussein Public Parks at King Abdullah II Street near King Hussein Medical Center. The mosque is located at an altitude of 1,013 meters (3,323 ft) above sea level and can thus be seen from most parts of Amman. It is square and features four minarets and marble floors.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In 2012, King Abdullah opened the Museum of the Prophet Muhammad, which houses a number of relics associated with the Prophet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-King_Hussein_Mosque_(Amman)_at_night.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0842433839216!2d35.82072571454997!3d31.98573168121816!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca228d105489f:0x2228c0c01f0bf7fa!2sKing Hussein Mosque!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573644095546!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1528, 'en', '', 'one col', 'king-hussein-bin-talal-mosque'),
(1529, 'King Hussein Bin Talal Mosque', 'King Hussein Bin Talal Mosque', 'King Hussein Bin Talal Mosque', 'King Hussein Bin Talal Mosque', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;King Hussein Bin Talal Mosque, better known as the King Hussein Mosque, is the largest mosque in Jordan. Not to be confused with the 1924 Grand Al-Husseini Mosque, also known as King Hussein Mosque, in Downtown Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;King Hussein Mosque was built in 2005 in the reign of King Abdullah II in West Amman, specifically in Al Hussein Public Parks at King Abdullah II Street near King Hussein Medical Center. The mosque is located at an altitude of 1,013 meters (3,323 ft) above sea level and can thus be seen from most parts of Amman. It is square and features four minarets and marble floors.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;In 2012, King Abdullah opened the Museum of the Prophet Muhammad, which houses a number of relics associated with the Prophet.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-King_Hussein_Mosque_(Amman)_at_night.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0842433839216!2d35.82072571454997!3d31.98573168121816!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca228d105489f:0x2228c0c01f0bf7fa!2sKing Hussein Mosque!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573644095546!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1528, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'king-hussein-bin-talal-mosque'),
(1530, 'Mezquita King Hussein Bin Talal', 'Mezquita King Hussein Bin Talal', 'Mezquita King Hussein Bin Talal', 'Mezquita King Hussein Bin Talal', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Mezquita King Hussein Bin Talal, mejor conocida como la Mezquita King Hussein, es la mezquita más grande de Jordania. No debe confundirse con la Gran Mezquita Al-Husseini de 1924, también conocida como la Mezquita King Hussein, en el centro de Ammán.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Mezquita del King Hussein fue construida en 2005 en el reinado del Rey Abdullah II en West Amman, específicamente en los Parques Públicos Al Hussein en la calle King Abdullah II, cerca del Centro Médico King Hussein. La mezquita se encuentra a una altitud de 1.013 metros (3.323 pies) sobre el nivel del mar y, por lo tanto, se puede ver desde la mayor parte de Ammán. Es cuadrado y cuenta con cuatro minaretes y pisos de mármol.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En 2012, el Rey Abdullah abrió el Museo del Profeta Mahoma, que alberga una serie de reliquias asociadas con el Profeta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-King_Hussein_Mosque_(Amman)_at_night.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0842433839216!2d35.82072571454997!3d31.98573168121816!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca228d105489f:0x2228c0c01f0bf7fa!2sKing Hussein Mosque!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573644095546!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1528, 'es', '', 'one col', 'mezquita-king-hussein-bin-talal'),
(1531, 'Mosquée King Hussein Bin Talal', 'Mosquée King Hussein Bin Talal', 'Mosquée King Hussein Bin Talal', 'Mosquée King Hussein Bin Talal', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Mosquée King Hussein Bin Talal, plus connue sous le nom de mosquée du King Hussein, est la plus grande mosquée de Jordanie. À ne pas confondre avec la grande mosquée Al-Husseini de 1924, également connue sous le nom de mosquée du King Hussein, au centre d&#039;Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Mosquée King Hussein a été construite en 2005 sous le règne du roi Abdullah II à West Amman, plus précisément dans les parcs publics Al Hussein, rue King Abdullah II, près du centre médical King Hussein. La mosquée est située à 1 013 mètres d&#039;altitude et peut donc être vue depuis la majeure partie d&#039;Amman. Il est carré et comporte quatre minarets et sols en marbre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;En 2012, le roi Abdallah a ouvert le musée du prophète Mahomet, qui abrite une série de reliques associées au prophète.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-King_Hussein_Mosque_(Amman)_at_night.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0842433839216!2d35.82072571454997!3d31.98573168121816!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca228d105489f:0x2228c0c01f0bf7fa!2sKing Hussein Mosque!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573644095546!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1528, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'mosquee-king-hussein-bin-talal'),
(1532, 'Moschea King Hussein Bin Talal', 'Moschea King Hussein Bin Talal', 'Moschea King Hussein Bin Talal', 'Moschea King Hussein Bin Talal', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Moschea King Hussein Bin Talal, meglio conosciuta come la moschea del King Hussein, è la più grande moschea della Giordania. Da non confondere con la Grande Moschea Al-Husseini del 1924, nota anche come Moschea del King Hussein, nel centro di Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Moschea del King Hussein fu costruita nel 2005 durante il regno del re Abdullah II a West Amman, in particolare nei parchi pubblici di Al Hussein in King Abdullah II Street, vicino al King Hussein Medical Center. La moschea si trova ad un&#039;altitudine di 1.013 metri (3.323 piedi) sul livello del mare e, quindi, può essere vista dalla maggior parte di Amman. È quadrato e ha quattro minareti e pavimenti in marmo.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Nel 2012, il re Abdullah ha aperto il Museo del profeta Maometto, che ospita una serie di reliquie associate al profeta.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-King_Hussein_Mosque_(Amman)_at_night.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0842433839216!2d35.82072571454997!3d31.98573168121816!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca228d105489f:0x2228c0c01f0bf7fa!2sKing Hussein Mosque!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573644095546!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1528, 'it', '', 'one col', 'moschea-king-hussein-bin-talal'),
(1533, 'Lot´s Cave', 'Lot´s Cave', 'Lot´s Cave', 'Lot´s Cave', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;To the south of the Dead Sea and near the town of Safi there is a steep slope that is the location of a monastery, a Byzantine basilica from the 7th century AD, a reservoir and some mosaics along with Lot&#039;s Cave.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Remains from the cave date to the early Bronze Age (3300–2000 BC) and an inscription in the cave mentions Lot by name.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lot, who was brother of Abraham, fled with his wife and his daughters from the sinfulness of Sodom. In spite of a warning his wife looked back upon the city and turned into a pillar of salt (Genesis 19:1-26). Today the strangely shaped rock on a slope above the Dead Sea bears the name “Lot’s Wife”.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/lotsCave-1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d4834.194547909319!2d35.501409864684625!3d31.04597675930109!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503a3a06035257b:0x4a4d7bd7cdd7141f!2sLot&#039;s Cave!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573733393148!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1533, 'en', '', 'one col', 'lots-cave'),
(1534, 'Lot´s Cave', 'Lot´s Cave', 'Lot´s Cave', 'Lot´s Cave', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;To the south of the Dead Sea and near the town of Safi there is a steep slope that is the location of a monastery, a Byzantine basilica from the 7th century AD, a reservoir and some mosaics along with Lot&#039;s Cave.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Remains from the cave date to the early Bronze Age (3300–2000 BC) and an inscription in the cave mentions Lot by name.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lot, who was brother of Abraham, fled with his wife and his daughters from the sinfulness of Sodom. In spite of a warning his wife looked back upon the city and turned into a pillar of salt (Genesis 19:1-26). Today the strangely shaped rock on a slope above the Dead Sea bears the name “Lot’s Wife”.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/lotsCave-1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d4834.194547909319!2d35.501409864684625!3d31.04597675930109!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503a3a06035257b:0x4a4d7bd7cdd7141f!2sLot&#039;s Cave!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573733393148!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1533, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'lots-cave'),
(1535, 'Cueva de Lot', 'Cueva de Lot', 'Cueva de Lot', 'Cueva de Lot', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al Sur del Mar Muerto y cerca del pueblo de Safi hay una pendiente pronunciada que es la ubicación de un monasterio, una basílica bizantina del siglo VII d. C., un embalse y algunos mosaicos junto con la Cueva de Lot.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Restos desde la fecha de la cueva hasta principios de la Edad del Bronce (3300–2000 a. C.) y una inscripción en la cueva menciona a Lot por su nombre.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lot, que era hermano de Abraham, huyó con su esposa y sus hijas del pecado de Sodoma. A pesar de una advertencia, su esposa miró hacia la ciudad y se convirtió en una columna de sal (Génesis 19: 1-26). Hoy, la roca de forma extraña en una pendiente sobre el Mar Muerto lleva el nombre de &quot;Esposa de Lot&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/lotsCave-1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d4834.194547909319!2d35.501409864684625!3d31.04597675930109!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503a3a06035257b:0x4a4d7bd7cdd7141f!2sLot&#039;s Cave!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573733393148!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1533, 'es', '', 'one col', 'cueva-de-lot'),
(1536, 'Grotte de Lot', 'Grotte de Lot', 'Grotte de Lot', 'Grotte de Lot', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Au sud de la mer Morte et près de la ville de Safi, se trouve une pente abrupte qui abrite un monastère, une basilique byzantine du 7ème siècle après JC. C., un réservoir et des mosaïques avec la grotte de Lot.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Reste de la date de la grotte jusqu&#039;au début de l&#039;âge du bronze (3300-2000 av. J.-C.) et une inscription dans la grotte mentionne Lot par son nom.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lot, qui était le frère d&#039;Abraham, s&#039;est enfui avec son épouse et ses filles du péché de Sodome. Malgré un avertissement, sa femme a regardé vers la ville et est devenue une colonne de sel (Genèse 19: 1-26). Aujourd&#039;hui, le rocher aux formes étranges sur une pente au-dessus de la mer Morte s&#039;appelle &quot;Femme du lot&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/lotsCave-1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d4834.194547909319!2d35.501409864684625!3d31.04597675930109!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503a3a06035257b:0x4a4d7bd7cdd7141f!2sLot&#039;s Cave!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573733393148!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1533, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'grotte-de-lot'),
(1537, 'Grotta di Lot', 'Grotta di Lot', 'Grotta di Lot', 'Grotta di Lot', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;A sud del Mar Morto e vicino alla città di Safi c&#039;è un ripido pendio che ospita un monastero, una basilica bizantina del VII secolo d.C. C., un serbatoio e alcuni mosaici insieme alla Lot&#039;s Cave.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Rimane dalla data della grotta fino all&#039;inizio dell&#039;età del bronzo (3300-2000 a.C.) e un&#039;iscrizione nella grotta menziona Lot per nome.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lot, che era il fratello di Abramo, fuggì con la moglie e le figlie dal peccato di Sodoma. Nonostante l&#039;avvertimento, sua moglie guardò verso la città e divenne una colonna di sale (Genesi 19: 1-26). Oggi, la roccia a forma strana su un pendio sul Mar Morto si chiama &quot;Moglie di Lot&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/lotsCave-1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d4834.194547909319!2d35.501409864684625!3d31.04597675930109!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503a3a06035257b:0x4a4d7bd7cdd7141f!2sLot&#039;s Cave!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573733393148!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1533, 'it', '', 'one col', 'grotta-di-lot'),
(1538, 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Al-Kharanah, is one of the best-known of the desert castles located in present-day eastern Jordan, about 60 kilometers (37 mi) east of Amman and relatively close to the border with Saudi Arabia. It is believed to have been built sometime before the early 8th century AD, based on a graffito in one of its upper rooms, despite visible Sassanid influences. A Greek or Byzantine house may have existed on the site. It is one of the earliest examples of Islamic architecture in the region.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It remains very well preserved, since it is located just off a major highway and is within a short drive of Amman, it has become one of the most visited of the desert castles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The castle is just south of Highway 40, an important desert road that links Amman with Azraq, the Saudi Arabian border and remote areas of Eastern Jordan and Iraq. It sits on a slight rise just 15 metres (49 ft) above the surrounding desert.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Kharana_in_Jordan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.523797847304!2d36.46069021454189!3d31.72890078130113!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b249e0321d58d:0xae2394f52625c2b!2sQasr al-Kharaneh!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573737457143!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1538, 'en', '', 'one col', 'qasr-al-kharanah'),
(1539, 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Al-Kharanah, is one of the best-known of the desert castles located in present-day eastern Jordan, about 60 kilometers (37 mi) east of Amman and relatively close to the border with Saudi Arabia. It is believed to have been built sometime before the early 8th century AD, based on a graffito in one of its upper rooms, despite visible Sassanid influences. A Greek or Byzantine house may have existed on the site. It is one of the earliest examples of Islamic architecture in the region.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It remains very well preserved, since it is located just off a major highway and is within a short drive of Amman, it has become one of the most visited of the desert castles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The castle is just south of Highway 40, an important desert road that links Amman with Azraq, the Saudi Arabian border and remote areas of Eastern Jordan and Iraq. It sits on a slight rise just 15 metres (49 ft) above the surrounding desert.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Kharana_in_Jordan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.523797847304!2d36.46069021454189!3d31.72890078130113!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b249e0321d58d:0xae2394f52625c2b!2sQasr al-Kharaneh!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573737457143!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1538, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'qasr-al-kharanah'),
(1540, 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Al-Kharanah, es uno de los castillos del desierto más conocidos ubicados en el este de Jordania, a unos 60 kilómetros (37 millas) al este de Ammán y relativamente cerca de la frontera con Arabia Saudita. Se cree que fue construido en algún momento antes de principios del siglo VIII d. C., basado en un graffito en una de sus habitaciones superiores, a pesar de las influencias sasánidas visibles. Una casa griega o bizantina pudo haber existido en el sitio. Es uno de los primeros ejemplos de arquitectura islámica en la región.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Se conserva muy bien, dado que se encuentra justo al lado de una carretera principal y se encuentra a poca distancia de Amman, se ha convertido en uno de los castillos del desierto más visitados.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El castillo está justo al sur de la autopista 40, una importante carretera del desierto que une Amán con Azraq, la frontera con Arabia Saudita y áreas remotas del este de Jordania e Irak. Se asienta en una ligera elevación a solo 15 metros (49 pies) sobre el desierto circundante.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Kharana_in_Jordan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.523797847304!2d36.46069021454189!3d31.72890078130113!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b249e0321d58d:0xae2394f52625c2b!2sQasr al-Kharaneh!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573737457143!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1538, 'es', '', 'one col', 'qasr-al-kharanah'),
(1541, 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Al-Kharanah est l&#039;un des noms les plus populaires dans notre pays et en Jordanie, un prix de 60 kilomètres (37 millions de dollars) et un commentaire relatif à la situation de la frontière avec l&#039;Arabie saoudite. Voir plus de détails sur ce qu&#039;il était déjà dit VIII. D. C., basado in graffito in a susa suscioniones superiores, a Pesar de las influencias sasánidas visibles. Un cas de mauvaise foi ou bizantina pudo haber existido en el sitio. Vous êtes le premier à découvrir des exemples d&#039;architecture architecturale dans la région.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Si vous préférez, assurez-vous que votre comportement est meilleur et si vous êtes très distant d&#039;Amman, si vous convertissez et si vous voulez que vos rêves soient consultés.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le château est juste à la sortie de l&#039;autoroute 40, une route importante qui nous sépare de l&#039;Amérique avec l&#039;Arabie, la frontière de l&#039;Arabie saoudite et des régions éloignées de la Jordanie et de l&#039;Irak. Si vous êtes en liaison directe avec un solo de 15 mètres (49 tartes) sobre el desierto circundante.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Kharana_in_Jordan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.523797847304!2d36.46069021454189!3d31.72890078130113!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b249e0321d58d:0xae2394f52625c2b!2sQasr al-Kharaneh!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573737457143!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1538, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'qasr-al-kharanah'),
(1542, 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Al-Kharanah, è uno dei castiglioni del deserito di altri avvocati nell&#039;Estero della Jordania, un unos di 60 chilometri (37 millesimi) nell&#039;estremità di Amman e confronta gli affari con l&#039;Arabia Saudita. Se cree que fue construido in algún momento antes de principios del siglo VIII d. C., basato su un graffito in una delle abitazioni superiori, una pesar de las influencias sasánidas visibles. Una casa griega o bizantina che esiste nel mondo. Es uno dei primer ejemplos di arquitectura islámica in the región.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Tieni molto al sicuro, guarda la pagina di una presentazione del principale e ti mostra una piccola distanza da Amman, in una conversione in uno dei castelli del mondo dei visitatori.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il castillo è appena uscito dall&#039;autopista 40, un&#039;importante portante del desiderio di un Aman con Azraq, la frontiera con Arabia Saudita e altri remoti dell&#039;est Jordania e Irak. Se ti piace una luce sopra un solo 15 metri (49 torte) su el desierto circundante.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Kharana_in_Jordan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.523797847304!2d36.46069021454189!3d31.72890078130113!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b249e0321d58d:0xae2394f52625c2b!2sQasr al-Kharaneh!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573737457143!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1538, 'it', '', 'one col', 'qasr-al-kharanah'),
(1543, 'Montreal Castle', 'Montreal Castle', 'Montreal Castle', 'Montreal Castle', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Montreal is a Crusader castle on the eastern side of the Arabah, perched on the side of a rocky, conical mountain, looking out over fruit trees below. The ruins, called Shoubak, are located in modern town of Shoubak in Jordan.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The castle was built in 1115 by Baldwin I of Jerusalem during his expedition to the area where he captured Aqaba on the Red Sea in 1116. Originally called &#039;Krak de Montreal&#039; or &#039;Mons Regalis&#039;, it was named in honor of the king&#039;s own contribution to its construction (Mont Royal).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Little remains of the original Crusader fortifications. Although it has never been fully excavated, it is known that there was a set of three walls, which partially remain. The most significant remains of the crusader portions of the crusader castle is the remains of a curtain wall that ran inside the later Muslim additions and two chapels.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/800px-Montreal_Castle_Visitor_center.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d5779.69196469746!2d35.55591747806706!3d30.531629823334526!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503dfdeae5e6ee9:0x955a7c3f09c03796!2sShobak Castle - Montreal!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573740239429!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1543, 'en', '', 'one col', 'montreal-castle');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1544, 'Montreal Castle', 'Montreal Castle', 'Montreal Castle', 'Montreal Castle', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Montreal is a Crusader castle on the eastern side of the Arabah, perched on the side of a rocky, conical mountain, looking out over fruit trees below. The ruins, called Shoubak, are located in modern town of Shoubak in Jordan.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The castle was built in 1115 by Baldwin I of Jerusalem during his expedition to the area where he captured Aqaba on the Red Sea in 1116. Originally called &#039;Krak de Montreal&#039; or &#039;Mons Regalis&#039;, it was named in honor of the king&#039;s own contribution to its construction (Mont Royal).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Little remains of the original Crusader fortifications. Although it has never been fully excavated, it is known that there was a set of three walls, which partially remain. The most significant remains of the crusader portions of the crusader castle is the remains of a curtain wall that ran inside the later Muslim additions and two chapels.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/800px-Montreal_Castle_Visitor_center.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d5779.69196469746!2d35.55591747806706!3d30.531629823334526!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503dfdeae5e6ee9:0x955a7c3f09c03796!2sShobak Castle - Montreal!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573740239429!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1543, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'montreal-castle'),
(1545, 'Castillo Montreal', 'Castillo Montreal', 'Castillo Montreal', 'Castillo Montreal', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Montreal es un castillo cruzado en el lado este de la Arabah, encaramado en la ladera de una montaña rocosa y cónica, con vistas a los árboles frutales a continuación. Las ruinas, llamadas Shoubak, se encuentran en la moderna ciudad de Shoubak en Jordania.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El castillo fue construido en 1115 por Baldwin I de Jerusalén durante su expedición al área donde capturó Aqaba en el Mar Rojo en 1116. Originalmente llamado &#039;Krak de Montreal&#039; o &#039;Mons Regalis&#039;, fue nombrado en honor al propio rey. Contribución a su construcción (Mont Royal).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Quedan pocos restos de las fortificaciones cruzadas originales. Aunque nunca se ha excavado por completo, se sabe que había un conjunto de tres paredes, que permanecen parcialmente. Los restos más significativos de las partes cruzadas del castillo cruzado son los restos de un muro cortina que corría dentro de las adiciones musulmanas posteriores y dos capillas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/800px-Montreal_Castle_Visitor_center.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d5779.69196469746!2d35.55591747806706!3d30.531629823334526!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503dfdeae5e6ee9:0x955a7c3f09c03796!2sShobak Castle - Montreal!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573740239429!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1543, 'es', '', 'one col', 'castillo-montreal'),
(1546, 'Château de Montréal', 'Château de Montréal', 'Château de Montréal', 'Château de Montréal', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Montréal est un château en croix sur le côté est de la Arabah, perché sur le flanc d’une montagne rocheuse et conique, surplombant les arbres fruitiers situés en contrebas. Les ruines, appelées Shoubak, sont situées dans la ville moderne de Shoubak en Jordanie.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le château fut construit en 1115 par Baldwin Ier de Jérusalem lors de son expédition dans la région où il captura Aqaba en mer Rouge en 1116. Initialement appelé &#039;Montreal Krak&#039; ou &#039;Mons Regalis&#039;, il fut nommé en l&#039;honneur du roi lui-même. Contribution à sa construction (Mont Royal).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il reste peu de vestiges des fortifications d&#039;origine croisées. Bien qu&#039;il n&#039;ait jamais été entièrement fouillé, on sait qu&#039;il existait un ensemble de trois murs qui restent partiellement. Les vestiges les plus significatifs des parties traversées du château croisé sont les restes d&#039;un mur rideau qui se trouvait à l&#039;intérieur des ajouts musulmans ultérieurs et de deux chapelles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/800px-Montreal_Castle_Visitor_center.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d5779.69196469746!2d35.55591747806706!3d30.531629823334526!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503dfdeae5e6ee9:0x955a7c3f09c03796!2sShobak Castle - Montreal!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573740239429!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1543, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'chateau-de-montreal'),
(1547, 'Castello di Montreal', 'Castello di Montreal', 'Castello di Montreal', 'Castello di Montreal', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Montreal è un castello a croce sul lato est dell&#039;Arabah, arroccato sul lato di una montagna rocciosa e conica, che domina gli alberi da frutto sottostanti. Le rovine, chiamate Shoubak, si trovano nella moderna città di Shoubak in Giordania.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Il castello fu costruito nel 1115 da Baldovino I di Gerusalemme durante la sua spedizione nella zona dove catturò Aqaba nel Mar Rosso nel 1116. Originariamente chiamato &quot;Montreal Krak&quot; o &quot;Mons Regalis&quot;, fu chiamato in onore del re stesso. Contributo alla sua costruzione (Mont Royal).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Vi sono pochi resti delle fortificazioni a croce originali. Sebbene non sia mai stato completamente scavato, è noto che esisteva un insieme di tre pareti, che rimangono parzialmente. I resti più significativi delle parti attraversate del castello a croce sono i resti di una facciata continua che correva all&#039;interno delle successive aggiunte musulmane e due cappelle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/800px-Montreal_Castle_Visitor_center.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d5779.69196469746!2d35.55591747806706!3d30.531629823334526!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503dfdeae5e6ee9:0x955a7c3f09c03796!2sShobak Castle - Montreal!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573740239429!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1543, 'it', '', 'one col', 'castello-di-montreal'),
(1548, 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Amra, also transcribed as Quseir Amra or Qusayr Amra, is the best-known of the desert castles located in present-day eastern Jordan. It was built early in the 8th century, some time between 723 and 743, by Walid Ibn Yazid, the future Umayyad caliph Walid II, whose dominance of the region was raising at the time. It is considered one of the most important examples of early Islamic art and architecture. The discovery of an inscription during work in 2012 has allowed for more accurate dating of the structure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The building is actually the remnant of a larger complex that included an actual castle, of which only the foundation remains. What stands today is a small country cabin, meant as a royal retreat, without any military function.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is most notable for the frescoes that remain on the ceilings inside, which depict, among others, a group of rulers, hunting, and naked women; above one bath chamber, an accurate representation of the zodiac. These have led to its designation as a UNESCO World Heritage Site, one of five in the country.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Amra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3390.846227094984!2d36.58511081466424!3d31.801940540367088!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b1e25b3292441:0x3a24cdc0130d66cc!2sQuseir &#039;Amra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573815079356!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1548, 'en', '', 'one col', 'qasr-amra'),
(1549, 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Amra, also transcribed as Quseir Amra or Qusayr Amra, is the best-known of the desert castles located in present-day eastern Jordan. It was built early in the 8th century, some time between 723 and 743, by Walid Ibn Yazid, the future Umayyad caliph Walid II, whose dominance of the region was raising at the time. It is considered one of the most important examples of early Islamic art and architecture. The discovery of an inscription during work in 2012 has allowed for more accurate dating of the structure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The building is actually the remnant of a larger complex that included an actual castle, of which only the foundation remains. What stands today is a small country cabin, meant as a royal retreat, without any military function.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;It is most notable for the frescoes that remain on the ceilings inside, which depict, among others, a group of rulers, hunting, and naked women; above one bath chamber, an accurate representation of the zodiac. These have led to its designation as a UNESCO World Heritage Site, one of five in the country.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Amra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3390.846227094984!2d36.58511081466424!3d31.801940540367088!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b1e25b3292441:0x3a24cdc0130d66cc!2sQuseir &#039;Amra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573815079356!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1548, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'qasr-amra'),
(1550, 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Amra, también transcrito como Quseir Amra o Qusayr Amra, es el más conocido de los castillos del desierto ubicados en el este de Jordania actual. Fue construido a principios del siglo VIII, en algún momento entre 723 y 743, por Walid Ibn Yazid, el futuro califa omeya Walid II, cuyo dominio de la región estaba aumentando en ese momento. Se considera uno de los ejemplos más importantes del arte y la arquitectura islámica primitiva. El descubrimiento de una inscripción durante el trabajo en 2012 ha permitido una datación más precisa de la estructura.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El edificio es en realidad el remanente de un complejo más grande que incluía un castillo real, del cual solo quedan los cimientos. Lo que se destaca hoy es una pequeña cabaña en el campo, pensada como una retirada real, sin ninguna función militar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Es más notable por los frescos que permanecen en los techos del interior, que representan, entre otros, un grupo de gobernantes, cazadores y mujeres desnudas; encima de una cámara de baño, una representación precisa del zodiaco. Estos han llevado a su designación como Patrimonio de la Humanidad por la UNESCO, uno de los cinco en el país.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Amra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3390.846227094984!2d36.58511081466424!3d31.801940540367088!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b1e25b3292441:0x3a24cdc0130d66cc!2sQuseir &#039;Amra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573815079356!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1548, 'es', '', 'one col', 'qasr-amra'),
(1551, 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Amra, également transcrit en Quseir Amra ou Qusayr Amra, est le plus connu des châteaux du désert situé dans l&#039;est de la Jordanie. Il a été construit au début du VIIIe siècle, entre 723 et 743, par Walid Ibn Yazid, futur futur calife omeyyade Walid II, dont la domination sur la région augmentait à cette époque. Il est considéré comme l&#039;un des exemples les plus importants d&#039;art et d&#039;architecture islamiques primitifs. La découverte d&#039;une inscription lors des travaux en 2012 a permis une datation plus précise de la structure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Le bâtiment est en réalité le vestige d&#039;un complexe plus vaste comprenant un château royal, dont il ne reste que les fondations. Ce qui ressort aujourd&#039;hui, c&#039;est un petit chalet à la campagne, conçu comme une retraite royale, sans aucune fonction militaire.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;C&#039;est surtout pour les fresques qui restent sur les plafonds intérieurs, qui représentent, entre autres, un groupe de dirigeants, de chasseurs et de femmes nues; au dessus d&#039;une chambre de bain, une représentation précise du zodiaque. Celles-ci ont conduit à sa désignation comme site du patrimoine mondial par l&#039;UNESCO, l&#039;un des cinq du pays.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Amra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3390.846227094984!2d36.58511081466424!3d31.801940540367088!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b1e25b3292441:0x3a24cdc0130d66cc!2sQuseir &#039;Amra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573815079356!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1548, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'qasr-amra'),
(1552, 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Qasr Amra, anche trascritto come Quseir Amra o Qusayr Amra, è il più noto dei castelli del deserto situati oggi nella Giordania orientale. Fu costruito all&#039;inizio dell&#039;VIII secolo, tra il 723 e il 743, da Walid Ibn Yazid, il futuro califfo omayyade Walid II, il cui dominio della regione stava aumentando in quel momento. È considerato uno dei più importanti esempi di arte e architettura islamica primitiva. La scoperta di un&#039;iscrizione durante i lavori del 2012 ha permesso una datazione più precisa della struttura.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;edificio è in realtà il residuo di un complesso più grande che comprendeva un castello reale, di cui rimangono solo le basi. Ciò che spicca oggi è un piccolo cottage in campagna, pensato come un rifugio reale, senza alcuna funzione militare.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;È notevole soprattutto per gli affreschi che rimangono sui soffitti interni, che rappresentano, tra gli altri, un gruppo di sovrani, cacciatori e donne nude; sopra una camera da bagno, una rappresentazione accurata dello zodiaco. Questi hanno portato alla sua designazione come Patrimonio dell&#039;Umanità dall&#039;UNESCO, uno dei cinque nel paese.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Amra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3390.846227094984!2d36.58511081466424!3d31.801940540367088!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b1e25b3292441:0x3a24cdc0130d66cc!2sQuseir &#039;Amra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573815079356!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1548, 'it', '', 'one col', 'qasr-amra'),
(1553, 'Afra Hot Springs', 'Afra Hot Springs', 'Afra Hot Springs', 'Afra Hot Springs', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;<br>Jordan is the leading destination for medical tourism in the Middle East and the Afra Hot Springs are a clear example. Located 26 km north of the city of Tafilah, the less-known Afra Hot Springs are less known than Ma’in; however, its medical benefits are the same.  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hot mineral water flows from 15 different water springs, ranging in temperature from 45° to 48° C. Tourists frequent the hot springs, seeking treatment for chronic physical ailments such as skin and circulatory diseases, and bone, joint, back and muscular pains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;These mineral-rich waters help in the treatment of infertility, arteriosclerosis, anemia, rheumatism and many other chronic diseases. The water in the springs contains elements with healing properties, including sodium, calcium, chloride, radon, hydrogen sulfide and carbon dioxide.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Afra hotsprings in Tafileh new.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3421.064055628116!2d35.63937391464292!3d30.968694581273997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150399e4b5f8abbd:0xd4f0bfbbe4f12c45!2sAfra Hot Springs!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573817160896!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1553, 'en', '', 'one col', 'afra-hot-springs'),
(1554, 'Afra Hot Springs', 'Afra Hot Springs', 'Afra Hot Springs', 'Afra Hot Springs', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Jordan is the leading destination for medical tourism in the Middle East and the Afra Hot Springs are a clear example. Located 26 km north of the city of Tafilah, the less-known Afra Hot Springs are less known than Ma’in; however, its medical benefits are the same.  &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The hot mineral water flows from 15 different water springs, ranging in temperature from 45° to 48° C. Tourists frequent the hot springs, seeking treatment for chronic physical ailments such as skin and circulatory diseases, and bone, joint, back and muscular pains.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;These mineral-rich waters help in the treatment of infertility, arteriosclerosis, anemia, rheumatism and many other chronic diseases. The water in the springs contains elements with healing properties, including sodium, calcium, chloride, radon, hydrogen sulfide and carbon dioxide.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Afra hotsprings in Tafileh new.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3421.064055628116!2d35.63937391464292!3d30.968694581273997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150399e4b5f8abbd:0xd4f0bfbbe4f12c45!2sAfra Hot Springs!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573817160896!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1553, 'Ar', '', 'one col', 'afra-hot-springs'),
(1555, 'Aguas Termales Afra', 'Aguas Termales Afra', 'Aguas Termales Afra', 'Aguas Termales Afra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Jordania es el principal destino para el turismo médico en el Medio Oriente y las aguas termales de Afra son un claro ejemplo. Ubicadas a 26 km al norte de la ciudad de Tafilah, las aguas termales de Afra menos conocidas son menos conocidas que Ma’in; Sin embargo, sus beneficios médicos son los mismos.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;El agua mineral caliente fluye de 15 manantiales de agua diferentes, con temperaturas que varían de 45 ° a 48 ° C. Los turistas frecuentan las aguas termales, buscando tratamiento para enfermedades físicas crónicas como enfermedades de la piel y circulatorias, y dolores de huesos, articulaciones, espalda y músculos. .&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Estas aguas ricas en minerales ayudan en el tratamiento de infertilidad, arteriosclerosis, anemia, reumatismo y muchas otras enfermedades crónicas. El agua en los manantiales contiene elementos con propiedades curativas, como sodio, calcio, cloruro, radón, sulfuro de hidrógeno y dióxido de carbono.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Afra hotsprings in Tafileh new.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3421.064055628116!2d35.63937391464292!3d30.968694581273997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150399e4b5f8abbd:0xd4f0bfbbe4f12c45!2sAfra Hot Springs!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573817160896!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1553, 'es', '', 'one col', 'aguas-termales-afra'),
(1556, 'Sources Chaudes de Afra', 'Sources Chaudes de Afra', 'Sources Chaudes de Afra', 'Sources Chaudes de Afra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Jordanie est la principale destination du tourisme médical au Moyen-Orient et les sources chaudes d&#039;Afra en sont un exemple clair. Situées à 26 km au nord de la ville de Tafilah, les sources chaudes d’Afra, moins connues, sont moins connues que Ma’in; Cependant, leurs avantages médicaux sont les mêmes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;eau minérale chaude provient de 15 sources différentes, avec des températures variant entre 45 ° et 48 ° C. Les touristes fréquentent les sources chaudes, recherchant un traitement pour des maladies physiques chroniques telles que les maladies de la peau et de l&#039;appareil circulatoire, et les douleurs osseuses. les articulations, le dos et les muscles. .&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Ces eaux riches en minéraux aident au traitement de l&#039;infertilité, de l&#039;artériosclérose, de l&#039;anémie, des rhumatismes et de nombreuses autres maladies chroniques. L&#039;eau des sources contient des éléments aux propriétés curatives, tels que le sodium, le calcium, le chlorure, le radon, le sulfure d&#039;hydrogène et le dioxyde de carbone.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Afra hotsprings in Tafileh new.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3421.064055628116!2d35.63937391464292!3d30.968694581273997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150399e4b5f8abbd:0xd4f0bfbbe4f12c45!2sAfra Hot Springs!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573817160896!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1553, 'fr', '', 'one col', 'sources-chaudes-de-afra'),
(1557, 'Afra Sorgenti Termali', 'Afra Sorgenti Termali', 'Afra Sorgenti Termali', 'Afra Sorgenti Termali', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;La Giordania è la principale destinazione del turismo medico in Medio Oriente e le sorgenti termali di Afra ne sono un chiaro esempio. Situato a 26 km a nord della città di Tafilah, le sorgenti termali Afra meno conosciute sono meno conosciute di Ma’in; Tuttavia, i loro benefici medici sono gli stessi.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;L&#039;acqua minerale calda scorre da 15 diverse sorgenti d&#039;acqua, con temperature che variano da 45 ° a 48 ° C. I turisti frequentano sorgenti termali, in cerca di cure per malattie fisiche croniche come pelle e malattie circolatorie e dolore osseo, articolazioni, schiena e muscoli. .&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Queste acque ricche di minerali aiutano nel trattamento dell&#039;infertilità, dell&#039;arteriosclerosi, dell&#039;anemia, dei reumatismi e di molte altre malattie croniche. L&#039;acqua nelle sorgenti contiene elementi con proprietà curative, come sodio, calcio, cloruro, radon, idrogeno solforato e anidride carbonica.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Afra hotsprings in Tafileh new.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt; \r\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3421.064055628116!2d35.63937391464292!3d30.968694581273997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150399e4b5f8abbd:0xd4f0bfbbe4f12c45!2sAfra Hot Springs!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573817160896!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1553, 'it', '', 'one col', 'afra-sorgenti-termali'),
(1558, 'Restaurants Amman', 'Restaurants in Amman', '', 'Restaurants, Amman', '\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;md-3 bd-3 d-pad&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/shams el balad.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Shams EL balad Restaurants Amman&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; style=&quot;object-fit: cover;&quot; /&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;orange-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shams El Balad&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Enjoy their a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;mazing view of the citadel and their dishes made of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;100% organic ingredients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/shams-el-balad/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;md-3 bd-3 d-pad&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/hashem.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Hashem Restaurant&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; style=&quot;object-fit: cover;&quot; /&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;orange-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hashem Downtown&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;p&gt;Hashem Downtown is the oldest restaurant in town, it has been running since 1956. A &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;must-see!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/hashem-downtown/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;md-3 bd-3 d-pad&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/Kan Zaman restaurants amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Kan Zaman Restaurant&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; style=&quot;object-fit: cover;&quot; /&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;orange-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kan Zamaan Restaurant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;p&gt;An attractive heritage place that serves great food. U&lt;span&gt;nique, a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;uthentic, oriental and local cuisine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/kan-zamaan/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;md-3 bd-3 d-pad&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/fakhreldin restaurant.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Fakhreldin Restaurant&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; style=&quot;object-fit: cover;&quot; /&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;orange-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fakhreldin Restaurant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;It has earned critical acclaim as one of the top restaurants in Amman. Quality meat, chicken and seafood.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/fakhreldin-restaurant/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;md-3 bd-3 d-pad&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/habibah sweets in Amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Habibah Sweets&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; style=&quot;object-fit: cover;&quot; /&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;orange-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Habibah Sweets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Family-run shop, they sell traditional chocolates and pastries and are famous for their &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;kanafeh&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/habibah-sweets/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;md-3 bd-3 d-pad&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/fatatri restaurant amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Fatatri&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; style=&quot;object-fit: cover;&quot; /&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;orange-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fatatri&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Combining Egyptian and Jordanian culture this restaurant specializes in &quot;feteer&quot;, a delicious pastry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/fatatri/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;md-3 bd-3 d-pad&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/primal bistro and cafe restaurants Amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;primal Restaurant AMman&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; style=&quot;object-fit: cover;&quot; /&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;orange-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primal Restaurant Amman&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;p&gt;The first and only paleo restaurant in Amman. &lt;span&gt;Totally gluten-free, refined sugar-free and lactose-free.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/primal-restaurant/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;md-3 bd-3 d-pad&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;\n            &lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/al quds.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Al-quds falafel&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; style=&quot;object-fit: cover;&quot; /&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;orange-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Al-Quds Falafel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\n                &lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;On the famous Rainbow street, Al-Quds restaurant is known to serve the best falafel in Amman.&lt;/p&gt;\n            &lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;en/al-quds-falafel/&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n', 1, 1558, 'en', '', 'one col', 'restaurants-amman'),
(1559, 'Shams El Balad', 'Shams El Balad', '', 'restaurant amman', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shams El Balad is a busy restaurant located in Jabal Amman area  &#039;inspired by the city it  lives in and the people that comprise it&#039;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;It is housed in a quintessentially Ammani home with outstanding views overlooking the citadel and Ummayad Palace.&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;They serve healthy mouth-watering local food inspired by the craft, produce and culture of the region. Their ingredients are 100% organic and come directly from the farms. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shams El Balad is a celebration of Jordanian heritage, land and the people who work tirelessly to protect them for all of us to enjoy.&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.370890586393!2d35.92490201447644!3d31.950833381229334!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f9b233d8d97:0x9926edf16bfbf80b!2sShams AlBalad!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1576315988858!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/shams el balad.jpg&quot; width=&quot;438&quot; height=&quot;251&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1559, 'en', '', 'one col', 'shams-el-balad'),
(1560, 'Kan Zamaan', 'Kan Zamaan', 'An attractive heritage place that serves great food. Unique, authentic, oriental and local cuisine.', 'Tourist attraction in Amman, oriental food, mezze, traditional food, knafeh', '&lt;div cla=&quot;&quot; div=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Kan Zamaan Restaurant is one of the best tourist attractions in Amman, the restaurant is an attractive heritage place that serves great food. The restaurant has the most amazing old stone arches and the decoration bends well with the setting. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Kan Zamaan is a distinguished landmark that sheds a new light on its cultural and historic legacy, as it continues to delight local food lovers with its unique, authentic, oriental and local cuisine garnished with forgotten flavours. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;They serve a wide selection of fine oriental cold and hot mezze, chargrilled meats, fresh pita bread prepared &amp;amp; baked daily in their Arabic brick oven, fresh seafood and local inspired dishes. They also offer delicious homemade knafeh. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;<br> Although it is a bit far out of the city centre it is definitely worth the ride!  They often play Oud live music and organize different types of events.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/Kan Zaman restaurants amman.jpg&quot; width=&quot;442&quot; height=&quot;294&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d108388.24555803406!2d35.8260677583293!3d31.90299239899252!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca7f5ef5df9a1:0x47a0e8f9731d5096!2sKan Zaman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1576335113536!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1560, 'en', '', 'one col', 'kan-zamaan'),
(1561, 'Afra Heisse Quellen', 'Afra Heisse Quellen', 'Afra Heisse Quellen', 'Afra Heisse Quellen', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;Übersetzung&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;<br><br><br>Jordanien ist das führende Reiseziel für Medizintourismus im Nahen Osten und die Afra Hot Springs sind ein gutes Beispiel. Die weniger bekannten Afra Hot Springs liegen 26 km nördlich der Stadt Tafilah und sind weniger bekannt als Ma&#039;in. Die medizinischen Vorteile sind jedoch gleich.  <br><br>Das heiße Mineralwasser fließt aus 15 verschiedenen Wasserquellen mit einer Temperatur von 45 bis 48 ° C. Touristen besuchen die heißen Quellen, um chronische körperliche Beschwerden wie Haut- und Kreislauferkrankungen sowie Knochen-, Gelenk-, Rücken- und Muskelschmerzen zu behandeln . <br><br>Diese mineralstoffreichen Wässer helfen bei der Behandlung von Unfruchtbarkeit, Arteriosklerose, Anämie, Rheuma und vielen anderen chronischen Krankheiten. Das Wasser in den Quellen enthält Elemente mit heilenden Eigenschaften, einschließlich Natrium, Calcium, Chlorid, Radon, Schwefelwasserstoff und Kohlendioxid.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt; &lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Afra hotsprings in Tafileh new.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3421.064055628116!2d35.63937391464292!3d30.968694581273997!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x150399e4b5f8abbd:0xd4f0bfbbe4f12c45!2sAfra Hot Springs!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573817160896!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1553, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'afra-heisse-quellen');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1562, 'Hashem Downtown', 'Hashem Downtown', 'Hashem Downtown is the oldest restaurant in town, it has been running since 1956. A must-see!', 'Downtown Amman, Falafel, hommous, mezze, 24 hours restaurant, 24h food', '&lt;div cla=&quot;&quot; div=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt; <br>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Hashem Downtown is the oldest restaurant in the city, it has been running since 1956. It is definitely a must during your trip to Jordan.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;It is known as the restaurant that never closes because it serves food 24/7! In it you can find the most delicious hummus, falafel and foul in town. &lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt; <br> &lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The walls of the restaurant are decorated with pictures of many celebrities who have visited it over the past 60 years such as His Majesty King Abdullah II, Queen Rania, Crown Prince HH Prince Hussein, Palestinian President Yasser Arafat, Omar Alsherif, Melhim Brakat, Kamal Alshinawi, George Wassof.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/hashem restaurant.jpg&quot; width=&quot;445&quot; height=&quot;296&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d6770.621150646353!2d35.9297785!3d31.9524701!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0xe7dab884a8b945e2!2sHashem Restaurant Down Town!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1576336687523!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1562, 'en', '', 'one col', 'hashem-downtown'),
(1563, 'Habibah sweets', 'Habibah sweets', 'Family-run shop, they sell traditional chocolates and pastries and are famous for their kanafeh.', 'Habibah, sweets, arab sweets, jordanian sweets, knafeh, kunafeh, kunafe, Amman', '&lt;div cla=&quot;&quot; div=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Family-run sweet shop founded in 1951 selling traditional chocolates and pastries. They are famous for their kanafeh which is a traditional Middle Eastern dissert made of fine semolina dough, a layer of cheese and sugar-based syrup.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Al-Haj Mahmoud Habibah left Nablus in 1947 and started his job at a small Kunafa shop in Jerusalem. One year later, he moved to Amman. Since then he has been gracefully offering his sweets to both locals and visitors who queue all the way around the block waiting for their sweet treat.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/habibah sweets amman.jpg&quot; width=&quot;443&quot; height=&quot;332&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13540.969057553559!2d35.926048531992045!3d31.954323699295294!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f99d8819489:0xcc54b3d129d39825!2sHabibah Sweets!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1576339669181!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1563, 'en', '', 'one col', 'habibah-sweets'),
(1564, 'Fakhreldin Restaurant', 'Fakhreldin Restaurant', 'It has earned critical acclaim as one of the top restaurants in Amman. Quality meat, chicken and seafood.', 'Top restaurant in Amman, Fakhreldin, meat, chicken, seafood', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #302f2f;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&#039;Fine Levantine cuisine in the elegance of an authentic Jordanian home&#039;. Fakhreldin Restaurant is located in one of the oldest neighbourhoods of Amman. It was designed and constructed during the mid-20th century’s golden era and over the years has also been a home to several prominent dignitaries in Jordan.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Fakhreldin Restaurant is distinguished by its service and food and has earned critical acclaim as one of the top restaurants in Amman. The best quality meat, chicken and seafood are used for the fantastic selection of grills available, traditional Middle Eastern appetizers and sweet Arabic desserts.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/fakhreldin.jpg&quot; width=&quot;444&quot; height=&quot;296&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.322932494197!2d35.918252650599904!3d31.952134781136916!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f99a48f39f3:0x3fd68db1f2177c00!2sFakhreldin Restaurant!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1576340310025!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1564, 'en', '', 'one col', 'fakhreldin-restaurant'),
(1565, 'Al-Quds Falafel', 'Al-Quds Falafel', 'On the famous Rainbow street, Al-Quds restaurant  is known to serve the best falafel in Amman.', 'Falafel, Al-Quds, Rainbow Street', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Located on the lively and vibrant Rainbow street, Al-Quds restaurant  is known to serve the best falafel in Amman. Many locals and tourists pop in to have a delicious falafel sandwich after a stroll down Rainbow street.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Due to its tiny size it does not have much sitting options besides a little bench outside the store, however you can buy your food to take-away or even order it online.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/e28c2eb2e503cacfa05fa26ffe47dd5c-al-quds.jpg&quot; width=&quot;426&quot; height=&quot;340&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d13541.683034851729!2d35.9265022!3d31.9494801!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x0:0x376a889bafb7348c!2sAl Quds Falafel!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1576341855898!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1565, 'en', '', 'one col', 'al-quds-falafel'),
(1566, 'Fatatri', 'Fatatri', 'Combining Egyptian and Jordanian culture this restaurant specializes in &quot;feteer&quot;, a delicious pastry.', 'Feteer, Fatir, Fateer, pastry, Egyptian pastry', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; text-decoration-line: inherit;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Combining Egyptian and Jordanian culture this restaurant specializes in &quot;feteer&quot; a delicious pastry that consists of a very thin dough filled with fresh ingredients of the customer&#039;s choice and baked in the oven. The dough only contains flower, water and some salt it does not have any conservatives or additives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;This restaurant not only provides an excellent service to its customers but also focuses on the personal development of its staff offering them the opportunity of learning new skills. Fatatri is the first restaurant in town to provide free English lessons to its team.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Make sure you stop by during your stay in Amman and  watch how the exceptionally talented chefs spread the dough and toss it in the air before filling it with fresh local ingredients. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/fatatri restaurant amman.jpg&quot; width=&quot;404&quot; height=&quot;249&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;510&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.436976592755!2d35.925943950599674!3d31.94903998113775!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f9b63402caf:0x18c1effcef8bfa3f!2zRmF0YXRyaSDZgdi32LfYsdmK!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1576344251915!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;iframe width=&quot;510&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d13540.974558857148!2d35.844875003039505!3d31.954286381136168!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca19aaa5157c9:0x7c9ec4b22728d0d2!2sFatatri 7th Circle!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1576344303377!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1566, 'en', '', 'one col', 'fatatri'),
(1567, 'Primal Restaurant', 'Primal Restaurant', 'The first and only paleo restaurant in Amman. Totally gluten-free, refined sugar-free and lactose-free.', 'Paleo restaurante, gluten-free, gluten free, lactose free, sugar free, no lactose, no sugar, vegan, vegetarian', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Primal is the first and only paleo restaurant in Amman. Their vision is &#039;for you to get back to eating purely and healthily&#039;. Located in the most affluent district of the city, Wadi Abdoun, Primal prides itself for having a menu that is suitable for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Offering a menu that is totally gluten-free, refined sugar-free, lactose-free, with countless vegetarian and plant-based vegan options. Moreover, Primal serves a wide selection of local and imported beer, wine and sparkling wine. Its modern and beautifully decorated establishment counts with a glass-encased area as well as out-door sitting. &lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Restaurants/primal bistro and cafe restaurants Amman.jpg&quot; width=&quot;445&quot; height=&quot;295&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.270109805313!2d35.88204971548299!3d31.95356813281916!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0f7312a01b9:0xbf3c31d4862d8d04!2sPrimal restaurant!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1576404328748!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1567, 'en', '', 'one col', 'primal-restaurant'),
(1568, 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', 'Qasr Amra', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;Übersetzung&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Qasr Amra, auch als Quseir Amra oder Qusayr Amra bezeichnet, ist die bekannteste der Wüstenburgen im heutigen östlichen Jordanien. Es wurde zu Beginn des 8. Jahrhunderts, einige Zeit zwischen 723 und 743, von Walid Ibn Yazid, dem zukünftigen umayyadischen Kalifen Walid II, erbaut, dessen Dominanz in der Region zu dieser Zeit zunahm. Es gilt als eines der wichtigsten Beispiele frühislamischer Kunst und Architektur. Die Entdeckung einer Inschrift während der Arbeit im Jahr 2012 ermöglichte eine genauere Datierung der Struktur.\r\n\r\n\r\nDas Gebäude ist eigentlich der Rest eines größeren Komplexes, der eine tatsächliche Burg enthielt, von der nur das Fundament übrig bleibt. Was heute steht, ist eine kleine Landhütte, die als königlicher Rückzugsort ohne militärische Funktion gedacht ist.\r\n\r\n\r\nAm bemerkenswertesten sind die Fresken an den Decken, die unter anderem eine Gruppe von Herrschern, Jägern und nackten Frauen darstellen. Über einer Badekammer eine genaue Darstellung des Tierkreises. Diese haben dazu geführt, dass es zum UNESCO-Weltkulturerbe zählt, eines von fünf im Land.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Amra.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3390.846227094984!2d36.58511081466424!3d31.801940540367088!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b1e25b3292441:0x3a24cdc0130d66cc!2sQuseir &#039;Amra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573815079356!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1548, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'qasr-amra'),
(1569, 'Montreal Burg', 'Montreal Burg', 'Montreal Burg', 'Montreal Burg', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;tw-ta-container tw-nfl&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;Übersetzung&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Montreal ist eine Kreuzritterburg auf der Ostseite der Arabah, die auf einem felsigen, konischen Berg thront und über Obstbäume blickt. Die Ruinen, Shoubak genannt, befinden sich in der modernen Stadt Shoubak in Jordanien.\r\n\r\n\r\nDas Schloss wurde 1115 von Balduin I. von Jerusalem während seiner Expedition in das Gebiet, in dem er 1116 Aqaba am Roten Meer eroberte, erbaut. Ursprünglich &#039;Krak de Montreal&#039; oder &#039;Mons Regalis&#039; genannt, benannt wurde es zu Ehren des Königs und seinem Beitrag zu dem Bau (Mont Royal).\r\n\r\n\r\nVon der ursprünglichen Kreuzritterbefestigung sind nur noch wenige Überreste erhalten. Obwohl es nie vollständig ausgegraben wurde, ist bekannt, dass es eine Reihe von drei Wänden gab, die teilweise erhalten sind. Die bedeutendsten Überreste der Kreuzritterabschnitte der Kreuzritterburg sind die Überreste einer Ringmauer, die innerhalb der späteren muslimischen Anbauten und zwei Kapellen verlief.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;tw-ta-container tw-nfl&quot; id=&quot;z6maec&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-placeholder tw-text-small tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-rmn&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/800px-Montreal_Castle_Visitor_center.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d5779.69196469746!2d35.55591747806706!3d30.531629823334526!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503dfdeae5e6ee9:0x955a7c3f09c03796!2sShobak Castle - Montreal!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573740239429!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1543, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'montreal-burg'),
(1570, 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', 'Qasr Al-Kharanah', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;Übersetzung&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Qasr Al-Kharanah ist eine der bekanntesten Wüstenburgen im heutigen Ostjordanland, etwa 60 Kilometer östlich von Amman und relativ nahe der Grenze zu Saudi-Arabien. Es wird vermutet, dass es vor dem frühen 8. Jahrhundert n. Chr. Erbaut wurde, basierend auf einer Malerei in einem der oberen Räume, trotz sichtbarer sassanidischer Einflüsse. Möglicherweise gab es ein griechisches oder byzantinisches Haus auf dem Gelände. Es ist eines der frühesten Beispiele islamischer Architektur in der Region.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEs ist sehr gut erhalten, da es direkt an einer großen Autobahn liegt und nur eine kurze Autofahrt von Amman entfernt ist. Es ist zu einem der meistbesuchten Wüstenschlösser geworden.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDie Burg liegt südlich des Highway 40, einer wichtigen Wüstenstraße, die Amman mit Azraq, der saudi-arabischen Grenze und abgelegenen Gebieten im Osten Jordaniens und des Irak verbindet. Es befindet sich auf einer leichten Anhöhe, nur 15 Meter über der umgebenden Wüste.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Qasr_Kharana_in_Jordan.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3393.523797847304!2d36.46069021454189!3d31.72890078130113!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b249e0321d58d:0xae2394f52625c2b!2sQasr al-Kharaneh!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573737457143!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1538, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'qasr-al-kharanah'),
(1571, 'Lot´s Höhle', 'Lot´s Höhle', 'Lot´s Höhle', 'Lot´s Höhle', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;Übersetzung&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Im Süden des Toten Meeres und in der Nähe der Stadt Safi befindet sich ein steiler Hang, an dem sich ein Kloster, eine byzantinische Basilika aus dem 7. Jahrhundert n. Chr., ein Stausee und einige Mosaike sowie die Lot-Höhle befinden.\r\n\r\n\r\nÜberreste aus der Höhle stammen aus der frühen Bronzezeit (3300-2000 v. Chr.) und eine Inschrift in der Höhle erwähnt Lot mit Namen.\r\n\r\n\r\nLot, der Bruder Abrahams, floh mit seiner Frau und seinen Töchtern vor der Sünde Sodoms. Trotz einer Warnung blickte seine Frau auf die Stadt zurück und verwandelte sich in eine Salzsäule (Genesis 19: 1-26). Heute trägt der seltsam geformte Felsen am Hang über dem Toten Meer den Namen &quot;Lots Ehefrau&quot;.<br><br>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/lotsCave-1.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d4834.194547909319!2d35.501409864684625!3d31.04597675930109!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1503a3a06035257b:0x4a4d7bd7cdd7141f!2sLot&#039;s Cave!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573733393148!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1533, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'lots-hoehle'),
(1572, 'King Hussein Bin Talal Moschee', 'King Hussein Bin Talal Moschee', 'King Hussein Bin Talal Moschee', 'King Hussein Bin Talal Moschee', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;Übersetzung&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Die King Hussein Bin Talal Moschee, besser bekannt als die King Hussein Moschee, ist die größte Moschee in Jordanien. Nicht zu verwechseln mit der Großen Al-Husseini-Moschee von 1924, auch bekannt als König-Hussein-Moschee, in der Innenstadt von Amman. \r\n\r\nDie König-Hussein-Moschee wurde im Jahr 2005 unter König Abdullah II. in West Amman gebaut, und zwar in den öffentlichen Parks von Al Hussein in der Straße King Abdullah II in der Nähe des King Hussein Medical Centers. Die Moschee befindet sich auf einer Höhe von 1.013 Metern über dem Meeresspiegel und ist daher von den meisten Teilen von Amman aus zu sehen. Es ist quadratisch und verfügt über vier Minarette und Marmorböden. \r\n\r\nIm Jahr 2012 eröffnete König Abdullah das Museum des Propheten Muhammad, das eine Reihe von Reliquien beherbergt, die mit dem Propheten in Verbindung stehen.<br><br>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-King_Hussein_Mosque_(Amman)_at_night.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.0842433839216!2d35.82072571454997!3d31.98573168121816!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca228d105489f:0x2228c0c01f0bf7fa!2sKing Hussein Mosque!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573644095546!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1528, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'king-hussein-bin-talal-moschee'),
(1573, 'Ovales Forum', 'Ovales Forum', 'Ovales Forum', 'Ovales Forum', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;Übersetzung&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Der 90 x 80 m große Platz ist von einem breiten Bürgersteig und einer Kolonnade aus ionischen Säulen aus dem 1. Jahrhundert nach Christus umgeben, die sich in Jerash befinden. Es gibt zwei Altäre in der Mitte und ein Brunnen wurde im 7. Jahrhundert n. Chr. hinzugefügt. Diese quadratische Struktur stützt jetzt eine zentrale Säule, die vor kurzem errichtet wurde, um die Jerash Festival-Flamme zu tragen.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nZusätzlich zu seiner Standardfunktion als Marktplatz war ein Forum ein Treffpunkt von großer gesellschaftlicher Bedeutung und oft Schauplatz vielfältiger Aktivitäten, einschließlich politischer Diskussionen und Debatten, Terminen und Treffen. In diesem Fall ergänzte es die Funktion eines Conciliabulums oder eines Versammlungsortes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/Oval forum.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3373.274364476112!2d35.88860441467668!3d32.277600716589504!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c8049828c3329:0x3dc1d9cc8c83e18b!2sOval Plaza!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573639165853!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1523, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'ovales-forum'),
(1574, 'Ummayyaden Palast', 'Ummayyaden Palast', 'Ummayyaden Palast', 'Ummayyaden Palast', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;tw-ta-container tw-nfl&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text-container&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;Übersetzung&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Der Umayyaden-Palast ist ein großer Palastkomplex aus der Umayyaden-Zeit auf dem Zitadellenhügel von Amman, Jordanien. Es wurde in der ersten Hälfte des 8. Jahrhunderts erbaut und ist heute größtenteils zerstört. Die restaurierte gewölbte Eingangskammer wird als &quot;Kiosk&quot; oder &quot;monumentales Tor&quot; bezeichnet.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEin Teil des Palastes wurde über bereits bestehenden römischen Bauten errichtet und eine ganze römische Kolonnadenstraße wurde in den Palast integriert. Erbaut um 730, als Amman eine Provinzhauptstadt war, verband der Komplex wahrscheinlich die Wohnviertel des Gouverneurs von Amman mit Verwaltungsbüros.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEs wurde noch während der Zeit der islamischen Abbasiden (750–969) und Fatimiden (969–1179) genutzt, obwohl ein Großteil des brandneuen Palastes nach einem verheerenden Erdbeben im Jahr 749 nie wieder aufgebaut wurde.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;tw-ta-container tw-nfl&quot; id=&quot;z6maec&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-placeholder tw-text-small tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-rmn&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/more places/1024px-Umayyad_Palace020.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.2027734119165!2d35.93198841466825!3d31.955395232729813!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f968d005511:0x961d62514c3119b!2sUmayyad Monumental Gateway!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573569271136!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1518, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'ummayyaden-palast'),
(1575, 'Firmenprofil', 'Firmenprofil', 'Firmenprofil', 'Firmenprofil', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Wir sind &lt;strong&gt;PV Travels&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;ein arabischer Reiseveranstalter, der erste echte Nahostreisedienst. Unser führendes Tour- und Reisebüro wurde 2011 in Jordanien gegründet und verfügt über umfangreiche Verbindungen in der gesamten Region. PV Travels freut sich auf die Gelegenheit, als Ihr Buchungsagent für Ihre Reisebedürfnisse zu arbeiten.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Geschäftsführer<br>&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Khaled Nawafleh ist seit 2011 &lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Gründer und Geschäftsführer von PV Travels. Er verfügt über mehr als 20 Jahre Erfahrung in der Tourismusbranche. Er wurde in Jordanien, Großbritannien und Frankreich ausgebildet. Er ist in die Planung und Vermarktung des Geschäfts involviert. Außerdem ist er mit der täglichen Geschäftsführung des Unternehmens befasst, kümmert sich um Kundenanfragen und ist bestrebt, deren Erwartungen zu erfüllen. Herr Khaled spricht fließend Arabisch, Englisch und Französisch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Unser Hauptziel &lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;ist es, als Ihr persönlicher Experte für Ihre Urlaubsplanung mit unserer Erfahrung in maßgeschneiderten Reiserouten aufzutreten. Wir kümmern uns um alle Aspekte Ihrer Reise, von individuellen Routen über Unterkünfte bis hin zu Reiseleitern und Aktivitäten. Unsere Programmkategorien decken alle Arten von Reisenden ab, ob Sie ein Öko-Trekker, ein spiritueller Sucher, ein Business-Profi oder einfach nur auf der Suche nach neuen Abenteuern in diesem Land der Schätze im Haschemitischen Königreich Jordanien sind. Mit unserer umfassenden Expertise können wir all Ihren individuellen Anforderungen gerecht werden .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professionalität und Erfahrung &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Aufgrund &lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;unserer 8-jährigen Erfahrung bei der Organisation von Touren in Jordanien und im Oman sind wir stolz auf unsere Tradition der maßgeschneiderten Betreuung unserer Kunden. Weil uns unser Ruf für Spitzenleistungen am Herzen liegt, ist uns jeder unserer Gäste wichtig. Wir konzentrieren uns auf Details, damit Sie die Erfahrung, mit uns zu reisen, nie vergessen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mehr Wert für Ihr Geld &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Seit 2011 bietet PV Travels seinen Kunden die beste Servicequalität und wettbewerbsfähige Preise. Als ein lokales jordanisches Großhandelsreisebüro unterhalten wir aufgrund des Umfangs unseres Geschäfts günstige Preise mit jordanischen Hotels und Dienstleistern. Diese Einsparungen werden an alle unsere Kunden weitergegeben.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;Übersetzung&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Wenn Sie Fragen haben, senden Sie uns bitte eine E-Mail an &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@pvt.jo&quot;&gt;info@pvt.jo&lt;/a&gt; und wir helfen Ihnen jederzeit gerne weiter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3443.900791644019!2d35.470754314626895!3d30.325339612204143!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x1501692d6e66afc9:0x422d1d1f4408faef!2sPv Travels!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1573562504645!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1513, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'firmen-profil'),
(1577, 'Upcoming Events in Jordan (test)', 'Events Jordan', '', '', '&lt;div data-tockify-component=&quot;calendar&quot; data-tockify-calendar=&quot;angela.callis.lewis&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;script data-cfasync=&quot;false&quot; data-tockify-script=&quot;embed&quot; src=&quot;https://public.tockify.com/browser/embed.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;', 0, 1577, 'en', '', 'one col', 'events-and-etc.'),
(1578, 'Jordanischer Dinar', 'Jordanischer Dinar', 'Jordanischer Dinar', 'Jordanischer Dinar', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Der &lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Jordanische Dinar, abgekürzt als JD, ist seit 1950 die jordanische Währung. Der jordanische Dinar wird neben dem israelischen Schekel im Westjordanland auch häufig verwendet. Der Dinar ist in 10 Dirham, 100 Qirsh, auch Piaster oder 1000 Fulus genannt, unterteilt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;1949 gab die Regierung Banknoten in Stückelungen von 1⁄2, 1, 5, 10 und 50 Dinar aus. Ab 1959 übernahm die Central Bank of Jordan die Notenproduktion. 1977 wurden 20 Dinar-Banknoten eingeführt, 1999 folgten 50 Dinar. 1999 wurden 1⁄2 Dinar-Banknoten durch Münzen ersetzt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Der Dinar ist sehr stark, nicht aufgrund einer starken Volkswirtschaft oder eines großen Exportvolumens, sondern weil er seit 20 Jahren an den US-Dollar gebunden ist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Der in Dollar festgelegte Dinar diente der jordanischen Wirtschaft gut. Es hat Währungsstabilität erreicht, das Vertrauen der Öffentlichkeit gestärkt, arabische und ausländische Investitionen angezogen und war in jeder Hinsicht eine erfolgreiche Politik.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Vor Reiseantritt empfehlen wir Ihnen, den &lt;a href=&quot;en/currency-converter/&quot;&gt;currency converter&lt;/a&gt; zu überprüfen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/jordanian-dinar.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1508, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'jordanischer-dinar'),
(1579, 'Währungsrechner', 'Währungsrechner', 'Währungsrechner', 'Währungsrechner', '&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Der Jordanische Dinar ist die Währung von Jordanien. Der Währungscode ist JOD. Nachfolgend finden Sie einen Währungsrechner.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;tw-ta-container tw-nfl&quot; id=&quot;z6maec&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;pre class=&quot;tw-data-placeholder tw-text-small tw-ta&quot; data-placeholder=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;tw-target-rmn&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;width: 474px; background-color: #fff; border: 2px solid #888; text-align: center; padding: 0px; margin: 0px auto;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding: 3px 0px 2px 0px; text-align: center; background-color: #ccc; border: 1px solid #888; width: 472;&quot;&gt;&lt;a title=&quot;Currency Converter&quot; class=&quot;HSlabel&quot; style=&quot;text-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://fx-rate.net/calculator/&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Currency Converter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;script type=&quot;text/javascript&quot; src=&quot;https://fx-rate.net/converter.php?size=short&amp;amp;layout=horizontal&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/Amman/currencies.jpg&quot; width=&quot;900&quot; height=&quot;239&quot; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1503, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'waehrungsrechner'),
(1580, 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', 'Ryanair', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ryanair ist eine irische Billigfluggesellschaft, die 1984 gegründet wurde und ihren Hauptsitz in Swords, Dublin, Irland, hat. Die wichtigsten operativen Stützpunkte befinden sich auf den Flughäfen Dublin und London Stansted. Es bildet den größten Teil der Ryanair Holdings-Fluglinienfamilie und hat Ryanair UK, Ryanair Sun, Malta Air und Lauda als Partnerfluggesellschaften.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Die Fluggesellschaft zeichnete sich durch ihre rasche Expansion aus, die auf die Liberalisierung der Luftfahrtindustrie in Europa im Jahr 1997 und den Erfolg ihres kostengünstigen Geschäftsmodells zurückzuführen ist. Das Streckennetz von Ryanair bedient 38 Länder in Europa, Nordafrika (Marokko) und dem Nahen Osten (Israel, Libanon und Jordanien).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Der größte Wettbewerber von Ryanair ist EasyJet, der sich stärker auf größere oder wichtigste Flughäfen wie Amsterdam und Paris-Charles de Gaulle konzentriert und sich vor allem an Geschäftsreisende richtet. Ryanair bedient auch Sonnen- und Stranddestinationen, unter anderem mit Stützpunkten auf den Kanarischen Inseln, Zypern, den griechischen Inseln und Malta.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Für Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, Tarifen, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abfahrtszeiten, verlorenem oder beschädigtem Gepäck, Online-Buchungsunterstützung und allgemeinen Anfragen rufen Sie bitte + 44 871 500 5050 an.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/ryanair.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1483, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'ryanair'),
(1581, 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', 'Royal Air Maroc', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Royal Air Maroc, besser bekannt als RAM, ist die marokkanische nationale Fluggesellschaft sowie die größte Fluggesellschaft des Landes. RAM ist zu 100% im Besitz der marokkanischen Regierung und hat seinen Hauptsitz auf dem Gelände des Flughafens Casablanca-Anfa.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Die Fluggesellschaft betreibt ein Inlandsnetz in Marokko, Linienflüge nach Afrika, Asien, Europa sowie nach Nord- und Südamerika sowie gelegentliche Charterflüge, die Hadsch-Dienste umfassen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Magic Universe ist ein On-Board-Service für Kinder von 0-12 Jahren. Royal Air Maroc hat für jedes Alter an alles gedacht, um Ihre Kinder bei Laune zu halten. Spielzeug und Spiele helfen Ihren Kindern, sich während des Fluges zu entspannen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Für Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, bei Tarifen, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abflugzeiten, verlorenem oder beschädigtem Gepäck, Online-Buchungsunterstützung und allgemeinen Anfragen rufen Sie bitte 00 212 5224-89797 an.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/royalmaroc.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1478, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'royal-air-maroc'),
(1582, 'Pegasus Fluggesellschaft', 'Pegasus Fluggesellschaft', 'Pegasus Fluggesellschaft', 'Pegasus Fluggesellschaft', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pegasus Airlines ist eine türkische Billigfluggesellschaft mit Hauptsitz in der Region Kurtköy in Pendik, Istanbul, die an mehreren türkischen Flughäfen stationiert ist. Diese Fluggesellschaft betreibt eine Ein-Klassen-Innenausstattung für alle ihre Flugzeuge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Allen Passagieren steht ein &quot;Flying Cafe&quot; zur Verfügung, in dem Speisen und Getränke gegen Aufpreis angeboten werden. Pegasus erwägt auch die Installation von In-Flight-Entertainment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pegasus Airlines wurde bei den European Business Awards 2019, einem der größten und renommiertesten Business-Wettbewerbe der Welt, zum „Nationalen Gewinner“ gekürt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Für Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, bei Tarifen, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abfahrtszeiten, verlorenem oder beschädigtem Gepäck, Online-Buchungsunterstützung und allgemeinen Anfragen rufen Sie bitte 00 90 850 250 6777 an.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Pegasus_Airlines.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1473, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'pegasus-fluggesellschaft');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1583, 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', 'Emirates', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Die Fluggesellschaft Emirates hat ihren Sitz in Garhoud, Dubai, Vereinigte Arabische Emirate. Die Fluggesellschaft ist eine Tochtergesellschaft der Emirates Group. Es ist die größte Fluggesellschaft im Nahen Osten und fliegt mehr als 3.600 Mal pro Woche von ihrem Drehkreuz am Flughafen Dubai in mehr als 150 Städte in 80 Ländern auf sechs Kontinenten.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Die Fluggesellschaft behauptet, aufgrund ihrer Flotte, die einen durchschnittlichen Treibstoffverbrauch von weniger als vier Litern pro 100 Passagierkilometer aufweist, geringere Emissionen als andere Fluggesellschaften zu haben.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Catering auf Emirates-Flügen von Dubai International wird von Emirates Flight Catering angeboten, das eine der größten Catering-Einrichtungen für Fluggesellschaften der Welt betreibt. Alle Flugzeuge verfügen über ein persönliches In-Flight-Entertainment-System (IFE) für Emirates-Flugzeuge. Emirates bietet zwei Arten von Unterhaltungssystemen an: ICE und ICE Digital Widescreen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Für Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, Tarifen, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abfahrtszeiten, verlorenem oder beschädigtem Gepäck, Online-Buchungsunterstützung und allgemeinen Anfragen wenden Sie sich bitte an +962 6 461 5222.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/tr25-July-Emirates.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1468, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'emirates'),
(1584, 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', 'Air France', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Air France ist die französische Fluggesellschaft mit Sitz in Tremblay-en-France. Es ist eine Tochtergesellschaft der Air France-KLM-Gruppe und Gründungsmitglied der SkyTeam Global Airline Alliance. Bedient 36 Ziele in Frankreich und betreibt weltweite Passagier- und Frachtdienste zu 168 Zielen in 78 Ländern.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Air France bietet Audio Video on Demand (AVOD) in allen Kabinen aller Langstreckenflugzeuge an. Das Bordunterhaltungssystem bietet mehrere Kanäle für Video, Audio, Musik und Spiele. Air France Magazine, die Bordzeitschrift der Fluggesellschaft, ist an jedem Sitzplatz enthalten, und Air France Madame, ein Luxusmagazin für Mode mit weiblicher Perspektive, ist in den Kabinen und Lounges von La Première und Business enthalten.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flying Blue, das Vielfliegerprogramm von Air France-KLM, vergibt Mitgliederpunkte basierend auf zurückgelegten Kilometern und Serviceklasse. Die Mitgliedschaft im Programm ist kostenlos. Das Programm ist in Standard (Explorer), Elite (Silber) und Elite Plus (Gold und Platin) Status unterteilt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Wenn Sie Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, Tarife, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abfahrtszeiten, verlorene oder beschädigte Gepäckstücke, Online-Reservierung Unterstützung und allgemeine Anfragen rufen Sie bitte 00 33 9 69 39 36 54 an.<br>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Air-France.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1463, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'air-france'),
(1585, 'Upcoming Events in Jordan', 'Upcoming Events in Jordan', 'Upcoming events in Jordan', 'Upcoming events in Jordan', '&lt;div class=&quot;row &quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/taj market pvt amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Christmas at Taj!&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Christmas @Taj!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Now - Wed 8th Jan 2020 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Come and enjoy the Christmas Bazar, parades, Carol shows, weekly giveaways, upside- down room and much more at the Taj Mall this Christmas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;christmas-at-taj&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/Boulevard Christmas pvt Amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Christmas at the Boulevard &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Christmas @the Boulevard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Now - Tue 31st December<br>&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Once again this year the Boulevard is beautifully decorated bringing us the Christmas spirit that we have been waiting for all year. They will be... &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;christmas-at-the-boulevard&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/white december meca mall amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;White December&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;<br>\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;White December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Now - Tue 31st December<br>&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Where else could you possibly do your Christmas shopping better than at the Mecca Mall? Come and have a fascinating start of the Christmas holiday, you will find all types of activities for the littlies and the not so young ones: Santa and his Reindeer will be waiting to receive you with open arms, there will be a wide range of stalls and homemade stew to warm you up!&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;white-december-at-mecca-mall&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/Christmas HOrse riding camp pvt Amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Christmas Horse Riding Camp &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Christmas Horse Riding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mon 23rd - Wed 26th&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Come and join some fun family time at Forest Hill Equestrian Center! Ages from 3-16 parents are welcomed. For further info and reservations please call 0795730333.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;christmas-horse-riding-camp&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/Christmas party Sheraton pvt Amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Grand Christmas Party&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Grand Christmas Party&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wed 25th Dec 8:30pm - 2am&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Jeed Ayoub Live at the Sheraton Hotel Last day for buying tickets 23-12For booking and more information: 0795367174&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;grand-christmas-party&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/Farmers market shams el balad pvt Amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Winter Farmers Market&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Winter Farmers Market&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sat 28th Dec 10am - 4pm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Every Saturday of this month Shams al Balad is organizing a Farmers market in collaboration with Mujeb Organic Farm. They will be selling beautiful handmade Christmas ornaments and organic products for you to cook the most delicious meals during these festive days!&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;winter-farmers-market--28th-december&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/park mondays.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;King Hussein park Run &quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;King Hussein Park Run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mon 30th Dec 7pm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Located on the lively and vibrant Rainbow street Al-Quds restaurant is known to serve the best falafel in Amman. Many locals and toursists...&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;myriam-fares-nye&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/Myriam Fares pvt Amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Myriam Fares NYE&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Myriam Fares NYE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tue 31st Dec 9pm <br>&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Come and celebrate New Year&#039;s Eve with the Lebanese Queen of stage Myriam Fares! Don&#039;t miss out!! She will be singing live at the Sheraton Hotel.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;habibah-sweets&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/pizza roma cafe pvt Amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;NYE on a budget&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;NYE on a budget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tue 31st Dec - Wed 1st Jan 1am&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Live Music @Pizza Roma Café 15JD with glass of wine/beer included booking must be confirmed and paid by 31/12 MIDDAY Jafar 079 7799 749&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;nye-on-a-budget&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/ragheb alama pvt Amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Ragheb Alama&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Ragheb Alama NYE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tue 31st Dec 6:30pm - Jan 1:30am&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;New Year&#039;s Eve Party with Ragheb Alama at the Grand Hyatt For tickets &amp;amp; more information: 0775655575&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;ragheb-alama-nye&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-4 bd-3  d-pad&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;white shadow-box&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/Al-Saqqar &amp;amp; Jaber Alamat pvt Amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Al-Saqqar &amp;amp; Jaber Alamat NYE&quot; class=&quot;full-width&quot; width=&quot;281&quot; height=&quot;186&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;orange-text &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Al-Saqqar &amp;amp; Jaber Alamat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tue 31st Dec 8:30pm - Jan 2am&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-justify h-pad d-pad-l d-pad-r&quot; data-truncate=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Tickets: Platinum JOD 70.00 inclusive Gold JOD 60.00 inclusive Reresrvation and info: 065004500 - 0798600565&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;align-center pad&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;issa-al-saqqar-amp-dj-jaber-alamat&quot; class=&quot;btn orange h-pad&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1585, 'en', '', 'one col', 'upcoming-events-in-jordan'),
(1586, 'Christmas at Taj!', 'Christmas at Taj!', '', '', '&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Now - Wed 8th Jan 2020&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/taj Christmas market pvt Amman.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Christmas at Taj&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.7264441501216!2d35.885771315482565!3d31.94118353343672!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca0ebe1f2a9e3:0xa0f1cb0956ab7d75!2sTaj LifeStyle Center!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ses!4v1576846358259!5m2!1sen!2ses&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1586, 'en', '', 'one col', 'christmas-at-taj'),
(1587, 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', 'Qatar Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Qatar Airways ist die staatliche Fluggesellschaft von Katar. Die Fluggesellschaft betreibt ein Hub-and-Spoke-Netzwerk, das über 150 internationale Ziele in Afrika, Zentralasien, Europa, Fernost, Südasien, dem Nahen Osten, Nordamerika, Südamerika und Ozeanien verbindet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Diese Fluggesellschaft hat eine Flotte von mehr als 200 Flugzeugen. Die Qatar Airways Group beschäftigt mehr als 43.000 Mitarbeiter. Die Fluggesellschaft ist seit Oktober 2013 Mitglied der Oneworld-Allianz, der ersten Golf-Fluggesellschaft, die eine der drei Airline-Allianzen unterzeichnet hat.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Das Bordunterhaltungssystem von Qatar Airways heißt Oryx One. Mit Ausnahme einiger Flugzeuge der Airbus A320-Familie verfügen alle Flugzeuge über persönliche Info-Bildschirme zum Zurücklehnen. Einige Flugzeuge der Airbus A320-Familie sind mit einem Hauptbildschirm ausgestattet. Katar rüstet Flugzeuge der Airbus A320-Familie auf Rückenlehnen-AVOD um. Qatar Airways bietet auch Wi-Fi-Konnektivität an Bord, mit der Passagiere SMS und MMS senden, auf E-Mails zugreifen und im Internet surfen können.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Für Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, Tarifen, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abfahrtszeiten, verlorenem oder beschädigtem Gepäck, Online-Buchungsunterstützung und allgemeinen Anfragen rufen Sie bitte 00 974 4022 6000 an.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/qatar.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1458, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'qatar-airways'),
(1588, 'Christmas at the Boulevard', 'Christmas at the Boulevard', '', '', '&lt;div cla=&quot;&quot; div=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Mon 16th Dec - Tue 31st&lt;/strong&gt;<br>&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Once again this year the Boulevard is beautifully decorated bringing us the Christmas spirit that we have been waiting for all year. They will be hosting activities for all ages. Make sure you don’t miss out on it! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Sunday to Wednesday 5 PM -11 PM &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Thursday to Saturday 4 PM -12 AM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;<br> &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/Boulevard Christmas pvt Amman.jpg&quot; width=&quot;442&quot; height=&quot;296&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.8657965039447!2d35.90305481548308!3d31.964537332272037!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca06e1969884d:0xbaf0e790ffe8b689!2sThe Boulevard!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ses!4v1576849665085!5m2!1sen!2ses&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1588, 'en', '', 'one col', 'christmas-at-the-boulevard'),
(1589, 'White December at Mecca Mall', 'White December at Mecca Mall', '', '', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thu 19th Dec - Tue 31st&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Where else could you possibly do your Christmas shopping better than at Mecca Mall? Come and have a fascinating start of the Christmas holiday, you will find all types of activities for the littlies and the not so young ones: Santa and his Reindeer will be waiting to receive you with open arms, there will be a wide range of stalls and homemade stew to warm you up!&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;For reservations and inquiries : 0790777351&lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt; <br>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/white december meca mall amman.jpg&quot; width=&quot;443&quot; height=&quot;273&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.385862741296!2d35.84144411548337!3d31.97755378162261!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca19bc3e1d1ed:0xc7b138ad3619f9b8!2sShawarmaati!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ses!4v1576846891417!5m2!1sen!2ses&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1589, 'en', '', 'one col', 'white-december-at-mecca-mall'),
(1590, 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', 'Lufthansa', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa &lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;(manchmal auch als Lufthansa German Airlines bezeichnet) ist die nationale Fluggesellschaft und größte deutsche Fluggesellschaft, die zusammen mit ihren Tochtergesellschaften die größte Fluggesellschaft in Europa im Hinblick auf beförderte Passagiere ist.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lufthansa &lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;ist eines der fünf Gründungsmitglieder der 1997 gegründeten Star Alliance, der weltweit größten Airline-Allianz. Insgesamt verfügt die Gruppe über 700 Flugzeuge und ist damit eine der größten Airline-Flotten der Welt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Das Vielfliegerprogramm der Lufthansa heißt Miles &amp;amp; More und wird von mehreren europäischen Fluggesellschaften gemeinsam genutzt, darunter auch alle Lufthansa-Tochtergesellschaften. Miles &amp;amp; More-Mitglieder können Meilen auf Lufthansa Flügen und Star Alliance Partnerflügen sowie über Lufthansa Kreditkarten und Einkäufe in den Lufthansa Shops sammeln.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Für Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, Tarifen, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abfahrtszeiten, verlorenem oder beschädigtem Gepäck, Online-Buchungsunterstützung und allgemeinen Anfragen wenden Sie sich bitte an +49 (0) 800 - 83 84 267.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Lufthansa.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1453, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'lufthansa'),
(1591, 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', 'Alitalia', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Alitalia - Società Aerea Italiana (Alitalia - Italienische Fluggesellschaft), die als Alitalia operiert, ist die nationale Fluggesellschaft von Italien. Alitalia ist seit 2009 Mitglied der SkyTeam-Allianz. Alitalia-LAI ist ursprünglich im Jahr 2001 beigetreten.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Seitdem hat Alitalia Codesharing-Vereinbarungen mit SkyTeam-Mitgliedern geschlossen, die es Passagieren ermöglichen, mit einem einzigen Alitalia-Ticket zahlreiche Ziele (mit einigen oder allen Segmenten, die von anderen Fluggesellschaften als Alitalia betrieben werden) zu erreichen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Das Vielfliegerprogramm der Fluggesellschaft heißt &quot;MilleMiglia&quot; (tausend Meilen) und ist Teil des SkyTeam-Allianzprogramms, mit dem Passagiere Meilen sammeln und diese mit Freikarten für die gesamte Allianz einlösen können.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Für Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, Tarifen, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abfahrtszeiten, verlorenem oder beschädigtem Gepäck, Online-Buchungsunterstützung und allgemeinen Anfragen rufen Sie bitte 00 39 06 65649 an.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/alitalia.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1448, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'alitalia'),
(1592, 'Winter Farmers Market', 'Winter Farmers Market', '', '', '&lt;div cla=&quot;&quot; div=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Sat 21st Dec 10:00am - 4:00pm&lt;/strong&gt;<br>&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Every Saturday of this month Shams al Balad is organizing a Farmers market in collaboration with Mujeb Organic Farm. They will be selling beautiful handmade Christmas ornaments and organic products for you to cook the most delicious meals during these festive days! Moreover, you won’t leave with an empty belly there will be mulled wine, mouth-watering seasonal soups, fresh juices and coffee!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;And if you come along with the littlies of the family they will have plenty of fun too, there will be kid’s activities throughout the day as well as food related talks for the elder ones. &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;<br> &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/Farmers market shams el balad pvt Amman.jpg&quot; width=&quot;448&quot; height=&quot;252&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.37072285307!2d35.9249020154828!3d31.95083793295527!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151b5f9b233d8d97:0x9926edf16bfbf80b!2sShams AlBalad!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ses!4v1576847244722!5m2!1sen!2ses&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 0, 1592, 'en', '', 'one col', 'winter-farmers-market'),
(1593, 'Oriental Dance Class', 'Oriental Dance Class', '', '', '&lt;div cla=&quot;&quot; div=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Sat 21st Dec 7pm - 8pm&lt;/strong&gt;<br>&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Roberto Dance Academy wants to celebrate this Christmas with you. Once again they are offering FREE dance lessons to women of all ages and abilities! Come and meet some lovely people and have a joyful start of Christmas! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;<br> &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/oriental belly dance pvt Amman.jpg&quot; width=&quot;444&quot; height=&quot;233&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3385.1624937608385!2d35.853425815482936!3d31.95648813267364!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca111f6ea355f:0x45f316730182c2d!2sRoberto Dance Academy!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ses!4v1576847572793!5m2!1sen!2ses&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 0, 1593, 'en', '', 'one col', 'oriental-dance-class'),
(1594, 'The Nutcracker Ballet', 'The Nutcracker Ballet', '', '', '&lt;div cla=&quot;&quot; div=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Sat 21st Dec 6pm&lt;/strong&gt;<br>&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Hosted by: The National Centre for Culture and Arts - King Hussein Foundation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Tickets: Mlabbas, Sajilni , The Outfit, NCCA Bookings &amp;amp; Info - Faisal Al-Mamun at 06-56 90 292 or 079 834 7472 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Coreographed by: Rania Kamhawi &amp;amp; Svetlana Tahboub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Performed by: MISK Dance Company and students of the Dance Department &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;<br> &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/Nutcracker ballet pvt Amman.jpg&quot; width=&quot;444&quot; height=&quot;234&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3384.3868160381658!2d35.90224411548339!3d31.977527931623822!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca01912f0c6c1:0x716e9d90e016781e!2sRoyal Cultural Center!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ses!4v1576847998985!5m2!1sen!2ses&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 0, 1594, 'en', '', 'one col', 'the-nutcracker-ballet'),
(1595, 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', 'British Airways', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;British Airways &lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;ist die nationale Fluggesellschaft des Vereinigten Königreichs mit Hauptsitz in Waterside, Harmondsworth, in der Nähe ihres Hauptflughafens am Flughafen London Heathrow. Es ist die zweitgrößte Fluggesellschaft im Vereinigten Königreich, gemessen an der Flottengröße und den beförderten Passagieren, nach EasyJet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Das abgestufte Treueprogramm von British Airways, der Executive Club, umfasst den Zugang zu speziellen Lounges und speziellen &quot;schnellen&quot; Warteschlangen. BA lädt auch seine Top-Unternehmenskonten ein, an einem &quot;Premier&quot; Anreizprogramm teilzunehmen. British Airways betreibt Airside-Lounges für Passagiere, die in Premium-Kabinen reisen. Diese stehen bestimmten Gruppen von Executive Club-Mitgliedern zur Verfügung.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Passagiere der First Class sowie Mitglieder des Gold Executive Club sind berechtigt, die First Class Lounges zu nutzen. Business Class Passagiere (in BA Richtlinien Club World oder Club Europe genannt) sowie Silver Executive Club Mitglieder können Business Lounges nutzen. Auf Flughäfen, auf denen BA keine Abfluglounge betreibt, wird häufig eine Drittanbieterlounge für Premium- oder Statuspassagiere bereitgestellt. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Für Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, Tarifen, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abfahrtszeiten, verlorenem oder beschädigtem Gepäck, Online-Buchungsunterstützung und allgemeinen Anfragen rufen Sie bitte 0344 493 0787 an.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/british.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1443, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'british-airways'),
(1596, 'Christmas Horse Riding Camp', 'Christmas Horse Riding Camp', '', '', '&lt;div cla=&quot;&quot; div=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Mon 23rd - Wed 26th&lt;/strong&gt;<br>&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Come and join some fun family time at Forest Hill Equestrian Center!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Ages from 3-16 parents are welcomed. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;For further info and reservations please call 0795730333.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/Christmas HOrse riding camp.jpg&quot; width=&quot;334&quot; height=&quot;445&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;90%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3377.6675144407996!2d35.86247431548647!3d32.159270022531835!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151c9cd3a66aa887:0xb691c2f521cdc5b1!2sForest Hill Equestrian Center Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ses!4v1576848835579!5m2!1sen!2ses&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 1, 1596, 'en', '', 'one col', 'christmas-horse-riding-camp');
INSERT INTO `en33_pages` (`id`, `name`, `title`, `meta_desc`, `meta_key`, `contents`, `published`, `lang_id`, `lang`, `icon`, `layout`, `url`) VALUES
(1597, 'King Hussein Park Run', 'King Hussein Park Run', '', '', '&lt;div cla=&quot;&quot; div=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Mon 23rd Dec 7pm&lt;/strong&gt;<br>&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Join the lovely King Hussein Park group for a lovely run in community! It’s a great opportunity to meet new people whilst keeping fit. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;They meet in front of Columbia University Middle East Research Center, Mohammad Al Said Al Batayneh, Amman, Muhammad As-Saeed Al-Batayni St., Amman, Jordania . &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Please make sure you read carefully their safety policies before you attend: &#039;DISCLAIMER AND SAFETY NOTICE: We’re a bunch of friends that enjoy running and meeting other runners. We take reasonable precautions to make sure our runs are safe by picking out quite neighborhoods, avoiding main/congested roads and junctions, and attempting to run against traffic whenever possible. That being said your own safety is your responsibility, and you run at your own risk. Before joining our runs please consider the following: 1. Assess your ability to endure physical excursion for 30 minutes - 1 hour. Our runs are usually at an easy pace and you&#039;ll generally be able to find someone to run with you if you run close to 10kph or faster. If we have sufficient runners we break into multiple pace groups We try to keep the loops short so that members can drop out whenever (or add as many) they want. Amman is hilly that makes it very difficult to avoid inclines. 2. Follow these tips to keep yourself safe and take all the necessary precautions you usually do when running by yourself, including but not limited to: - Wearing bright /reflective materials especially when running at night. - Looking both ways before crossing any street. - Not listening to loud music, or using noise cancelling headsets in order to hear oncoming traffic and/or instructions. - Carrying cash and ID incase you need to stop and buy some water, etc. - Brining a bottle of water and applying sunscreen especially for our morning runs - Downloading the course map to Strava in order to make sure you’re on the right path if you lag behind or need a break.&#039;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/events/events resized/park mondays.jpg&quot; width=&quot;422&quot; height=&quot;275&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;250&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3383.881652901556!2d35.826038315483466!3d31.991223530940292!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x151ca18a01a6daf9:0xd097c76691c4b055!2sColumbia Global Centers | Amman!5e0!3m2!1sen!2ses!4v1576849263588!5m2!1sen!2ses&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;', 0, 1597, 'en', '', 'one col', 'king-hussein-park-run'),
(1598, 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', 'Austrian Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Die Austrian Airlines AG ist die nationale Fluggesellschaft Österreichs und ein Tochterunternehmen der Lufthansa Group. Sie fliegt ab Juli 2016 sechs inländische und mehr als 120 internationale Ganzjahres- und Saisonziele in 55 Ländern an und ist Mitglied der Star Alliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Diese Fluggesellschaft bietet an Bord Services wie Mahlzeiten auf kurzen Strecken und Snacks an, von denen einige je nach Flugdauer hinzugefügt werden. Auf längeren Strecken bieten sie zwei Arten von Menüs mit verschiedenen Arten von Snacks und Getränken.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Darüber hinaus bieten sie im Rahmen der Unterhaltung an Bord Filme nur auf längeren Flügen an sowie Audiokanäle, Spiele und das Flugmagazin Skylines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Für Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, Tarifen, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abfahrtszeiten, verlorenem oder beschädigtem Gepäck, Online-Buchungsunterstützung und allgemeinen Anfragen wenden Sie sich bitte an +1 310 616 55 85.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/Austrian-new-logo-e1524235202848-916x515.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1438, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'austrian-airlines'),
(1599, 'Turkish Airlines', 'Turkish Airlines', 'Turkish Airlines', 'Turkish Airlines', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Turkish Airlines &lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;ist die nationale Fluggesellschaft der Türkei. Seit August 2019 bietet das Unternehmen Linienflüge zu 315 Zielen in Europa, Asien, Afrika und Amerika an. Damit ist es der größte Hauptfluganbieter der Welt, gemessen an der Anzahl der Passagierziele.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Die Fluggesellschaft fliegt mehr Ziele nonstop von einem einzigen Flughafen aus an als jede andere Fluggesellschaft der Welt und fliegt in 125 Läner, mehr als jede andere Fluggesellschaft. Mit einer operativen Flotte von 24 Frachtflugzeugen bedient die Frachtabteilung der Fluggesellschaft 82 Ziele.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Am 14. September 2018 unterzeichneten Turkish Airlines und Lega Basket Serie A, die führende professionelle Basketballliga in Italien, einen Sponsoringvertrag, der die Fluggesellschaft zu einem offiziellen Partner für die Saison 2018-19 der LBA macht.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Im August 2019 einigte sich Turkish Airlines mit dem Club Atlético River Plate darauf, der Hauptsponsor des argentinischen Sportclubs für die nächsten drei Spielzeiten zu werden.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Für Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, Tarifen, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abfahrtszeiten, verlorenem oder beschädigtem Gepäck, Online-Buchungsunterstützung und allgemeinen Anfragen rufen Sie bitte +1 800 874 88 75 an.<br>&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/turkishairlines2.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1429, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'turkish-airlines'),
(1600, 'Royal Jordanian', 'Royal Jordanian', 'Royal Jordanian', 'Royal Jordanian', '&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Royal Jordanian Airlines ist die nationale Fluggesellschaft von Jordanien mit Hauptsitz in Amman, Jordanien, die planmäßige internationale Flüge über vier Kontinente von ihrer Hauptbasis am Queen Alia International Airport aus durchführt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Royal Jordanian&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt; ist Mitglied der Arab Air Carriers Organization und der Oneworld Airline Alliance. Die Fluggesellschaft führt mehr als 500 Flüge pro Woche mit mindestens 110 täglichen Abflügen durch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Crown Class-Passagiere können Lounges auf der ganzen Welt nutzen, einschließlich aller Lounges der Oneworld-Mitgliedsfluggesellschaften. Seit August 2008 betreibt Royal Jordanian zwei Lounges: eine in Amman am Queen Alia International Airport und eine in Aqaba am King Hussein International Airport. Im August 2008 eröffnete Royal Jordanian seine neue Lounge, die über 340 Passagiere aufnehmen kann.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;de&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Für Hilfe bei Ihrer Reservierung, Tarifen, E-Ticketing, Ankunfts- und Abfahrtszeiten, verlorenem oder beschädigtem Gepäck, Online-Buchungsunterstützung und allgemeinen Anfragen rufen Sie bitte +962 651 00000 an.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;full-width&quot; src=&quot;uploads/filemanager/Photos/airlines/royal-jordanian-airlines-359182.jpg&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-12&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width=&quot;100%&quot; height=&quot;300&quot; style=&quot;border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3492247.663606793!2d34.87836949724749!3d31.265081424894323!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x15006f476664de99:0x8d285b0751264e99!2sJordan!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sjo!4v1572870339732!5m2!1sen!2sjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;allowfullscreen&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1424, 'ge', '', 'one col', 'royal-jordanian'),
(1601, 'Christmas Eve at Zorba', 'Christmas Eve at Zorba', '', '', '&lt;div cla=&quot;&quot; div=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Tue 24th Dec 9pm - 3am&lt;/strong&gt;<br>&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Line-up: Dj Besso &amp;amp; Percussionist Rami Haddad&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Tickets available at Zorba Pub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Early bird 10jd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;On doors 15jd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Tickets and Info: 0787472959&lt;/span&gt;<br>&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#039;Arial&#039;, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;font7&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;md-5 d-pad-t&quot;&gt;&