(131, 'a:5:{s:2:\"en\";s:939:\"Al Anbat Hotel and Restaurant is 3 star hotel located on the main street of Wadi Musa, on the hilltop overlooking the Petra mountain range. Free shuttle service is offered to and from the Visitor&#039;s Center and the hotel.\n\nEach private room has modern furnishings, a LCD TV, an air-conditioning unit, a mini-fridge, western facilities and complimentary toiletries. Every room offers free WiFi.\n\nGuests can enjoy the outdoor swimming pool. Turkish Bath can be enjoyed at an extra cost with service that include, steam room, Jacuzzi, and massages.\n\nOther facilities on site include the coffee shop, souvenir shop, and supermarket.\n\nTransfers can be arranged through the hotel at an extra cost. Additional services like tours, guides, and arrangements for continued travel after checking out of our hotel can also be arranged through the hotel. Free parking is available in front of the hotel for guests.\n\nWe speak your language!\";s:2:\"fr\";s:939:\"Al Anbat Hotel and Restaurant is 3 star hotel located on the main street of Wadi Musa, on the hilltop overlooking the Petra mountain range. Free shuttle service is offered to and from the Visitor&#039;s Center and the hotel.\n\nEach private room has modern furnishings, a LCD TV, an air-conditioning unit, a mini-fridge, western facilities and complimentary toiletries. Every room offers free WiFi.\n\nGuests can enjoy the outdoor swimming pool. Turkish Bath can be enjoyed at an extra cost with service that include, steam room, Jacuzzi, and massages.\n\nOther facilities on site include the coffee shop, souvenir shop, and supermarket.\n\nTransfers can be arranged through the hotel at an extra cost. Additional services like tours, guides, and arrangements for continued travel after checking out of our hotel can also be arranged through the hotel. Free parking is available in front of the hotel for guests.\n\nWe speak your language!\";s:2:\"it\";s:840:\"Situato sulla via principale di Wadi Musa, sulla collina che domina la catena montuosa di Petra, l&#039;albergo a 3 stelle Al Anbat Hotel &amp; Restaurant offre un servizio navetta gratuito da e per il centro visitatori.\n\nLe camere sono climatizzate e dotate di arredi moderni, una TV LCD, un mini frigorifero, un set di cortesia e la connessione WiFi gratuita.\n\nLa struttura vanta una piscina all&#039;aperto e, a pagamento, un bagno turco che include sala vapore, vasca idromassaggio e servizio massaggi.\n\nL&#039;hotel ospita anche una caffetteria, un negozio di souvenir e un supermercato.\n\nL&#039;Al Anbat Hotel &amp; Restaurant mette a vostra disposizione un servizio di trasferimenti a pagamento, un parcheggio gratuito di fronte all&#039;hotel e la possibilità di organizzare escursioni, visite guidate e altri spostamenti. \";s:2:\"es\";s:939:\"Al Anbat Hotel and Restaurant is 3 star hotel located on the main street of Wadi Musa, on the hilltop overlooking the Petra mountain range. Free shuttle service is offered to and from the Visitor&#039;s Center and the hotel.\n\nEach private room has modern furnishings, a LCD TV, an air-conditioning unit, a mini-fridge, western facilities and complimentary toiletries. Every room offers free WiFi.\n\nGuests can enjoy the outdoor swimming pool. Turkish Bath can be enjoyed at an extra cost with service that include, steam room, Jacuzzi, and massages.\n\nOther facilities on site include the coffee shop, souvenir shop, and supermarket.\n\nTransfers can be arranged through the hotel at an extra cost. Additional services like tours, guides, and arrangements for continued travel after checking out of our hotel can also be arranged through the hotel. Free parking is available in front of the hotel for guests.\n\nWe speak your language!\";s:2:\"Ar\";s:939:\"Al Anbat Hotel and Restaurant is 3 star hotel located on the main street of Wadi Musa, on the hilltop overlooking the Petra mountain range. Free shuttle service is offered to and from the Visitor&#039;s Center and the hotel.\n\nEach private room has modern furnishings, a LCD TV, an air-conditioning unit, a mini-fridge, western facilities and complimentary toiletries. Every room offers free WiFi.\n\nGuests can enjoy the outdoor swimming pool. Turkish Bath can be enjoyed at an extra cost with service that include, steam room, Jacuzzi, and massages.\n\nOther facilities on site include the coffee shop, souvenir shop, and supermarket.\n\nTransfers can be arranged through the hotel at an extra cost. Additional services like tours, guides, and arrangements for continued travel after checking out of our hotel can also be arranged through the hotel. Free parking is available in front of the hotel for guests.\n\nWe speak your language!\";}', 'a:3:{i:0;s:75:\"https://pvt.jo/uploads/filemanager/Hotel Pictures/Petra/Alanbat Hotel/3.jpg\";i:1;s:75:\"https://pvt.jo/uploads/filemanager/Hotel Pictures/Petra/Alanbat Hotel/2.jpg\";i:2;s:75:\"https://pvt.jo/uploads/filemanager/Hotel Pictures/Petra/Alanbat Hotel/1.jpg\";}'),
