(158, 'a:5:{s:2:\"en\";s:335:\"Located in Dana, Dana Guesthouse offers free WiFi in public areas. It includes a spacious terrace and a restaurant. Free private parking is possible on site.\r\n\r\nAll rooms at Dana Guesthouse are simply furnished and fitted with carpeted floors. Each one offers a balcony, a wardrobe and an outdoor dining area. It has a shared bathroom.\";s:2:\"fr\";s:0:\"\";s:2:\"it\";s:0:\"\";s:2:\"es\";s:0:\"\";s:2:\"Ar\";s:0:\"\";}', 'a:0:{}'),
(170, 'a:5:{s:2:\"en\";s:335:\"Located in Dana, Dana Guesthouse offers free WiFi in public areas. It includes a spacious terrace and a restaurant. Free private parking is possible on site.\r\n\r\nAll rooms at Dana Guesthouse are simply furnished and fitted with carpeted floors. Each one offers a balcony, a wardrobe and an outdoor dining area. It has a shared bathroom.\";s:2:\"fr\";s:400:\"Situé à Dana, le Dana Guesthouse propose une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite dans les parties communes. Il comprend une terrasse spacieuse et un restaurant. Un parking privé gratuit est disponible sur place.\r\n\r\nToutes les chambres du Dana Guesthouse sont meublées simplement et revêtues de moquette. Chacune comprend un balcon, une armoire et un coin repas extérieur. Il a une salle de bain partagée.\";s:2:\"it\";s:392:\"Situata a Dana, la Dana Guesthouse offre la connessione WiFi gratuita nelle aree comuni Comprende un&#039;ampia terrazza e un ristorante. Parcheggio privato disponibile gratuitamente in loco.\r\n\r\nTutte le camere della Dana Guesthouse sono arredate in modo semplice e dotate di pavimenti in moquette. Ognuno offre un balcone, un armadio e una zona pranzo all&#039;aperto. Ha un bagno in comune.\";s:2:\"es\";s:392:\"El Dana Guesthouse se encuentra en Dana y ofrece conexión WiFi gratuita en las zonas comunes. Incluye una amplia terraza y un restaurante. Se ofrece aparcamiento privado gratuito.\r\n\r\nTodas las habitaciones del Dana Guesthouse están amuebladas de forma sencilla y tienen suelo de moqueta. Cada uno ofrece un balcón, un armario y una zona de comedor al aire libre. Tiene un baño compartido.\";s:2:\"Ar\";s:539:\"??? ??? ????? ?? ???? ? ????? ???? ????? ??? ?????? ?? ??????? ??????. ????? ?????? ?????? ???????. \r\n????? ?????? ?????? ????? ?? ??????\r\n\r\n???? ????? ?? ??? ????? ????? ?????? ?????? ??????? ????? ???????. ???? ?? ????? ???? ?????? ????? ?????? ?????? ?????? ?? ?????? ?????. ????? ??? ???? ?????\r\n\";}', 'a:1:{i:0;s:71:\"https://pvt.jo/uploads/filemanager/Hotel Pics Esra/dana guest house.jpg\";}'),
