(325, 'a:7:{s:2:\"en\";s:934:\"Al Anbat Hotel and Restaurant is 3 star hotel located on the main street of Wadi Musa, on the hilltop overlooking the Petra mountain range. Free shuttle service is offered to and from the Visitor\'s Center and the hotel.\r\n\r\nEach private room has modern furnishings, a LCD TV, an air-conditioning unit, a mini-fridge, western facilities and complimentary toiletries. Every room offers free WiFi.\r\n\r\nGuests can enjoy the outdoor swimming pool. Turkish Bath can be enjoyed at an extra cost with service that include, steam room, Jacuzzi, and massages.\r\n\r\nOther facilities on site include the coffee shop, souvenir shop, and supermarket.\r\n\r\nTransfers can be arranged through the hotel at an extra cost. Additional services like tours, guides, and arrangements for continued travel after checking out of our hotel can also be arranged through the hotel. Free parking is available in front of the hotel for guests.\r\n\r\nWe speak your language!\";s:2:\"fr\";N;s:2:\"it\";N;s:2:\"es\";N;s:2:\"Ar\";N;s:2:\"ge\";N;s:2:\"pt\";N;}', 'a:2:{i:0;s:34:\"/uploads/filemanager/Guide/G01.jpg\";i:1;s:44:\"/uploads/filemanager/L635816304870004997.jpg\";}'),
